window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4301,"title":"Chapter 4301: Strange Incident","paragraphs":["Chapter 4301: Strange Incident","Editor: Henyee Translations","A raft appeared on the great river. There was a boatman on it, and he was presently holding onto a bamboo pole.","Ling Han had witnessed this scene many times before. The boatman’s skin was green, and it was as if he had been dead for countless years. Just the sight of him was harrowing.","There was something very strange about this place. On one hand, it was easier for those with a lower cultivation level to pass through, but the stronger their abilities, the more bizarre things they would encounter. At the slightest provocation, they would lose their lives.","Otherwise, would the Imperial Clans miss out on something as valuable as the Source Dao Stone?","It was not that they did not want it, but rather that they could not obtain it.","Now that two Venerate Tier elites had appeared here, not only did they not retract their aura, but they even attacked wantonly. Would this lead to a strange incident happening?","In Ling Han’s eyes, the boatman in front of him was already strange enough.","Xiu, xiu! He and Ding Shu moved quickly, and had already surpassed the boatman.","The Blood Crow Venerate and the Crimson Moon Venerate quickly caught up to Ling Han and Ding Shu. Their speed was astonishing, and if it weren’t for the fact that they kept howling uncontrollably like wolves, they would have caught up to Ling Han and Ding Shu in a single step.","But when they passed by that boatman, a strange thing happened.","The boatman’s turbid eyes suddenly lit up. Then, he waved the bamboo pole, sweeping it towards the two Venerates.","The bamboo pole was clearly only that long, but as the boatman waved it, it seemed to have turned into a divine rod that was extraordinarily long, rapidly smashing into the backs of the two Venerate Tier elites.","Regulations glowed, which was incredibly terrifying.","The two Venerate Tier elites both exclaimed in surprise. They had no choice but to turn around and charge at the bamboo pole.","Peng!","The two great Venerate Tier elites struck the bamboo pole at the same time. They both grunted, and were sent flying.","In this attack, even if they joined forces, they were still no match for the boatman.","The boatman didn’t stop, and with a turn of the bamboo pole, it shot towards Crimson Moon Venerate. Meanwhile, his left hand pressed down, turning into a large, decaying hand that grabbed out at Blood Crow Venerate.","The Crimson Moon Venerate and the Blood Crow Venerate both humphed coldly. In the first attack, they had only been caught off guard. If they really came to blows, what did they have to fear?","Boom, the two Venerate Tier elites both unleashed their battle prowess. Instantly, a terrifying might overflowed. They displayed battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier.","A great battle broke out, and the boatman battled the two Venerate Tier elites alone, not falling into a disadvantage at all.","However, the two Venerate Tier elites were also very aggressive, launching a powerful counterattack and steadying their footing.","Ling Han stopped, and turned around to watch the battle.","“F***, do you want to die?” Ding Shu also stopped, “Aren’t you going to run?”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “After being hunted down for so long, don’t you want to take revenge?”","“Venerate Tier elites are engaged in a great battle. If you want to seek death, I’m not going to accompany you,” Ding Shu shrugged.","Ling Han smiled, and blew the horn of the Great Emperor. The two shockwaves immediately shot towards the Crimson Moon Venerate and Blood Crow Venerate like arrows.","“Ao!” Even at this moment, the two Venerate Tier elites couldn’t help but howl like wolves.","It was completely irresistible.","However, the boatman was unaffected, and did not stop attacking, continuing to attack the two Venerate Tier elites.","This caused the two Venerate Tier elites to feel awkward. Merely one boatman was enough to become a strong rival for them, and now they had to howl like wolves from time to time. How could they hold up to this?","This was fatal!","In a battle between elites, in a situation when their abilities were more or less equal, even the slightest mistake would be fatal. Thus, it was really too dangerous for them to be howling like wolves now. They were constantly wandering on the border between life and death.","Ling Han also went all out, and attacked from the sidelines like crazy.","He definitely had to suppress the two Venerate Tier elites. Only then would he be able to create a chance for the boatman.","Only a few minutes had passed, but the two Venerate Tier elites kept encountering dangerous situations — it should be known that under the influence of the Great Emperor Horn, they couldn’t even take down a True Self Tier, which showed how much strength they could only unleash.","Pu!","The Blood Crow Venerate’s lower abdomen was struck by the bamboo pole, causing him to throw up blood madly. Even his spirit was almost beaten out out him.","“I am a Venerate Tier, the fourth pinnacle suppresses the heaven and earth!” The Blood Crow Venerate roared loudly, and four pillars of Dao appeared in his body, suppressing his soul.","However, Ling Han blew the bugle horn, and he couldn’t help but howl at the sky. Instantly, his four pillars of Dao immediately disappeared into his body.","Peng, a bamboo pole shot over, and the Blood Crow Venerate was ruthlessly hit. With a somersault, peng, he fell into the eerie river.","With a splash, this Venerate Tier instantly disappeared, as if he had been swallowed by the river waters.","Crimson Moon Venerate couldn’t help but feel chills all over his body. This was too f****** strange.","He naturally knew that after leaving the City of Death, there was a great misfortune outside. However, previously, due to his fury, he had been so focused on hunting Ling Han that he had completely forgotten about this matter.","Now, he finally realized that the situation was not good.","Once Blood Crow fell into the water, it was hard to say whether he would live or die!","Crimson Moon Venerate only hesitated for a moment before immediately turning around to flee.","Under Ling Han’s influence, he was no match for the boatman at all. Thus, it was best to retreat as soon as possible.","He retreated, and the boatman gave chase. However, without the influence of the Great Emperor Horn, Crimson Moon Venerate was extremely fast, and the boatman couldn’t catch up to him either.","After chasing for a while, the boatman returned and landed on the small raft again. He stretched out a bamboo pole and stirred in the river water, as if he was fishing out something.","“What the hell?” Ding Shu murmured.","When the boatman raised the bamboo pole again, a strange scene appeared. There was actually a hand holding onto the end of the bamboo pole.","A person was lifted up. He had greenish-white skin, but had a pair of wings on his back.","Was it the Blood Crow Venerate?","But now, the Blood Crow Venerate seemed to have become a walking corpse. Though his eyes were open, his gaze was extremely turbid. He just stood there numbly on the ship, completely motionless.","The boatman held onto the paddle, and slowly headed down the river’s course.","This scene caused both Ling Han and Ding Shu to hold their breaths.","A Venerate, after falling into the river, had become like this after he was fished up?","That was a Venerate Tier elite!","This was truly strange.","Just like that, the two of them watched the small raft disappear into the distance, right until it disappeared from their sight.","“How f*cking strange!” Ding Shu couldn’t help but curse again.","In truth, Ling Han also very much wanted to curse. This scene caused his scalp to go numb.","What exactly was going on here?","He took a few deep breaths to calm his emotions, then asked Ding Shu, “Next, do you still plan to go to the City of Death?”","“What would I be going there for? To seek death?” Ding Shu said in irritation, “You are quite awesome yourself, to actually draw out Venerate Tier elites to hunt you down. And now, great, even I have been implicated.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said, “All right, all right. You have plenty of Source Dao Stones, and as for Han Di, I’ve already killed him. You won’t have the chance to get revenge either.”","“F***!” Ding Shu almost jumped up to strangle Ling Han, “Compensate me! Compensate me! Compensate me!”","Ling Han simply laughed loudly.","After making a fuss for a while, Ding Shu said, “At first, I was still going to stay here for eight to ten years, but now, I have to leave in advance. When will your people pick you up?”","“There are about two months left.”","“All right then, let me take a ride.”","“No problem.” Ling Han nodded."]},{"number":4302,"title":"Chapter 4302: Great Change in the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 4302: Great Change in the World","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han and Ding Shu walked back together.","Their cultivation levels were low, so they didn’t trigger any strange events. They followed the eerie river and entered the forest, staying in the stone house to avoid those strange creatures. Then, they hurried on their way. A month later, they entered the swamp.","Another few days later, they passed through this place, and saw the path that led out.","Then, they pushed open the stone door, and arrived inside the black hole.","Ling Han and Ding Shu both sat down in cross-legged positions. At present, all they could do was wait, but with their habits, they naturally would not waste the slightest bit of time. This little bit of time was also enough for them to comprehend Dao and cultivate.","This wait took over a dozen days.","All of a sudden, this peaceful space bubbled, and then a large hand stretched in, exuding an overwhelming aura.","A Saint!","“Let’s go,” Ling Han said softly. He immediately dashed toward the large hand.","Ding Shu didn’t hesitate, and he immediately dashed over as well.","The two of them landed in the palm of the large hand. The large hand immediately curled up, clenched into a fist, and then retracted.","Though the power of the black hole was terrifying, and even a Sect Master could not escape its attraction, it was not enough in front of Saint-level power, and could not affect this giant hand at all.","Very quickly, this large hand brought Ling Han and Ding Shu out of the black hole.","The large hand loosened, and then dissipated.","“Old man!” Ling Han called out. Ahead of him, the Nine Mountains Saint was standing in midair, and there were a considerable number of people standing beside him. They were the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and the others.","“Yi, Little Han, who is this?” the large black dog immediately asked.","“Ding Shu,” Ling Han replied.","“En?” The large black dog was shocked. This was Ding Shu, the other Genesis World’s Master?","Meanwhile, the empress and Hu Niu came over, one on the left and one on the right. They surrounded Ling Han. They had been apart for ten years, so they naturally missed him very much.","“Let’s go back first,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. He tore a rip into space and led everyone away.","With the Saint’s guidance, their speed was naturally very fast. Only a few days later, they had returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“Thank you, old man. I’ll take my leave first. There’s no need to see me out.” Ding Shu immediately waved his hand in farewell, as if someone was holding a saber to his neck.","This was Ling Han’s base camp, so he naturally had to be careful.","However, Ling Han had never thought of using this kind of method to get rid of his competitors. He merely smiled.","“Was it successful?” the Nine Mountains Saint asked Ling Han.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Just look at what you’re saying. How could it not be successful when it is me?”","“Brat!” The Nine Mountains Saint shook his head with a smile, saying, “Don’t be cheeky.”","Ling Han immediately recounted his experiences in these ten years. In truth, he spent the majority of his time refining the Source Dao Stones, so this part only needed to be glossed over.","Everyone listened quietly. When they found out that Ling Han had actually advanced into the Tenth Form, they all inhaled sharply.","The Ninth Form only existed in legends, but Ling Han actually advanced into the Tenth Form.","This was too awesome.","Meanwhile, the Nine Mountains Saint frowned and placed a hand on Ling Han’s shoulder. He extended his Spiritual Power, and after a careful examination, he said in a solemn voice, “You can’t refine the Source Dao Stone anymore. Although the lifespan lost is negligible compared to the increase in lifespan brought by the increase in cultivation level, the Source Power of your lifespan has been greatly weakened.”","“Even now, your foundations have already been damaged, and you need to use Great Herbs to heal it. If you continue to refine them, I’m afraid it will cause an irreversible and eternal injury.”","Only now did Ling Han become serious.","He knew that his life force had been damaged, and had already decided to find a Great Herb to compensate for it, but he had not thought that the situation would actually become so serious.","He sighed, took out all the remaining Source Dao Stones, and said, “You guys split them among yourselves, but use them carefully.”","The Nine Mountains Saint picked up a Source Power Dao Stone, examined it closely, and said, “This contains Regulations, which is both related to time and even contains a sliver of karma. It’s the only thing that can allow a cultivator to sacrifice their lifespan in exchange for time.”","He paused for a moment, then continued, “At most, three days to refine one, so that the life force that has been expended can slowly recover, and should not hurt the foundations.”","Everyone nodded. Ling Han was a good example.","“Oh, that’s right. How’s the situation in the universe now? Have those Imperial Clan elites become aggressive again?” Ling Han asked. He had already been away from this world for ten years.","“There really has been a great change,” the large black dog said. “In the sixth year after you entered the Dark Clouds Hell, the Mountain Sea Heaven broke apart, and a large number of Yin souls wreaked havoc, stirring up boundless winds and clouds.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but frown. A large number of Yin souls were invading. This was really a big matter.","“And now?” he asked.","“In the beginning, everyone acted as if it had nothing to do with them.” The little azure dragon continued, “However, this Yin soul army advanced like a hot knife through butter, attacking cities and plundering land. The territory of their force rapidly expanded, and even those Imperial Clans could no longer sit still.”","“Now, with the Imperial Clans taking the lead, they have formed an alliance against the Yin soul army. The whole universe has laid down everything else, and are united against the Yin soul army,” the perverted pig also said.","Ling Han was even more surprised. Under the pressure of the invasion of the Yin souls, the various great forces had actually joined forces?","“The Imperial Clans and the Imperial Weapons are still unable to expel the Yin souls?” He felt it strange.","This was the Imperial Weapon. Once it unleashed its might, it was equivalent to a Great Emperor coming back to life. Yet, it was still unable to suppress the Yin souls?","“Sigh, there are too many Yin souls. Moreover, they use the Mountain Sea Heaven as their base, and when they encounter the might of the Imperial Weapon, they hide back into the Netherworld,” the large black dog said. “Moreover, there are also Saints among the Yin souls, as well as Imperial Weapons!”","Ling Han almost spluttered. Yin souls also had Imperial Weapons?","F***, don’t tell him that Yin souls could even cultivate to Great Emperor-level.","“It’s said that it’s transformed from the remains of a Divine Beast from the ancient times. It’s different from the Imperial Weapon of the later generations,” the little azure dragon explained. In this aspect, he had a lot of say.","Ling Han took a deep breath, and concluded, “In other words, the present situation is considerably dire.”","“We have to have a new Emperor appear, and only then would we be able to completely chase those Yin souls back. Otherwise, sigh!” The large black dog shook his head. Otherwise, things would not be good.","“Thus, all the great Imperial Clans have put down their airs now. In fact, they have even spared no expense, and established a so-called Ancestral King Academy, focusing fully on nurturing prodigies, so as to stimulate the world of cultivation to enter into an era of prosperity. Prodigies from various places have appeared, all of them competing for the imperial throne.”","Though the heaven and earth were already prepared to welcome a new Emperor, the appearance of the Imperial Path still needed an opportunity, such as enough prodigies.","In the Imperial Path, there was no lack of competition. If there were only a few people, then what was the point of competing?","When one became Emperor, it was never one that was outstanding among the mediocre, but rather countless prodigies would fight tooth and nail to become Emperor. Only the most outstanding, the most naturally talented, and the most fortunate would be able to stand out.","“Ancestral King Academy?” Ling Han was slightly interested, “Can anyone go?”"]},{"number":4303,"title":"Chapter 4303: Ancestral King Academy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4303: Ancestral King Academy","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Theoretically, yes.” The large black dog nodded.","“However, brat, you’re being hunted down by so many Imperial Clans. If you really enter there, hoho, you’ll probably be chased around to be beaten every day,” the little azure dragon said, delighting in Ling Han’s misfortune.","Ling Han smiled, “That won’t happen. With the old man’s intimidation, on the surface, even the Imperial Clans would not dare to do anything to me.”","Just think, how terrifying would a Saint wielding an Imperial Weapon be?","It was presently a crucial period in the resistance against Yin souls. Saints were naturally the most important power, and the Nine Mountains Saint even had an “Imperial Weapon”. Of course, he belonged to the category of people that needed to be united, so how could he be pushed onto the opposing side?","Thus, even if Ling Han swaggered boldly into the ranks of the Imperial Clans, these people would still have to force themselves to bear with it.","Of course, if they were battling at the same cultivation level, and Ling Han was still killed, then the Nine Mountains Saint would have nothing to say. After all, he was the one who had said this.","“Battle at the same cultivation level? Hehe, if I don’t break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, who in this world would be able to block a single strike from me?” Ling Han was extremely proud.","This was the Tenth Form, and it was definitely peerless in the world!","Even Ding Shu, who was also a ruler of the Genesis World, couldn’t reach the Tenth Form as long as he didn’t have the Imperial Weapon. This required both natural talent and great fortune.","“Brat, are you planning to go to the Ancestral King Academy?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han nodded, “Of course. I have to suppress those old friends of mine, and let them know how to kneel down and proclaim their conquest.”","“Haha, how arrogant. However, Grandpa Dog likes it.”","“Grandpa Dragon also supports you.”","“Zhi!” The perverted pig humphed, which could be considered as expressing his stand.","“Come, let’s report this to the old man.”","Ling Han and the others went to seek out the Nine Mountains Saint, and expressed their desire to go to the Ancestral King Academy.","“All right.” The Nine Mountains Saint immediately nodded. For Ling Han, this was currently the most suitable choice for him.","As long as he did not expose the fact that the “Imperial Weapon” in his possession was actually a fake, Ling Han would definitely be safe. The Imperial Clans would also have to be cautious, as once a Saint that possessed the Imperial Weapon unleashed his might, the damage caused would be devastating.","Ling Han and the others decided to set out immediately. This time, there were more people going. Not only were there the Three Milk Tea Brothers, there was also the perverted pig, the empress, Hu Niu, and the seven Calabash Brothers. In any case, they had nothing to worry about.","Led by the Nine Mountains Saint, they arrived at the Dark Moon Planet in just a few days.","The Ancestral King Academy was located here.","A very long time ago, the Dark Moon Planet was a great planet. It had once given birth to a Saint, but this Saint encountered misfortune in his later years, and actually went mad, destroying the sect that he had founded with his own hands. From then onwards, the cultivation of the Dark Moon Planet had also fallen into a period of decline.","However, with the establishment of the Ancestral King Academy here, it was clear that the cultivation of the Dark Moon Planet would also undergo a powerful revival.","“Come, let’s go and register.”","They headed to the academy, but when they arrived at the main doors, they all gritted their teeth.","There was a sea of people here, numbering in the millions.","They were all here to register?","Ling Han and the others only had to ask casually, and received a definite answer.","The Ancestral King Academy had gathered all the strongest prodigies in the universe, and in future, they would all be top-notch elites contending for the imperial throne. If they could enter the academy, putting aside whether they would be qualified to contend for the imperial throne in future, merely being classmates with so many Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters, wasn’t that enough to brag about for a lifetime?","Furthermore, a new Emperor would definitely be born in the Ancestral King Academy, and that would be a source of even more boasting — to be Sect Brothers and Sect Sisters with a new Ancestral King, what kind of glory was that?","Thus, everyone tried their best to crawl in.","“A test will begin. Three stages have to be passed first.” The little azure dragon went to gather information, and soon returned.","Because there were really too many people here, and there was an endless stream of them every day, the Ancestral King Academy was completely too busy to deal with them. Thus, they simply set up an extremely difficult test, and eliminated the majority first.","As for the rest, no matter what, they could still be considered prodigies. There was no harm in spending some time to investigate them. Who knows, they might be worth nurturing.","“What test?” Ling Han asked.","“It’s just a matter of fighting and killing anyway,” the little azure dragon said casually.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, and did not take it to heart.","With his strength, no matter what kind of test it was, he could pass it with his eyes closed.","“Silence!” A cultivator suddenly leaped into the air.","“Who do you think you are? Why do I have to listen to you?” Someone was displeased, and immediately rebuked.","“Humph!” That cultivator looked downwards, his eyes bright, instantly exuding a terrifying aura.","This was a powerful Sect Master elite.","The person who had spoken just now immediately became a coward, not daring to make a sound.","“Everyone, listen up,” the Sect Master elite said. “The Foundation Building Tiers stand here, the Cauldron Forging Tiers stand here, the Core Formation Tiers stand here, the True Self Tiers stand here, the Spirit Transformation Tiers stand here.”","He pointed at them one by one, distributing the places where cultivators of different cultivation levels should stand.","There were no Sect Master-level elites here. Aside from the Golden Generation elites, those who could become Sect Master-level elites were all older people. Firstly, they were not qualified to attempt breaking through to Emperor Tier, and secondly, they were already so old, so how could they bring themselves to compete with young people for cultivation resources?","The Sect Master swept an eye over them, and said coldly, “Let me give you a word of advice. Don’t choose the wrong side. Otherwise, if you’re found out, it won’t be as simple as being kicked out!”","Everyone was stunned. These words were filled with killing intent.","Instantly, a few people quietly stepped out, and went to other teams.","—Initially, they had wanted to bluff, and participate in the competition of a lower cultivation level with their higher cultivation level. In that way, they would be able to pass easily, but with this Sect Master here, who would dare?","Was he seeking death?","“Now, the Foundation Building TIer cultivators will go first and enter the doors ahead,” the Sect Master said. With a shake of his hand, a stone door fell from the sky, but it was tightly closed.","The Foundation Building Tier cultivators instantly started to move toward the stone door.","“Lord, the stone door can’t be pushed open!” The person standing in the first position gave a shove, and said to the elite in the sky.","“You can’t even open the doors, scram!” the Sect Master elite chided coldly.","The person at the forefront could only leave dejectedly. As it turned out, pushing open the stone door was the first stage.","The person in second place continued to walk forwards, and began to push open the doors.","However, he had also failed, and similarly fled with his tail between his legs.","Failure, failure, failure. The first stage was extremely difficult, and only a very few people could pass. But even so, there were really too many people here. The efficiency of testing them one by one was really too low.","The Sect Master was exasperated. He waved his hand again, and stone doors descended one after another. There were a total of five of them.","Each stone door corresponded to a cultivation level. Now, five people with the same cultivation level could undergo the test together, so the speed was naturally greatly sped up.","Martial arts was always the structure of a pyramid. The lowest cultivation level had the highest number, and the higher the cultivation level, the fewer people there would be.","It was the same here. There were the most Foundation Building Tier cultivators, and there were considerably fewer Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators. When it was True Self Tier, there were only about a thousand left, and Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivators were even rarer, only a mere hundred.","After all, the Ancestral King Academy had been established for several years, and the true prodigies had naturally entered the academy long ago.","“Get lost, let me go first!” The line was originally advancing in an orderly manner, but one person suddenly squeezed forward, his attitude very arrogant."]},{"number":4304,"title":"Chapter 4304: The person who cut into the queue","paragraphs":["Chapter 4304: The person who cut into the queue","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a young man who looked to be in his twenties. He was dressed in a green embroidered gown, and his expression was filled with arrogance.","With regards to cutting the queue, the majority would definitely have a displeased attitude. Thus, a great many people called out in displeasure.","“What are you cutting into the queue for? Get lost!”","“Who do you think you are!”","“Don’t disturb order!”","The black-robed young man’s gaze was disdainful, as he swept a disdainful glance over everyone, “Because I am Zhang Wei!”","Zhang Wei?","Everyone exchanged looks. None of them had any recollection of this person’s name, so it was obvious that he was not a famous person. Then was it really good for you to be so arrogant?","“My older brother is Zhang Jia, Niu Tengfei, Imperial Son Niu’s follower!” Zhang Wei added.","When these words fell, quite a few people immediately shut up.","Imperial Son!","Whether it was the Golden Generation, the Silver Generation, or the Imperial Son of the third generation, those that could be crowned with the title of Imperial Son were all prodigies, and it was extremely possible that they would become Saints in future, and be respected by the whole world.","Thus, even if Zhang Wei was only the younger brother of Imperial Son Niu Tengfei’s follower, he could still be very awesome.","This was the intimidation of the Imperial Clan, and was also the golden signboard of the Imperial Son.","Zhang Wei saw that everyone had fallen silent, and couldn’t help but show a hint of pride in his expression. Who cares how strong your backers are? Can they compare to the Imperial Son? Thus, in front of me, you had best obediently keep your mouths shut.","He swaggered forwards, his hands dangling back to front, and front to back. There was no doubt how arrogant he was.","Ling Han gave the large black dog a look, and the large black dog understood his signal. When Zhang Wei walked over, he stretched out a leg and tripped him up. Pa, Zhang Wei was caught off guard, and instantly fell forwards.","However, the True Self Tier was already capable of using Regulations, so he naturally wouldn’t be tripped easily. He stretched out a hand and struck the ground, wanting to use the momentum to bounce back up. However, at this moment, a powerful force pressed down on his back, as heavy as a planet, making him unable to bounce back up at all.","Peng, he fell heavily onto the ground, his face covered with dust.","“Pu!”","“Hahaha!”","When everyone saw this, they all laughed loudly.","They were wary of Zhang Wei’s background, and felt that it was better to have less trouble, so they did not stop him from cutting into the queue. However, this did not mean that they did not even have the courage to gloat over his misfortune.","Zhang Wei had suddenly fallen down, and his speed of getting back to his feet was also very fast. Immediately, he looked towards Ling Han and the others.","He had not even seen the large black dog make a move, but he was the closest to these “people”, so there was an 80% chance that it was these people who had done it.","“Was it you?” Zhang Wei pointed at Ling Han, his expression slightly twisted.","He had just introduced himself, and had the backing of an Imperial Son, yet someone actually dared to mess with him. How could he accept this?","Ling Han shook his head, “I hate being pointed at.”","“Hate? Heh, when I trample all over you, you will hate it even more!” Zhang Wei declared coldly.","Pa, he immediately suffered a kick.","“You actually dare to threaten our father!”","“Fight!”","“Beat him so hard that even his mother won’t recognize him!”","The children all rushed forwards, and began to attack Zhang Wei.","The advancement of their cultivation levels was practically inconceivable. They didn’t need any cultivation resources at all, yet their cultivation level soared. By now, they were already in the True Self Tier, which was why they were able to line up with Ling Han and the others. And if it was the empress and Hu Niu, they could only join the ranks of the Core Formation Tier.","Zhang Wei still had some strength. Otherwise, even if he had a powerful backer, he wouldn’t dare to be so full of confidence. After all, if he couldn’t push open the stone door with his bare hands, that would be embarrassing in public.","But in a one-on-one battle, he may not even be a match for the babies, what more when it was seven against one. He naturally did not even have the ability to parry, and could only be beaten up.","It wasn’t long before he was beaten black and blue, on the verge of death.","The seven babies all clapped their hands, looking like they were smiling.","“Father, did we do a good job?” Eldest Baby even asked Ling Han for credit.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Beautiful!”","The seven babies were instantly enraptured, unable to contain their joy.","Everyone gritted their teeth as they watched. This group of people was far too violent. They had actually thrashed someone at the entrance of the academy? Moreover, they had thrashed someone who was related to the Imperial Son!","How could they be so outrageously bold?","However, the Sect Master was clearly watching, yet did not make a move to stop them. This attitude was quite ambiguous.","At this time, the people in front either succeeded or were eliminated. Finally, it was Ling Han and his group’s turn.","“Grandpa Dog will go first.” The large black dog walked up, and with a strong push, the stone door was opened. With a xiu, he entered, and the stone door immediately closed. It was impossible for the people behind him to take advantage of the opening.","Next, it was the little azure dragon, followed by the seven babies, and they all passed easily.","Ling Han was the last. He walked forwards, stretched out a hand and pressed down. A force immediately bounced back. He increased the force slightly, and the stone door was easily pushed open.","After entering the stone door, they arrived in another world. However, this world was extremely small, and there was a person sitting cross-legged in front of them.","“You’ll pass if you can take a single strike from me,” the person said.","Ling Han swept over with his divine sense, and already had an idea.","This was not a real person, but rather something like the Tool Spirit. It was formed by the Regulations of heaven and earth, so even its features were blurred.","“My cultivation level is at the fifth form of the True Self Tier,” the person said. Then, with a wave of his hand, Regulations shot towards Ling Han like a sword.","The fifth form of the True Self Tier?","Ling Han was astonished. He was at the Tenth Form, and no one had ever achieved this before, and it was also possible that no one would be able to achieve this in the future.","Oh, this was not a real person, after all. Hence, it could only tell that Ling Han had broken through the limits of the Fourth Form, but did not know exactly how many times he had broken through.","Which also meant that whether it was the Fifth Form, the Sixth Form, or the Seventh Form, this Tool Spirit would treat them all the same.","The might of this attack, en, was about the peak stage of the Fifth Form.","In other words, the fifth form would actually find it very difficult to parry, but if it was the sixth form, it would be an easy feat.","After all, those the Ancestral King Academy wanted to select were only those who could become Venerate Tier or even Saint Tier prodigies in the future, that could create a prosperous situation in which tens of thousands of prodigies competed for the throne.","If their final accomplishment could only be Spirit Transformation Tier, or even Sect Master Tier?","How could they be in the mood to nurture him? It was completely a waste of time and resources.","Just as he was thinking this, the attack had already arrived.","Ling Han didn’t even move to parry. The Starlight Screen spread open. Peng, the attack landed, but it didn’t even break a crack in the Starlight Screen.","Ka, on the other side of this small place, a stone door opened, which meant that Ling Han could leave now.","He entered, and saw that there was also a person seated here.","“Defeat me, and you’ll pass,” the person said.","It was also formed from Regulations, and was not a real person at all.","Then there was no need to be reserved. Ling Han rushed forwards, and with a series of chaotic blows, knocked this opponent to the ground.","As expected, another stone door quietly opened on the other side.","The third stage had been passed, but it did not mean that he could enter into the Ancestral King Academy. Instead, he had obtained the qualifications for the second round of the test.","After walking out of the stone door, Ling Han discovered that he had arrived inside the Ancestral King Academy. That stone door actually had the effect of Transfer Formation, though the distance of transmission was pitifully short.","The empress, the large black dog, and the others had all passed the test, and were waiting for him ahead.","“The second round is the audition. After passing, you can become one of the members of the Ancestral King Academy,” someone said calmly. It was actually another Sect Master-level elite."]},{"number":4305,"title":"Chapter 4305: So ordinary?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4305: So ordinary?","Editor: Henyee Translations","As expected of Ancestral King Academy. Sect Master elites kept watch everywhere.","What was a Sect Master?","That was a person who could establish a sect, and would be treated and respected wherever he went. But in this place, Sect Masters seemed to have become an errand boy, and were not uncommon.","Those who had passed three stages did as they were told, and there were fewer people, which greatly decreased the difficulty of the selection.","There was a courtyard in front of them, and when everyone walked over, they saw a group of people come out, all of them looking dejected.","“I am the Fifth Form, and in the end, I was still eliminated!”","“Sigh, I also cultivated Seven Cauldrons, and I actually didn’t pass!”","“That’s right. With our aptitude, we can already go to a great sect and become Dao Child, yet we still can’t pass.”","“Just how freakish does one’s aptitude have to be?”","These people complained as they walked, their faces filled with defiance and dissatisfaction.","Hearing their words, the expressions of the new batch of people changed drastically. F***, they only had the aptitude of the Fifth Form and Seven Cauldrons. Then wouldn’t they also be kicked out of the Academy?","“Next.” At the entrance, there was a Dao Apprentice standing guard. He waved at Ling Han and the others, “Hurry, don’t dawdle.”","Everyone was a little timid, not daring to be the first to enter.","“Grandpa Dog will go.” The large black dog was the first to run out and enter the courtyard.","After a while, the Dao Apprentice looked surprised, and said to everyone, “Next.”","Yi, the person, no, the dog did not come out, which meant that he had passed the test?","Everyone’s faces were slightly flushed. How could it be that they were no match for a dog?","“I’ll do it!” Immediately, someone entered, but in just a few seconds, he ran out dejectedly, looking despondent.","Obviously, he had not passed the test.","“Next,” the Dao Apprentice was expressionless as he called out again.","This time, no one scrambled to be the first.","“Let’s go!” The seven babies stepped out one after another.","What was going on here?","The Dao Apprentice was also a little dazed. Seven toddlers actually managed to pass the first three stages? Oh, he understood now. They must have deliberately suppressed the growth of their bodies. Otherwise, they looked to be only four or five years old, so how could they have cultivated to the extent that even he could not tell their cultivation level?","“One by one,” he hurriedly said.","“Sigh, how willful!” Eldest Baby spread her hands.","“Alright, just listen to him.”","The babies queued up, and Eldest Baby entered first.","Only after a while, the Dao Apprentice was once again surprised, and said to Second Baby, “Next.”","Yi, she had passed?","Everyone gritted their teeth. Just now, it was a dog, and now it was a child. Even they had passed, so what reason did they have to fail?","It wasn’t long before the seven kids all passed the test.","“Next,” the Dao Apprentice continued.","This time, another person became active and rushed into the courtyard. In the end, in less than three seconds, he ran out with his tail between his legs.","Failure.","F***, what was going on here? Both the dog and the babies could pass, but prodigies like them could not?","“Look at your Grandpa Dragon!” The little azure dragon swaggered forward.","Everyone was even more depressed. Now, they were actually being mocked by a four-legged snake?","However, what made them even more depressed was the fact that the Dao Apprentice quickly shouted “next”, yet they didn’t see the little azure dragon being chased out. It was clear that he had passed the test.","Ling Han smiled, and strode away.","Everyone shook their heads. Judging by the current situation, it was obvious that only freaks could pass the test. You look too normal at first glance, so it is impossible for you to pass.","Ling Han entered the courtyard, only to see an old man drinking tea. He looked at Ling Han, and a strange expression instantly spread across his face. “Ling Han?”","“Yo, Senior recognizes me!” Ling Han said with a smile.","This was naturally a Sect Leader elite. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to suppress the prodigies that had come over. He stared at Ling Han, killing intent in his eyes.","Ling Han knew that this definitely belonged to some Imperial Clan, so by nature, he didn’t like him.","This Sect Master was called Baili Dong, and was naturally a member of the Baili Clan. It could be said that when he saw Ling Han, he wanted to smack him to death.","However, this couldn’t be allowed. Ling Han still had the backing of a Saint who wielded an Imperial Weapon. Killing Ling Han would bring calamity to the Baili Clan.","It was as if Baili Dong had eaten an entire bowl of flies. He was disgusted, but he had no choice but to calm down, and said, “Release the True Self.”","This was the final stage, to examine aptitude.","Ling Han smiled and released the True Self of Destruction.","—The other True Selves were all nine-coloured. This was too dazzling. It was clearly telling others that he had already cultivated to the ninth form.","This undoubtedly trampled all over the Golden Generation. Perhaps it would incite some Imperial Clan elites to take risks and kill him at all costs. Thus, he had best keep a low profile. As long as everyone followed the rules, he would have nothing to fear.","“Yi?” This time, Baili Dong was really shocked. Of course, it was not because Ling Han was really too awesome, but rather because he was too ordinary.","Others could only be considered Fifth Form, then the True Self would also evolve into Glass Fetus, Jade Fetus, Purple Fetus, and so on, and when it reached Seventh Form and above, there would even be Tricolored, Four-coloured or Five-coloured True Selves.","As he saw it, with how freakish Ling Han was, the True Self would have to be at least five-colored.","But the truth was completely different. It was actually so ordinary?","“This?” He pondered for a moment. Wasn’t this crippled?","Ordinarily, this kind of aptitude was not qualified to enroll into the Ancestral King Academy. He could very well chase Ling Han away. As long as he told the truth, no one would accuse him of using his public office to avenge a private grudge.","However, if Ling Han was allowed to stay outside, who knew what kind of good fortune he would obtain. What if he became powerful again?","Why not... leave him in the academy. With such a weak True Self, even if he became Spirit Transformation Tier, he would still become trash, and there was no need to worry.","That’s right, that was the plan. As long as he was tied up in the academy, he would not be able to cause any ripples, and his whole life would be over. Furthermore, Ling Han was here, which was equivalent to having hold of something on the Nine Mountains Saint. He was sure that the Nine Mountains Saint would also work hard to resist the Yin souls.","Not bad, this was a brilliant idea.","“All right, you have passed,” Baili Dong stated calmly, and waved his hand, “Leave from the backyard, and there will naturally be someone to take you through the procedures.”","He was playing favorites, but it didn’t matter, because Ling Han’s freakishness was known to the whole world. For the sake of this, it was reasonable for him to let Ling Han pass the test, right?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and strode out of the courtyard.","As expected, there were a great many manservants here. When they saw him come out, one of them immediately said, “Lord Ling, I will lead you to go through the procedures.”","Ling Han followed him and went through the admission procedures.","This was actually just registering one’s identity and cultivation level.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and filled in “True Self Tier Seventh Form” on the column of cultivation level. This was in line with his freakish identity, but it was not enough to drive the Imperial Clans to madness, to kill him at all costs.","The empress, the large black dog, and the others were still in front of him. Everyone met up, and went to their accommodations.","Everyone was allocated a small courtyard, and they could also choose servants according to their own tastes, who would them deal with trifling matters.","Ling Han did not take it. He had too many secrets on him, and did not want to have the eyes and ears of an Imperial Clans by his side.","Not long after they settled down, someone came to cause trouble.","It was a group led by Zhang Wei."]},{"number":4306,"title":"Chapter 4306: Leaving in Anger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4306: Leaving in Anger","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Brother, it’s him!” Zhang Wei had been stretching out his head to look around, and soon discovered Ling Han. Immediately, he stretched out a finger and pointed in his direction.","Yi, how did he come in so quickly?","Ling Han felt that this was a little strange. Previously, Zhang Wei had been beaten to the ground. Even if his aptitude had passed the test, there was no way he could have found help so quickly.","Unless, of course, he did not take the test, but rather directly ran off to find help.","His older brother, Zhang Jia, was the follower of an Imperial Son.","Ling Han looked over. There were three other people beside Zhang Wei, and one of them looked a little like Zhang Wei, though he looked slightly older.","This was probably Zhang Jia.","As expected, that person strode out, and only stopped when he arrived in front of Ling Han. However, he did not immediately make a move. Instead, he showed a smile, and said, “This Junior Brother, how should I address you?”","Ling Han shook his head, “You are not yet qualified to call me Junior Brother!”","Zhang Jia couldn’t help but look furious.","He was not qualified?","He himself was a prodigy. Otherwise, he would not have been accepted into the Ancestral King Academy. Furthermore, he was now riding on the coattail of an Imperial Son. Even a great many people with natural talent and higher status than him would have to treat him with respect.","‘I’m only being polite before resorting to force, yet you’re rubbing my nose in it?’","“Hehe, what an arrogant mad man!” The other two young men also walked over, smirking coldly.","“Brother Zhang, there’s no need to be polite with this kind of person. Just beat him into submission.”","Zhang Jia nodded, pointed at Ling Han’s nose, and said, “I gave you face, but you refused. Then you can only suffer the consequences of your own actions.”","Ling Han chuckled and said, “There’s one thing that you and your brother are very similar in. You both like to point at others, and I hate this the most.”","“So what?” Zhang Jia asked proudly.","Pa!","Ling Han moved, and slapped Zhang Jia onto the ground.","At this, the world fell silent. Zhang Jia directly fainted.","F***!","This scene caused the other two young men to be dumbfounded. What was going on? That was Zhang Jia.","The three of them were Niu Tengfei’s followers, so their cultivation level and strength were equal. Thus, Zhang Jia was sent flying with a single palm strike. If the two of them went up to fight, they would definitely be delivering themselves up to die.","“Scram,” Ling Han said calmly.","He couldn’t even be bothered to look at this kind of minor character.","“Let’s go.” The other two followers hurriedly turned around and left, while Zhang Wei carried Zhang Jia on his back and ran away dejectedly.","This scene was witnessed by a great many people, and they were all excited.","“Hiss, this newcomer is very awesome, isn’t he? He even dares to trifle with an Imperial Son’s people.”","“Hehe, he can only act arrogant for a while now. When the Imperial Son of the Niu Clan arrives later, he would probably have to lower his head and apologize.”","“You guys have guessed wrongly — do you guys know who he is?”","“Who is it?”","“Ling Han, the Imperial Son Killer!”","“What!”","Ling Han was so famous, so there were definitely people who recognized him. When they revealed his identity, it immediately caused a great many people to be stunned.","Who did not know of Ling Han’s name?","It was rumored that quite a few Imperial Sons had died by his hand. Previously, he had even caused the five great Imperial Clans to join forces, and go to the Nine Suns Holy Land to seek him out. However, they had not thought that Nine Mountains would become a Saint, and furthermore, had hold of the Imperial Weapon, and directly rebuked the five great Imperial Clans.","However, in the last dozen or so years, there had been no more news of Ling Han. At first, it was thought that because he was wary of the Imperial Clans, he had disappeared without a trace. They had not thought that he would appear again now, and directly clash with an Imperial Clan.","The Imperial Son Killer truly lived up to his reputation of specializing in provoking Imperial Sons.","Everyone quietly waited to watch the excitement.","After a while, Zhang Wei, Zhang Jia and the others came again, and this time, there was also an extraordinary-looking young man. His whole body was covered with a warm light.","Imperial Son, Niu Tengfei.","This Imperial Son very quickly focused his gaze on Ling Han. A look of realization appeared on his face, and he said, “I was wondering who would be so outrageously bold to not even give me face. So it is Ling Han.”","What!","When Zhang Wei and the others heard this, their hearts clenched.","They had naturally heard of Ling Han’s great name. That was truly a lawless person. It was said that he had even killed the Imperial Son, yet he was still alive and well. This was proof enough of his abilities.","And now, they had actually come into conflict with this kind of Demon King. Wasn’t that just courting death?","“Brat, don’t speak so sarcastically. Do you dare battle me?” The large black dog immediately jumped out.","A look of fury appeared on Niu Tengfei’s face. As he saw it, Ling Han had the Nine Mountains Saint standing behind him, so he could just barely be considered an Imperial Son, and was qualified to be his equal. However, how could a demonic dog be qualified to strut around in front of him?","“Ling Han, control the creatures around you, so that they will not seek their own suffering!” he said balefully.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Now that they’ve entered the academy, we’re all classmates. Since you look down on your classmates so much, shouldn’t I report this to the leaders of the academy?”","‘F*ck you!’","Niu Tengfei took a few deep breaths, but forcefully suppressed his anger.","He was a third generation Imperial Son, and everyone knew that Ling Han was already capable of beating up a third generation Imperial Son. Only the Silver Generation could stand against him.","Thus, if he were to forcefully use force now, that would only be seeking his own humiliation.","The Ancestral King Academy didn’t punish disciples for sparring with each other, as long as they didn’t cripple or cause death. Thus, if he took the initiative to provoke Ling Han and was beaten up for it, he could only swallow this bitter pill.","“Good! Good! Good!” Niu Tengfei said hatefully, “Since you’re here, then enjoy yourself!”","He couldn’t defeat Ling Han, but wasn’t there still the Silver Generation? If the Silver Generation couldn’t defeat Ling Han, there was still the Golden Generation!","Because he himself had come from the Imperial Clan, he knew better than anyone else just how terrifying the Golden Generation was. That kind of crushing pressure was enough to drive anyone to despair.","Ling Han was already the public enemy of the Imperial Clans. Thus, as long as they knew that Ling Han had come, he was sure that there would be a great many powerful Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters that would make a move, and teach this mad man a harsh lesson.","Niu Tengfei had come aggressively, yet ran away with his tail between his legs, greatly disappointing those who wanted to watch the excitement.","Seriously, they had anticipated for so long for nothing; they actually did not fight.","After this small interlude, everything was peaceful again.","Ling Han found out that the Ancestral King Academy had a very special set of rules.","Usually, if you had any questions on cultivation, you could completely ask for guidance from the teachers of the academy. If a Sect Master could not answer, a Venerate Tier would come out. If a Venerate Tier could not answer, then even a Saint would come out.","However, as for cultivation resources, one would have to fight for them himself.","Every month, the academy would hold a martial arts competition to decide the top ten of each cultivation level, and only these top ten would be able to obtain cultivation resources, a huge amount at that.","—The Ancestral King Academy wasn’t a charity to help everyone grow together. Wrong, elites would become stronger here, while the rest would only become weaker.","Because what was nurtured here was the future Ancestral King. At the very least, they would be competitors on the Imperial Path. Without such natural talent and abilities, what value would there be to nurture them?","Thus, everyone here was working hard on cultivation.","Only 10 people at each cultivation level could receive cultivation resources. This meant that many Imperial Sons would be empty-handed at the end, which showed how fierce the competition was.","Yet Ling Han was very expectant. When would the next tournament begin?","—"]},{"number":4307,"title":"Chapter 4307: Ding Shu is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 4307: Ding Shu is Here","Editor: Henyee Translations","A few days later, the Ancestral King Academy welcomed another freakish prodigy.","Ding Shu.","He had shocked the world with a single feat, possessing the Eight Coloured True Self, scaring a large number of people. Even a Saint that was overseeing the academy was alerted, and personally tested it out. Immediately, he expressed the intention to take Ding Shu as disciple.","What was shocking was that Ding Shu actually refused.","Ling Han knew that Ding Shu had still concealed his strength. This guy was the ninth form of the True Self Tier, so he should possess the Nine-colored True Self. However, if he truly displayed the Nine-colored True Self, it probably wouldn’t be a Saint admiring him, but rather the Imperial Clans would kill him by hook or by crook.","Thus, Ding Shu should not have reached the end of the ninth form yet. He only had to show those True Selves that had not yet begun to develop into the ninth form, and he would naturally be able to bluff his way through.","He was the exact opposite of Ling Han. Ling Han showed the Tenth Form, but the effect was the same, and that was to appropriately conceal his strength.","However, the information about Ling Han’s True Self was inexplicably exposed.","Now, everyone in the academy knew that though Ling Han had cultivated to the seventh form, his True Self was actually extremely ordinary.","This similarly alerted a few higher ups, and they deliberately called Ling Han over for a follow-up examination. The result confirmed the rumors.","When the news spread out, the academy was once again shaken.","This time, it was not because they were shocked by how high Ling Han’s natural talent was, but rather because he was too weak.","Instantly, a great many disciples submitted a joint application, requesting that Ling Han be kicked out of the academy.","To have such a person stay in the academy, wasn’t that smearing the reputation of the academy? Oh, when an Ancestral King walked out of the academy in future, and said that he had once shared a class with this kind of weak trash, wouldn’t that be a stain on his whole life?","The higher ups of the academy discussed for a while, and decided to give Ling Han a chance.","In the next competition, if Ling Han could make it into the top twenty, then he could continue to stay in the academy. Otherwise, he would be kicked out of the academy.","This request wasn’t too high. After all, they did not demand that Ling Han make it into the top 10. But it definitely wasn’t a low requirement either. Top 20! With his “mediocre” True Self?","The news quickly spread throughout the entire academy. Everyone was curious and expectant. Would Ling Han, this guy who had risen so powerfully, be able to continue performing miracles, or would he be kicked out of the academy and scram with his tail between his legs?","Ding Shu immediately found Ling Han.","“Hey, what method did you use to actually turn the True Self into a mortal body?” His face was filled with curiosity.","Others might not know, but how could he not know? Ling Han had cultivated the ninth form, and was a freak like him. Thus, how could Ling Han have possibly become a piece of trash?","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “That’s how it is in the first place. Perhaps you’re overthinking things?”","Ding Shu slanted a sideways glance at him, “Are you setting a trap for someone again?”","Ling Han spread his hands, “I have always kept a low profile.”","“Hehe.” Ding Shu put on a fake smile, obviously not believing him.","“To say nothing of me, didn’t you also deliberately reveal the Eight Coloured True Self?” Ling Han said with a smile. “What is it? Do you want me to rectify your name? You’re the ninth form.”","Ding Shu didn’t say anything else. He glanced at Ling Han and said, “The next tournament will be five days later. You’re not truly aiming to rank in the top twenty, are you?”","“Hehe, haven’t you always wanted to compete with me?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Then you have to take it easy. Don’t be eliminated before you even come into contact with me.” Ding Shu stood up, and left with a wave of his hand.","“Sure, you should work hard too. Who knows, there may be elites here,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Ding Shu merely laughed loudly, and did not speak. It was as if he disdained from replying.","...","At Niu Tengfei’s place.","“What? That guy’s True Self is actually a mortal body!” Niu Tengfei immediately stood up, his face filled with hatred.","“The Seventh Form has actually formed a mortal body?” He faltered for a moment, then laughed loudly. He was the Imperial Son, so it was naturally not difficult for him to obtain information about Ling Han.","“We really fell for his intimidation!” Niu Da stopped laughing. A man’s name was like a tree’s shadow. Ling Han’s previous performance was too nature-defying, blasting the pride of the third-generation Imperial Sons to nothing, making him not dare to clash with him at all.","“I... am also in the Seventh Form now!” He clenched his fists. Unlike Ling Han, who could not obtain enough cultivation resources without venturing out, he was the Imperial Son, and had abundant cultivation resources, so there was absolutely no need for him to worry about this problem.","Thus, he had already advanced into the seventh form, and was close to catching up to the tail of the Silver Generation.","“Imperial Son, should we go find that guy now, and teach him a good lesson?” Zhang Jia asked. It could be said that he bore a grudge against Ling Han.","Niu Tengfei pondered for a moment, then quickly shook his head.","“That brat is also a grandmaster of formations, and has mastered the Star Steps. Thus, even if he can’t win, he can still run. Previously, it wasn’t like there hadn’t been a Silver Generation member that had fought with him before, and that was how he managed to play around with him.”","“However, during the academy tournament, it can only be held in a fixed area. This guy’s Star Steps can’t show its might.”","“Hehe, by then, he would only be able to suffer a beating.”","He was already confident, “I will use my connections, and have that guy face me in his first battle. I will defeat him in public, and restore the prestige of our Imperial Clans!”","“Hehe, Imperial Son is brilliant!” Zhang Jia immediately flattered.","The other two hurriedly followed, and said, “Ling Han was too impudent previously, offending so many Imperial Clans. If Imperial Son, you defeat Ling Han, then whatever Ziwei Imperial Clan, and Xuanfeng Imperial Clan would owe Imperial Son a favor.”","“In this way, the Imperial Son’s name could even surpass the Golden Generation!”","Previously, everyone had said that only the Golden Generation could suppress Ling Han. If Niu Tengfei could do so, then wouldn’t aptitude be on par with the Golden Generation?","Niu Tengfei showed an expression of pride. He was definitely going to be a hero!","...","Time slowly crept by. One day later, the battles between disciples of the Foundation Building Tier began first.","Ling Han didn’t pay any attention to them, because the people by his side were all at least at the Core Formation Tier. What was so fun about watching a bunch of little brothers and sisters that he did not know fight?","After this day, it was time for the Cauldron Forging Tier disciples to battle, and then another day later, it was time for the Core Formation Tier disciples to battle.","With the participation of his two beautiful wives, Ling Han naturally had to attend. He had long since arrived at the tournament grounds. This place had been reinforced by the Saints. To say nothing of the great battle between Core Formation Tier cultivators, even a battle between Sect Masters would find it very difficult to cause too much damage.","The aptitude of the empress and Hu Niu was comparable to the Imperial Son, but even if they now cultivated the Imperial Scroll and Body Art, they could only match the aptitude of an ordinary Imperial Son.","Thankfully, the majority of Imperial Sons had all advanced into True Self Tier, so the two women were ranked fourth and fifth respectively. This result could not be considered too bad, as they had obtained a great amount of cultivation resources.","The competition ended, and Ling Han left. However, he bumped into Niu Tengfei at the door.","“Tomorrow, I will beat the crap out of you!” this Imperial Son declared, his lips curling up slightly, looking extremely arrogant.","Ling Han chuckled upon hearing this. There were actually people who believed his bluff.","“Then, let’s wait and see.” He smiled. Then, he would beat the crap out of you tomorrow."]},{"number":4308,"title":"Chapter 4308: Battles Begin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4308: Battles Begin","Editor: Henyee Translations","A day passed, and the True Self Tier battles began.","The top twenty from the previous tournament would not participate in the preliminaries. The others would fight first, and after about twenty to thirty people had been decided, the challenges would begin — the top twenty from the last tournament would be challenged. If they won, they would replace them, and if they lost, they would lose the right to continue fighting.","Thus, Ling Han, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon would have to participate in the preliminaries first.","There were a total of more than three hundred people. After about four rounds, there would only be about twenty to thirty left.","After drawing lots, everyone’s opponents were decided.","Ling Han’s opponent was... Niu Tengfei.","Yi, so coincidental?","Ling Han was astonished. He was the Imperial Son, yet he hadn’t even made it into the top twenty?","He must be deliberately targeting him.","The Ancestral King Academy was founded by the combined forces of the various Imperial Clans. Thus, if Niu Tengfei had done something that allowed the two of them to coincidentally match up with each other, it would not be difficult to imagine.","However, this guy was going to shoot himself in the foot.","Did he really think that he was a mortal and could be bullied as he liked?","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. Then he’ll beat him to his heart’s content.","Very soon, the first round of eliminations began.","Because there were more people, they were divided into three groups. Ling Han took a look. He was in the last group.","‘Fine, I’ll just have to wait.’","The large black dog and little azure dragon were in the first group, and the two of them easily defeated their respective opponents.","—They had not entered into the Dark Clouds Hell, so the advancement of their cultivation level naturally could not keep up with Ling Han. However, they would be taking alchemical pills concocted by Ling Han every day, and added with the resources provided by the Nine Suns Holy Land, their advancement rate could not be considered slow.","Afterwards, Ling Han returned, and distributed the Source Dao Stones to them, allowing the advancement of the people by his side to rapidly increase.","Thus, the two of them were both in the fifth form of the True Self Tier. They couldn’t compare to Ling Han, but they were definitely elites in this cultivation level.","However, there were many prodigies gathered here. Even if they could pass the first round, they might not be able to pass the second and third rounds of elimination. After all, the fifth form was still a little too low.","The seven babies didn’t participate in the battle. Firstly, they didn’t need cultivation resources, and secondly, there were too many elites here. Ling Han was afraid that something would happen to them.","In the second group, Ding Shu took the field, displaying terrifying abilities. He defeated his opponent with a single strike, and it was in line with his “Eighth Form” battle prowess.","The battles for the third group immediately began.","Ling Han walked into the arena, and Niu Tengfei had already walked in as well. His hands were crossed behind his back, a faint smile curling up the corners of his lips.","“You did it on purpose, didn’t you?” Ling Han asked.","“That’s right,” Niu Tengfei nodded proudly.","“I’ve really troubled you,” Ling Han said with a smile. “However, aren’t you afraid of shooting yourself in the foot?”","“Hahaha!” Niu Tengfei laughed loudly, “Don’t think that just because I am not in the top twenty, my abilities are very, very weak! On the other hand, I too am in the Seventh Form, but I had something on previously, and have only recently returned to the academy, and have not participated in the previous ranking battles.”","Oh, so that was how it was.","Ling Han nodded and said, “By the looks of it, you still won’t be able to enter the top 20 this time.”","“Humph, you are really arrogant!” Niu Tengfei smirked coldly. With a thought, a True Self appeared above his head, and five-coloured light overflowed.","Seeing this scene, quite a number of people exclaimed in shock. Even those higher ups in the academy were nodding repeatedly.","“Five Coloured True Self, almost catching up to Silver Generation.”","“En, among the Silver Generation, he can at least be ranked at the bottom.”","“Who would’ve thought? What heaven-defying fated opportunity did this brat obtain? He actually managed to cultivate a Five Colored True Self!”","Hearing the exclamations of shock from the masses, Niu Tengfei revealed an expression of pride. He had indeed obtained a great opportunity, which allowed him to advance into the Seventh Form. Furthermore, he had even allowed the True Self to form the Five Coloured Fetus.","The gods were blessing him, so they couldn’t be envious.","Ling Han cracked his knuckles, and said, “Although this is still a little weak, this is like beating a child on a cloudy day, when there is nothing else to do. I am free anyway.”","“You!” Niu Tengfei glared angrily. Even at a time like this, you are still so arrogant?","Boom, he charged out, and used the celestial technique. A black-coloured bull appeared, condensing Regulations and high-level energy, which ruthlessly crashed towards Ling Han.","Especially the two bull horns, which were exuding a coldness like Divine Metal. Their destructive power was definitely terrifying.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and with a flash, xiu, he instantly disappeared from where he had been standing. When he reappeared, he had already appeared behind Niu Tengfei. Then, he shot out a punch.","He hadn’t used any celestial technique, but he had instilled his own understanding of martial arts into this punch. This was the path that he had tentatively begun to walk.","In everyone’s eyes, this punch was very ordinary, yet seemed to contain some kind of Regulations, filled with mystery.","Peng, with a single punch, Niu Tengfei did not manage to parry or dodge at all, or perhaps he had forgotten to parry. He was hit solidly, and instantly sprawled out on the ground.","He was just about to bounce up, but a foot had already stepped on his head. If he dared to struggle with all his might, it was possible that his mind would be trampled through.","Niu Tengfei instantly didn’t dare to move.","He couldn’t help but flush red with embarrassment. Yesterday, he had even threatened to beat Ling Han into submission. Who would’ve thought that he would be beaten to the ground in a single exchange?","What kind of strange footwork was this, that it could actually surpass his divine sense?","Star Steps?","That was impossible. There was a suppressing formation here, and he could not communicate with the ley lines. Otherwise, how could he have taken the initiative to ask for a rebuff?","“No way, he was knocked down with a single punch?”","“Too weak!”","“Could it be that his Five Coloured True Self was formed through the use of a natural treasure? Otherwise, his battle prowess definitely wouldn’t be so weak.”","“That’s right. I saw that Ling Han’s punch was very ordinary, but why didn’t he even move to parry?”","“Sigh, what a piece of trash.”","Everyone shook their heads. What Seventh Form and Five Coloured True Self? He was so weak.","The higher-ups were also a little confused. Though they thought that Ling Han’s punch was a little strange, upon closer thought, it seemed to be very ordinary.","Was Niu Tengfei really too weak?","However, the outcome of the battle had already been decided, so they couldn’t worry about this for the time being. In that case, they would just let the battle test Ling Han’s strength.","Not long after, all three groups of battles ended.","After drawing lots again, the second round of eliminations began.","This time, Ling Han’s luck was slightly better. He had drawn an opponent in the sixth form of True Self Tier, so he was naturally able to deal with him easily with his advantage of having a “higher cultivation level”.","It was the same for the third and fourth rounds. After all, those who could cultivate to the seventh form should have the strength to advance into the top thirty. As long as they did not encounter each other in advance, passing four rounds of elimination battles would not be a problem.","The large black dog and little azure dragon also passed four rounds. However, due to the limitations of their cultivation level, it was almost impossible for them to advance any further. No matter what, they had to advance into the peak stage of the sixth form. In fact, only after reaching the seventh form would they be qualified to charge into the top twenty.","Next, they could watch the show.","Now, a total of 22 people had passed four rounds of elimination, and gained the qualifications to challenge the top 20. Every person had a chance, and if they failed, they could only wait for another month.","“Begin.” A Sect Master spoke up."]},{"number":4309,"title":"Chapter 4309: Battling the Number one","paragraphs":["Chapter 4309: Battling the Number one","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to attack. After all, he was an elite, so he definitely couldn’t rush into battle.","The seeds ranked in the top 20 all stood proudly, according to their rankings. Thus, one only had to count which rank this person was ranked in to know his ranking.","First place was Guan Xia.","Guan Xia, Imperial Son of the Xuanfeng Imperial Clan, Silver Generation, and also Guan Yuanming’s cousin. In terms of a large clan, this relationship was quite close.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. Previously, when he had entered into the True Dragon Abyss, wasn’tCheng Qing from the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan the one who had stood out in the True Self Tier? Why was it now Guan Xia that was sitting in the position of the number one elite of the True Self Tier?","He asked the large black dog, and only then did he find out that Cheng Qing had already advanced into the SpiritTransformation Tier. In that case, it was naturally impossible for him to participate in the competition for the True Self Tier.","However, at that time, Cheng Qing could do as he liked in the True Self Tier, and was the top elite. However, after advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier, because his cultivation level was not high, and there were some Golden Generation elites that remained at this cultivation level, he was naturally suppressed very badly, and was not even able to enter into the top twenty.","So that was the case. Ling Han nodded.","“Little Han, who do you plan to challenge?” the large black dog asked.","“Needless to say?” Ling Han said with a smile.","The large black dog finally understood. Ling Han was definitely aiming for the first place.","“Take it easy. Don’t expose the secret that you are the Tenth Form,” the large black dog warned. If this spread out, it was probable that even the caskets of Ancestral Kings would not be able to contain them, and they would turn into zombies, one after another, and come out.","“I know.” Ling Han nodded. As an unreliable guy, he actually dared to remind him. How shameless.","Consecutive challenges were issued, but most of them failed. There were very few who succeeded. Furthermore, those who had previously stood in the 18th, 19th, and 20th places had been defeated, and now, they were fighting their way back. This was an ordinary tug-of-war.","Ling Han saw that Ding Shu was already restless, so he stepped out first.","“Yi, Ling Han is going to issue a challenge!”","“Who would he choose?”","“Although he’s at the Seventh Form, his True Self is far too weak. In fact, he can only rank at the bottom of the Seventh Form. Thus, I believe that he won’t challenge anyone above the fifteenth rank.”","“Hehe, there are those that are weaker than him, such as that Imperial Son of the Niu Clan.”","“Pu!”","A great many people laughed out loud. Niu Tengfei would definitely become a great joke in future. He couldn’t even win against a fellow cultivator of the same cultivation level with a mortal body; how utterly humiliating.","Niu Tengfei didn’t leave. He was unwilling to give up, and wanted to see how Ling Han was defeated. Hearing the gossip of the masses, he couldn’t help but blush.","However, most of the people here were Imperial Sons, and none of them had a background weaker than his. So what if he was furious? They weren’t afraid of him, or they wouldn’t be spouting such words even though they knew he was here.","It was all Ling Han’s fault! It was all this evil villain’s fault!","Niu Tengfei’s eyes were spitting fire, wanting nothing more than to rush up and kill Ling Han.","He was extremely dissatisfied. As the Imperial Son, he had naturally grasped a great many ultimate techniques, but he had not even managed to cast them before he was defeated, which made him feel that he had lost too unjustly.","However, he was also very curious which pushover Ling Han would pick.","Right at this moment, Ding Shu also jumped out.","“I’ll challenge him!”","“I choose him!”","Practically at the same time, Ling Han and Ding Shu both stretched out their hands and pointed at Guan Xia.","This?","Everyone couldn’t help but grit their teeth. That was Guan Xia, a Silver Generation elite. Not only had he long since cultivated to the Seventh Form, he was actually still a Six-Colored Fetus!","If it was not for the fact that he still wanted to attempt the Eighth Form, and challenge the heights of the Golden Generation, he would have long since been able to advance into the Spirit Transformation Tier.","This kind of opponent should be avoided at all costs, and they actually wanted to snatch the opportunity to issue a challenge?","Especially Ling Han. He still had a mission. If he lost this battle, he would not be able to make top twenty, and would be kicked out of the academy.","Under such pressure, he actually dared to challenge Guan Xia, who was ranked number one?","Just how outrageously bold was this?","“Ling Han issued the challenge first,” a Sect Master said.","Ding Shu had no choice but to step aside.","However, this was also good. If Ling Han won, then it would be enough for him to defeat Ling Han, and if Ling Han lost... hoho, that would be impossible.","Just in time. He wanted to have a hearty battle with Ling Han.","Guan Xia walked out, looking down on Ling Han.","This wasn’t the first time they had met, and they had already fought once before. However, at that time, Guan Xia’s cultivation level had far surpassed Ling Han’s. Ling Han could only use the Star Steps to toy around with him, but didn’t have the strength to fight him head-on.","Now, after more than ten years, Ling Han’s cultivation level had greatly improved, and Guan Xia had also advanced from the sixth form to the seventh form. His improvement was actually quite amazing.","“This time, you have nowhere to run!” Guan Xia stated calmly. The Silver Generation elite had moved, and was actually unable to suppress a person whose abilities and cultivation level was far inferior to his. This had become a humiliation to him.","But this time, he would be able to wash away this humiliation.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Why should I flee?”","“Haha, someone seems to have forgotten the scandal of being hunted down by me all over the universe!” Guan Xia said disdainfully.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “At that time, I was in the third form of the True Self Tier, and you were in the sixth form. If I were to face you head-on, that would be an extremely stupid thing to do.”","Guan Xia was speechless for a moment. Indeed, the gap in cultivation level was too wide, so it was very normal that Ling Han was outmatched. On the other hand, with a gap of three minor levels, Ling Han was still able to escape alive from the grasp of a Silver Generation elite. This was the truly awesome thing.","He immediately composed himself, and said calmly, “I understand. You were stimulated by that battle, so you took the crooked path to rapidly increase your cultivation level. Your cultivation level has indeed increased, but the quality of your True Self... heh.”","Needless to say, everyone knew that Ling Han’s seventh form was a mortal body.","The path of cultivation level requiredone to take one firm and solid step at a time. In the end, there was a price to pay for taking a shortcut that could lead to quick success.","The truth was indeed so. Ling Han had paid a price, but it was not having the quality of his True Self decreased, but rather damaged the foundations of his life force, and almost caused a huge problem.","Guan Xia’s deduction was reasonable, and everyone nodded. No wonder Ling Han’s Seventh Form was so weak. So that was the logic.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile, “Have you come to battle, or to commentate?”","“To defeat you?” Guan Xia shook his head, “It would only be the matter of a few moves.”","“All right, I’ll wait and see.” Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","“Ignorant!” Guan Xia sneered, and pointed a finger at Ling Han. Instantly, the whole sky was filled with stars.","Boom, every streak of starlight was the size of a fist, and Regulations could be vaguely seen. Like raindrops, they enshrouded Ling Han.","Ling Han stood proudly, unafraid in the slightest.","This was natural. He was in the Tenth Form, and even if all the True Self Tier elites here attacked at the same time, he could still suppress them single-handedly.","—If these people knew that he had once easily killed a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator in the Second Change, their thoughts would definitely be different now.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","When the starlight landed on or near Ling Han, it immediately exploded. Instantly, seals appeared everywhere, and a terrifying energy surged chaotically, turning into golden mushroom clouds.","Ling Han instantly disappeared from sight."]},{"number":4310,"title":"Chapter 4310: Six Coloured Saber","paragraphs":["Chapter 4310: Six Coloured Saber","Editor: Henyee Translations","“This is Guan Xia’s strength!”","“This is the true strength of the Seventh Form.”","“That brat is too arrogant. He actually dared to take this attack head-on.”","“Haha, he’s going to be kicked out of the academy this time.”","Everyone smirked coldly. Most of the people here were descendants of the Imperial Clans and the minority were Dao Child of the Holy Lands. How could they dare to oppose the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters openly by saying differently?","“Pei! Even if you guys die 100 times, Little Han won’t lose a single hair!” the large black dog immediately spat.","“It’s not that Grandpa Dragon looks down on you guys, but you guys are just a bunch of trash in my eyes.” The little azure dragon’s mouth was also unforgiving, its sharpness extremely high.","This caused everyone to be furious. If it was not for the fact that this was the tournament grounds, and there were a considerable number of elites standing guard, they really wanted to rush up and tear the mouths of these two guys.","“Heh, he can’t even withstand a single strike. What else is there left to say?” one of the Imperial Sons asked coldly.","Facts spoke louder than words.","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon and the large black dog wore expressions of disdain. “Has the battle been decided already? Idiot!”","“The victor hasn’t been decided yet?” The Imperial Son laughed in spite of himself, “Why do you people only know how to pester endlessly?”","“Pei, even the Lords have not announced the results, so what are you jumping around for?” the large black dog spat out.","“Grandpa Dragon guesses that this guy might have some shameful relationship with Guan Xia’s a$$hole,” the little azure dragon said with certainty.","That Imperial Son instantly wanted to throw up blood. He had only spoken the truth, so how did it have anything to do with Guan Xia?","“Stop the commotion!” A Sect Master shouted in a deep voice. Instantly, everyone fell silent.","On the battlefield, the light gradually dispersed, and Ling Han was seen standing proudly, completely unscathed.","How was this possible!","Instantly, everyone felt their scalps go numb. This guy had taken a blow from Guan Xia head-on. Even if Guan Xia had not used his full strength, how could he have blocked it so easily?","Could it be that this guy was wearing some treasured armor that could withstand such a violent attack?","“This is unfair!”","“That’s right. In battle, it is not allowed to use any kind of Spirit Tool.”","“Otherwise, if I go and get a Saint Tool, wouldn’t I be able to sweep aside all opposition and be invincible?”","Everyone called out, thinking that Ling Han had severely breached the rules.","“Shut up!” the Sect Master shouted in a deep voice. “Ling Han didn’t use a Spirit Tool.”","‘What?’","Disbelief spread across everyone’s faces. How was this possible?","Meanwhile, Guan Xia took a deep breath, his expression becoming incredibly serious.","Since the Sect Master said that Ling Han didn’t use a Spirit Tool, that must be the case. He recognized this Sect Master, though he wasn’t from his own clan. Instead, he was from the Peacock Imperial Clan. He definitely wouldn’t side with Ling Han.","In other words, Ling Han’s strength... was very strong.","He needed to get serious.","Weng, Guan Xia’s whole body glowed. On his right side, a six-coloured saber appeared, and there were incredibly mysterious veined patterns on the blade.","He stretched out his hand and grabbed it. The colorful saber was already in his hand.","Yi, didn’t they say that Spirit Tools couldn’t be used?","Ling Han focused his gaze, and couldn’t help but look slightly surprised. This colorful saber used Dao as its structure, and high-level energy as its blade. It was not a real saber.","Six colours?","True Self?","“Ling Han, try out the might of my saber strike!” Guan Xia said coldly. He brandished his saber in a slash. Six-coloured light dazzled the skies, as if even the heaven and earth had been sliced apart.","Yi, True Self can be used as a weapon?","Ling Han really didn’t know. Was this a secret technique that only the members of the Imperial Clans had mastered, or was it Guan Xia’s own fortuitous encounter that allowed him to possess such a Mystical Power?","He wanted to test out its might.","Ling Han clenched his hand into a fist, and charged towards the six-coloured saber.","Peng!","Guan Xia was instantly sent flying. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s body also swayed slightly. Even though he had suppressed his cultivation level to the Seventh Form, he was still able to firmly suppress Guan Xia.","However, when he raised his hand, a wound actually appeared on the tip of his fist.","It should be known that he had also cultivated Body Art, and his physique was incredibly tough. Coupled with the fact that he could automatically disperse the attack power within six Heavens, how could he possibly be injured by a Seventh Form?","That wasn’t refined from Origin Gold.","Interesting.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up, and his interest was instantly piqued.","And witnessing the might of this strike from Guan Xia, many Imperial Sons instantly felt exalted, and cheered loudly.","“Good job, Imperial Son Guan.”","“This is the true strength of the Silver Generation!”","“Despicable dog, four-legged snake, what else do you guys have to say now?”","The large black dog and little azure dragon’s expressions were filled with disdain. Ling Han didn’t get serious at all, okay? They really didn’t know what these people were acting so smug about.","Ling Han shook his fist. This was only a minor injury, and it immediately stopped the bleeding.","Using one’s True Self as a blade, the destructive power was a little overbearing.","I should be able to as well.","With a thought from Ling Han, the True Self of Destruction appeared.","As expected, it was very ordinary, too ordinary.","Everyone had seen it with their own eyes, and they were all certain that Ling Han was done for.","Even if he had now cultivated to the seventh form, how could a True Self of such quality evolve again? Then, with such a mortal body advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier, what spiritual body could he cultivate?","Too weak.","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He controlled the True Self to turn into a hammer.","“Haha!” Guan Xia couldn’t help but laugh coldly, “Do you think that just by watching me do it once, you would be able to turn the True Self into a weapon? You are really too naive!”","It was because he already had one foot into the Spirit Transformation Tier that he was able to turn the True Self into a weapon, and could be considered a pseudo spiritual body.","If you didn’t have the comprehension of the Spirit Transformation Tier, you wouldn’t be able to do it.","Boom, he brandished his saber and struck again, without mercy. He wanted to defeat Ling Han as soon as possible with a thunderous force.","Ling Han was extremely casual as he greeted the attack with the battle hammer that the True Self of Destruction had formed.","The colorful saber and the battle hammer clashed, but there was no physical impact, because the True Self of Destruction wasn’t solid, so the colorful saber directly slashed over, slicing towards Ling Han’s neck.","Everyone was filled with anticipation. They truly hoped that Ling Han would not be able to dodge in time, and be beheaded with a single strike.","—If Ling Han had really died here, the Nine Mountains Saint would have nothing to say. This was a very normal sparring match, so it was understandable that they could not help him in time. Moreover, it was Ling Han who had provoked Guan Xia first.","“Have you recorded it?” an Imperial Son asked.","“Of course.”","This could be used as proof. You see, it was Ling Han himself who had courted death.","Shua, the saber slashed over. Ling Han took a step back, dodging this blow.","His mind was completely focused on how to transform the True Self into a weapon. Thus, he was completely immersed in his own world, like a child who had just gotten a new toy.","However, he was completely helpless. No matter how much of a prodigy he was, there was no way he could immediately gain appreciation just by looking at someone else’s ultimate move.","After several dozen moves, Ling Han was naturally at a disadvantage. Guan Xia had complete control of the situation.","However, no matter how fiercely Guan Xia attacked, he was still unable to turn his advantage into victory.","Ling Han’s toughness seemed to have no bottom. No matter how much you beat him down, he would be able to withstand it.","This rendered everyone speechless. Was it really so difficult to defeat Ling Han?","Forget it.","Ling Han shook his head. If he wanted to cultivate the True Self into a weapon, he would definitely need to know how it worked. It was definitely impossible if he couldn’t find a way to do so.","He was only curious, because when it came to the Spirit Transformation Tier, the True Self would evolve into a spiritual body.","He was only a sliver away from Spirit Transformation Tier, so there was no need to waste his energy.","En, he was getting serious now.","— New chapter is coming soon —"]},{"number":4311,"title":"Chapter 4311: Getting serious","paragraphs":["Chapter 4311: Getting serious","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han decided to get serious.","His aura immediately changed, and a terrifying power surged. He threw a punch, bringing with it a crushing force, that shot towards Guan Xia.","‘What?’","Guan Xia couldn’t help but feel astonished. Why had Ling Han’s strength suddenly increased so much?","However, could he dodge?","He had been beating down on Ling Han all this while. Oh, now that Ling Han was fighting back, he actually didn’t dare to take it head-on?","With a loud shout, he brandished the colorful saber, slashing out at Ling Han.","Fine, I might as well split you into two.","Peng, fist crashed into colorful saber, but the result this time was completely different. The colorful saber was forcibly shattered, and then crumbled, turning into endless pieces.","At the same time, Guan Xia was also sent flying, drawing a curve in the sky before landing heavily on the ground, raising a cloud of dust.","At this moment, a dead silence fell.","What was going on?","Was Guan Xia sleepwalking? He had actually been smashed with a single punch?","“Hahaha!” The large black dog and little azure dragon laughed loudly.","“How is it? Do you all yield, trash?”","“If you don’t have any abilities, then stop blabbering nonsense, to avoid making a big fool of yourself.”","The two of them began to mock to their heart’s content. Who asked those people from before to be so arrogant? Once these two guys started their mockery, their battle prowess would definitely not be something that a few dozen Imperial Sons could oppose.","“Guan Xia, stand up quickly!”","“You’re one of the strongest members of the Silver Generation!”","“Stand up!”","Everyone was cheering Guan Xia on, but what use was that? He had already been knocked unconscious by Ling Han’s punch.","His cultivation level was three minor levels lower than Ling Han’s, so how could he possibly withstand a single punch from him?","It was already very fortunate that he hadn’t been beaten to death.","Ling Han clapped his hands, and asked, “Am I number one now?”","Seeing how uncaring he was, everyone wanted to slap him.","Too arrogant; he was really too arrogant.","However, even Guan Xia had been defeated. Apart from glaring at him, what else could they do?","None of them could figure it out. Ling Han’s True Self was clearly so ordinary, so how could he burst out with such terrifying battle prowess?","“Unfortunately, Han Dihas gone to the Dark Clouds Hell. He is the Silver Generation elite that has the highest chance of breaking through to Eight Forms,” someone suddenly said, his expression filled with regret.","“En!” This caused quite a number of people to nod.","Han Di was indeed a freakish natural talent. It eben seemed like he had hopes of catching up to the weakest of the Golden Generation. He took a risk by entering into Dark Clouds Hell, and now there was no news from him. It was unknown what had become of him.","“With Han Di’s talent, he’s probably already reached the Eighth Form by now. If he were here, Ling Han wouldn’t be so arrogant!”","“Too bad!”","Everyone gritted their teeth. It could not be helped. They could only watch as Ling Han acted arrogantly and proudly.","However, what they didn’t know was that Han Di had indeed advanced to the Eighth Form. Moreover, he had even battled with Ling Han before being easily killed by Ling Han.","Eight Forms versus Ten Forms, and it was a freak like Ling Han at that. Wasn’t that just courting death?","Ling Han had no intention of exposing this. He peered down at them, appearing extremely arrogant and haughty.","No one issued a challenge. Ling Han stood there in boredom, while his eyes turned towards Ding Shu.","Yet Ding Shu gave him a strange smile. He issued a challenge to Xu Youque, the Imperial Son who was ranked second. Very soon, he defeated him, and took his place as second place.","He walked to Ling Han’s side, crossing his arms over his chest.","“Why aren’t you challenging me?” Ling Han asked through divine sense.","“You and I have too many secrets, so it would be best not to battle here,” Ding Shu replied.","Ling Han nodded. If Ding Shu really challenged him, then he would definitely suppress his battle prowess. If they battled like this, it would really be too dissatisfying.","“Alright, let’s set a time. We’ll go to a desolate planet to battle.”","“Deal.”","After this battle, Ling Han’s name naturally spread throughout the academy again. Previously, everyone thought that he was done for, with how his True Self was only mortal.","However, this battle had redeemed Ling Han’s name. Your uncle is still your uncle, and he was still very awesome.","This also attracted the curiosity of many people. How could Ling Han be so powerful?","Ling Han received a large amount of cultivation resources. Indeed, the Ancestral King Academy wasn’t stingy in this aspect. The rewards for the top ten were extremely generous, so he could improve his cultivation level at a high speed.","However, Ling Han’s hidden danger was still not resolved. His life force was still severely damaged, and he needed a greatly nutritious Celestial medicine to repair the damaged life force.","This kind of Great Herb was extremely valuable even among the Imperial Clans, so it was naturally impossible to be offered a reward. Thus, Ling Han couldn’t possibly obtain such a Great Herb from the Ancestral King Academy.","Forget it, he’ll improve his cultivation first. In any case, he hadn’t reached the end of the tenth form yet, and was still a little far from breaking through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. He wasn’t in a hurry to consider this problem.","A few days later, Ding Shu ran over and dragged him to an uninhabited planet for a battle.","Ling Han gladly agreed. He very much wanted to know how strong Ding Shu was, and what secret techniques he had grasped. Though they had both come out of Genesis World, and were both poor, and had to start from the beginning again, people like them would all have great opportunities, and definitely could not be underestimated.","The two of them battled fiercely. Ling Han tried his best to appear as if he was exerting his full effort, to avoid Ding Shu from noticing anything off. He suppressed his cultivation level to the middle stage of the ninth form, and battled fiercely with Ding Shu.","In this battle, Ding Shu was definitely going all out, allowing Ling Han to see a great many of his secrets.","Unlike Ling Han, Ding Shu did not have the ability to neutralize attacks within six Heavens, but he could increase his own battle prowess by three Heavens for a short period of time. This was also considerably terrifying. Caught off guard, Ling Han almost suffered a loss.","Thankfully, his defense was so strong that it rendered others speechless. He was only in a flurry for a moment.","Ding Shu attacked a few more times, and couldn’t help but stop, sighing dejectedly.","“The fact that you can dissipate the attacks that you receive is too great an advantage.” He appeared very exasperated, then a little curious, “What is this limit of yours?”","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before replying, “Within six Heavens.”","“Hiss!” Ding Shu inhaled sharply, “I have a Mystical Power that has awakened, that can increase battle prowess by three Heavens. It has always been my trump card that can turn the tables, but when I encounter you, it is as if I am naturally subdued!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, patted his shoulder, and said, “So, remember to call me Boss in the future.”","Ding Shu was naturally unwilling. He was also an incredibly domineering person.","“Why don’t we do this? Let’s make a bet.” His eyes darted around, “If one of us can break through to the Tenth Form, the one who does not succeed would have to admit that he is the lackey.”","Hehe, your awareness is quite high, huh? You’re really made for being a lackey.","“What if both of us break through or fail to break through?” Ling Han asked.","“Then let’s compete to see who can break through the true limit after advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier,” Ding Shu Ding Shu said.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded decisively, because he was already invincible, “Don’t you regret it.”","“Of course.” Ding Shu was proud, “You can’t regret it either! Hehe, I am very interested in taking you as my underling.”","“Same goes for me.”"]},{"number":4312,"title":"Chapter 4312: Baili Luoyang","paragraphs":["Chapter 4312: Baili Luoyang","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ancestral King Academy","A group of Venerate Tier elites were seated. None of them spoke, and the atmosphere appeared extremely oppressive.","“Humph, to have a murderer who killed members of the Imperial Clans wander around in front of our eyes all day long, what kind of great humiliation is that?” A Venerate Tier slammed a hand on the table and exclaimed loudly, his face filled with fury.","This was Venerate Guan from the Xuan Feng Imperial Clan. Their Imperial Son, Guan Yuanming, had died in Ling Han’s hands, so he naturally saw Ling Han as a thorn in his side.","“What can we do?” the Demon Ox Imperial Clan’s Venerate Niu said. There were two black bull horns growing from his head, and mysterious seals lit up, exuding a terrifying pressure. Even a Sect Master could only shiver helplessly in front of him.","“Even Guan Xia is no match for him, and Han Di is still in the Dark Clouds Hell. There should be no one in the Silver Generation that can match him,” a Bodhisattva of the Buddhist Race of South Heavenly Realm said.","All of a sudden, all the Venerate Tier elites were a little speechless. If they were to make a move, killing Ling Han would naturally be child’s play, but unless they no longer wanted their lives, and planned to let the clan behind them take a huge risk, they would definitely not make a move on Ling Han.","“There’s one person who might be able to deal with that despicable brat,” the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan’s Venerate Shi said calmly.","“Who is it?” All the Venerates asked.","Yet Venerate Shi looked towards the Venerate Tier from the Ziwei Imperial Clan, “You will have to ask Big Brother Hanyun.”","Baili Hanyun couldn’t help but look startled, and asked, “You’re talking about that unfilial brat?”","Meanwhile, Venerate Shi sighed, and said, “Old Brother Hanyun, Luoyang was only too young at that time, and that was why he made such a great mistake. However, he should have gotten the punishment he deserved by now, so it’s about time to let him out.”","Baili Hanyun remained silent, his expression extremely dark.","The other Venerate Tier elites didn’t know the situation, and were all unable to answer. They were also curious. Judging by Venerate Shi’s tone, this “Luoyang” should have extremely shocking natural talent, but because he had committed a grave mistake, he was imprisoned by the Baili Clan.","Venerate Shi continued, “Furthermore, if Luoyang is allowed to come out, it would be just right for him to redeem himself.”","Baili Hanyun considered for a moment, then said, “I will contact the clan and make this suggestion.”","“He, then we’ll wait for Brother Hanyun’s good news,” Venerate Shi said with a nod.","Baili Hanyun, on the other hand, was decisive. He directly tore a rip into the Void and left.","Once he left, the other Venerate Tier elites were all curious, and began to ask who exactly this “Luoyang” was.","“The Baili Clan is blessed by the heavens. The Golden Generation has Baili Tian, the Silver Generation has Baili Yun, but you guys don’t know. The Baili Clan also has a prodigy called Baili Luoyang. It is said that his natural talent is even above Baili Yun, and is close to catching up to the Golden Generation.”","“However, this Baili Luoyang has once caused a huge scandal.”","“He has an illicit relationship with his aunt by marriage. After it was discovered, he was imprisoned by the Baili Clan. Calculating the time, it should have been about forty to fifty years.”","Venerate Shi said slowly.","All the Venerate Tier elites were astounded. To have inappropriate relations with their own aunt, this brat was really bold! Furthermore, he was already a member of the Imperial Clan, so what kind of beauties would not be easily obtainable in this world? Why did he have to target his own aunt?","Because it was too rare, these Venerate Tier elites all felt the urge to gossip.","“However, after committing such a colossal mistake, the Baili Clan actually didn’t kill him, and merely locked him up. This guy’s natural talent can be seen from this.” Venerate Shi continued.","“But he’s already been locked up for forty to fifty years. Can his cultivation level still keep up?” a Venerate Tier elite asked.","“The Baili Clan has no plans to give up on this clansman. Locking him up is only to temper his temperament, and the supply of various cultivation resources is not decreased in the slightest.” Venerate Shi smiled, “Judging by Baili Hanyun’s reaction, that Baili Luoyang should still be in the True Self Tier.”","“He can suppress that despicable brat, Ling Han?”","“His aptitude is comparable to Golden Generation’s. If he can advance into the Eighth Form, then he naturally can.”","“Heh, then let’s just wait and see.”","...","Ziwei Imperial Clan.","At the foot of a mountain stream, there was presently a naked young man sitting cross-legged beneath the waterfall, enduring the barrage from the waterfall.","Upon a closer look, one would discover that this waterfall was actually formed by Regulations. When it impacted on the young man’s body, endless seals exploded, terrifying without bounds.","Yet this young man was seated like a boulder, multiple divine patterns appearing on his body, intertwining to form incredibly complex veined patterns.","His face was as sharp as a blade, his expression resolute, and there was a coldness that seemed to have seen through everything.","Xiu, his eyes suddenly snapped open, and instantly, two streaks of divine light shot out.","An elder had suddenly appeared in front of him at some unknown time. He looked very ordinary, but upon a closer look, it was as if even the heavens were bowing their heads to him. He was indescribably powerful.","The Divine Fluid Saint of the Baili Clan.","“To be able to withstand the barrage of the Waterfall of Regulations, you should have advanced into the Eighth Form!” the Divine Fluid Saint said. Even though the sound of the waterfall crashing was as loud as thunder, his voice was still clear and distinct.","The young man stood up, and strode out of the waterfall. Then, he bowed to the Divine Fluid Saint, and said, “Luoyang pays his respects to Ancestor Divine Fluid.”","The Divine Fluid Saint nodded, and said, “You’ve already been here for 41 years, so it’s about enough time for you to reflect on your actions. Now, I have a mission for you.”","“Please instruct, Ancestor.” The young man bowed slightly, but there was an untamed expression on his face.","“Kill a person,” the Divine Fluid Saint said.","‘Hmm?’","The young man couldn’t help but be taken aback. The Imperial Clan wanted someone killed, and they actually had to specially assign him?","“Who?” he asked darkly.","“This person’s name is Ling Han!” the Divine Fluid Saint said. “Now, immediately report to the Ancestral King Academy. Your Fourth Uncle will inform you of the subsequent events.”","“Yes,” the young man nodded.","...","Ancestral King Academy","Ling Han had a large amount of cultivation resources, and his cultivation level instantly increased at a faster pace. Of course, this was completely incomparable to the Source Dao Stone. Otherwise, he would be able to advance to the end of the tenth form in about a year, and now, he would need three to four years.","Unless he could also obtain natural treasures, which could shorten this time.","His cultivation level had already reached a very high level. Cultivation level was something that had been tempered through a long period of time, so it was definitely impossible that it could be achieved overnight.","Peace had not lasted many days, when Ling Han received a mission.","In the Ancestral King Academy, one could not just focus on cultivating.","True elites definitely didn’t come from cultivating, but from battling.","Thus, the disciples of the Ancestral King Academy would be sent out to carry out various missions every once in a while. Basically, there would be some dangers to train themselves.","The mission that Ling Han had received was to destroy a gang that was secretly excavating a True Clouds Metal mine.","True Clouds Metal was a very rare metal, and was a fusion agent for refining Celestial Tool. After adding this thing, it could greatly increase the chances of successfully forging a Celestial Tool.","The Eastern River Planet was a place that produced True Cloud Metal, and it belonged to the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan. However, it was a subordinate clan of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan that actually controlled the mine. Thus, there was an outrageously bold gang of thieves, to be actually stealing True Clouds Metal."]},{"number":4313,"title":"Chapter 4313: Assassin Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4313: Assassin Again","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was a solo mission.","Thus, after Ling Han received the mission, he set off for the Eastern River Planet.","After several intergalactic teleportations, Ling Han finally arrived at his destination.","The Eastern River Planet was not considered a great planet. It was not that the planet was not big enough, but rather that the overall level of cultivation of the whole planet was not high enough. The strongest would only be Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Ling Han first went to the Liu Clan that was in charge of the True Clouds Metal mine.","He revealed his identity, and immediately received a warm welcome from the Liu Clan. In fact, just how enthusiastic were they? At the banquet, a few young and beautiful female clansmen of the Liu Clan repeatedly toasted him. As long as Ling Han was willing, they would probably come knocking on his door tonight.","This was a disciple of the Ancestral King Academy. As long as he didn’t die, he would at least become a great elite of the Venerate Tier in the future.","To the Liu Clan, this was naturally an incredibly strong backer that they had to cozy up to.","Ling Han naturally ignored this. There was only one thing on his mind now, and that was to increase his cultivation level, so that he could truly take control of his own destiny.","He asked about the mine, but the Liu Clan knew very little about this gang of thieves.","“To tell you the truth, Brother Ling, these bandits are really slippery.” The clan leader of the Liu Clan began to complain, “We have already set up a large number of people in the mine, but they would always find the weakest spot in the defense, and take advantage of the opening.”","“And by the time we discovered it, and charged over en masse, they had already fled completely.”","Thus, the Liu Clan actually did not know much more than Ling Han. Not only did they not know the identity of the thieves, they did not even know how many people there were in fact, or the cultivation level of the strongest elite.","Sigh.","Ling Han didn’t place any hopes on these guys anymore, and decided to go and take a look himself.","“Brother Ling, let Little Ming accompany you. He could lead the way.” The clan leader of the Liu Clan was very eager, and pushed out his grandson.","If this was a woman, Ling Han would definitely refuse decisively, to avoid trouble, but if it was a man, he didn’t have to worry about that.","Thus, he nodded, “All right.”","Liu Ming, the third generation of the Liu Clan, a young man filled with heroic spirit. At present, his cultivation level was at Cauldron Forging Tier. In a Spirit Transformation Tier-level clan, his cultivation level could not be considered low. He was the most outstanding descendant of the Liu Clan.","This inevitably made him a little proud. After he was called over, he only nodded at Ling Han, looking very proud.","Ling Han didn’t mind, and let Liu Ming lead the way. The two of them set off for the mine.","The mine was very big. Though it had been mined for several hundred years, only one third of it had been excavated, but as far as the eye could see, a large mountain range had suddenly decreased by half, which was still very abrupt.","“Brother Ling, this mine is too big,” Liu Ming said. “There are a total of more than 300 people in our Liu Clan, and there are 274 who has stepped onto the Celestial Path. Now, they’ve all been sent out to patrol, but it’s still impossible to guard against them.”","“Why did the Ancestral King Academy send you alone?” he asked in anger.","—Oh, there are more than 200 of us here yet we still can’t deal with it, so what can you do alone?","Ling Han chuckled, but a powerful aura suddenly spread out, instantly making Liu Ming’s chest constrict and his eyes pop out.","“For better or worse, I am a True Self Tier, so you should maintain appropriate respect.”","Fear appeared on Liu Ming’s face. This was the fear of death.","Previously, he had been extremely indignant. He was clearly older than Ling Han, but why was Ling Han already an elite of the True Self Tier? Furthermore, he had even entered into the Ancestral King Academy. In future, he could at least become a Venerate Tier elite.","Wasn’t it because he came from the “Imperial Clan”?","Just because this was the territory of his clan, he had absolutely no respect for Ling Han, appearing very arrogant. It was only at this moment that he suddenly realized that even if Ling Han killed him, so what? Would the clan dare to complain about anything to an Imperial Clan?","“Go back,” Ling Han said with a wave of his hand. He couldn’t be bothered to argue with this kind of person.","Liu Ming shuddered, and hurriedly turned around to flee.","Ling Han spread out his divine sense and communicated with the ley lines, enveloping the entire mountainous area under his surveillance.","Yi?","He suddenly faltered. It was not that he had discovered that gang of thieves, but rather that he had discovered a person that was presently sneaking towards him.","Strange Shadow Steps.","Ling Han immediately determined that this person was using the Strange Shadow Steps.","An assassin from the Battle God Palace.","Hehe, these guys were really well-informed, finding out his whereabouts so quickly.","Or... had someone in the academy deliberately leaked his information?","Ling Han believed that it was the latter. Otherwise, it was impossible that the assassins from the Battle God Palace would have followed him here as soon as he arrived.","However, merely dispatching a Spirit Transformation Tier assassin, this was looking down on him too much, wasn’t it?","However, for the Battle God Palace, assassins had the initiative in the first place, and the victime was completely unprepared when they intended to kill. Even assassins with weaker abilities could assassinate powerful targets, what more when it was a Spirit Transformation Tier assassin that was dispatched now. Wasn’t that enough?","No one knew that Ling Han’s current strength was enough to kill a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and sat cross-legged on the ground, quietly waiting for the assassin to arrive.","After a while, he had already caught sight of the assassin approaching.","It could not be helped. Firstly, the strength of his soul had long since reached the level of Spirit Transformation Tier, and secondly, he could also communicate with the ley lines, which was equivalent to having set up countless eyes for him. Thirdly, this was also the most important. His accomplishments in the Strange Shadow Steps had even surpassed this assassin.","Hence, to hide his tracks in front of him, wasn’t that a joke?","Close, close. The assassin was extremely calm. He was clearly at the Spirit Transformation Tier, yet he didn’t make a move at all. Instead, he wanted to get close enough to kill Ling Han with a single strike, preventing Ling Han from even thinking of fleeing.","Finally, this assassin walked to the most suitable position, and suddenly made his move.","Shua, a cold light streaked past, seeming capable of slicing apart even heaven and earth.","The sword swept past. Pu, Ling Han was instantly severed into two halves, blood spraying madly.","The assassin couldn’t help but reveal a smug expression. He, an assassin who had undergone two transformations of the Spirit Transformation Tier, was naturally able to easily kill a True Self Tier with his sword.","But right at this moment, he suddenly felt a pain in his back, and his whole person instantly stumbled forwards.","He turned his head, and couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat.","Ling Han!","The target that he had already killed had actually come back to life. Furthermore, a punch had landed on his back, breaking at least seven of his bones.","“You, why didn’t you die?” He appeared to be extremely disbelieving, because he had personally moved.","Ling Han cracked a smile. He naturally wouldn’t tell him that he had already used the black light of illusion to confuse him.","“Before you die, send a message to the Battle God Palace. Tell them to remember not to send any more trash the next time they come to assassinate me. Also, it won’t be long before I find the location of the Battle God Palace and dispose of them once and for all.”","“How boastful of you!” That killing intent humphed, “All the generations of Ancestral Kings have not been able to destroy our Battle God Palace, so who do you think you are?”","Though he was severely injured, he was sure that he was completely capable of killing Ling Han again."]},{"number":4314,"title":"Chapter 4314: Thieves from inside","paragraphs":["Chapter 4314: Thieves from inside","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Come.” Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","In any case, he had to wait for these thieves. Since he had nothing else to do, he would play around with this guy.","“Die!” the assassin roared as he charged forward.","For assassins, this was a very foolish action.","What was an assassin? Naturally, they would attack from the shadows, and kill their target when they were least on guard. Otherwise, they would be called death warriors.","But now, he was a major tier higher than Ling Han. So what if he attacked Ling Han head-on? How could it be that he would lose?","The reason why he had snuck over previously was firstly, it was because of his occupational habit. Secondly, he was afraid that he would alert Ling Han, and this brat would use the Star Steps to escape.","Xiu, xiu, two figures walked out of his body, but their features were very blurry, and could not be seen clearly. However, the aura they exuded was Spirit Transformation Tier-level.","These were his two spiritual bodies.","Most people would mold their spiritual bodies to be like themselves, and use them as manifestations of themselves. They could deal with some trivial matters when their original body was cultivating. However, for assassins, there was absolutely no need to care about how the spiritual bodies looked like, as long as their abilities were strong enough.","The assassin attacked from the front, while the two spiritual bodies attacked from the side. They didn’t have a Spirit Tool in hand, but spiritual bodies were formed by the Regulations of heaven and earth and high-level energy in the first place, so they could be considered human-shaped Spirit Tools.","This time, Ling Han had a lot of time. He casually parried, wanting to see just how strong a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator was.","After a few moves, he had a considerable understanding of the battle prowess of Spirit Transformation Tier elites.","As expected, the colorful saber that Guan Xia channeled out was the True Self, which could also be considered a pseudo spiritual body, but compared to a real spiritual body, it was still considerably inferior.","The attacks of the two spiritual bodies were quite impressive, and they weren’t made of flesh and blood either. Even if they were shattered, as long as they were nurtured in the mind, they would be able to recover in no time.","It was because of this that the assassin allowed the two spiritual bodies to barge around and act extremely arrogantly.","Of course, he was also incredibly shocked internally. Even if he was heavily injured due to an “accident”, and could not unleash his full battle prowess, a starving camel was still bigger than a horse. Suppressing a True Self Tier cultivator should be a piece of cake.","However, after battling for so long, he actually did not have the slightest bit of advantage, which naturally made him feel fear.","What was going on here?","After fighting for a while longer, Ling Han felt bored.","This opponent was too weak. Even a Spirit Transformation Tier couldn’t give him enough pressure, and he had seen more or less what he needed to see.","It was time to end this battle.","Ling Han’s expression instantly changed. Boom! A terrifying aura surged out, and he finally unleashed the true power of the Ten Forms.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Who cares if you are a spiritual body or the real one, they were all sent flying with a single punch.","He had already started to walk his own path. His punches didn’t seem to have any rhythm, but they were extremely powerful.","“Impossible!” the assassin exclaimed in shock. He had practically seen a ghost.","A True Self Tier cultivator was actually able to suppress a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator like him?","Who would believe this?","You’re dizzy from having drank too much, aren’t you?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “If I told you that I’ve already killed four Spirit Transformation Second Change Tier elites, would you call me a maniac?”","If this had been before the battle, everyone would have thought that Ling Han had gone crazy, but now, that assassin believed it without a doubt.","Without hesitation, he immediately retreated.","This sure-kill target of the Battle God Palace had become stronger again. Even a Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change was no match for him. At least, they would have to send out the Fifth Change or even the gold-medal assassin who had actually undergone Sixth Change.","“You still want to leave?” Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “Just how much do you look down on me?”","The assassin activated the Strange Shadow Steps and instantly dove into the shadows.","However, he had not even taken a few steps, when he saw an iron fist flying towards him.","‘What?’","He hurriedly dodged, his heart filled with shock.","With the help of the Strange Shadow Steps, Ling Han actually managed to capture him?","Peng!","He could not dodge this punch at all, and was hit solidly. He opened his mouth, and spat out blood madly. There were also large amounts of internal organs mixed in his blood.","Waves of helplessness rose up in him. He felt his vision darken, and he really wanted to immediately pass out.","Ling Han threw another punch, and the assassin was completely unable to dodge. He was killed.","“This Battle God Palace is really like a lingering ghost,” he muttered. Previously, he had stayed in the Dark Clouds Hell for ten years, and had almost forgotten that he had such an enemy. And what happened? Practically the moment he appeared, their assassins came as well.","“I’ll kill whoever comes.”","He tidied up the battlefield, then continued his surveillance.","However, after this night, he did not gain anything.","On the second day, Ling Han rested at the Liu Clan Residence, but in the afternoon, he received a notice from the Liu Clan. That gang of thieves had actually moved, stealing all the True Clouds Metal that the Liu Clan had mined a few days ago and had not yet transported away.","Interesting.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. He had waited all night yesterday, yet no thieves had appeared, and during the day, he had only rested for a short while at the Liu Residence, when the theft of ores happened again.","Upon further thought, though the Liu Clan had set up all kinds of defenses, they had not even seen a shadow of the other until now.","Was there really a group of thieves that appeared and disappeared mysteriously, or was there a traitor in the Liu Clan?","Originally, Ling Han wasn’t too interested in capturing this group of thieves. This was a matter of the Imperial Clan, and it was already good enough that he wasn’t a hindrance. How could he possibly do things sincerely?","But now, he was curious. If there really was a traitor in the Liu Clan, then this guy was really outrageously bold, daring to even steal from the Imperial Clan.","En, he wanted to see what kind of prodigy this was.","In the next few days, he stayed at the Liu Residence, looking like he was just going through the motions, and actually did not care about anything else.","However, on the fourth day, Ling Han left quietly with the Strange Shadow Steps and entered the mineshaft.","He spread out his divine sense and communicated with the ley lines, taking control of everything in his surroundings.","A few hours later, he discovered a sneaky figure, and cautiously headed towards the mining area.","This man obviously knew the defenses of the Liu Clan like the back of his hand. He circled all the way, avoiding all the sentry guards, and began to steal.","This person wasn’t weak, so the speed of mining wasn’t slow either. In just a few hours, he had excavated a large area of the mountain. Without any care, he stuffed all the rocks into his Spatial Spirit Tool.","Ordinarily, miners would only excavate ores rich in True Clouds Metal, and other useless stones would be discarded. Thus, there was naturally a great difference in the speed of the two.","This person left quietly, avoiding all the sentry guards along the way. Furthermore, this person was also very careful. After making a large circle outside, he actually returned to the Liu Residence.","As expected!","Ling Han could see very clearly. After this person entered into the Liu Clan, he removed the black cloth that was covering his face, and a familiar face appeared.","—Liu Ming.","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. Although he had already guessed that this thief was most likely a traitor of the Liu Clan, he had never imagined that it was actually Liu Ming."]},{"number":4315,"title":"Chapter 4315: Divine Bird?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4315: Divine Bird?","Editor: Henyee Translations","As the most outstanding member of the third generation of the Liu Clan, Liu Ming even had a chance to take over the position of clan leader in the future. Why did he still have to poach his own clan?","Ling Han’s interest was piqued even further. He stealthily concealed himself. Under the Strange Shadow Steps, to say nothing of Liu Ming, even the clan leader of the Liu Clan, a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite, may not be able to discover his existence.","Liu Ming looked left and right at the door, closing the doors and windows tightly.","However, he didn’t know that Ling Han had already hidden himself in his room. He was just waiting to see what tricks he would play.","Liu Ming moved aside a cabinet, and there was actually a secret door behind it. After he opened it, Ling Han immediately leaped over first.","“Yi?” Liu Ming seemed to have sensed something, but after being stunned for a while, he still entered through the secret door, then returned the cabinet to its original position.","This secret passage was not long, and he soon reached the end. This was a secret room. It was not very big, and the furnishings were very simple. There was only a stone table placed here, and there was a box on top of the stone table. It could not be seen what material it was made of.","Liu Ming walked to the side of the stone table, and showed a hint of excitement as he opened the box on it.","Instantly, a small head poked out of the box.","Ling Han looked closely. This was a small bird, its feathers as bright as fire, incredibly handsome.","“Come, I’ve brought you food,” Liu Ming said as he retrieved the ores from his Spatial Tool and placed them on the stone table.","The little bird immediately jumped out, and picked up a piece of ore in a single bite. Crack, crack, crack, it began chewing, and very soon, it had devoured this piece of ore completely.","So that was the case.","The reason why this Liu Ming had stolen the ores was to feed this little bird.","But why was he willing to take such a risk?","Because of interest? That was obviously impossible.","“Little bird, I’m your father. I feed you and raise you, so you definitely have to listen to me in the future,” Liu Ming said as he continued to feed the bird.","Meanwhile, the little bird merely chirped, as if it was pressing for more.","Liu Ming continued to feed. Even though this small bird was only the size of a fist, its appetite was astonishing. It actually ate all the ores that Liu Ming had stolen, yet its stomach did not bulge at all.","No wonder this guy would steal from the mine every once in a while. With this little bird’s appetite, whoever raised it would feel immense pressure.","Liu Ming continued to blabber, and the little bird was already about to fall asleep. Thus, he could only helplessly place the little bird back into the box. Then, he left through the secret passage.","Ling Han materialized and opened the box.","Hu! Hu! Hu!","This little bird was presently in a deep slumber, and was even snoring loudly.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Should birds snore? Are you a f****** pig?","He poked the little bird with his finger, but the little bird was still sleeping soundly, showing no signs of waking up.","F***, you really are a pig.","Ling Han poked it again, and only then did he see that this little bird had opened its eyes. He could clearly see that this little bird actually looked impatient.","“Yi, you are not that idiot, Liu Ming.” The little bird looked at Ling Han and said, its voice crisp like a young girl’s.","“You can actually speak?” Ling Han was surprised. Previously, Liu Ming had chattered for who knew how many times, but the little bird was only chirping, causing Ling Han to think that it was just a young bird that had not developed intelligence.","“Isn’t that nonsense?” the little bird asked impatiently, looking very experienced.","“Are you asking for a beating?” Ling Han shook his fist.","The little bird fell silent. Though it was very arrogant, it was also very smart. It knew what kind of people it could trifle with, what kind of people it could deceive, and what kind of people it could not afford to offend.","...The person in front of her was a True Self Tier cultivator, stronger than her!","“Oh, that’s right, what breed are you?” Ling Han was curious. Liu Ming definitely wouldn’t raise a mortal bird. Moreover, this little bird actually fed on True Clouds Metal ore, which showed how extraordinary it was.","“Divine bird, of course,” the little bird said boldly.","“Don’t joke around,” Ling Han said.","The little bird ignored him, looking proud.","“Liu Ming should know of your background. Looks like your background is not weak, either. That’s why this brat is supporting you so closely, and looks like he considers himself your father. He probably hopes that when you grow up in the future, you can become his right-hand man,” Ling Han deduced.","The little bird was proud, “Of course, I am very powerful! But that idiot actually wanted to impersonate my father. I am really about to laugh myself to death. He is really as stupid as can be!”","Indeed.","Ling Han nodded. Even now, Liu Ming still didn’t know that the little bird’s intelligence had long since developed. It was completely impossible for him to deceive it. On the other hand, this little bird was the sneaky one. It was practically treating Liu Ming like a fool, treating him completely like a meal ticket.","“Hey, why are you looking at me with such an expression?” The little bird was a little scared. Ling Han’s eyes were so frightening.","Ling Han snickered, “It’s been a long time since I’ve eaten roast chicken.”","“Get lost, I’m a divine bird!” The little bird immediately exploded. “Didn’t you see that brat Liu Ming almost worshipped me? You actually want to eat me?”","“He’s counting on you to help him conquer the world in the future, but I don’t need you,” Ling Han shrugged.","The little bird blinked its eyes at him, and said with a dry laugh, “Don’t, don’t be like that. Worse come to worst, I’ll just hang out with you in the future.”","“I can’t afford to raise a glutton like you. It’s better to barbeque and eat you,” Ling Han said.","“I can also eat very little,” the little bird hurriedly said. “Although I ate so much previously, most of the energy has been stored up. I’m keeping it to slowly absorb in the future.”","Ling Han looked like he was considering. After a while, he asked, “Then what specialty do you have?”","“I can spit fire,” the little bird said.","“Che,” Ling Han said in disdain. “My third child knows how to spit fire.”","“Tsk!” The little bird also appeared very disdainful, “The flames I spit out are the strongest flames in the world. There is nothing they cannot burn, and nothing they cannot melt!”","“Then try spitting it out.” Ling Han took out a piece of Divine Metal and placed it in front of the little bird.","The small bird opened its mouth and spat. Pu, a fiery flame shot out, and struck the Divine Metal, instantly penetrating through it.","Ling Han was astounded. This was a Three Star Divine Metal, yet it had been directly melted by a mouthful of flames from the little bird. Its might was really quite strong.","“How is it? Impressive, right?” the little bird asked proudly.","“So-so, just passable,” Ling Han said.","“Just passable?” The little bird was unconvinced, “Even if you are in the True Self Tier, and can shatter the Three Star Divine Metal, it is still impossible for you to so easily pierce a hole in the Divine Metal.”","“Is that so?” Ling Han said with a smile. He activated the Divine Metal, and he reached over to touch it. Wherever his hand touched, the Divine Metal would immediately be annihilated, and not even a speck of it would remain.","“F***!” The little bird cursed, then stared at Ling Han as if he was a monster.","She had just boasted, and in the end, reality had mercilessly slapped her in the face.","“Let’s just make roast chicken,” Ling Han said.","“Don’t, don’t, don’t!” The little bird hurriedly flapped its wings, “I’ll follow you. In the future, when I help you fight, I’ll spit fire at whoever displeases you!”","Tsk, she finally had some awareness.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4316,"title":"Chapter 4316: Caught red-handed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4316: Caught red-handed","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Do you have a name?” Ling Han asked the little bird.","The standard of his naming skills was chillingly low, yet he just so happened to like naming people.","The little bird shivered for no reason, and hurriedly said, “Yes, yes, yes, my name is Zhu Hongyi.”","“This name is so lame,” Ling Han grumbled. “Why don’t I give you a nickname? En, I’ll call you Little Red.”","The little red bird tried its best to counter, but it naturally didn’t dare to say anything verbally. Her expression said, ‘whatever you like’.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han grabbed the little red bird, and using the Star Steps, xiu, he directly disappeared from the secret room.","This time, no matter how hard Liu Ming wracked his brains, he could not possibly know how the little red bird had disappeared.","After returning to his residence, Ling Han acted as if nothing had happened. This little red bird definitely had a powerful background. Though he did not know what breed it was for the moment, when he returned, he would ask the Nine Mountains Saint. It should not be too difficult to find out.","However, he used the ley lines to control the entire Liu Clan. Two days later, he discovered that Liu Ming had moved again.","He waited first, and when Liu Ming was almost done stealing, he directly used Star Steps to cross over and apprehend Liu Ming.","“You—”","Pa!","Liu Ming had just managed to ask, when he was knocked unconscious by a palm strike from Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, and roared at the sky. His voice rolled out, reverberating throughout the entire mountainous area.","Not long after, the members of the Liu Clan all ran over.","Looking at Ling Han, and then looking at the person whose face was covered with a black cloth lying by his feet, wasn’t that clear enough?","“Brother Ling, have you caught the thief?” The clan leader of the Liu Clan was overjoyed. He had not been able to catch that group of thieves after so many days, but Ling Han had already reaped some results after just a few days. As expected of a disciple of the Ancestral King Academy.","To be honest, he was also very grateful in his heart. That was because the Liu Clan did not possess this True Clouds Metal mine, and was only acting as a doorman for the Imperial Clan. If the ore was lost, the Liu Clan would naturally bear the brunt of it, and could not escape the blame.","Thankfully, Ling Han had finally caught a thief, and there was finally some progress.","“Clan leader Liu, you had best be mentally prepared,” Ling Han said. With a kick, he kicked Liu Ming to the feet of the clan leader of the Liu Clan.","The clan leader of the Liu Clan did not understand. What did he mean by that?","He stretched out a hand and with a wave, the black cloth on Liu Ming’s face immediately shattered.","Yi!","When they saw that the masked person was actually Liu Ming, all the members of the Liu Clan exclaimed in shock.","How was this possible?","Why was it Liu Ming? How could it be Liu Ming?","This didn’t make sense.","“Brother Ling, did you make a mistake?” The clan leader of the Liu Clan looked towards Ling Han, his face filled with suspicion. Could it be that Ling Han was also unable to catch the culprit, so he knocked Liu Ming unconscious, and made him look like this, so he could use him as a scapegoat?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “The digging marks here are still very new. Furthermore, you guys search the Spatial Spirit Tool on him.”","The clan leader of the Liu Clan picked up the Spatial Tool that Liu Ming had on him. With a thought, a large amount of True Clouds Metal appeared out of thin air, piling up like a small mountain.","This time, the members of the Liu Clan were all in an uproar.","Caught red-handed?","The clan leader of the Liu Clan frowned, and sent out a palm strike, waking Liu Ming up.","“—Who is it!” Liu Ming’s thoughts were still stuck on before he fell unconscious. Thus, the moment he woke up, he continued what he had been saying before he fell unconscious.","He immediately saw the clan leader of the Liu Clan and the others, and couldn’t help but feel a chill in his heart.","Previously, he had been in a coma, and did not know what had happened. Seeing that the members of the Liu Clan were all here, and the ores that he had just stolen had piled up into a small mountain, as the saying goes, guilty conscience makes one lose his composure.","Pa, he immediately knelt down, and cried, “Grandpa, save me! You must save me!”","If he hadn’t said this, the clan leader of the Liu Clan would have still been able to defend him. However, now that Liu Ming had said this, it was equivalent to admitting it in public. How could he continue to defend him?","“Evil creature, how dare you!” Clan leader Liu rebuked harshly. He was both furious and confused. This grandson of his had extraordinary natural talent, and had a bright future ahead of him. How could he be so foolish?","‘You don’t lack cultivation resources, so what’s the point of stealing the True Clouds Metal?’","Liu Ming was usually proud, but he had never experienced any setbacks, what more when it was such a big matter. He was completely stupefied, and only knew to kowtow continuously, begging the clan leader of the Liu Clan to save him.","The clan leader of the Liu Clan was in a very difficult position. On one side, this was his beloved grandson, who was also the most outstanding descendant of the Liu Clan. In future, he would be able to hold up the banner of the Liu Clan, so he naturally was unwilling to allow Liu Ming to die here.","However, if he wanted to protect Liu Ming, there was only one way, and that was to kill Ling Han here to keep him quiet. He could tell others that Ling Han had been killed by a thief.","In any case, he knew that Ling Han had offended a great many Imperial Clan elites. If he really killed Ling Han, he believed that he would even be rewarded by the Imperial Clan elites.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but feel a killing intent rise up in his heart.","Ling Han saw this, and smiled faintly, “Clan leader Liu, are you planning to kill me to keep the secret?”","The clan leader of the Liu Clan couldn’t help but laugh drily when his thoughts were pointed out, “Brother Ling really knows how to joke. No matter how courageous I am, how would I dare to bully a prodigy of the Ancestral King Academy?”","“That had better be the case,” Ling Han said. “Perhaps the clan leader of the Liu Clan still doesn’t know yet. I’ve mastered the Star Steps!”","The clan leader of the Liu Clan couldn’t help but feel his heart clench. That’s right, Star Steps!","This was a person that even the Imperial Clan couldn’t kill, so how could he kill him?","He changed his mind again. In any case, the matter of Liu Ming stealing the True Clouds Metal had nothing to do with the clan. Worse come to worst, he could just sever the weak link for the sake of the whole clan’s survival. Otherwise, when Ling Han broke free and returned to the Ancestral King Academy, what awaited the Liu Clan would be a calamity.","Seeing the expression on Clan leader Liu’s face, how could Liu Ming not understand?","He didn’t want to die.","Thus, he could no longer bother to keep the secret, and said, “Grandpa, the reason why I stole the True Clouds Metal is because—”","Pu!","Ling Han moved, and with a heavy punch, Liu Ming was instantly blasted into dust.","He naturally could not allow Liu Ming to reveal the secret of the little red bird.","“You!” The clan leader of the Liu Clan pointed angrily at Ling Han. He was still thinking about how he was going to make excuses for his grandson. At the very least, he would have to save his life. Furthermore, why had Liu Ming robbed the mine for no reason? There must be some hidden reason.","Why had Ling Han suddenly made a move?","“The evidence is irrefutable, so we naturally have to kill him,” Ling Han said calmly. “What is it? Is the leader of the Liu Clan still thinking of how to cover for him?”","The clan leader of the Liu Clan was furious, yet had nothing to say.","“Alright, this matter has been resolved. I’m going to return and report to the academy,” Ling Han said as he took a step forward. He activated his Star Steps and arrived before the Liu Residence. He grabbed the little red bird and directly tossed out the formation foundations that formed the intergalactic Transfer Formation.","He left.","Xiu, he and the little red bird crossed the galaxy. After a few teleportations, they returned to the Ancestral King Academy.","Ling Han went to report the matter, and the Liu Clan had already reported this matter through the Galaxy Network. Since Liu Ming had already been killed, the clan leader of the Liu Clan had naturally given up on tampering with the truth, and reported the matter to the higher-ups in full detail.","Ling Han took out a bit of time to return to the Nine Suns Holy Land. He was going to ask the Nine Mountains Saint to take a look at the breed of the little red bird."]},{"number":4317,"title":"Chapter 4317: Descendant of Vermillion Bird?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4317: Descendant of Vermillion Bird?","Editor: Henyee Translations","After returning to the Nine Yang Holy Land, Ling Han paid a visit to the Nine Mountains Saint.","However, the Nine Mountains Saint wasn’t here. Instead, he had gone to the front lines.","The so-called front line was the galaxy where the Mountain Sea Heaven was located. Now, a large number of Yin souls were constantly launching attacks, wanting to expand their territory. The war situation was extremely grim. Thus, the Nine Mountains Saint also stationed himself at the front line.","“Don’t torment yourself. I’ll tell you, all right?” The little red bird couldn’t bear it. Every day, it would be teleported across galaxies. Come on, she was a girl.","“En, tell me,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“I’m really a divine bird!” the little red bird said as if it were serious.","“As I see it, you are really asking for a beating!” Ling Han humphed.","“Let me ask you. In the ancient times, the Divine Beasts were equal, and what was the most powerful?” the little red bird asked.","“True Dragon?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“How ignorant! How can the True Dragon be considered the strongest in the world?” The little red bird’s mouth was quite derisive. “In my opinion, you should eat more pig brain to help nourish your brain.1”","Fortunately, the pervert pig wasn’t here. Otherwise, he would definitely pluck all your feathers!","Ling Han smiled, “Then tell me, what is the strongest?”","“The Vermillion Bird, of course!” the little red bird said proudly. “I am the descendant of the Vermillion Bird, so you have to treat me with respect!”","“A little bird like you?” Ling Han laughed in spite of himself. According to legends, when the Divine Beast Vermillion Bird spread its wings, it could fill an entire galaxy, and this little red bird in front of him was only the size of a palm, at most.","“That’s because I haven’t grown up yet!” the little red bird said angrily. “If I showed my mystical abilities at this time, wouldn’t I have long since been made into a roast chicken?”","Oh, she didn’t forget to insult others.","Ling Han looked at the little red bird. Perhaps Liu Ming had found out about the little red bird’s background through ancient records, and that was why he worshipped it like it was his ancestor. Of course, it was also possible that the little red bird was full of nonsense, and had deceived Liu Ming into believing it.","However, being able to swallow the raw True Clouds Metal, spit out fiery flames, and easily melt the Three Star Divine Metal, the little red bird was definitely no ordinary breed.","You see, hadn’t the Four-Legged Snake also just been born? It didn’t seem strange for there to be a descendant of the Vermillion Bird as well.","The question was, why did he always encounter this kind of unreliable guy?","Was he specialized in taking in trouble children?","Ling Han was extremely speechless, but since he already knew the origins of the little red bird, there was naturally no need for him to seek out the Nine Mountains Saint. He returned to the Ancestral King Academy.","He had just returned to the academy when the large black dog and little azure dragon came to look for him.","“Little Han, you have a rival again,” the large black dog immediately said.","“Oh?” Ling Han didn’t care. As long as he didn’t break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier, who else could pose a threat to him at the True Self Tier?","Even Ding Shu could not, even if the other had advanced into the Tenth Form.","En, speaking of Ding Shu, if this brat was unable to break through to the Tenth Form, he would have to obediently become his underling. And Ling Han was 90% sure that Ding Shu’s chances of breaking through to the Tenth Form would not exceed 10%.","“A guy called Baili Luoyang. Apparently, he’s here to snipe you.” The little azure dragon continued, then stared at the little red bird in Ling Han’s arms. “Huh, since when did you start rearing birds?”","“Four-Legged Snake, do you have any insight? Who’s worthy of raising me?” the little red bird immediately chirped.","“Yi, your mouth is quite powerful.” The little azure dragon humphed. “Little Han, are we going to eat roast chicken tonight?”","The little red bird was extremely speechless. None of you know what a Divine Beast is?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Don’t underestimate her. According to her, she is the descendant of Vermillion Bird.”","“What?” The little azure dragon’s eyes bulged.","“Are you dumbfounded now, stinky Four-Legged Snake!” The little red bird was proud of itself, “My mother, my ancestor is the strongest Divine Beast in the world.”","“Bullsh!t, the strongest Divine Beast is clearly my Imperial Father, the True Dragon that sweeps aside all opposition in the world!” The little azure dragon immediately retorted.","“True Dragon?” The little red bird stuck out its tongue, looking disdainful, “In the past, the True Dragon has been defeated by the Vermillion Bird who knows how many times, so save it.”","“Nonsense, the True Dragon is the strongest!”","“The Vermillion Bird is clearly the most powerful!”","The two of them were at loggerheads just like that, each of them raising their necks high, looking like they were determined to convince the other.","Ling Han shrugged, not bothering to pay them any regard.","“Little Han, where did you get this little bird from?” The large black dog clicked his tongue in wonder.","Ling Han briefly explained what had happened, and the large black dog couldn’t help but feel rueful. Ling Han’s luck was truly heaven-defying. He could obtain such good fortune just by completing a random mission.","This was the descendant of a Divine Beast! Moreover, the little red bird had also let the cat out of the bag. It was extremely likely that she was the daughter of the Vermillion Bird, and belonged to the first generation!","If Ling Han could receive the help of the two Divine Beasts in the future, just how terrifying would this power be?","No matter how he thought about it, it would definitely not be difficult for the first generation offspring of Divine Beasts to become a Saint, and it would definitely be an incredibly powerful Saint — who knows, it may even be possible that it could become a Pseudo-Emperor. That would really be boundlessly terrifying.","“Oh, that’s right. What’s with that Baili Luoyang?” Ling Han asked.","“Oh, Grandpa Dog isn’t too sure either, but I’ve heard others say that this guy is extremely awesome, and said that he wants to pull you off your horse,” the large black dog said casually.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Then just wait and see.”","What he was more concerned about was who had leaked his whereabouts to the Battle God Palace.","“Speaking of suspects, everyone in the whole Ancestral King Academy is under suspicion.” Ling Han was extremely speechless. He didn’t seem to have done anything bad, so how did he make so many enemies?","The little red bird fed on ores. Of course, it mainly ate Divine Metal. If there was refined Divine Metal, that was naturally even better. If there wasn’t, she was actually not very picky about her food.","She was at the Core Formation Tier now, and she could swallow all Divine Metal below four stars in a single gulp. There were terrifying flames in her body that could melt it immediately, so she didn’t need to worry about indigestion at all.","If it was Four Star Divine Metal, she could just barely eat it, but the speed would be very, very slow.","Thus, if she wanted to rapidly increase her cultivation level, it was best that she ate Divine Metal that corresponded to her cultivation level.","Ling Han was rich and imposing, buying a large amount of Divine Metal and tossing it to the little red bird. In any case, if he needed money, he could just concoct alchemical pills, and there was no need for him to become a thief like Liu Ming.","At present, the little red bird was already familiar with the empress and Hu Niu, and had a very good relationship with them. However, she and the little azure dragon were natural enemies, and the moment they met, they would argue and insult each other, causing even Ling Han to have the thought of matchmaking the two of them.","What a lovey-dovey couple. Furthermore, they were both the first generation of Divine Beasts. If they gave birth to descendants, just how amazing would their natural talent be?","Unknowingly, it was time for the monthly exam again. Whether they could receive cultivation resources would depend on their ranking in the monthly exam.","The large black dog and little azure dragon were both eager to give it a try. They had the Source Dao Stone, and their cultivation level was advancing at a terrifying rate. They were hoping to break into the top twenty this time.","The empress and the others competed first, and their results improved slightly compared to the last time. After all, the empress and the others also had Source Dao Stones, and their cultivation levels were also low, so their improvement was even faster.","After their battle, it was Ling Han’s turn.","Because he had gotten first place last month, there was no need for Ling Han to participate in the knockout battles. He only had to wait for others to challenge him.","It wasn’t long before the elimination battles concluded. As expected, Baili Luoyang won four battles in a row with an absolute advantage.","“I, will challenge you!” He pointed at Ling Han."]},{"number":4318,"title":"Chapter 4318: Accident","paragraphs":["Chapter 4318: Accident","Editor: Henyee Translations","Baili Luoyang, a prodigy of the Baili Clan, belonged to the Silver Generation. In terms of natural talent, he could even catch up to the tail of the Golden Generation, which showed how awesome he was.","Because of an inappropriate romance, he was imprisoned and shelved by his clan. Only a rare few people in the outside world knew of him.","Now that he had reappeared, he stood proudly, exuding a powerful aura.","This made everyone sigh with emotion. The Ziwei Imperial Clan was truly doted on by the heavens. Not only did they have a Golden Generation elite like Baili Tian, they also had Baili Yun and Baili Luoyang, two Silver Generation elites.","In fact, Baili Luoyang even had the potential to become a Golden Generation elite.","Ling Han walked out. There were only two options for being challenged: first, accept the challenge, and second, admit defeat.","It was obviously impossible for him to admit defeat, so he naturally accepted the challenge.","“You crippled a cousin of mine,” Baili Luoyang said coldly.","He was naturally referring to Baili Che, who had been crippled by Ling Han just when he was about to break through to the True Self Tier. From then onwards, his cultivation level was eternally stuck at the level of Pseudo True Self Tier, and had completely faded out of the ranks of Imperial Sons.","—There was no Imperial Son that was so useless.","“And then?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Thus, I will also cripple you!” Baili Luoyang declared balefully.","Ling Han looked at the elites of the academy and said, “Hey, hey, hey, everyone heard that, right? This guy wants to use his public office to avenge a private grudge!”","“Don’t make a mountain out of a molehill. It’s time for the tournament,” Venerate Shi reprimanded. “Moreover, it’s inevitable that one won’t be able to stop in time during the tournament, which is unavoidable.”","Ling Han chuckled and said to Baili Luoyang, “Since that’s the case, I’ll cripple you as well.”","“Haha!” Baili Luoyang sneered, “Do you know what cultivation level I have?”","With a thought, the True Self appeared, exuding a seven-coloured light.","The Seven Colours True Self, even stronger than Guan Xia’s.","“The Eighth Form of the True Self Tier!” he declared proudly.","After so many years, he had been imprisoned all this while. For a prodigy like him, he was naturally filled with pent-up anger. Now, he had risen up aggressively, and should reign supreme, so that his great name would spread throughout the entire universe.","And Ling Han was his stepping stone.","This opponent was very good, and had the reputation of being invincible among his peers. Thus, if he defeated Ling Han, he would naturally become famous overnight.","“Eight Forms!”","“Heavens, it really is the Eight Forms!”","“This is the exclusive territory of the Golden Generation!”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. Though they had already guessed that Baili Luoyang was very possibly in the Eighth Form, or there would have been no need for him to challenge Ling Han, but with their own eyes, they could not help but feel stunned.","The aptitude of the Golden Generation meant that he would have a chance of breaking through to the Imperial Path in future.","“How is it?” Baili Luoyang asked proudly.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Not much. It’s still not enough for one hand of mine.”","You!","To say nothing of Baili Luoyang, everyone shook their heads, feeling that Ling Han was too arrogant.","‘You’re only at the Seventh Form, and you’ve only formed a mortal body. Yet, you want to defeat the Eighth Form single-handedly?’","Do you know what the Eighth Form means?","Supreme aptitude!","For such a prodigy, only he would be able to emerge victorious against an opponent with a superior cultivation level, and you still want to emerge victorious against someone with an advantage of a minor level, or even use only one hand in reality?","Hehe, wasn’t this the biggest joke in the world?","“Stubborn!” Baili Luoyang charged over. Boom, a terrifying power was completely displayed, as he unleashed the strength of the Eighth Form to his heart’s content.","After being silent for so long, he was going to explode with brilliance.","Boom, he was wrapped in boundless might, and Regulations turned into divine red clouds that shone behind him, making him seem as if he had transformed into a Celestial King.","This might was too astonishing, and everyone was completely captivated.","True Self Tier could actually be this strong!","As it turned out, this was the height that the Golden Generation had once reached. It was practically enough to make one lose all hope.","Baili Luoyang charged over, boundless power surging. He was going to defeat Ling Han in a single stroke.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and stretched out his right hand, grabbing out at Baili Luoyang.","His movements were clearly very slow, and very casual at that, but they were incredibly precise, as he aimed directly for Baili Luoyang’s neck.","This was going too far, and you actually dare to look down on me like this?","Baili Luoyang roared in fury, his right hand transforming into a saber that slashed out at Ling Han.","Peng!","The hand saber slashed onto Ling Han’s arm, yet was suddenly sent flying back. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s attack was completely unaffected, and he easily gripped Baili Luoyang’s neck.","The battle came to an abrupt stop.","F***!","At this moment, everyone’s mouths were wide open, and they couldn’t make a single sound. Even those Venerate Tier elites were dumbfounded.","What was going on?","Ling Han had actually taken down the Eighth Form of True Self Tier with a single move?","How could this be believed?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said to Baili Luoyang, “How about it? I said I can deal with you with one hand, right?”","Everyone was speechless. This was not something that could be done with a single hand; this was practically an insta-kill.","The gap in strength between the two... was as wide as the gap between heaven and earth!","Was Ling Han really in the seventh form? Was his true self really a mortal?","This question arose in everyone’s mind. Even if the Seventh Form could defeat the Eighth Form, it shouldn’t have been so easy, right?","Ling Han’s eyes sharpened. Boom, under the reverberation of a terrifying power, the True Selves in Baili Luoyang’s mind instantly shattered one after another.","“How dare you!” Baili Hanyun was furious, and immediately stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","Since Ling Han had moved, he was naturally prepared. Immediately, he used the Star Steps, and left the range of Baili Hanyun’s attack.","“Yo, are you embarrassed and angry now?” he asked calmly.","Baili Hanyun moved impulsively, but he immediately realized that if he killed Ling Han with his superior strength, the Nine Mountains Saint would definitely stomp in fury, and bring great calamity to himself and the Baili Clan.","He forced himself to calm down, and said, “You have such a vicious heart. It is only an ordinary sparring match, and you actually did such a vicious thing, crippling the cultivation level of your opponent! Going by the rules of the academy, I can also cripple your cultivation level and expel you from the academy.”","‘Oh, you’re trying to reason with me now?’","Ling Han chuckled and said, “Previously, when Baili Luoyang said that he wanted to cripple me, why didn’t anyone say anything, and said that doing so was wrong and against the academy’s rules? Oh, that’s right, I seem to have protested to the Lords before, right?”","“Sorry, it was an accident, an accident!”","Being mocked by Ling Han like this, the Venerate Tier elites all felt slightly awkward. This double standard was really too obvious.","“Luoyang was just saying, and you actually made a move!” Baili Hanyun argued.","“Ya, I already said it was an accident!” Ling Han shook his head, “In a battle, it is inevitable that there would be mistakes. This is also what the Lords have said. Even the Lords would accidentally make mistakes, what more a minor character like me. Hehe.”","At this moment, Baili Hanyun actually didn’t know what to say.","In terms of quibbling, Ling Han was even more skilled at it than he was. Moreover, if he wanted to forcefully suppress Ling Han, Ling Han also had the backing of the Saint and the Imperial Weapon behind him. Thus, he had special privileges.","Thus, what could they do?","If he wanted to deal with Ling Han, he could only follow the rules and have someone at the same cultivation level kill him. In that case, the Nine Mountains Saint would have nothing to say.","Now, everything had returned to square one. If he wanted to kill Ling Han, he could only wait until Ling Han advanced into Spiritual Transformation Tier. Then, there would definitely be many prodigies that could defeat him.","They could only wait."]},{"number":4319,"title":"Chapter 4319: Opening Her Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 4319: Opening Her Heart","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han felt very pleased.","Crippling Baili Luoyang in front of so many Venerate Tier elites naturally vented his anger greatly.","In fact, he wasn’t an unreasonable person. Just look, he hadn’t been too ruthless against the likes of Guan Xia, had he? Who asked Baili Luoyang to clearly cripple him right from the start? What was there to be polite about?","He had crippled a member of the Imperial Clan, and could even receive the cultivation resources of the Imperial Clan as a reward. Was there anything more pleasurable than this in this world?","Of course, Ling Han’s display of dominance would definitely bring hidden dangers to the empress, the large black dog, and the others. Thus, Ling Han had them be more cautious and attentive. Usually, they had to be more careful when they did things, and not jump into a trap.","During this time, Ding Shu fought a few more times with Ling Han. He slowly cultivated to the end of the ninth form, wanting to break through to the tenth form, and with Ling Han as a whetstone, the possibility of taking this step would be considerably higher.","However, taking this step was really too difficult.","Even though Ding Shu was also the overlord of the Genesis World, he had already used the power of dimensional beings when he had broken through to the ninth form. If he were to attempt the tenth form now, this power would similarly be severely repelled, and would not be of any crucial use.","Thus, he only had a sliver of a chance in theory.","A year had passed, and Ling Han had pushed the third True Self to the end of the tenth form. Going by the look of things, he still needed around three years to be able to succeed.","So slow.","Every once in a while, the Ancestral King Academy would welcome a batch of new students. Some of them were truly extraordinarily talented, and it was unknown where they had come from. They had previously been completely unknown, but now, they were shining brilliantly.","Chi Menghan finally arrived as well. She and the silver-haired little lolita joined the academy at the same time.","“I didn’t see you before, and I thought that you weren’t interested in coming here.” Ling Han found a chance to meet Chi Menghan.","Chi Menghan smiled faintly, “Previously, I was at the crucial moment of breaking through to Spiritual Transformation Tier, so I have been in seclusion all this while.”","“Yi, you’re a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite?” Ling Han was surprised.","Chi Menghan smiled proudly, “Now, you are no match for me.”","“Let me offer my congratulations first,” Ling Han said with a smile. “However, your words are quite confident. Those who have been defeated by me before, even if they have surpassed me in terms of cultivation level, could not possibly defeat me.”","“Then, shall we compete?” Chi Menghan asked, provoking him.","“Sure.”","The two of them went to an uninhabited planet. Previously, when Ling Han and Ding Shu had sparred, they had both chosen this place.","“This place... looks like a great battle happened not too long ago here.” Chi Menghan swept an eye over the area.","Ling Han nodded, “I fought with a very conceited guy. He keeps being unwilling to admit that I am the boss. However, it won’t be long now.”","He had already shown Ding Shu that his cultivation level was Tenth Form, which greatly provoked Ding Shu. He swore that he would also rush up to Tenth Form. Otherwise, he would have to acknowledge Ling Han as his Big Brother.","For him, this was definitely not allowed.","Chi Menghan smiled, and said, “Don’t tell me that you also want me to acknowledge you as my boss?”","These words were very normal, but accompanied with her turning back to look at him with a smile, the effect was completely different. Instantly, there was a kind of indistinct sparks flying.","Ling Han’s heart involuntarily throbbed.","After coming to this great world, he had been very restrained. He had not thought of any kind of emotional entanglement with any woman, but there were some things that really could not be clearly distinguished just by dividing the boundaries.","Chi Menghan had helped him several times when he was in danger. He couldn’t pretend that he hadn’t seen this deep affection.","Sigh, it was all his fault. He was too outstanding.","Ling Han thought shamelessly. He chuckled, “Forget about Boss. If I win, you can just acknowledge me as your husband.”","“Pervert!” Chi Menghan shouted. Her pretty face was flushed red, and she launched an attack at Ling Han.","She didn’t know Ling Han’s strength, so she naturally wouldn’t use her full strength at once, lest she accidentally wound Ling Han or even beat him to death.","Ling Han snickered, and channeled his power, clashing head-on with Chi Menghan.","After a few moves, Chi Menghan couldn’t help but feel stunned. This was because Ling Han’s power was truly no weaker than hers.","How was this possible?","She had broken through from the Eighth Form of True Self Tier, and once she advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier, she possessed the power of four Heavens, capable of crushing the Spirit Transformation Tier First Change.","But when it came to Ling Han, she couldn’t even suppress a True Self Tier cultivator?","“Could it be that you’ve advanced to the ninth form?” Chi Menghan exclaimed in astonishment. This was the only possibility.","Ling Han smiled in acknowledgment.","He wasn’t lying either, because he had indeed reached the ninth form of the True Self Tier.","Even so, Chi Menghan was still incredibly stunned. This was the ninth form of the True Self Tier, a cultivation level that only existed in legends. Even the Golden Generation could only look up to it.","However, a sense of pride also rose up in her heart.","This was the man that she had her eye on. As expected, he had not disappointed her expectations.","“Why aren’t you fighting anymore? Do you want to be my wife that much?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Chi Menghan’s pretty face flushed red, and she hurriedly launched another attack, blasting towards Ling Han.","She was only a Spirit Transformation Tier First Change, so she had only formed a single spiritual body. Moreover, she clearly hadn’t reached the consummate level yet. This “True Self” was extremely vague, and she could just barely make out a human figure.","Spiritual body and main body joined forces, and launched a mad barrage of attacks at Ling Han.","How could a young girl’s heart be guessed so easily?","If he didn’t guess correctly, he would be blamed, and if he guessed correctly, he would still garner a pout.","The two of them battled fiercely, but naturally did not have any animosity. They only wanted to know how strong the other was.","As they fought, it was inevitable that there would be physical contact. Every time they touched, an ambiguous feeling would spread between the two of them.","Ling Han wasn’t a blockhead, either. She was deeply in love with him, and he owed her too many favors, so his resistance had more or less dissipated.","Thus, he no longer suppressed his own heart. Cultivating was all about nature and following one’s heart. It was naturally not good for him to forcefully suppress his emotions.","“From now on, you are my wife,” Ling Han said.","Chi Menghan rolled his eyes, and said, “Have I lost to you?”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “If you lose to me, will you really be my wife?”","Chi Menghan knew that she had made a slip of the tongue, so she stomped her foot and left in a pout.","“Sigh!” Ling Han stroked his chin, and said, “Being as handsome as I am, my luck with women is truly too good. I’ve sinned!”","He returned to the Academy. It had only been a few days, and he had already received a notice. Those at the True Self Tier, Spirit Transformation Tier, and Sect Master Tier would immediately set out for the Mountain Sea Heaven. The battle situation there was tense, and prodigies like them were needed to join.","If they did not arrive in time, they would be severely punished.","Ling Han didn’t like the Imperial Clans, but he was still duty-bound to fight against Yin souls. Thus, he, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, the perverted pig, and the seven babies immediately set out, heading towards the Mountain Sea Heaven.","After half a month’s long journey, they arrived at the Mountain Sea Heaven. The Dark Moon Planet wasn’t too far from here in the first place.","Ling Han had come here once, and had a very deep impression of this place. He discovered that this place had changed greatly.","—There were actually a considerable number of planets that had appeared in the initially empty galaxy. They were spread around the Mountain Sea Heaven, and surrounded it.","— New chapter is coming soon —"]},{"number":4320,"title":"Chapter 4320: Rushing to the front lines","paragraphs":["Chapter 4320: Rushing to the front lines","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was astonished. These planets had most likely been transported here.","This was really extravagant. In order to oppose the Yin souls, a planetary line of defense had been forcefully built here.","To the Sect Masters, Venerate Tiers, and Saints, battling in space wasn’t a big deal. They could tear a rip in the Void and instantly travel millions and millions of kilometers. However, for cultivators below the level of Sect Master, they still had to be down-to-earth.","Moreover, the power of cultivators wasn’t inexhaustible. They needed to absorb the power of heaven and earth to recover, so they naturally needed planets as a medium.","Ling Han and the others followed the rules and landed on a planet numbered Eleven.","There were a total of 33 planets here, and they were not randomly made up. Instead, every planet was connected to one another, and responded to one another, forming a formation. Thus, if these planets were not destroyed, the formation would not be unravelled, and the Yin souls that was trapped inside would not be able to charge out.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. Using a planet as a formation foundation wasn’t something that formation grandmasters could do, but Formation Saints!","In order to resist the Yin souls, even the Formation Saint had been invited out of their seclusion. It should be known that this kind of existence was really too transcendent. Even Saints would have to be extremely polite when they saw him, and in the whole universe, there were possibly only three to five of them.","They first went to complete their recruitment report, then were assigned into a team, and could enter into battle at any time.","The 33 planets were the first line of defense against the Yin soul army, and was also the most crucial line of defense. Once it was lost, the Yin soul army would be able to use this as a breakthrough point and advance into the depths of the vast universe.","Thus, every planet could not be lost, and there would be Saints standing guard with the Imperial Weapon on each of them.","Ling Han kept a very low profile. In front of the army of Yin souls, his freakish natural talent was completely useless. It was a competition of pure strength. Furthermore, Yin souls did not have any qualms. Even if it was a Sect Master-level yin soul that encountered him, they would still make a move.","Thus, it was necessary to keep a low profile. After all, he hadn’t matured yet.","Thankfully, though this planet had been forcefully pushed to this position by a great elite with supreme might, the ley lines had not been damaged, and could still be communicated and used. However, this Earth Qi was very weak. Whether it was using Star Steps or extracting Earth Qi to transform into a dragon, the effects were much worse.","There was nothing that could be done. The main power of heaven and earth had been used to turn into the power of the great formation. Though Ling Han was a grandmaster of formations, it was obviously impossible for him to compare to a Formation Saint.","It was already good that he could use it. At least, he would have a way out.","After only three days, the Yin souls launched another large-scale attack.","They pretended to attack a great many planets, and their main targets of attack were the seventh, eleventh and twenty-third planets. Countless Yin souls were teleported over, floating in the skies, practically covering the skies.","This was not just the Yin souls, but also the aura of the Netherworld, which greatly weakened the Regulations of heaven and earth that everyone could draw upon.","The person standing guard here was the Drizzle Saint of the Red Lotus Imperial Clan. Aside from him, there were also seven Saints supporting him. This kind of lineup could be considered exaggerated.","Under the control of the Drizzle Saint, the cultivators on the eleventh planet all moved out to meet the Yin souls.","As soon as they came into contact, the side of the Living Realm suffered heavy casualties.","This was the main attack point of the Yin souls. The Yin souls that came were all very powerful, and the Yin souls would not be injured by mystical power. They could only be hit with high-level energy, or the Regulations of heaven and earth, making them extremely hard to kill.","“Ling Han, let’s see who can kill more Yin souls.” Ding Shu jumped out, appearing extremely heroic.","“Sure!” Ling Han nodded.","If he killed a Yin soul in the Living Realm, he would be rewarded by heaven and earth. Previously, in the Black Divine Temple, Ling Han had thus healed his internal injuries.","Wasn’t it a good opportunity to compensate for the damage to his life force?","The two freaks charged out at the same time, unleashing their full battle prowess. Destructive Energy surged, and with a single strike, one, or even a few Yin souls, were killed. The efficiency was incredibly shocking.","When the number of Yin souls killed had reached a certain extent, the rewards from heaven and earth also came. Ling Han immediately felt warm all over, and a heat surged through his whole body, making him feel so comfortable that he wanted to cry out loudly.","His life force was presently being repaired, so it was naturally very comfortable.","Kill, kill, kill!","Ling Han and Ding Shu weren’t the only ones. The large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the others also mercilessly launched attacks. This wasn’t just for the sake of the Living Realm. It was also extremely beneficial for them, as they had also used many Source Dao Stones.","The eight Saints quickly joined the battle as well. However, the reason why the Drizzle Saint hadn’t unleashed the Imperial Weapon was because she wanted to prevent the Yin Saint from unleashing the Imperial Weapon as well. Otherwise, if the eleventh planet was suddenly obliterated, the restriction of the great formation would also be lifted.","The leading figure of the Yin souls was naturally a Saint as well. He was called Jiuhua Yin Saint, and he was battling fiercely with the Drizzle Saint, not falling into a disadvantage at all. His strength was astonishing.","“Jiuhua, since you have already become a Saint in the Netherworld, you can claim to have transcended, so what need is there for you to start a war?” The Drizzle Saint exchanged blows with the Jiuhua Yin Saint, as she launched verbal attacks.","The Jiuhua Yin Saint merely smirked coldly, “You are merely a chess piece on the chessboard, and can only be manipulated by others. Don’t act as if the whole world is under your control.”","“Becoming a Saint is already transcendent, so what do you mean by a chess piece?” the Drizzle Saint retorted.","“Haha, not only are you a chess piece, you are also a chess piece that knows nothing.” Jiuhua Yin Saint sneered, but his attacks were continuous. Extracting the terrifying Regulations, he launched a mad offensive.","Everyone heard this conversation with their ears, and they were all surprised.","A Saint was only a chess piece?","Then who was the one playing the game?","Ancestral King?","However, who didn’t know that there were no Emperors in the world? How could there be an Ancestral King then?","Moreover, if there really was an Ancestral King, would there be any need for so much trouble? They could suppress the heaven and earth by themselves, so what if there were more Saints? They would all be suppressed with a single palm strike, and no matter how many Imperial Weapons they summoned, it would only be a matter of spending a little more effort.","However, how could they have the time to ponder this problem now? The great battle was still continuing, and there were continuous casualties. The situation was extremely tense.","Fortunately, after confirming that the Yin soul army was attacking these three planets, the Saints guarding the other planets also came over and joined the battle.","With the addition of such a fresh force, the Yin soul army was finally completely defeated.","“Why do you have to do this?” the Drizzle Saint said. “If this continues, both sides will only suffer losses. Yin and Yang should be in order, and only then will they be able to exist eternally. You had best give up on this idea. The matter of the Yin sousl wreaking havoc in the Living Realm has never happened before. It will not happen now, nor will it happen in the future.”","“Hahaha!” Jiuhua Yin Saint laughed loudly, as if everyone else was an idiot.","“The wheel of history is rolling, and no one can stop it!” he said, “Those who go along with it will prosper, and those who go against it will die. Not too long after, you will all know just how ignorant you all are!”","“How pretentious!” a considerable number of Saints exclaimed coldly.","Only the Great Emperor could rule over the universe, and it had never been heard that the Netherworld had produced a Great Emperor. With the order of heaven and earth, the Ancestral King could only be born in the Living Realm.","Without the lead of a Great Emperor, wouldn’t it be a huge joke if the Netherworld beings wanted to conquer the Living Realm?"]},{"number":4321,"title":"Chapter 4321: Mending life force","paragraphs":["Chapter 4321: Mending life force","Editor: Henyee Translations","The soul-stirring battle ended, and everyone hurriedly rested.","A great many people were severely wounded, and a great many had even died in battle on the battlefield. Of course, the Yin souls had paid an even greater price. In the end, a great many Saints moved together, causing a devastating blow to the Yin souls.","However, after death, the soul fragments would head to the Netherworld, which was equivalent to adding battle prowess to the Netherworld out of thin air. Meanwhile, in the case of the Living Realm, nurturing an elite would have to be done step by step, and it would take a very long time.","From this aspect alone, the Living Realm couldn’t afford to waste any more time.","“What do you guys think the Netherworld beings are aiming for?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, Ding Shu, and Chi Menghan formed a small alliance.","“That’s right. This is really baffling.” Ding Shu also clasped his head, unable to figure it out no matter what.","Launching a war and contesting for territory was for nothing more than population and resources, but what did Yin souls want the population and resources of the Living Realm for?","Indeed, killing yang souls would allow the Netherworld to increase its “population” for a short period of time. However, this would be killing the goose that lays the golden egg. Only by maintaining the endless growth of the yang souls would the Netherworld have an endless supply of new troops.","Yin souls that hadn’t developed intelligence couldn’t think of this, but it wouldn’t be that even Yin Saints couldn’t think of it.","Ordinarily, with Yin and Yang separated, each guarding their own side, minding their own business, this was the best result.","Why did one party have to violate the law?","“There’s definitely a big secret that we don’t know about,” the little azure dragon said in a deadpan voice.","“Che!” Everyone gave him the middle finger. His words seemed to be very profound, but in truth, it was just saying what was obvious.","“Additionally, even the Yin Saint calls himself a chess piece. Could it be that a Great Emperor’s celestial corpse has appeared in the Netherworld?” The large black dog stroked his chin.","Previously, the information that Jiuhua Yin Saint had revealed was really chilling. If even Saints were pawns, then who would be qualified to play the game?","A Great Emperor!","“The Netherworld can’t possibly give birth to a Great Emperor,” Chi Menghan said with absolute certainty. “Our ancestor entered the Netherworld before, and he’s 100% sure that the Netherworld doesn’t have the environment to give rise to a Great Emperor.”","The ancestor she was talking about was definitely the Ancestral King Donglin.","Since an Ancestral King had already said that it was impossible for the Netherworld to give rise to a Great Emperor, then it was definitely impossible. The Ancestral King was one that had already stepped into this threshold, so he was naturally the most qualified to make this declaration.","“Could it be a Great Emperor had died, and after his death, entered into the Netherworld, and became a Great Emperor in a different manner?” Ding Shu speculated.","Everyone nodded in agreement. Although the Netherworld didn’t possess the foundations to give rise to a Great Emperor, what if they had the experience of becoming a Great Emperor originally?","“Impossible,” Chi Menghan said with a shake of her head. “According to our ancestor, the Great Emperor is far too powerful. It’s also because of this that once the Ancestral King dies, his soul will be absorbed by heaven and earth and become a part of the Regulations of heaven and earth.”","“Thus, it is definitely impossible that a Great Emperor would appear in the Netherworld.”","Her words were resolute, and it was clear that she was absolutely certain.","This was the conclusion that the Ancestral King Donglin had come to. There was no doubt that it was true.","Everyone were scratching their heads in confusion. They couldn’t figure it out no matter what.","However, even the Saints were completely confused, so just how knowledgeable were they? Then, with Ling Han and the others, a few True Self Tiers and Spirit Transformation Tier discussing here, what conclusion could they come to?","“Forget it, let’s hurry up and increase our strength.” In the end, everyone could only say helplessly.","Ling Han smiled at Ding Shu and said, “Hey, when are you acknowledging me as Big Brother?”","“Pei! I still haven’t advanced to the Spirit Transformation Tier yet, so as long as I don’t advance to the Spirit Transformation Tier, I’ll always have a sliver of hope!” Ding Shu said with his head held high.","Ling Han’s expression was filled with suspicion, “You won’t never break through to Spirit Transformation Tier for the rest of your life to avoid becoming my underling, right?”","“F*** you, I will definitely reach Tenth Form!” Ding Shu clenched his fists, his fighting spirit blazing.","“Hehe.”","Everyone returned to rest, and Ling Han also needed to make some adjustments.","In this battle, he had profited greatly.","He would be rewarded by heaven and earth for killing Yin souls in the Living Realm, and the Yin souls he had killed this time could be considered uncountable. With Destructive Energy added with his present terrifying battle prowess, even a Spirit Transformation Tier-level Yin soul would be killed.","Thus, the benefits he received were also astonishing.","The damaged life force had already been completely mended!","Of course, he would never be able to recover the lifespan that he had lost. This was the price that he had to pay for the rapid increase of his cultivation level. It was like there was a Regulation of Karma. If you wanted to take a shortcut, you would definitely have to pay a price.","With a lifespan of about a thousand years, Ling Han was still able to afford it.","“Now that the life force has recovered, I have nothing to worry about.”","He was not so foolhardy to use the Source Dao Stone again. Instead, he was anticipating the invasion of the Yin souls that would follow. His life force had recovered to the consummate level, and if he was rewarded again, it would definitely help him increase his cultivation level.","Several days later, the Yin souls once again wreaked havoc.","This time, the main battlefield was not on the eleventh planet, but there were still a considerable number of Yin souls that had come. Ling Han had killed innumerable enemies, and had also received a great many rewards from the heaven and earth. His cultivation level instantly had a clear improvement.","Invigorating!","Ling Han was filled with anticipation. After battling here for a year and a half, he should be able to reach the end of the Tenth Form, and qualify to break through to Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Furthermore, this was improving one’s cultivation level through battle, so there was absolutely no need to worry that his cultivation was advancing too fast, and his foundations would be unstable.","Yin souls launched a minor offensive once every three days, and a major offensive once every ten days, as if they wanted to completely exhaust the accumulation of their forces over these countless years.","The Living Realm’s side suffered great losses, but as long as they survived, they all had astonishing improvements.","However, this kind of benefit was not something that everyone could enjoy evenly, because the Yin souls would not be injured by mystical power, and only high-level energy and Regulations would be able to injure them. It would be extremely straining for those below the True Self Tier to deal with the Yin souls.","Thus, those participating in the battles here were at least at the True Self Tier. If Core Formation Tiers and Cauldron Forging Tiers came, not only would they not be able to reap any benefits, they would even lose their lives.","In a blink of an eye, a year had passed.","Ling Han had already cultivated the eighth True Self to the tenth form. He was only missing the last True Self, and he would be able to touch the end of the True Self Tier.","“If the Yin souls are still so cooperative, it would probably take another month.” Ling Han broke into a grin. He was really looking forward to it.","“Little Han!” The large black dog’s solemn voice rang out from outside.","“En?” Ling Han walked out.","“The Yin souls are here again!” the large black dog said in excitement.","For them, the invasion of the Yin souls was actually a gift, and if someone gave a gift, and it was a great gift at that, who would not be happy?","“All right, let’s move out!”","Ling Han charged out with the large black dog, little azure dragon, Chi Menghan, and the seven babies. This was another great opportunity to improve his cultivation.","Of course, the Yin souls weren’t purely here to deliver gifts. Under their continuous barrage, the Living Realm’s side also suffered heavy losses. After all, not everyone was as powerful as Ling Han and the others.","Furthermore, if he really encountered a powerful Yin soul, Ling Han could still use the Star Steps and immediately flee with his people. How many people could possess such an advantage?","Everything was normal. When the Living Realm elites confirmed the main target of attack for the Yin soul army, a large number of Saints and Venerate Tiers rushed over and started a massacre. The chaos was almost instantly pacified.","But this time, it seemed a little different.","The Void suddenly tore apart, and a long river surged over.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4322,"title":"Chapter 4322: Yin River Reappears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4322: Yin River Reappears","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Yi!” Ling Han immediately exclaimed in surprise.","“En?” Ding Shu also appeared very stunned.","“What’s wrong?” the large black dog and the others hurriedly asked.","Ling Han took a deep breath, “This river... seems a little familiar.”","“You think so too?” Ding Shu looked towards Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, “If both of us think that way, then I’m sure we are not mistaken.”","“Hey, what kind of riddle are you guys playing?” The little azure dragon didn’t have much patience, and was already so anxious that it was about to stomp its feet.","“That Yin River from Dark Clouds Hell!” Ling Han said darkly, finally unravelling the mystery.","“What!” Everyone was stunned.","The Dark Clouds Hell was a dangerous place in this universe. It was hidden inside a black hole, and there were great dangers within. Even a Saint with an Imperial Weapon could possibly die if they entered.","But that should be completely unrelated to this place. Why had the Yin River of the Dark Clouds Hell suddenly appeared here?","Moreover, wasn’t the Dark Clouds Hell hidden inside the black hole?","“Little Han, could it be that you’ve both seen wrongly? It just looks similar,” the large black dog said.","“That’s right, that’s right. There are many such great rivers in the world, and it may not be that one.” The little azure dragon also nodded repeatedly.","“Yes or no, it’s very easy to prove,” Ling Han said in a deep voice.","“How?” Chi Menghan asked.","“Is the boatman there?” Ding Shu continued.","The sudden appearance of this great river stunned everyone. In the vast universe, what did the sudden appearance of a great river mean?","In any case, the Yin soul army had already been defeated. A great many people put away their weapons, and looked towards the skies.","The Yin River surged and flowed endlessly. There was clearly no riverbed, but it was as if the great river was controlled by an invisible power, and the waters did not seep out in the slightest.","All of a sudden, everyone felt a frightening Yin Qi seeping directly into their bones, and every single one of them trembled endlessly.","This was a bone-deep chill that could not be erased.","What was going on here?","A cold and sinister river appeared out of nowhere. No matter how they thought about it, this did not seem like a good thing.","Even the Saints came over, and stood on the banks of the river, looking alert.","“Look!” Someone pointed into the distance of the river.","Everyone looked over, and their hearts clenched.","There, there was actually a small ship slowly sailing over. In fact, it couldn’t even be considered a ship. It could only be called a boat, and there was a boatman standing at the bow of the boat, who was presently slowly holding onto a bamboo pole.","If this happened on some planet, that would be very normal.","However, in the universe, a cold river suddenly stretched out, and a boatman appeared in the river. No matter how one thought about it, it didn’t seem right.","Ling Han turned to look at Ding Shu, and Ding Shu coincidentally turned to look at him as well. The two of them frowned, and a powerful chill rose up in their hearts.","And this kind of small boat... there was actually not just one.","Very quickly, another small boat appeared, then a third, and a fourth. There were more and more of them, and they filed off.","As they sailed closer, everyone could clearly see that these boatmen all had greenish-white skin, and their eyes were dull, as if they had been dead for a very, very long time.","This was not a Yin soul. On the contrary, it was like a walking corpse that had lost its soul!","“Humph, how pretentious!” a Saint said coldly. He raised his hand and pressed down, and instantly, a large hand that was comparable to a planet appeared, blasting towards those small rafts.","The attack of a Saint was world-shaking!","However, just as this large hand was about to descend, a sword light flashed past, incredibly stunning, illuminating even the dark universe.","In the skies, that giant hand was suddenly severed into two halves, which fell from either side of the great river, yet did not touch the great river in the slightest.","Such a terrifying attack was dispersed just like that.","Hiss!","Everyone was stunned upon seeing this. The person who had attacked just then was a Saint. Even a Saint’s attack had been so easily blocked, so what cultivation level was the person who had moved just then?","It had to be a Saint!","Where did it come from?","This wasn’t a Yin soul!","Could it be that... aside from Yin souls, there were other kinds of strange existences?","All of a sudden, all the Saints looked like they were facing a great enemy.","Merely the Yin souls causing chaos was enough to give them a headache, and now a new enemy was going to appear?","“Yi!” A Saint’s expression suddenly changed drastically. He was from the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan.","“Unbroken, what’s wrong?” a Saint beside him asked.","The Unbroken Saint took a deep breath, pointed at a small raft, and said, “The person on board... is a former Saint of our Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan that disappeared a very long time ago!”","“What!”","Though this was a conversation between the two of them, there were Saints all around them, so they naturally managed to easily hear the conversation between the two of them.","“Could it be that person?” A Saint suddenly recalled.","A Saint from the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan suddenly disappeared, and only the Imperial Weapon flew back to the clan on its own, and this became a mystery for all eternity.","“In the past, this Saint of our clan had once brought the Imperial Weapon to the Dark Clouds Hell to investigate. However, not long after, the Imperial Weapon flew back to our clan on its own, and there was no more news of that Saint from then onwards,” the Unbroken Saint said slowly.","A great many years had already passed, so the blow rendered through the death of a Saint could not possibly shake the foundations of the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan. Because a new Saint had already appeared, the Unbroken Saint did not mind revealing that secret from all those years ago.","That was something that had happened tens of millions of years ago, but how could it not be shocking that a former Saint had suddenly reappeared?","He also needed the Saints to give him some advice. What was going on here?","How could a Saint live for tens of millions of years? Then what the hell was this former Saint in front of him?","“Dark Clouds Hell!” All the Saints frowned deeply.","This was a land of desolation in the universe. Though it was also the sole source of Source Dao Stones, and had drawn the envy of who knew how many Imperial Clans, none of them dared to launch a large-scale assault.","Now, a river that belonged to the Dark Clouds Hell had suddenly appeared, and a predecessor that had been lost countless years ago had turned into a boatman. No matter how one thought about it, this would make one feel a chill run down their spine.","Just when these Saints were confused, the “boatmen” launched an attack.","Boom!","A terrifying attack was launched. These boatmen were either Saints or Venerate Tiers, and their abilities were too terrifying. In an instant, a hole was torn open in their ranks, and they penetrated deeply, attacking towards the eighteenth planet.","“Stop them!” All the Saints hurriedly shouted. Immediately, Saints revived the Imperial Weapons, and attacked those strange boatmen.","The awakening of the Imperial Weapon was equivalent to the revival of a Great Emperor. This battle prowess was naturally terrifying. With a single strike, those boatmen were like straws, scattering in all directions. They were completely outmatched.","When Saints encountered a Great Emperor, they could only flee upon hearing his arrival. If they clashed head-on, they would definitely die.","Instantly, a few boatmen were smashed into smithereens.","However, there was a strange force that sucked the shattered pieces of these boatmen into the great river. In just a short while, these boatmen emerged from the great river.","...They were complete, and had come back to life!","No, no, no. They should have died long ago. Thus, it was fine even if they were shattered. They just had to rebuild their bodies.","Seeing this scene, everyone’s scalps went numb."]},{"number":4323,"title":"Chapter 4323: The sea of blood gives rise to might","paragraphs":["Chapter 4323: The sea of blood gives rise to might","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was too terrifying.","Countless Saint-level and Venerate-level elites joined the battle. This was already enough to give them a headache, and what was more terrifying was that these “things” were actually undying. That naturally caused them to lose all hope.","How were they supposed to continue fighting?","Even if you killed them 10,000 times, they could still be revived 10,000 times. They could not be killed completely at all.","“There’s no such thing as a problem with no solution in this world,” Ling Han said from below. “I believe that Yin River’s ‘revival’ ability is also limited.”","“But the problem is, even if it can only be ‘revived’ two to three times, this is enough to make one’s head hurt,” Ding Shu said with a frown.","That’s right. This was a huge problem. Furthermore, they did not know where the “revival” limit of the Yin River was. This made them feel uncertain, and would make them feel even more hopeless.","Boom!","In the universe, the fierce battle was still continuing.","The Saint that had awakened the Imperial Weapon unleashed a massacre. The Imperial Weapon showed its might, and there was no match for it at all. Groups of boatmen were destroyed, and the Yin River was like a river of life, endlessly reviving them.","However, there was a time limit to the awakening of the Imperial Weapon. Very quickly, that Saint couldn’t hold on any longer, and retreated to the side.","If he continued on, he would be sucked dry by the Imperial Weapon!","Thankfully, another Saint immediately took up the responsibility, and similarly revived the Imperial Weapon, sweeping aside all opposition.","However, the Yin soul army made a comeback, and there was also a Yin Saint that was similarly brandishing the Imperial Weapon, striking the heavens above and shattering the nine earths below. It was boundlessly terrifying.","Close combat had begun, and the situation had become incredibly dire.","This time, the Yin souls had reinforcements. The boatmen that had come out of the Yin River were too terrifying. They were all Saint-level and Venerate-level. With their combined forces, not only were they not inferior to the Living Realm’s side, they even looked like they were about to surpass them.","Thankfully, the Living Realm’s side had many Imperial Weapons, and under the continuous awakening, they were still able to stabilize the situation.","Boom, right at this moment, the Void split open, and a sea of blood appeared.","“F*ck!” Ling Han couldn’t help but curse.","No way!","Chi Menghan’s cherry mouth was also slightly agape, similarly extremely stunned.","She was no stranger to this sea of blood. At that time, three Saints had joined forces, bringing the Imperial Weapon into this sea of blood. In the end, there were endless Saint corpses in this sea of blood, and they were forcefully chased out.","Afterwards, a great many Imperial Clans joined forces, and barged in together with the Imperial Weapon, but it was also useless. In the end, they left in a sorry state.","Why was this sea of blood here to join in on the excitement at such a crucial moment?","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. Jiuhua Yin Saint had said that they were all chess pieces, and the only difference was that the Saint from the Living Realm was a chess piece that was ignorant.","To the Imperial Clans, this sea of blood was naturally not unfamiliar to them. All the Saints looked incredibly livid.","They were done for. If the corpses of the Saints in the sea of blood also joined the battle, and were to help the Yin souls at that, what else could they do but flee in disarray?","Fight with all their might?","It was indeed possible that the Yin souls would be blocked here, but most of the Saints here would probably die as well.","Just ask, how many Saints would have such great awareness, and be willing to sacrifice themselves?","The sea of blood boiled. Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, figures appeared and joined the battle, and the target of their attacks... was none other than the Saints from the Living Realm.","They were done for.","Seeing this scene, despair rose up from the bottom of everyone’s hearts.","The two lands of danger contained a great number of Saint corpses, and now these Saint corpses had actually all “revived” at the same time. They could even come back to life after being destroyed by the Imperial Weapon, so how were they supposed to withstand this invasion?","Everyone’s fighting spirit fell drastically, and even the Saints had no desire to continue fighting.","It could be clearly seen that the line of defense formed by the Saints and Venerate Tiers was rapidly crumbling, and a large number of Yin souls took advantage of the opening to charge out, charging towards the 33 planets.","As long as these planets were shattered, the formation would disperse on its own, and the Yin souls would be able to penetrate straight in.","At this moment, Ling Han actually felt a sliver of curiosity.","Yin souls all had the help of the sea of blood, the Saints and Venerate Tiers of the Yin River. When these elites attacked, even the combined forces of the Imperial Clans could only just barely resist. Then what was the point of ordinary Yin souls participating in the battle?","This great formation could only trap Sect Masters, at most. Venerates should be able to forcibly break through. Then, for the Netherworld army, their elites were enough to sweep aside all opposition in the world, so why would they still care about those mere pawns?","Previously, Jiuhua Yin Saint had already said that this was a game of chess. Then, ordinary Yin souls should be considered pawns, right? So, pawns also had the special effect of pawns?","“Little Han, we should retreat!” the large black dog shouted.","Ling Han nodded. It was indeed time to retreat. With the Netherworld coalition army charging over, the defense line formed by the Saints would fall sooner or later. Furthermore, these Saints had clearly lost their fighting spirit, so the rate at which the defense line crumbled would also be sped up.","“Retreat! Retreat!” The Saints also issued the command to retreat. By now, the Yin soul army was already unstoppable. If they fought a bloody battle here, it would only expend their power.","Instantly, the Transfer Formation flashed repeatedly, and everyone began a large retreat.","Ling Han also threw out the formation foundations. Wrapped in white light, they hurriedly retreated.","When they reappeared, they were already very, very far away from the Mountain Sea Heaven.","However, even at such a far distance, they could still see the great battle that was breaking out in the universe. Endless brilliance was flickering, and the aftermath of energy surged over, turning into a terrifying storm.","Boom!","In the sky, a ball of light suddenly exploded. It was extremely blinding, and one couldn’t even open their eyes.","“A planet has been obliterated!” Ling Han said darkly.","“Sigh!” Everyone sighed. The situation was really taking a sharp turn for the worse. Who would have thought that the Netherworld would have such powerful helpers?","One of the planets had been obliterated, and the formation was naturally destroyed. From now onwards, the Yin souls would be able to penetrate deeply, and no one would be able to stop them.","Ling Han grimaced. Why was it not peaceful wherever he went?","There was Hysteria in the Genesis World, wanting to devour all dimensions and destroy all life. He had initially thought that it would be quiet here, but after a few days of peace, the matter of Yin souls wreaking havoc actually appeared again.","It was absolutely impossible for living beings and Yin souls to coexist, so this was another unsolvable situation.","The so-called dark period in history was referring to the invasion of Yin souls?","Then, at this kind of moment, there should be a Great Emperor appearing to pacify the world.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","It was as if fireworks were being set off in the skies. Another planet exploded, releasing a brilliant light. There was an indescribable beauty about it, but everyone only felt a chill. The Yin soul coalition army was unstoppable. If they continued to wreak havoc like this, would there still be a place for living beings in this world?","Next, were they going to enter into an era of complete darkness?","Boom, boom, boom! Right now, only the sound of planets exploding could be heard. Everyone remained silent. No one was in the mood to speak.","“Hehe, you all still haven’t given up!” A voice suddenly rang out in everyone’s minds, and a young monk suddenly appeared in the skies.","He was called a young monk, because he was actually very, very young. He looked to be only 15 or 16 years old. However, his body wasn’t small at all. In fact, his bald head was the size of a whole planet.","The little monk moved, his left palm striking out at the sea of blood, while his right palm struck out at the Yin River. He actually wanted to snipe the two great monsters at the same time.","C"]},{"number":4324,"title":"Chapter 4324: Second Life!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4324: Second Life!","Editor: Henyee Translations","Boom!","A terrifying scene appeared. The young monk struck out with both hands, and endless Regulations lit up, as if the whole universe had been lit up. The two palms struck, and the Yin River and the sea of blood were actually forced to retreat.","“Motherf*cker!”","“Holy f*ck!”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Meanwhile, a large number of Saints hadn’t retreated too far, and they all started to curse.","Was this little monk trying to defy the heavens?","How many corpses of Saints were there in the Yin River and the sea of blood? Though they were called “corpse”, they still possessed battle prowess on the level of Saints.","Thus, to force the sea of blood and the Yin River back with a single strike, just how terrifying was the power needed?","Could it be that a Great Emperor had already appeared in this universe?","But now that a new Emperor had appeared, how could there possibly be no news of it at all?","“Could it be Buddhist Land’s strongest Buddha Son?” someone asked in a trembling voice.","Buddhist Land was the same as various great Imperial Clans. There was Golden Generation and Silver Generation, and it was said that the Buddhist Son that belonged to Golden Generation had long since reached Sect Master Tier.","Yet now, he had actually become Emperor?","Was it really that exaggerated?","“No, this definitely isn’t that Buddha Son from the Buddhist Land,” a Saint said. He had seen that Buddha Son from the Buddhist Land before, and he was completely different from this young monk.","“This is far too astonishing. This young monk is genuinely only 15 or 16 years old. Such a young Great Emperor?” another Saint said.","“This little monk isn’t a Great Emperor yet, but his abilities have far surpassed that of a nine-star Saint,” the Saint from the Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan said.","“Could it be—”","“Pseudo-Emperor!” All the Saints exclaimed in shock. Indeed, upon closer observation, they discovered that this little monk was indeed not an Ancestral King; he was still slightly away from that, but a great deal stronger than a Saint.","Thus, there was only one possibility, and that was a Pseudo-Emperor.","The little monk was incredibly domineering, and after another few consecutive moves, he blasted the Yin River and the sea of blood into continuous retreat.","Countless Saints and Venerate Tier corpses charged out, but in front of a Pseudo-Emperor, they were not enough at all. With a single blwo, they were all blasted to smithereens.","So what if you could be revived by the Yin River and the sea of blood? A Pseudo-Emperor was not an Imperial Weapon, and did not need to be awakened. At any time, a Pseudo-Emperor could maintain a prime state.","“Six Buddhist Weapons!” the young monk exclaimed softly. He sent out a palm strike, and the Buddhist Staff, Skanda Staff, and the other Divine Weapons appeared behind him. They emitted golden light, and hong, blasted towards Yin River and the sea of blood.","Boom!","This was the ultimate move of a Pseudo-Emperor. With a single strike, the sea of blood and Yin River exploded.","“Doga, who would’ve thought? Not only did you not die, but you even managed to live a second life!” A booming voice reverberated through the Yin River.","It was clearly a sound, but like divine sense, it instantly spread to every corner of the universe, and everyone could hear it clearly.","Who... was this person?","There were only corpses in the Yin River. Though every single one of them had astonishing battle prowess, all of them were walking corpses. They had never seen any of them open their mouths to speak.","And now, someone in the Yin River spoke. This voice... just hearing it would cause one to feel chills all over their body, and reverence rise up from the depths of their hearts. It was as if that was a supreme being that they could only kneel on the ground and look up at it.","The master of the Yin River? The true master of the Dark Clouds Hell?","Hold on!","Doga? Buddha Doga?","After a moment of shock, everyone suddenly realized that the meaning behind these words was also incredibly frightening.","Was this little monk Buddha Doga? No, no, no, not the Buddha Doga from hundreds of millions of years ago, but his second incarnation!","In the past, Buddha Doga was only left with a sheet of skin. Could it be that it was an old sheet of skin that he had shed, while his physical body had lived a second life?","Heavens, living a second life, what kind of shocking news was this?","Ling Han was also taken aback. This young monk with delicate features was actually Buddha Doga? That Buddha Doga that had killed countless Saints in the Black Heaven Divine Temple?","He gritted his teeth. He really needed some time to digest this.","“You should have returned to dust long ago. What are you waiting for?” the small monk asked calmly.","Since he didn’t retort, it meant that he really was the Buddha Doga that had lived a second life.","“Humph, at our level, what we pursue is nothing more than eternal life,” the person in the Yin River said. “Doga, don’t meddle in other people’s business. Otherwise, I will end your life here!”","However, Buddha Doga’s expression was calm as he said, “Those who defy the heavens will ultimately suffer a divine punishment. What’s the point of you hiding in the Yin River and struggling at death’s door? Moreover, you can give it a try. Will you kill me, or will I kill you?”","When he said the last words, he suddenly exploded with a baleful killing intent that was indescribably terrifying.","So what if they were Saints? They all humphed, their expressions extremely pained.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor. Beneath the Black Heaven Divine Temple, who knew how many Saints had been captured by this Lord, and tortured to death. Now, he had lived a second life, and his battle prowess had probably risen instead of decreasing. Suppressing Saints was really child’s play.","In this world, the new Ancestral King had yet to appear, so the Buddha Doga was the strongest existence. There was no other that could compare!","“Gagaga!” A strange laugh rang out from the Yin River. “Doga, you are too arrogant! However, for the sake of your Senior Brother, I will not drop down to your level this time. In any case, there is still a little bit of time left.”","Boom, the Void shattered, and the Yin River instantly retreated, sinking completely into the Void. Then, the Void closed, and the Yin River was no longer seen, as if it had never existed.","No sound was heard from within the sea of blood, but it had also entered into the Void.","The two super threats were resolved by Buddha Doga alone.","With the departure of these two powerful reinforcements, the Yin soul army no longer wreaked havoc, and immediately retreated, returning to the Mountain Sea Heaven.","Buddha Doga stood proudly in the universe. That massive figure seemed to be able to illuminate the entire universe, and everyone in the surrounding galaxy could see it clearly.","“Greetings, Lord Doga!” A Saint stepped forward, and his manifested body was also millions and millions of meters tall. He tried to get closer, “I am the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan’s Rainbow Saint Light Saint. Lord Doga, do you have time to pay a visit to our humble Clan?”","This was a Pseudo-Emperor, an awesome character who already had one foot into Emperor Tier. He was definitely an ultimate VIP.","Pa!","Buddha Doga sent out a palm strike, and the Rainbow Light Saint was instantly sent flying.","F***.","Seeing this scene, everyone gritted their teeth.","That was a Saint, an existence that was close to invincible in this world. He was practically standing at the peak of martial arts. Furthermore, the Rainbow Light Saint was a Saint of the Imperial Clans, and held the Imperial Weapon in his hand.","Was this... really appropriate?","Buddha Doga humphed coldly, and said, “I hate people like you the most. Stop trying to worm your way into being friends with me!”","In the distance, the Rainbow Light Saint had already stood still. An incredibly clear palm print had appeared on his face. He was in an incredibly awkward situation. He had taken the initiative to approach, yet he had actually been slapped?","How humiliating.","Weng, he activated the Imperial Weapon at the first instant, and said harshly, “Doga, even when the Ancestral King appears, he is still incredibly polite towards the Imperial Clans. You are merely a Pseudo-Emperor, and you actually dare to hit me?”","Buddha Doga glanced at him coldly, and said, “If you continue to make noise, I’ll kill you!”","How domineering!","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. This mighty figure from the ancient times was still as awesome as always.","In the past, he had imprisoned and tortured Saints, allowing them to experience the calamity of hell. And now? He had casually slapped a Saint from an Imperial Clan.","That was how a true man should be!","—"]},{"number":4325,"title":"Chapter 4325: Temporarily quelling the chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 4325: Temporarily quelling the chaos","Editor: Henyee Translations","Faced with the domineering attitude of Doga, the Rainbow Light Saint hesitated slightly.","Being slapped in full public, he naturally wanted to get his pride back, but the problem here was this was a Pseudo-Emperor in front of him, a god of death that had committed boundless sins in the ancient times.","If he couldn’t pacify him, what if he was killed by the other party?","—A Saint and the Imperial Weapon were still unable to deal with a Pseudo-Emperor, so it would be useless even if he died. Who would be able to avenge him? Moreover, if the Pseudo-Emperor wanted to flee, would the Saint be able to catch up with him with the Imperial Weapon?","Unless a deadly trap was set up, and dozens of Saints carried the Imperial Weapons to ambush and kill, it would be impossible to stop a Pseudo-Emperor who wanted to leave.","But to have the Saints of the other Imperial Clans join forces with him, how could that be possible?","Who would be willing to take such a risk?","The Rainbow Light Saint hesitated for a moment before finally calming down the Imperial Weapon and forcefully suppressing his anger.","Er, being outmatched by a Pseudo-Emperor, it should be understandable.","Buddha Doga looked around, and no one dared to make eye contact with him.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor. With the word ‘Emperor’, it was equivalent to being invincible.","After sweeping a glance over them, Buddha Doga turned his gaze to Ling Han.","With a single step, Buddha Doga appeared in front of Ling Han. His colossal figure also returned to his normal form, like an ordinary little monk. However, there was a Buddha Halo at the back of his head that was exuding golden light, making him appear incredibly sacred.","Ling Han didn’t dare to think that this person was a benevolent person. He was someone who could create hell for Saints at the slightest provocation. How could he not be vicious and merciless?","His heart clenched, but he did not panic too much.","If Buddha Doga wanted to kill him, he could have done so in the Black Heaven Divine Temple. He wouldn’t have needed to wait until now.","“Young people grow up very quickly,” Buddha Doga said with a nod. However, he looked like a little monk at this moment, so speaking in this manner naturally made him appear old and experienced.","In front of this person, even the little azure dragon and the large black dog didn’t dare to speak cheekily. They obediently stood on the sidelines.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Thank you for your praise, Senior.”","“I’ve often heard about you,” Buddha Doga said. “Interesting.”","Ling Han was slightly flattered. A Pseudo-Emperor would actually pay attention to him. This was really unexpected.","“I will continue to work hard,” he said.","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. He nodded and didn’t say anything else. He took another step, and a golden path appeared. With a single step, he instantly disappeared into the boundless distance.","The power of a Pseudo-Emperor was indescribably mysterious.","All of a sudden, a great many Saints’ eyes were focused on Ling Han.","Previously, a Saint had stepped forward to strike up a conversation with him, and Buddha Doga had directly sent him flying with a slap. However, he had taken the initiative to talk to a junior just now, and it seemed like they were having a great conversation at that. How could everyone not be surprised?","But why was this person Ling Han?","Now, Ling Han had become a thorn in the side of the Imperial Clans. A great many Imperial Clans wanted to get rid of him, yet Buddha Doga actually concerned himself with Ling Han.","Though he had only said a few words just now, and they could not be sure that Buddha Doga admired Ling Han very much, but what if?","What if they killed Ling Han and made Buddha Doga unhappy?","If it was the Nine Mountains Saint added with the Imperial Weapon, the various great Imperial Clans could at least hold on. Worse come to worst, they could hold on until the Nine Mountains Saint died. They refused to believe that the Nine Suns Holy Land would be able to nurture another Saint in a short amount of time.","—This required background and great fortune.","However, in the case of Pseudo-Emperor, sigh, these Imperial Clan elites shook their heads. They could not afford to trifle with him, not even the slightest bit.","The awakening of the Imperial Weapon could probably intimidate him for a while, but would they be able to maintain this state forever?","Was it so difficult to kill a measly True Self Tier cultivator?","When they saw Ling Han, these Imperial Clan Saints all felt sullen. Now, Ling Han was equivalent to having double insurance, so how were they supposed to make a move!","Even the Battle God Palace had to consider carefully. If they angeredBudha Doga, perhaps this force that had hidden for millions and millions of years would be razed to the ground.","Ling Han, on the other hand, did not think that Buddha Doga was deliberately taking care of him. This kind of elite should only have the goal of becoming Emperor in his eyes. It was purely because he thought that Ling Han was good at causing trouble, so he had deliberately come to praise him.","Right now, the Yin souls of the Mountain Sea Heaven had been suppressed, meaning that they wouldn’t come out to cause trouble for the time being. Thus, this place would be refurbished, with Saints taking turns to stand guard. Meanwhile, the others returned to do whatever they were doing.","However, there was a sword hanging over everyone’s hearts.","There should be two incomparably terrifying beings in the Yin River and the sea of blood. Perhaps, they were also Pseudo-Emperors. Otherwise, with how domineering Buddha Doga was, he couldn’t possibly watch them retreat helplessly.","Right now, they had been chased off by Buddha Doga. However, this didn’t mean that they would never return.","On the other hand, the reason why they had compromised was because they felt that the “time” had not arrived yet.","No one knew what this time was referring to, but the danger would make a comeback. This should be a sure bet.","At that time, the two Pseudo-Emperors would make a comeback with troops of Yin souls and the dead. Morevoer, they would even move personally. Just how terrifying was that?","Moreover, there were already three Pseudo-Emperors now, so how could those of the Golden Generation and Silver Generation not be burning with anxiety?","The path to becoming Emperor had opened, and these three had even set one foot on the finishing line, but they were still at the starting line. How were they supposed to compete!","The tournament had not even begun, and the results had already been announced. Who would be willing to accept this?","After returning to the Ancestral King Academy, the atmosphere of cultivation suddenly became extremely tense.","Since the three Pseudo-Emperors had not taken that last step, it meant that everyone still had a chance.","Furthermore, from the conversation between Buddha Doga and the Master of the Yin River, they should both be antiques, and had only managed to live to this era through special means. Thus, even if they were Pseudo-Emperors, they would definitely face even more difficulties in becoming Emperor.","Thus, though everyone was temporarily lagging behind, and furthermore, they were not just a little bit behind, there was still a sliver of hope that they could become Emperor.","On this path, there was no such thing as first come, first served. There was no such thing as fairness or injustice. There was only hard work, and they could only forge onwards bravely.","What did it matter that they would be bleeding and battered? What did it matter that they had failed in the end? Only by putting in the effort would they be able to live without regrets, and have no regrets of living this life.","“By the looks of it now, the two from the Yin River and sea of blood should both be Pseudo-Emperors as well. Causing so much trouble, their purpose must be for the sake of becoming Emperor,” the large black dog deduced.","It was only a Pseudo-Emperor that could kill so many Saints. Just look at Buddha Doga, and it was clear just how many Saints had been captured and experimented on by him.","“It’s extremely likely that they’re losers from the Imperial Path millions and millions of years ago. However, through some special method, they managed to struggle at death’s door and live to this era.” The little azure dragon also said, “Just like Buddha Doga, who lived a second life and wants to continue contesting for the throne.”","“Sigh, with such an opponent, the pressure is so great,” Ding Shu exclaimed ruefully.","Meanwhile, Ling Han glanced at him, saying, “You’ve lost, so hurry up and acknowledge me as the boss!”","“Pei, as long as I don’t break through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, this bet will never end.” Ding Shu hurriedly broke into a run, to avoid being mocked by Ling Han again."]},{"number":4326,"title":"Chapter 4326: Enlightenment","paragraphs":["Chapter 4326: Enlightenment","Editor: Henyee Translations","Right now, the Ancestral King Academy appeared especially calm. Everyone was working hard on their cultivation.","Ling Han went to check on the empress and Hu Niu. They had both reached the end of the Core Formation Tier, and could now attempt to break through to the True Self Tier.","However, the advancement of the little red bird’s cultivation level was astonishing, because she was the first to advance into the True Self Tier. When she saw Ling Han, she instantly became aggressive, wanting to duel with him and turn the tables in their relations.","Ling Han directly grabbed the little azure dragon, letting this pair of enemies fight.","Though the little red bird was extraordinary, its cultivation level was not as high as the little azure dragon’s. Furthermore, the little azure dragon was also a Body Arts user, so its power was even more violent. Even if the little red bird’s flames could burn Four Star Divine Metal, against the little azure dragon’s physique, that was still somewhat difficult, and its flames could not burn through it at the first instant.","In the end, the little red bird was ruthlessly beaten, and obediently continued to follow Ling Han.","Looking at the little red bird whose feathers were all disheveled, Ling Han sighed, and said to the little azure dragon, “You don’t know how to have tender feelings for the fairer sex at all. You won’t be able to find a girlfriend like this.”","“Why would Grandpa Dragon want a girlfriend?” the little azure dragon asked directly.","“When you grow up, it’ll be too late for regrets.”","The little azure dragon was still in the form of a four-legged snake, and the growth of the Dragon Race was slow in the first place. It would need at least ten thousand years to be considered mature. Thus, even though this guy’s cultivation level increased very quickly, his mind was still like a child’s.","“I curse that you won’t be able to get a wife for the rest of your life!” Meanwhile, the little red bird poked a straw doll1. It hated the little azure dragon to the core.","Sure enough, they were truly a quarrelsome but loving couple.","However, after returning to the Ancestral King Academy, although there was still a large amount of cultivation resources provided, the rate of advancement of cultivation level was completely incomparable to refining the Source Dao Stone, or killing a Yin soul to obtain a reward from heaven and earth.","After three months, Ling Han had only cultivated the eighth True Self to the tenth form. He was only one True Self away from being able to completely cultivate the entire True Self Tier.","“I still need about three months.” Ling Han sighed.","Under the stimulation of the supreme elites the likes of Buddha Doga and the others, every single one of them was cultivating with all their might, trying to rush their cultivation level as soon as possible.","For example, the Silver Generation had all advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and the well-known ones had already become Sect Master elites, qualified to be called great elites.","The Golden Generation was even more incredible. It was said that two of them already had one foot into Venerate Tier, and the day they became Venerates could possibly be within two to three years.","It could not be helped. Those walking at the forefront of the Imperial Path were already Pseudo-Emperors. If they still did not rush, even if they were supremely talented, so what?","There could only be one Emperor in a single era!","Ling Han first stopped cultivating. Only by striking a balance between work and rest, would he be able to maintain the continuous improvement of his cultivation level. Otherwise, it was possible that he would not be able to reach it even if he tried his best.","He left, planning to walk around in the academy to change his mood.","The Ancestral King Academy was very large. If he did not use his movement technique, and just walked slowly step by step, it would take him at least half a year to complete a full circle, and if he wanted to tour every corner, that would be need even more time than that.","Ling Han was in no hurry. He merely admired the mountains and waters, and his next step was to break through to Spiritual Transformation Tier. Naturally, he needed to comprehend the Dao of Heaven and Earth, and where was the Dao of Heaven and Earth?","It was in the environment.","When he walked to the side of a lake, he saw the rippling waves, and when the sunlight danced wildly on the surface of the lake like golden snakes, he suddenly felt something. He sat down in a cross-legged position, and endless enlightenment dawned on him.","Boom! Energy from heaven and earth surged over, and in his mind, the ninth True Self was actually rapidly advancing towards the Tenth Form.","Enlightenment!","If anyone saw this, they would definitely be incredibly envious, jealous, and hateful.","Others may not even be able to get a chance of enlightenment in their lifetime, but what about Ling Han?","Being able to gain enlightenment while taking a stroll, what could be more infuriating than that?","One day, two days, three days. Ling Han sat as still as a rock, and the nine-coloured light exuded by the ninth True Self In his mind was also becoming dimmer and dimmer. This naturally was not a bad thing, but rather a great thing. It meant that he was rapidly advancing towards the tenth form.","Enlightenment was the most awesome. It was like heaven and earth had given you a cheat code. It wouldn’t be strange for someone to even advance three minor levels of cultivation level.","However, Ling Han had truly experienced enlightenment too many times, so it wasn’t as exaggerated as this. However, as long as he could quickly cultivate to the tenth form, he would have profited greatly.","“Yi, isn’t that Ling Han?” On the fourth day, two people passed by. They were both enchanting young men, and one of them holding a leash attached to a fierce beast in hand. That was a blood-coloured fierce tiger, its wild nature still present, its eyes shining fiercely.","These were two Imperial Sons of the Silver Generation. One was Xu Youque of the White Feather Imperial Clan, and the other was the Kong Wuyang of the Peacock Imperial Clan. It was him who was had the leash on that fierce beast, the great tiger.","“This guy is actually still in the mood to sit idly by the lake?” Xu Youque appeared slightly surprised.","What time was it now?","Even the Golden Generation cultivated diligently, trying to catch up to the likes of Buddha Doga and the others. However, what about Ling Han?","‘Have you given up on becoming Emperor?’","“No, can you sense the power of heaven and earth?” Kong Wuyang was startled, then asked Xu Youque solemnly.","“The energy of heaven and earth is flowing towards him, and the Regulations have also been captured.” After Xu Youque sensed for a moment, he immediately looked surprised, “Hiss, this speed is too astonishing. Could it be that he has broken through?”","“Who do you think would break through in public?” Kong Wuyang countered.","Xu Youque instantly came to a realization. “He experienced enlightenment.”","Both of them looked extremely jealous. Enlightenment! This was a once in a lifetime opportunity for every cultivator.","Even if they were Silver Generation elites, and had indeed experienced enlightenment before, they had only experienced enlightenment once or twice in total.","Thus, they naturally knew just how beneficial enlightenment could be.","—The bottleneck in cultivating was nonexistent in the face of enlightenment.","“We can’t let this brat succeed!” Kong Wuyang suddenly said.","Xu Youque frowned, and said, “This is the Academy. If we publicly harass him, it will be very difficult for us to escape cleanly.”","This was mainly because Ling Han had the support of a Saint who wielded an Imperial Weapon. In fact, there was even a Pseudo-Emperor behind him, so they didn’t dare to provoke Ling Han.","“Hehe, I came out to walk around with the cat, and accidentally caused the cat to alert him. You can’t blame me for that, right?” Kong Wuyang smiled, “After all, who asked him not to be in his own room?”","“Wonderful!” Xu Youque instantly clapped his hands.","Kong Youyang undid the chains on the Blood Tiger, allowing it to move freely.","This was a ferocious beast. The moment it regained its freedom, it immediately growled at Xu Youque and Kong Wuyang, as if it wanted to attack them. However, Kong Wuyang’s eyes only sharpened, and this ferocious beast was so frightened that it fled with its tail between its legs.","—It was only a True Self Tier cultivator, so how could it possibly be a match for a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator?","Vicious beasts may not have developed intelligence, but it did not mean that they were as stupid as pigs. Avoiding elites was the instinct of living beings.","However, this fierce beast had only taken two steps when it spotted Ling Han, and instantly, its viciousness increased again.","It snuck forwards, slowly advancing towards Ling Han. Only when it was extremely close, did it suddenly launch an attack. With a xiu, it darted out, opened its eerie bloody mouth, and bit out at Ling Han’s neck."]},{"number":4327,"title":"Chapter 4327: Going too far","paragraphs":["Chapter 4327: Going too far","Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing this scene, both Kong Wuyang and Xu Youque smirked coldly.","If the blood tiger succeeded, then even if Ling Han didn’t die, he would be crippled. If it didn’t, then Ling Han’s enlightenment would definitely be interrupted. Whichever the result was, they would be happy to see it.","Moreover, this was indeed somewhat related to them. However, they had been walking a cat, so it was impossible for them to keep a constant eye on the cat, right?","Moreover, if you wanted to cultivate, you should have stayed inside your room. Who could you blame for running outside to cultivate? Moreover, you are also a True Self Tier, and being wounded by a True Self Tier fierce beast, that is also because you yourself are not strong enough, right?","No matter how one looked at it, more of the responsibility laid wiht Ling Han. As for them? Hehe, they had only made a small mistake.","Chila, the blood tiger bit down solidly.","It was done!","Kong Wuyang and Xu Que were both overjoyed. They had not thought that such a difficult person like Ling Han would actually die in the mouth of a wild beast.","It was too easy, practically as easy as blowing off dust.","Yi?","However, they were soon stunned, because Ling Han was still sitting there completely unscathed. The scene of his neck being bitten off did not appear.","F***, what kind of neck do you have?","“Is it Divine Metal?”","Even if it was Divine Metal, with the sharp fangs of fierce beasts, it would still be able to cause considerable damage to Divine Metals of the same level. Otherwise, with fierce beasts being unable to use celestial techniques, how could they possibly pose a great threat to cultivators?","The blood tiger was also taken aback. With its limited intelligence, it felt that this was extremely strange.","It refused to give up. Crackle! It bit down again.","It was still useless. On the contrary, the impact caused its teeth to hurt.","What was going on?","Right at this moment, it felt the prey it was biting move. It stood up, and a terrifying aura instantly surged out, making it instinctively feel fear.","That was a kind of... fear towards a supreme great beast.","“Wu!” The blood tiger hurriedly loosened its jaws, and retreated repeatedly, its tail clamped between its legs.","“How disappointing, it didn’t bite him to death!” Xu Youque said harshly.","“He’s the number one elite of the True Self Tier, after all. If he were so easily bitten to death, he wouldn’t deserve the name of number one,” Kong Wuyang said calmly. “However, his enlightenment has also been interrupted. We’ve reached our goal.”","“True,” Xu Youque said with a nod. A smile tugged at the corners of his lips.","But why didn’t they think about why Ling Han hadn’t stood up previously?","That was because he had already completed his appreciation. In his mind, the ninth true self was also like a mortal body, not showing any brilliance, and looking very ordinary.","“Come, let’s go provoke him,” Kong Wuyang said with a smile.","“All right.” Xu Youque’s interest was instantly piqued.","The two of them walked side by side, heading towards Ling Han.","“Aiyo, I’m really sorry,” Kong Wuyang said. “I was walking around with the cat. I just let it walk around on its own. I didn’t expect its wild nature to be so hard to tame, and it actually disturbed Junior Brother Ling. Oh, right, why is Junior Brother Ling cultivating here?”","“You weren’t affected, were you?” Xu Youque asked pretentiously.","Ling Han glanced at the two of them, and said calmly, “If I was affected, how do you plan on compensating?”","“Compensation?” Kong Wuyang laughed loudly, “I was only slightly negligent, yet you’re already putting on airs? Hehe, why aren’t you cultivating in your room? Why have you come here? And you still want compensation? What a huge joke!”","“No compensation?” Ling Han also smiled.","Kong Wuyang issued a command through his divine sense, commanding the blood tiger to continue attacking Ling Han. Under his training, though this ferocious beast’s wild nature was still hard to calm, it was still very willing to obey the command to attack.","Even if it knew that Ling Han was powerful, the blood tiger was even more aware of its master’s might. This was a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite that had subdued it completely.","Thus, after receiving the command, the blood tiger practically did not hesitate at all. With a leap, it bit out at Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han didn’t even turn his head. With a single punch, this blood tiger was forcefully killed.","“You actually dared to beat my beast pet to death!” Kong Wuyang immediately said coldly, “I spent a lot of effort to buy this, so how are you going to compensate me?”","‘Hehe, I’m going to make you suffer a great loss, and you would still have to humbly offer your apologies!’","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “You allow wild beasts to injure others, and still want me to compensate you?”","“Firstly, don’t spout nonsense. Secondly, so what if I bully you?” Kong Wuyang’s expression was filled with pride, “Could it be that you want to use force against me?”","He was a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite!","Spirit Transformation Tier, as well as aptitude as one of the Silver Generation, allowed his battle prowess to sweep aside ordinary Spirit Transformation Tiers. His battle prowess could easily defeat Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change or even Third Change, so wouldn’t it be easy to deal with a True Self Tier?","He was deliberately trying to anger Ling Han, so that Ling Han would take the initiative to attack him. Then, even if he severely injured Ling Han, no one would be able to say anything.","In the martial arts world, the hierarchy of status was maintained. If a lower cultivation level cultivator actively attacked a higher cultivation level cultivator, then it would already be considered merciful if they weren’t killed.","“Ling Han, don’t be rash. You are nothing but a True Self Tier.” Xu Youque deliberately tried to mediate, but every word was stoking the flames of anger. “Moreover, it was indeed you who had beaten Brother Kong’s beast pet to death. Logically speaking, you should apologize to Brother Kong.”","Ling Han smiled and said, “You two think I’m at the True Self Tier, so you can humiliate me as you please, right?”","“So what if I am? Come bite me?” Kong Wuyang said proudly. His appearance was really a little despicable.","“All right, I’ll oblige you!” Ling Han leaped out, and charged towards Kong Wuyang.","Kong Wuyang was not shocked, but rather overjoyed. Haha, you were the one who took the initiative to attack. He had already recorded this. At that time, he would only have to erase the previous content, and directly broadcast the scene of Ling Han taking the initiative to attack. There was irrefutable evidence. Who would be able to speak up for Ling Han?","You definitely have to swallow this loss in silence!","“How dare you!” he shouted loudly, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Of course, he still didn’t dare to kill Ling Han. He had only used one percent of his power in this palm strike, but for a Spirit Transformation Tier, one percent of his power was enough to severely wound the Eighth Form of the True Self Tier.","Ling Han was unafraid, and greeted the incoming attack with a punch.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and the scene of Kong Wuyang and Xu Youque’s eyes popping out in shock appeared.","Ling Han blocked it!","Not only had he blocked it, but he had even forced Kong Wuyang to retreat continuously.","W-what was going on?","Kong Wuyang and Xu Youque were both numb with shock.","You are only a True Self Tier!","Hold on, did this guy break through at some time?","The two of them observed closely, sensing the aura that Ling Han was exuding.","True Self Tier, definitely the True Self Tier.","Then... this was terrifying.","A True Self Tier cultivator was actually capable of competing with a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator in power, and had even won?","What kind of monster was this!","Ling Han didn’t give the two of them any time to ponder. He immediately charged over again.","Boom!","Kong Wuyang hurriedly counterattacked. This time, he naturally went all out; he did not want to be forced back again. Right now, his chest was still slightly burning.","In this exchange of blows, both of them took a few steps back, and it was actually a tie.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Kong Wuyang and Xu Youque both wanted to curse the heavens. Was this real?","A measly True Self Tier cultivator could actually fight a SpiritTransformation Tier cultivator head-on. Moreover, it was an Imperial Son, and even a Silver Generation cultivator at that!"]},{"number":4328,"title":"Chapter 4328: Slapped instead","paragraphs":["Chapter 4328: Slapped instead","Editor: Henyee Translations","This should be a completely impossible feat.","However, the truth was right in front of their eyes, so how could they deny it?","Monster, he was definitely a monster.","Kong Wuyang was in a very passive position. He was presently in an incredibly stunned state, and being bombarded madly by Ling Han, he could only parry.","However, his strength was ultimately not inferior to Ling Han. Very soon, he had adjusted his condition, and immediately turned the situation around.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them continued to exchange blows. Energy fluctuations spread into the distance.","Kong Wuyang couldn’t help but feel anxious. If the scene of him and Ling Han fighting forcefully was seen by others, what face would he have left?","Would he become the first Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator in history to tie with a True Self Tier?","If he were to be recorded in the history books in this manner, his name would stink for all eternity.","He roared loudly, and his spiritual body walked out of his body. Both himself and his spiritual body used the Imperial Technique at the same time, which blasted madly towards Ling Han.","The Imperial Technique was indeed awesome. Furthermore, the higher the cultivation level, the greater the gap between the Imperial Technique and the Saint Technique, and the ordinary celestial technique. This had increased his battle prowess by a whole twelve Heavens!","Furthermore, this was the simultaneous upgrade of oneself and one’s spiritual body, so how terrifying was it?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be reserved either. He similarly used the Imperial Technique. The heavenly saber was fierce, and his battle prowess was similarly shocking.","However, he wasn’t a Spirit Transformation Tier elite, after all, so it was impossible for him to manifest a spiritual body. Thus, he was naturally at a disadvantage.","It was a one-on-two battle, and both “enemies” possessed strength that was not inferior to his own, so Ling Han appeared to be slightly strained. However, he had already taken the preliminary step of creating his own path, and every casual move he made was an amazing move, forcibly holding up the situation.","It was hard to determine the victor!","Xu Youque could only gape in shock upon seeing this. There was actually such a powerful True Self Tier in this world?","Had he seen wrongly?","Was he dreaming?","Heavens!","Sensing the great commotion here, people soon ran over to investigate the situation. When they discovered that a battle had broken out, they naturally did not mind watching the excitement.","But when they saw clearly that Kong Wuyang’s opponent was Ling Han, everyone felt as if their heads were about to explode.","“That, is that really Ling Han?”","“I didn’t see wrongly, right?”","“Hiss!”","“...Ling Han is actually battling with a Spirit Transformation Tier!”","Kong Wuyang was a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator. This news had already spread throughout the entire academy. Moreover, even if one hadn’t received the news, he could easily confirm this fact just by looking at the spiritual body that he had summoned.","“... Ling Han should have also advanced into Spirit Transformation Tier, right?”","“That’s right. He has long since reached the Seventh Form. Furthermore, he has cultivated a mortal body, so it is impossible for him to break through to the Eighth Form. Thus, it would be very normal for him to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier.”","Everyone thought the opposite way around. It should be Ling Han who was more low-key, and did not make any big boasts about breaking through to Spirit Transformation Tier. After all, there were really quite a number of people who had broken through to the Spirit Transformation Tier in this period of time in the Academy.","“That’s not right!” Immediately, someone said in a trembling voice, “You guys sense again. Is the aura that Ling Han is exuding really Spirit Transformation Tier?”","Everyone sensed it, and then, all of them revealed expressions of extreme shock.","The True Self Tier!","‘F*ck! He’s actually at the True Self Tier!’","How was this possible?","Everyone inhaled sharply. They were all deeply stunned, and could not say a single word.","So what if it was the Golden Generation?","Had they ever reached such heights when they were in the True Self Tier? Capable of standing against a Spirit Transformation Tier?","Was this guy really only capable of tailing the Golden Generation? Or had he already reached the level of being one of the most outstanding members of the Golden Generation? In fact, he had even surpassed them?","Now, the only feeling that everyone had left was shock.","Kong Wuyang became more and more anxious. There were too many people watching. If he was still so sloppy, and was still unable to deal with Ling Han after so long, how would he be able to face others in the future?","However, he had already used the Imperial Technique, so how was he supposed to further increase his battle prowess?","Burning Imperial Blood?","What a joke. The Imperial Blood was the trump card of trump cards, so how could it be used casually? Furthermore, even if he won with the Imperial Blood, how could he convince the masses?","However, without using the Imperial Blood, Kong Wuyang would really be unable to suppress Ling Han.","Could it be that it was going to end in a draw?","Ling Han humphed, and his attacks became incredibly powerful. Every move he made looked like he wanted to drag Kong Wuyang down with him.","Kong Wuyang naturally didn’t want to die with Ling Han, so he could only choose to retreat. This caused him to instantly fall into a disadvantage.","Everyone was even more stunned, shaking their heads and sighing.","Ling Han was really too strong. This True Self Tier was going to defy the heavens.","The more Kong Wuyang fought, the more displeased he felt. He could not accept such a result.","He was a dignified Spirit Transformation Tier and Silver Generation elite; he definitely couldn’t lose!","Fine, do you think I don’t dare to fight you head-on?","Kong Wuyang no longer dodged. Instead, he looked like he was going to take Ling Han head-on.","Scare me? Humph, could it be that you would not be afraid of both sides being wounded?","Boom!","However, he had guessed wrongly. Faced with an attack that looked like he was going to drag Ling Han down with him, Ling Han did not dodge at all, and directly charged towards him.","‘F*ck!’","At this moment, Kong Wuyang was dumbfounded. At least a few thousand curse words raced through his mind.","‘Why do you f*cking want to drag me down with you?’","If I had known this earlier, I would rather be humiliated than do this!","However, it was already too late for regrets now. Both of their attacks had landed on each other.","Kong Wuyang was instantly sent flying. All the bones in his body were broken, and he opened his mouth, spitting out blood.","After sustaining such a heavy injury, the spiritual body immediately dissipated.","Thankfully, he had not died. Furthermore, he did not seem to have suffered any fatal or crippling injuries. He only had to rest for a few months, and he would be able to recover completely.","He relaxed slightly, but when he looked at Ling Han again, he instantly couldn’t help but throw up blood madly.","He looked as if nothing had happened. In other words, he was completely unscathed.","You should be called Ling Wuyang, right1?","He tragically discovered that Ling Han was perfectly fine. To say nothing of being severely injured and throwing up blood, not even a single hair of his was missing.","No wonder this guy kept looking like he was going to fight him to the death. It wasn’t that the other party wanted to scare him with this kind of attitude, but rather that this guy’s defense was practically freakish.","He felt so wronged!","To actually fight a guy with freakish defense to the death, wasn’t that just courting death?","“Pu!” He spat out blood continuously, feeling extremely depressed.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He had cultivated Body Art, so how strong was his physique? Moreover, he could automatically disperse all attacks within six Heavens, and it was enough as long as he retained a little power to form a shield.","Wasn’t it a joke to fight him to the death?","F***!","Ling Han actually won?","The fact that a True Self Tier cultivator could fight a Spirit Transformation Tier head-on, and a Silver Generation Imperial Son at that, was already enough to make one’s scalp go numb, all right? But Ling Han actually won, and this was even more inconceivable.","Ling Han looked at Xu Youque and said, “Do you also want to seek justice from me?”","Xu Youque’s strength was no weaker than Kong Wuyang’s, but after seeing Ling Han’s strength and freakishness, what confidence did he still have?","Without saying a word, he turned around and left.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. This was the academy, after all, and it was established by the Imperial Clans. No matter what, he had to restrain himself.","He smiled, turned and left as well. The enlightenment this time directly allowed him to reach the consummate level of the True Self Tier, and he could now attempt to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4329,"title":"Chapter 4329: Breaking through to Spirit Transformation Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4329: Breaking through to Spirit Transformation Tier","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Ancestral King Academy was filled with tumultuous waves.","Those who had not witnessed it with their own eyes could not believe that this True Self Tier cultivator could actually battle a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator, and even win at that. Wasn’t that the biggest joke in the world?","However, Imperial Son after Imperial Son expressed that it was true, and added with the fact that there were also recorded images as proof, others had no choice but to believe that there really was a freakish heaven-defying freak in this world.","This time, the members of the Golden Generation were all rendered speechless.","Were they this powerful in the past?","Since they were not so powerful, what else could they say?","Now, there were undercurrents surging, and the threat that Ling Han posed was too great. He was even more freakish than the Golden Generation. If his cultivation level really increased, then in the competition on the Imperial Path, who else would be a match for him?","Even if Ling Han didn’t become Emperor in the end, no one at the same cultivation level could rival him. Who would the heaven and earth allow to become Emperor then?","Get rid of him?","In the past, this would have still been possible. Although the combination of the Nine Mountains Saint and the Imperial Weapon were terrifying, faced with the threat of a future Great Emperor, a great many Imperial Clan Clans would still steel their hearts and kill Ling Han while he was still maturing.","But now?","Buddha Doga was a Pseudo-Emperor. If he was really angered, it was probable that even an Imperial Clan would be destroyed.","This was also why Ling Han dared to unleash his full strength. He was aware that his relations with Buddha Doga was not very close. However, others didn’t know this, and they naturally couldn’t verify this with Buddha Doga.","Ling Han couldn’t care less. He closed his doors, and began to concentrate on breaking through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","In his mind, the nine True Selves were all like mortal bodies, but occasionally, a terrifying aura would circulate, as if it could suppress the heavens.","Ling Han immersed himself in the great dao.","This took two months’ time.","He finally obtained enough comprehension, and began to break through to Spiritual Transformation Tier.","The Spiritual Transformation Tier meant being able to transform the True Self, one after another, into a spiritual body in one’s mind. How many True Selves do you have? In the end, that was how many changes you would be able to reach.","Thus, these two cultivation levels were closely related.","Ling Han began to stimulate the first True Self to transform into a spiritual body. He naturally chose the True Self of Destruction. This was the most powerful True Self with Destruction Energy as its core.","Even though it was only a change in form, taking this step was extremely difficult.","Because the change in form was only superficial, what truly caused a qualitative change was the soul, and the grasp of the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","Without being able to take this crucial step in the understanding of great dao, there was no way he could succeed.","Ling Han’s accumulation over the past two months was both his appreciation of the Dao of Heaven and Earth, as well as the final tempering of his cultivation level. Since he had taken this step, it meant that he was already confident.","Moreover, for him, the difficulty of breaking through to the ninth and tenth form was even higher than breaking through to the Spirit Transformation Tier. Thus, now that he had overcome both of the great difficulties, how difficult would it be to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier?","The True Self of Destruction was only a virtual body. Ling Han had experimented with it before, and after unleashing it, it would not have the effect of wounding the enemy at all. However, it would be different if it was a spiritual body. This would unleash a terrifying battle prowess that was not inferior to the original.","‘Come!’","He activated the Power of Dimension in his body, stimulating the transformation of the True Self of Destruction. This was the only way, because with his current cultivation level, he was still not qualified to come into contact with such a profound level of energy.","However, the Power of Dimension was like a super nutritious tonic to the True Self of Destruction. In any case, Ling Han’s comprehension was already enough, so the True Self began to undergo a qualitative change.","Multiple mysterious seals appeared on the True Self of Destruction. With the boost from the Regulations of heaven and earth, it transformed from virtual to solid, changing rapidly.","Correspondingly, Ling Han’s physique was also rumbling loudly. This was because the upper limit of his physique was also further lifted. The energy of heaven and earth surged over, increasing his power.","“Wu!” Ling Han released a muffled groan. His power had increased too quickly, causing his body to be slightly unable to bear it. Pa, pa, pa! His skin immediately split apart, and blood gushed out, causing him to instantly turn into a figure of blood.","Not only that, but the bones in his body were also cracking. They were actually grinding themselves, as if they were about to turn into dust.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel shocked. If this continued, he wouldn’t even have broken through, and his whole person would be finished before then.","Stop?","How could that be allowed!","Ling Han immediately ruled out this option. He only hesitated slightly, and then continued this process.","He had broken through to Ten Forms, so he was definitely different from the rest.","Ling Han’s eyes flashed with madness. On the path of pursuing the strongest, he was definitely a maniac.","There was no room for retreat on this path.","Again!","Pa, pa, pa! His skin exploded, and his bones shattered. Ling Han’s whole person collapsed. In fact, cracks even appeared on his skull, which was densely covered with small cracks like a spider’s web.","However, his life essence was actually still as vigorous as fire, his vitality soaring sky-high.","Ling Han gritted his teeth and continued.","Pa, all the bones in his body were shattered, and it was as if his whole person had turned into blood clay. Only his mind was unbroken, and was undergoing that incomparably crucial evolution.","Ling Han guarded this precious territory, and the True Self of Destruction gradually took solid form.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye, and the True Self of Destruction finally turned completely into a spiritual body.","Spiritual Transformation Tier!","Instantly, an ancient battle drum sounded in the heaven and earth. Countless flowers fluttered, and fragrance wafted for millions and millions of miles.","Ling Han’s body quickly began to reforge. This was a new fetus that had evolved from an old body, and was rapidly growing. In just a few hours, it was already no different from before.","However, Ling Han could feel that this new body had a qualitative change, and was even more energetic than the old body.","When he completed the growth of his new body, the phenomenon of heaven and earth also rapidly disappeared, and in its place, there were thunderclaps and dark clouds.","Kuang!","Ling Han only felt a tremor in his mind, and a small golden figure appeared. It held a crystalline sword in hand, and charged towards the Spiritual Body of Destruction in his mind.","It was an internal demon.","The Spiritual Body of Destruction immediately charged forwards. It was only a single punch, and peng, the tiny golden figure was annihilated.","Er... that was it?","Even Ling Han faltered for a moment. ‘You can be considered an internal demon for better or worse, yet you’re actually dealt with with with a single punch?’","However, this was indeed the case. The dark clouds in the sky had already dispersed, and no new internal demon had appeared.","Fine then.","With a thought from Ling Han, the Spiritual Body of Destruction walked out of his body. It was in human form, but its features and body were a little blurry, and could not be seen clearly at all.","It couldn’t be helped. He was only at the early stage of the Spiritual Transformation Tier, so he naturally hadn’t cultivated his first spiritual body to the extreme yet. Otherwise, this spiritual body would look exactly like him.","Of course, there was no rule stating that the spiritual body had to be completely the same as the original, and could also be molded into the form of a weapon.","In short, the spiritual body was used to assist in battle and cultivation. It was fine as long as it could achieve this effect.","“How strong am I now?”","Ling Han was extremely curious. He activated the Star Steps and instantly exited the Ancestral King Academy. He appeared in a primitive forest.","“I’ll find a wild beast to spar with.”","He strolled forward, and not long after, a giant wolf that was as long as three hundred meters walked out.","=True Self Tier.","Ling Han shook his head. How could a True Self Tier be enough for him to test his abilities now?","He only glared at it, and the giant wolf was instantly scared out of its wits. It directly sprawled out on the ground, trembling as it waited for death.","—"]},{"number":4330,"title":"Chapter 4330: Astonishing battle prowess","paragraphs":["Chapter 4330: Astonishing battle prowess","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han didn’t make a move. He had only come to test his strength, and there was no need for him to kill for no reason.","He continued to walk, searching for Spiritual Transformation Tier beasts.","However, there were really too few vicious beasts of this level. Thankfully, Ling Han was a formations grandmaster. Using the ley lines to explore, he soon found a vicious beast that met the criteria. With a flash, he had already arrived in a valley.","He released a battle cry, and instantly, a golden-haired ape leaped out. It was only thirty meters tall, but the aura it exuded was more than a hundred times stronger than the giant wolf from before.","The golden ape was filled with ferocity. Two fangs protruded from its mouth, and killing intent exuded from its eyes. However, it did not attack at the first instant, but merely stared at Ling Han.","Ferocious beasts were bloodthirsty and violent, but they had an instinctive fear of powerful beings.","In the eyes of this golden ape, Ling Han was this kind of elite.","“Come!” Ling Han smiled, and took the initiative to charge out.","In the face of provocation, the wild beast naturally would not cower either. The golden ape immediately roared, and clapped its arms on its chest. Then, it charged towards Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The man and ape battled fiercely, and Ling Han unleashed his full power.","This ferocious beast was very powerful, and in terms of power, it was even superior to Ling Han. Furthermore, the golden ape’s claws were incredibly sharp, not inferior to a Celestial Tool of the same level. It also posed a certain amount of threat to Ling Han, tearing his clothes.","However, that was all there was to it. Ling Han’s skin was frighteningly tough, and such sharp massive claws only caused some white claw marks to appear on his body. It was completely unable to break through his defenses.","“After growing a new body, my body has undergone a qualitative change. Not only has my vitality increased greatly, my defense has also increased greatly.” Ling Han nodded internally. Combined with the fact that he could disperse attacks within six Heavens, he was practically a freak.","“My power is more or less equivalent to 15 Heavens of Spirit Transformation Tier!”","Even Ling Han was gritting his teeth. Every time a normal Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator raised their cultivation level by a minor level, they would probably be able to increase their power by three Heavens. Then, even if it was a Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change cultivator, they would only be able to possess 15 Heavens of power.","This was completely related to the quality of the True Selfves that had been formed in the past, and not the number of True Selves.","Thus, this was also why everyone thought that Ling Han was done for when they found out that the True Self that he had formed was a “mortal body”.","That’s right. How much power could a spiritual body formed from a mortal body have?","An advance of two Heavens? Or one Heaven?","“Let’s try the spiritual body again.” With a thought from Ling Han, the spiritual body immediately manifested, and he threw a punch at the golden ape.","Vicious beasts didn’t need to cultivate; they only needed to eat and eat, and they would naturally be able to grow to the heights that they should have. Thus, although vicious beasts would also be divided into the likes of Spiritual Transformation Tier and True Self Tier, the two systems were completely different.","—Ferocious beasts did not have a spiritual body!","The spiritual body and main body joined forces, and the pressure on the golden ape instantly increased.","This was not a good test. Ling Han immediately withdrew from the battle, and had the spiritual body fight the golden ape one-on-one.","Peng!","The spiritual body threw a punch, clashing with the golden ape. The spiritual body instantly retreated rapidly, but though the golden ape had the advantage in power, it was still crying out in pain.","As it turned out, its claws were badly mangled.","It should be known that the spiritual body was manifested from the True Self of Destruction, and contained Destructive Energy, so just how terrifying was its destructive power?","No matter how stubborn one was, he shouldn’t clash head-on with Destructive Energy.","His spiritual body charged forward aggressively.","Whether it was himself or his spiritual body, they were both controlled by Ling Han with a single thought. It was as if he had an additional pair of arms and legs, and he could use them extremely smoothly.","Fight, fight, fight.","The more the golden ape fought, the more it was at a disadvantage. In terms of power, it was completely at an advantage, but against the Destructive Energy, it was only seeking its own suffering.","Moreover, vicious beasts didn’t know any celestial technique, and were mostly focused on close-quarter combat. Only in this way could they display their advantage in power. The problem was, this just happened to be Ling Han’s strongest aspect.","Going head-on against Destructive Energy? Hehe.","After exchanging a few more blows, the golden ape screamed in agony before turning around to flee.","Its survival instincts took the upper hand. It didn’t want to die.","Ling Han chuckled, but did not make a move.","There was no reason, so he did not want to commit murder.","Using the Star Steps, he returned to the Ancestral King Academy.","After breaking through to the next major tier, Ling Han had to report this to the academy. This concerned what level he would be assigned to in the next monthly exam. Otherwise, if a Spirit Transformation Tier went to fight with a True Self Tier, wouldn’t that be torturing noobs?","After making his report, he also told the empress and the others the good news, causing everyone to be overjoyed, and express that they wanted to have a good celebration.","And when the news that Ling Han had broken through to Spiritual Transformation Tier spread throughout the entire academy, it also caused those Silver Generation elites who had long since broken through to Spiritual Transformation Tier, and even those Golden Generation elites, to smirk coldly.","‘You’ve finally come!’","No matter how freakish you were, you had just broken through to Spiritual Transformation Tier, after all, so how strong could your battle prowess be?","Seizing the chance, they would kill this guy.","Of course, it had to be done openly and publicly, so that neither the Nine Mountains Saint nor Buddha Doga could fly into a rage because of this.","“Little Han, come, Grandpa Dog offers you a toast.” The large black dog held the wine cup in his paws.","“Grandpa Dragon also gives you a toast.” The little azure dragon also joined in on the excitement.","“All right.” Ling Han raised his cup in return.","Meanwhile, the women didn’t join in on the excitement. They talked about feminine topics, especially Chi Menghan, who had just joined. She was bombarded with questions from the empress and Hu Niu, especially some sensitive questions, causing her face to flush bright red.","“However, you were invincible in the True Self Tier, and now that you’ve advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier, there should be a lot of people stronger than you. You have to be careful.” It was rare for the large black dog to be serious.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “I know.”","“Looks like you’ll have to keep a low profile for a while,” the little azure dragon said with a smile. “That’s just right. Once you leave, the first place of the True Self Tier will fall to Grandpa Dragon.”","“There’s still Ding Shu. You have to wait for a while longer,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Pei, this guy has long since reached the peak stage of the ninth form. Why hasn’t he broken through yet?” The little azure dragon was extremely displeased. With the help of the Source Dao Stone, he had already cultivated to the eighth form. Once Ding Shu advanced, there would definitely be no one in the True Self Tier that could be a match for him.","Ling Han naturally knew that Ding Shu was putting up a stubborn resistance. To avoid acknowledging him as the boss, he was fixated on the Tenth Form.","However, this really wasn’t a matter of how long he would continue to fixate on it. This guy had better not be stubborn, and stay in the True Self Tier for the rest of his life, right?","Ling Han smiled. It was not to that extent. Ding Shu had once been the overlord of the Genesis World, so he should know how to choose.","Moreover, the Ancestral Kings from ancient times had only cultivated to the ninth form, at most, and that was enough to attain dao.","Time flew by, and the next monthly assessment had already arrived.","The empress and Hu Niu were already qualified to charge into the top three. This attracted the attention of a great many people. After all, the empress was extraordinarily beautiful, and her natural talent in cultivation was also so astonishing, which naturally made them dazzling.","However, because of Ling Han, no one dared to harrass them.","In the True Self Tier battles, Ding Shu was still ranked first. Previously, Ling Han was absent, so he naturally took first place. The little azure dragon was second, and the large black dog was fifth.","This day passed, and it was now the turn for the Spirit Transformation Tiers. The entire academy was also waiting to see how Ling Han would perform."]},{"number":4331,"title":"Chapter 4331: Everyone’s Anticipation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4331: Everyone’s Anticipation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Under the anticipation of countless people, the monthly assessment for Spirit Transformation Tier began.","Because Ling Han didn’t have a rank for Spirit Transformation Tier, he naturally had to start from the knockout battles.","Following the breakthrough of a large number of True Self Tier cultivators, there were many Spirit Transformation Tier cultivators. There were some from the Golden Generation that had not broken through for a long time, as well as outstanding elites of the Silver Generation. It was said that they had already cultivated to the Sixth Change or even the Seventh Change.","There were also some powerful Dao Childs from the Holy Lands. They were the same batch as the Golden Generation, or even from an earlier batch. Some were Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change, and some were Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change. They too could not be underestimated.","Of course, after advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier, while cultivation level was important, the quality of the spiritual body was also important, directly affecting the strength of battle prowess.","Thus, it was not impossible that a Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change would lose to a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change. Of course, for a Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change to lose to a Spirit Transformation Tier First Change, the possibility of this was practically non-existent.","There were too many people, and Ling Han had to fight four knockout battles before he could enter into the ranking battles.","In the first round, his luck was not too bad. He drew an opponent that was a Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change. Furthermore, it was not an Imperial Son, but rather a Dao Child from a Holy Land.","This Dao Child was only around two hundred years old. In the outside world, he really couldn’t be any more outstanding. A two-hundred-year-old Spirit Transformation Tier elite was terrifyingly young.","However, in the case of the Ancestral King Academy, this advancement was only so-so. There were a lot of hundred-year-old Spirit Transformation Tiers.","This Dao Child’s name was Wu Qinghuai. He was very handsome, and had a lanky figure. There were two spheres formed from Regulations on his body. One was fire, and the other was ice, and they endlessly revolved around his body.","“Imperial Son Xuan has asked me to pass on a message to you. If you want to live, it would be best for you to cripple your own cultivation level and apologize to him,” he said through divine sense the moment he arrived.","Lin Xuan?","Ling Han chuckled and said, “Then tell him that before long, I’ll chop off his head and use it as a ball!”","Demanding him to cripple his own cultivation level; was this any way to resolve the problem peacefully?","Since you are using your superior strength as a bullying tactic, then don’t blame me for being ruthless.","“Ling Han, how are you worthy of opposing Imperial Son Xuan?” Wu Qinghuai asked coldly, “Lord Xuan is loved by the heavens, and has been blessed by a strange phenomenon at his birth. Now, he is only a hundred years old, yet has already cultivated to the consummate level of the Minor Advanced Tier!”","“If it was not for the fact that Lord Xuan still wishes to break the supreme limit, he would have long since become a Venerate Tier elite!”","“Compared to him, you are still very far off!”","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to speak any more nonsense. He crooked a finger at Wu Qinghuai, “Cut the crap. I am going to beat you up now!”","“Haha, you are really arrogant!” Wu Qinghuai declared coldly. ‘Though you are indeed very freakish, I am a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator at the peak stage of Second Change, which is practically two minor levels higher than you.’ No matter how he thought about it, there was no reason for him to lose.","“Humph!” With a flash, two spiritual bodies walked out.","He had cultivated the Second Change to the end, so the two spiritual bodies were completely identical to him.","If there had to be any difference, it would be that both of his spiritual bodies were flickering with red and white light, though they were very faint.","“Die!”","The three Wu Qinghuai charged towards Ling Han at the same time. In this battle, Spirit Tools were prohibited. Thus, their six hands formed into fists, palms and claws respectively, striking out different celestial techniques. Regulations boomed, their might terrifying.","Ling Han wanted to test out his opponent’s strength, so he didn’t use his spiritual body. Instead, he simply brandished his fists in response.","Peng!","With this strike, though Ling Han’s figure trembled, the three Wu Qinghuai were all sent backwards.","What!","Seeing this scene, everyone couldn’t help but inhale sharply.","Everyone was very clear about Wu Qinghuai’s abilities.","—He had cultivated to Sixth Form when he was in the True Self Tier, and furthermore, it was a Two Colour True Self.","Thus, after advancing into the Spirit Transformation Tier, every spiritual body could provide him with six Heavens of power. Two complete spiritual bodies would be the power of twelve Heavens, and with the combined power of three “people”, the power would naturally be even greater.","But even so, Ling Han actually had the upper hand in terms of power.","Hiss, what kind of freak was this?","Wu Qinghuai had suffered a loss in a single strike, but did not lose his fighting spirit because of this. Instead, he immediately made a comeback, and directly used the Saint Technique His three bodies channelled three different Saint Techniques respectively, complementing each other, causing his battle prowess to increase even further.","With the boost from the Saint Technique, the battle prowess of each body had reached 21 Heavens. With the three of them working together, and added with the amplification of each other, their total battle prowess could reach twenty-three or even twenty-four Heavens!","Ling Han also channelled the Saint Technique, exchanging blows with Wu Qinghuai.","One strike after another, with his freakish physique, this was naturally no big deal, but Wu Qinghuai did not have the kind of ability that he did. Under such a head-on clash, he very soon could not hold on any longer, and his face was as pale as could be.","After a few more exchanges, he had no choice but to admit defeat. Otherwise, he would attain a great loss.","Ling Han smiled faintly before turning around to leave the arena.","This time, he did not show off, but everyone’s shock did not decrease in the slightest.","In a situation when the spiritual body’s quality was about the same, then every difference of a minor level would lead to an overwhelming advantage.","It was very simple to understand. The other side had an additional spiritual body.","Every spiritual body had battle prowess that was on par with oneself, so how crucial was it to have one more or one less?","However, Ling Han was one minor level below Wu Qinghuai, and he didn’t even use his spiritual body, but that was still enough to force Wu Qinghuai to have no option but to lower his head and admit defeat. This meant... just how high-level was his spiritual body?","Mortal body? Mortal your sister!","Everyone knew that they had definitely been deceived by Ling Han. This guy should have cultivated some kind of secret technique that could hide the quality of the True Self. Thus, while he looked like a mortal, in truth, he could possibly be a Seven-Colored True Self!","“With how freakish this guy is, he’s definitely no weaker than the Golden Generation. Thus, he’s at least a Seven Colours True Self!”","“No, the Golden Generation wouldn’t have been able to defeat a Spirit Transformation Tier while still in True Self Tier. At the very least, the Spirit Transformation Tier couldn’t be at the Imperial Son’s level! So, it’s extremely likely that this guy has reached the legendary ninth form, possessing the Eight Colours True Self!”","“Hiss!”","Everyone gritted their teeth. This was the ninth form; even among the Golden Generation, how many had reached this kind of height?","Was there? Was there one?","“Let’s just wait and see. We should be able to see his true strength soon.”","After the first round of elimination battles, very soon, the second round began.","This time, it was only natural that Ling Han’s opponent was stronger. In a knockout battle, it would definitely that the strong would win, and the weak would lose.","However, this still wasn’t the Imperial Son. It was still a Dao Child. His name was Liu Yue, a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change.","The moment they clashed, Liu Yue directly summoned all three spiritual bodies, surrounding Ling Han.","“Four Directions Celestial Killer Formation!”","Liu Yue gave a soft exclamation, and his four bodies moved at the same time, blasting towards Ling Han.","He was clearly a level stronger than Wu Qinghuai.","Liu Yue’s Spiritual Body should also be Two Colours, but he was a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change, and his base power was as high as 18 Heavens, which was above Ling Han’s. Added with the four bodies joining forces and forming a formation, his battle prowess was naturally further boosted.","Ling Han took this strike head-on, and his body instantly trembled. He was almost sent flying.","His fighting spirit rose, and with a battle cry, he used an Imperial Technique, Regulations channelled, and his battle prowess soared to thirty Heavens in a single stroke!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Although Liu Yue possessed four bodies, he was still suppressed by Ling Han.","W-what!","— New chapter is coming soon —"]},{"number":4332,"title":"Chapter 4332: Suppressed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4332: Suppressed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was once again shocked. They had already overestimated Ling Han, but only after fighting did they realize that they had still underestimated Ling Han.","“It’s clear now.”","“His power should be 15 Heavens.”","“With the use of the Imperial Technique, his battle prowess has soared to 30 Heavens.”","“Yi, isn’t the Imperial Technique only able to boost one’s battle prowess by 12 Heavens?”","“It is indeed very strange. On this guy, the Imperial Technique can actually burst out with the battle prowess of 15 Heavens!”","Meanwhile, those Venerate Tier elites frowned slightly. Their eyes were naturally sharp, and they had guessed the truth.","“This brat has already begun to walk his own path.”","“Thus, he was able to use the Imperial Technique to the extent that it surpasses ordinary people.”","“That’s because the Ancestral Kings have all walked their own paths, and only then could they be strong enough to suppress the heaven and earth!”","This caused all the Venerates to feel uneasy. Ling Han had such natural talent, and had even forged his own path. As long as he became a Saint, he would be the strongest competitor on the Imperial Path.","‘Members of the Golden Generation, perhaps your true opponent isn’t Buddha Doga, or the two in the sea of blood and Yin River. Instead, it’s this newcomer who hasn’t even advanced to the Minor Advanced Tier yet.’","Ling Han used the Imperial Technique, and instantly gained the upper hand. Under wave after wave of attacks, Liu Yue could only hold on stubbornly, and no longer had the ability to fight back.","In the end, Liu Yue could only bow his head in submission.","Two consecutive wins!","This was an inconceivable accomplishment. Even for the Silver Generation, when they had just entered the Spiritual Transformation Tier, they could only obediently withdraw their arrogance, becausea Spirit Transformation Tier First Change could at most burst out with battle prowess of over a dozen Heavens, so how could they possibly be a match for a veteran Spiritual Transformation Tier?","Even if their opponent was only Dao Child-level.","However, Ling Han had overturned all of this. He had even defeated a Dao Child that had undergone Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change, and what was most troubling?","He had not gone all out yet.","Up until now, Ling Han still hadn’t summoned his spiritual body. In other words, he had only used half of his strength.","This was too terrifying.","In the third round, Ling Han finally drew out an Imperial Son. Moreover, it was a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change.","The Thousand Spirit Imperial Clan’s Cheng Qing.","Ling Han had seen this Imperial Son in the True Dragon Abyss before. At that time, Cheng Qing was the strongest in the True Self Tier. Now, he had long since stepped into the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and furthermore, cultivated to the Third Change. Just how strong would his battle prowess be?","As an Imperial Son, his aura was extraordinary. There was a full moon shining behind him, exuding a golden brilliance.","This was a powerful opponent.","Ling Han took a deep breath, not daring to be careless in the slightest.","Cheng Qing was naturally very cautious as well. If he won, that was natural. What was there to be proud of if a Third Change had won against a First Change? But if he lost, then he, an Imperial Son, would become a laughing stock.","Thus, he could only win this battle, but could not lose.","Three spiritual bodies materialized from within his body. Their expressions were solemn, and there were six-colored rays of light around them.","This meant that when Cheng Qing had been in the True Self Tier, he had formed a Six-Coloured True Self.","“Come!”","A fierce battle could break out at any moment. The moment they exchanged blows, Ling Han discovered that his strength was inferior to his opponent’s. Cheng Qing had already cultivated the Third Change to the middle stage. Thus, his power reached as high as 20 Heavens.","With the boost of the Imperial Technique and the combined power of three spiritual bodies, Cheng Qing’s battle prowess was at least superior to Ling Han by three Heavens.","There was a publicly acknowledged standard in the cultivation world, and that was once there was a gap of three Heavens in battle prowess, it would be a crushing advantage.","As expected, Cheng Qing immediately had the upper hand. Every move was fierce, blasting Ling Han so hard that he could only parry.","This caused everyone to nod repeatedly. They had finally suppressed this guy.","But upon further thought, a Silver Generation elite actually had to depend on the advantage of two minor levels of cultivation level to be able to suppress Ling Han. Wasn’t this proof of how terrifying Ling Han was?","However, though Ling Han was at a disadvantage, he did not look like he was about to collapse at all.","His defenses were too strong. Even if he was hit a few times, so what? He would only be scratched, and be completely unharmed.","However, there was a time limit to the battle, and it was far from lasting until the moment Cheng Qing’s power was exhausted. The battle would then be forcefully stopped, and the outcome of the battle would naturally be judged based on the advantage and disadvantage of the situation.","Thus, if this continued, Ling Han would definitely lose.","With a thought from Ling Han, his spiritual body appeared.","This was the first time he had revealed his spiritual body in front of everyone, instantly attracting everyone’s attention. Even those Venerate Tier elites were no exception.","However, no matter how they looked, they couldn’t find anything special about this spiritual body. It was just as ordinary as the True Self that Ling Han had previously displayed.","Everyone knew that the quality of the spiritual body directly determined the strength of the cultivator. Ling Han was so powerful, so the quality of his spiritual body must also be incredibly shocking. How could it be so mediocre?","“This guy is really cautious, to still keep his spiritual body secret!”","Everyone shook their heads, feeling that Ling Han was being too cautious.","Again!","Ling Han and the spiritual body charged out together, greeting Cheng Qing.","The spiritual body took the lead. This was formed by a combination of Regulations and the soul. Though it could cause massive damage to a physical body, it itself was not a physical body. It was difficult for the mystical power to injure it, and even if it was damaged, it was fine. As long as it was nurtured in the mind, it would be able to recover to its original state in no time.","Thus, spiritual bodies could be used without any scruples, and there was basically no need to worry that they would be destroyed.","Peng!","The Spiritual Body of Destruction struck out with both fists, each fist attacking one of Cheng Qing’s spiritual bodies respectively. Under the boiling of the terrifying power, the Spiritual Body of Destruction was instantly sent backwards, but Cheng Qing’s two spiritual bodies began to tremble rapidly, flickering inconsistently.","Upon another exchange, the battle prowess of these two spiritual bodies had clearly dropped greatly.","What!","This caused everyone to go numb with shock. What was going on here? Could it be that Ling Han’s spiritual body could still restrain other spiritual bodies? Otherwise, why did Cheng Qing’s spiritual body seem to have been severely injured after the exchange of blows, and his battle prowess had decreased drastically?","Others might not be able to see clearly, but with the cultivation level and insight of the Venerate Tier elites, how could they not see clearly!","“This boy’s spiritual body seems to have a special ability that can restrain other spiritual bodies.”","“That’s right. The spiritual body is formed from Regulations. Theoretically speaking, the higher the level of Regulations that forms the spiritual body, the more powerful it would be.”","“However, it can even suppress the spiritual body of an Imperial Son. This... is too shocking!”","All the Venerate Tier elites frowned deeply. Ling Han’s performance was becoming more and more amazing, and he was looking more and more capable of becoming Emperor.","Most importantly, the majority of Imperial Clans were standing on the opposing side of Ling Han. Naturally, they were unwilling to see Ling Han become Emperor. Otherwise, without the invasion of the Netherworld, they would be dealt with first.","Ling Han’s main body was slightly inferior to Cheng Qing’s main body in terms of battle prowess, but his spiritual body was invincible in destructive power. Under the barrage of punches, Cheng Qing’s three spiritual bodies were all severely injured, and he had no choice but to withdraw them into his mind to nurture.","In this way, it became Ling Han and the Spiritual Body of Destruction that joined forces to battle Cheng Qing’s main body, so it was hard to say who would win.","However, before they could determine the victor, the time limit for the battle had already arrived.","The Venerates discussed among themselves, and judged Ling Han as having lost.","This was too unfair. On the surface, it was a tie, but Ling Han was battling Cheng Qing, who was Third Change while Ling Han was a First Change. No matter what, he should be judged to have won, right?","Hehe, in order to suppress Ling Han, these mighty figures were really shameless."]},{"number":4333,"title":"Chapter 4333: A kickass rookie","paragraphs":["Chapter 4333: A kickass rookie","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han merely smiled faintly at this.","Though his battle prowess could match a Silver Generation like Cheng Qing, even if he really passed four rounds of elimination battles, and challenged the top ten, he would definitely not have the slightest chance of winning.","Those were all Imperial Sons above the level of Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change. In fact, there were even Golden Generation elites among them.","If it was just a gap of one or two minor levels, Ling Han was confident that he could crush him, but if the gap was too wide, no matter how freakish he was, he could not do anything. After all, those people were also geniuses of the present generation.","Thus, since he couldn’t obtain cultivation resources anyway, what was there to be concerned about?","As for worthless fame? He didn’t take it to heart. Moreover, did his freakishness need these rankings to prove it?","What worried Ling Han was where he was going to obtain cultivation resources.","There was no need to think about the Ancestral King Academy for the moment. No matter what, he had to be at least Third Change, or even Fourth Change first. Only then would he be able to charge towards the top ten, right?","Then, Yin soul?","Ling Han shook his head again. Under the powerful suppression of Buddha Doga, the Netherworld army had currently retreated into the Mountain Sea Heaven. If he went over to kill Yin souls... en, he would be killed at any moment.","Dark Clouds Hell?","This was fine. His life force had already recovered. Though the life force he had lost could not be recovered, compared to the long lifespan he had left, he was completely capable of sustaining the expenditure.","However, he now knew that it was suspected that there was a Pseudo-Emperor in the Dark Clouds Hell, and if he thought about it carefully, the Source Dao Stone appearing out of thin air, was it also related to this Master of the Yin River?","The more he thought about it, the more terrifying it was. He had best not touch this trouble again.","Then what was he to do?","It didn’t work like this, and it didn’t work like that either. Could it be that he had to cultivate diligently on his own?","Though the Ancestral King Academy had been modified by many Saints, and the power of heaven and earth here was dense, and the Regulations were lively, so it was very easy to sense them, this was only an environmental factor. It could not replace cultivation resources.","Thus, he still had to go and see if there were any ancient sites that had opened, which could allow him to earn some extra income, and obtain some natural treasures.","As he kept an eye out for news on the Galaxy Network, he kept a low profile and cultivated in the academy.","However, those Silver Generations that had been in the Spiritual Transformation Tier previously were all clamoring, waiting for Ling Han to charge up to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Sure enough, after this monthly exam, Ling Han’s strength was revealed. Occasionally, there would be people challenging him, and they were all Imperial Sons that were in the Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change and above.","Wasn’t it obvious that they wanted to use their superior cultivation level to suppress him?","Furthermore, sparring would have to be done in a place where the formations would suppress Ling Han. The so-called “fairness” was only targeted at Ling Han’s Star Steps.","Faced with this kind of provocation, Ling Han naturally ignored it completely. He wasn’t stupid. He clearly knew that he would definitely lose and be beaten, yet he still foolishly rushed forwards?","But in this way, he continuously forfeited the battle, which also caused many people’s impression of him to rapidly deteriorate, thinking that he was cowardly and weak. This was only sparring, and could not possibly kill or cripple. You don’t even have the courage to fight?","The empress, the large black dog, and the others were all indignant on Ling Han’s behalf. He had clearly suffered injustice, so why was it that Ling Han was in the wrong instead?","Ling Han, on the other hand, was completely unconcerned. The best way to respond to all this was through strength.","Just you wait!","Not long after, Ding Shu also broke through.","It wasn’t the Tenth Form, but rather the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","In the end, he gave up. If he were to continue fixating on the Tenth Form, it was possible that he would be trapped in the True Self Tier for the rest of his life.","In any case, in the past, it was possible that the Great Emperor was only the ninth form, or in fact, only the eighth form.","“B-Boss!” He was willing to admit defeat. After breaking through, he came to find Ling Han.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and nodded, “En, Little Ding.”","“Don’t call me that!” Ding Shu said angrily.","“Alright, Little Shu,” Ling Han readily agreed.","Ding Shu was even more depressed. However, he was the boss here, so what could he do?","“Although I recognize you as my boss now, our battle hasn’t ended yet!” Ding Shu said. “If I surpass you in any cultivation level, you’ll have to turn around and recognize me as your boss!”","“Sure.” Ling Han nodded. On the path of the strongest, he did not think that anyone could surpass him. At most, they could only fight to a tie.","Moreover, the Spiritual Transformation Tier was directly linked to the True Self Tier. Thus, Ding Shu would at least have to wait until the Minor Advanced Tier to be able to compete with him again. There was still a lot of time.","Once Ding Shu broke through, the little azure dragon naturally became the number one cultivator in the True Self Tier, making him extremely conceited and arrogant.","The empress and Hu Niu had also advanced into the True Self Tier, and similarly maintained the high rate of improvement in their cultivation level.","On this day, he was walking around in the academy, wanting to see if he could encounter another chance of enlightenment.","Unfortunately, this was something that could only be encountered by luck. It was not something that could come just because he wanted it to. After walking for half a day, he was only here to look at the mountains and waters. Thankfully, he still had Hu Niu, the empress and Chi Menghan by his side. This could be considered as accompanying these beauties.","“Yi, why are so many people running towards the entrance?” Hu Niu suddenly asked curiously.","In just a short while, they saw at least four groups of people rushing past, all heading in the direction of the academy’s entrance.","“Let’s go take a look, let’s go take a look,” Hu Niu said excitedly.","Since they had nothing else to do, the four of them headed towards the entrance of the academy.","When they arrived, they were all surprised. Why were there so many people here?","After asking around, they finally found out what had happened.","As it turned out, someone wanted to join the academy, but this person was very arrogant. He wanted to see if the Ancestral King Academy was qualified to take him in. Thus, he sat at the academy’s entrance, and requested a battle of equal cultivation levels. If anyone could defeat him, then he would join the academy.","F***, so cocky?","Ling Han and the others were all surprised. Faced with this kind of mad man, those big shots in the academy could tolerate it?","This person... was only in the True Self Tier.","“Have you guys heard of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan?” someone beside them asked. These words were directed at Chi Menghan.","Chi Menghan pondered for a moment, and seemed to recall something. “Descendant of the Thousand Bird Saint Emperor? Yi, wasn’t there no news of this clan since hundreds of millions of years ago?”","“That’s right. The Thousand Bird Imperial Clan has indeed disappeared for a long time, but they have reappeared now.” That person nodded.","“Could it be that the person is the Imperial Son of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan?” Chi Mengan immediately made the connection.","Yet that person shook his head, “This person is the son-in-law of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. This time, he has been accompanied by a Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. Thus, though the higher ups of the academy are very displeased, it would not be appropriate for them to say anything.”","Chi Menghan found this strange. “This person is still sitting here, so how could it be that no one that can defeat him?”","“That’s true.” That person smiled bitterly, “Recently, it seems like a great many freaks have appeared. This guy has already won seventeen consecutive battles, and there is no one that can match ten moves from him.”","This was quite impressive. After all, this was the Ancestral King Academy. There were many Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters here, and not one of them was able to withstand ten moves from him.","“What’s his name?” Chi Menghuan asked again.","“Hehe, Fairy Chi, you must have heard of his name,” that person said, his face filled with certainty.","“Oh?” Chi Menghan was astonished. “Who is it?”","“Origin!”","—"]},{"number":4334,"title":"Chapter 4334: Powerful Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4334: Powerful Origin","Editor: Henyee Translations","Origin!","Years ago, there were three outstanding freaks, who broke records madly on the Galaxy Network. They were Origin, Myriad Dao, and Heaven Crushing.","Of course, following Ling Han’s arrival on the Galaxy Network, he also broke the records of these people again. “Number One in the Galaxy” could be considered very well-known.","Ling Han had always wanted to know the true identities of these three people, but these three people had hidden themselves very well, and had not revealed themselves all this while.","He had never imagined that he would actually meet Origin, and this guy had actually become the son-in-law of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan!","Ling Han’s interest was piqued, and he turned to look at Origin.","This was a young man in plain clothes. His appearance was average, and could not be considered ugly, nor could he be considered handsome. However, he had an aura of might and dignity. He was clearly just sitting very ordinarily, yet it was as if he was the centre of heaven and earth, causing others to involuntarily turn to look at him.","“With such a large Ancestral King Academ, are there no elites?” A woman said. She was truly beautiful, with eyebrows as white as snow and skin as fair as snow. She held a seven-colored treasured sword in her hand, and her heroic appearance was captivating.","This woman was a beauty on the same level as the empress, Chi Menghan, and the others. Thus, when they saw her, quite a number of men revealed expressions of infatuation.","However, which one of those who could enroll into the Ancestral King Academy wasn’t a prodigy?","When they heard this woman’s words, they all looked furious.","“Humph, now that the Imperial Sons has advanced into the Spirit Transformation Tier, how many of them are still stuck at the True Self Tier?” they retorted.","The beauty waved the treasured sword in her hand, “Alright, then please send out Spirit Transformation Tiers and Minor Advanced Tiers. We’ll have a fair battle and see who can block ten moves from Brother Origin.”","Brother Origin?","Looks like this woman was the noble daughter of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan, and the wife of Origin.","Looking at this woman’s exquisite beauty, and looking at Origin’s calm expression that showed a faint mockery, it naturally made a great many Imperial Sons angry.","“All right, I’ll battle you!” Cheng Qing was the first to jump out.","He had once been the strongest of the True Self Tier. Though his abilities could not be ranked in the Spirit Transformation Tier at present, suppressing his cultivation level in a battle of True Self Tier, his battle prowess was definitely astonishing.","“Seventh Grandfather, please set it up!” That beauty turned her head, and said respectfully in a certain direction.","Peng!","Instantly, a massive piece of damaged rock dropped down from the skies, landing heavily on the empty space in front of the academy gates.","This rock was extraordinarily heavy, shaking the ground so much that it trembled madly.","Everyone looked over. This rock looked ordinary, but there were streaks of light flickering at its fractures, giving it a mysterious feeling.","“If you battle on this rock, everyone’s cultivation level will be pulled to the same level,” the beauty said. “Come on.”","With a leap, Cheng Qing had already landed on the damaged rock. One of his hands was clasped behind his back, while his other hand was hooking at Origin in a provoking manner.","Origin slowly stood up, and unhurriedly leaped onto the damaged rock. Then, he said, “If you can block ten moves from me, I’ll consider it your victory.”","F***, this was too exaggerated, wasn’t it?","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, against the Silver Generation, who would dare make such a boast?","Cheng Qing was indeed furious. The other Imperial Sons also sneered repeatedly, feeling that this Origin was really too arrogant.","“He only broke some records on the Galaxy Network. Does he really think he’s all that impressive?”","“The Imperial Clans have never been on the Galaxy Network.”","“Without the participation of the Imperial Clans, what meaning is there to this kind of first place?”","Everyone began to mock him. At this moment, they were naturally standing on the same side as Cheng Qing.","Cheng Qing shouted loudly, and took the initiative to attack.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Although his cultivation level had been suppressed to the True Self Tier, the Silver Generation was still the Silver Generation. His abilities were incredibly terrifying, and as he delivered one attack after another, Regulations exploded madly, high-level energy boiling, terrifying to the extreme.","For three consecutive moves, Origin only dodged.","“Hahaha!” Everyone laughed loudly.","“How boastful. Now that they’re truly fighting, he can’t even withstand a single blow.”","“By the looks of it, this Origin isn’t all that impressive!” The large black dog also rushed over and said to Ling Han.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head slowly.","“Huh? You’re actually optimistic about this person?” the large black dog asked.","“Just wait and see,” Ling Han said.","After three moves, Origin finally launched a counterattack.","Boom, a terrifying aura surged out of his body. It was as if he had turned into a great demon god, and instantly overwhelmed Cheng Qing.","Peng!","It was only a single move, and Cheng Qing had already been blasted off the damaged rock. With a ‘wa’, he threw up blood madly.","What!","Everyone was dumbfounded. A dignified Silver Generation was actually defeated in a single move?","“Next,” Origin said calmly, as if he didn’t take defeating a Silver Generation elite to heart at all. Instead, he took it as a matter of course.","“How arrogant!” Another Silver Generation exchanged blows with him, but he did not manage to avoid Cheng Qing’s fate. He first delivered three moves, and then was defeated in a single move by Origin.","The third, the fourth, the fifth... so what if he suppressed his cultivation level? Origin displayed a powerful dominance, and on the level of True Self Tier, he was not only invincible, but also overwhelming.","Later on, even a Golden Generation elite made a move, but he was still defeated in two to three moves.","This triggered an earthquake.","The Golden Generation was the strongest generation, and even if this Golden Generation that had made a move was the weakest existence among them, he was still a whole lot stronger than the Silver Generation.","Hiss!","Was this guy who had created a freakish record on the Galaxy Network really invincible among his peers?","But no matter what, they could not allow him to be so arrogant.","If they were really blocked at the door, and all of them bowed their heads in submission, how would they be able to face others in future?","The problem was, even the Golden Generation had lost. Was there really anyone who could defeat Origin?","“Imperial Son Xuan should be able to. Unfortunately, in order to break through his limits, he has gone to some barren land to train!”","“On the other hand, Imperial Son Qing and Imperial Son Ming have already advanced into Venerate Tier, and have long since left the academy.”","“Even the three strongest members of the Golden Generation are unable to move. The others probably won’t be able to suppress Origin either.”","“What do we do? Are we really going to allow him to continue being so arrogant?”","Right at this moment, the little azure dragon stepped onto the stage and issued a challenge to Origin.","At present, he was the number one elite in the True Self Tier of the Ancestral King Academy. However, even the Golden Generation had lost, so everyone naturally did not have much confidence in him. When they saw him ascend the stage, no one cheered him on.","This infuriated the little azure dragon. Why was there no one optimistic about him?","“Grandpa Dragon is very angry, and the consequences are very serious!” the little azure dragon said.","Meanwhile, Origin smiled and said, “Not bad, you’re even stronger than those trash from before! To defeat you, I might need 100 moves, or even more.”","No one would’ve thought that Origin would have such a high opinion of the little azure dragon.","Yet the little azure dragon wasn’t happy at all. It took the initiative to attack, and said loudly, “Pei, how could Grandpa Dragon possibly lose to you!”","The two of them immediately began a fierce battle.","The little azure dragon was extraordinary. In the past, he had been able to exchange blows with Ling Han. Now that he had cultivated the Imperial Scroll his abilities had naturally increased even further.","Sure enough, he was locked in a fierce battle with Origin. At this moment, it was hard to decide who was stronger between the two of them.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4335,"title":"Chapter 4335: Extortion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4335: Extortion","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone was captivated by the sight.","Who would’ve thought that the little azure dragon would be so powerful!","Although he was currently number one in the True Self Tier, there were the likes of powerful characters like Ling Han and Ding Shu, and added with the fact that the Silver Generation had all broken through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, the value of the little azure dragon being number one was naturally insufficient.","Only now did they know that the little azure dragon was truly awesome.","“That’s right. You are worthy of me showing my true strength!” Origin stated calmly. Boom, nine streaks of dense black mist suddenly surged out of his body, and his whole aura changed immediately. Boom, he sent out a palm strike, and terrifying divine patterns intertwined.","“Pei! Grandpa Dragon is also going to show his true abilities!” The little azure dragon never let people off the hook easily. It immediately opened its mouth and spat out saliva.","“Yo!” The little red bird immediately covered its nose, its expression filled with disgust.","She was not the only one. The expressions of the others were more or less the same. This fighting style was too shameless.","Yet Origin was expressionless. He continued to strike with his palm, and under the boiling of energy, his saliva was immediately annihilated. It was impossible for his saliva to spit onto anyone.","Boom, the attack landed, its might indescribably terrifying.","The little azure dragon was instantly sent flying, blood seeping from the corner of its mouth.","With his powerful physique, he was still wounded?","Origin’s strength was truly terrifying.","The little azure dragon wanted to continue fighting, yet Ling Han leaped over and forcefully dragged it away.","“You’re not going to battle me?” Origin suddenly asked.","“Me?” Ling Han smiled faintly, “Why should I battle you?”","He had come to the Ancestral King Academy for the sake of cultivation resources and to disgust the Imperial Clans. How could he possibly fight for them?","Origin faltered for a moment, then nodded at Ling Han, but didn’t say anything.","“Let go, Grandpa Dragon hasn’t lost yet!” The little azure dragon was still defiant.","“You’re no match for him,” Ling Han said with certainty.","The little azure dragon humphed, but didn’t say anything else. Just now, he was just being stubborn as per usual.","After a while, he said, “This Origin’s strength is not inferior to Ding Shu.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. He had the same feeling.","“Next.” Origin continued to provoke, his voice calm. He did not look the slightest bit smug just because he had defeated a few Imperial Sons.","But the more this was the case, the more furious everyone was.","Showing off subconsciously was the most detestable thing.","“Ding Shu!” These Imperial Sons all thought of one person.","Very quickly, Ding Shu was invited over.","When he found out the identity of Origin, Ding Shu immediately cried out. Without anyone provoking him, he himself leaped onto the damaged rock.","“I’ve always wanted to meet the four of you,” he said loudly.","These words came out of nowhere, but Ling Han knew that Ding Shu had always wanted to battle Origin, Myriad Dao, Heaven Crushing, and Number One in the Galaxy. Now that his chance had come, he was naturally excited.","A solemn expression appeared on Origin’s face, and he said, “You are a good opponent.”","“Haha, come fight me!” Ding Shu charged out, striking out furiously with his palms.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely. Neither of them used their Spirit Tool, and merely used their own strength to their heart’s content.","Ding Shu was indeed strong, not the slightest bit inferior to Origin. The two of them exchanged blows, and it was hard to decide who was stronger between them.","After several hundred exchanges, Ding Shu finally unleashed his trump card. A mysterious glow enveloped his body, and his battle prowess instantly soared by three Heavens.","In this kind of fierce battle, if one’s battle prowess suddenly increased by three Heavens, that could directly decide the outcome of the battle.","However, it was clear that Originhad also been guarding against Ding Shu’s ultimate move. Eighteen streaks of black aura suddenly exploded from his body, turning into eighteen giant demonic snakes that counterattacked Ding Shu.","Boom!","Their most powerful attacks clashed, and both of them trembled. They both retreated, and then began to vomit blood.","Both of their powerful attacks were directed at each other. Thus, once they unleashed their powerful attacks, it was inevitable that their attacks would be stronger, while their defenses would be weaker. This would cause considerable damage to both of them.","“I’ve lost.” Ding Shu sighed.","Everyone was curious. Wasn’t this clearly a tie?","“In that attack just now, I also used a sliver of Spirit Transformation Tier-level comprehension,” Ding Shu said.","‘F*ck! You’re far too honest!’","If you didn’t reveal it, who would know?","Everyone was speechless. How could there be such a person?","Origin, on the other hand, smiled, and said, “All right. When I break through to Spiritual Transformation Tier, I’ll go all out in battle with you again.”","“All right!” Ding Shu nodded, and very decisively jumped off the damaged rock. “Great! Great!” He strode off, still laughing loudly.","Crazy!","Everyone shook their heads, but even Ding Shu admitted that he was outmatched, so who else could they look for?","Ling Han?","Everyone turned to look at Ling Han. Then, they all frowned, their expressions awkward, as if they had swallowed flies.","To put it bluntly, the Ancestral King Academy was jointly established by a great many Imperial Clans, and in the eyes of the Imperial Clans, Ling Han was like a thorn, prickly, bothersome, and heart-piercing! Thus, after Ling Han entered into the academy, he was repeatedly targeted.","If it was not for the fact that he still had the Nine Mountains Saint behind him, he would probably have long since been killed, and his corpse thrown into a smelly ditch.","And now, they had to depend on Ling Han to fight against Origin?","No matter how they thought about it, it was a headache.","But aside from Ling Han, who else could stand against Origin?","They couldn’t let this guy sit at the academy’s entrance forever, right? Otherwise, the Ancestral King Academy would really become a joke in the world.","“Ling Han, you take the field,” a Silver Generation elite said to Ling Han. However, this wasn’t a request, but rather a command.","Ling Han pretended not to hear.","“Ling Han, this concerns the academy’s honour and humiliation, don’t be too selfish!” Another Silver Generation attacked Ling Han.","F***, why didn’t you guys say this when you all came to issue a challenge?","Ling Han ignored him.","With him being so profligate, no one could do anything about it. However, they couldn’t allow Origin to continue being arrogant, so some higher ups of the academy came to find Ling Han, hoping that he could make a move.","“Sigh, I’ve been challenged for the past few days, so my body is very weak now,” Ling Han immediately complained to this big shot.","‘F*ck you!’","The big shot’s expression was strange. It wasn’t like he didn’t know that Ling Han hadn’t fought at all these days, so how could he be weak?","Oh, this guy was taking advantage of the opening to extort him.","“All right, as long as you can defeat Origin, I will give you a portion of cultivation resources,” he said through gritted teeth. There was nothing else that could be done. At present, he could only allow Ling Han to extort him.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “My body is weak, so one portion isn’t enough nutrition.”","That big shot gritted his teeth, “Two portions!”","“Ten portions!” Ling Han made an exorbitant demand. This was a rare opportunity.","“Impossible!” That big shot refused immediately.","“Ten portions would only be equivalent to ten months’ worth. I haven’t even asked for a year yet,” Ling Han said with a smile. “How about it? If it’s a deal, I’ll go. If not, then forget it.”","That big shot stared at Ling Han with a fierce gaze.","Ling Han was unafraid, and merely smiled.","They wanted him to make a move, yet did not give him any benefits. How could that be possible!","“All right!” That big shot agreed, “The prerequisite is that you must win.”","“Don’t worry, I can’t lose,” Ling Han said calmly. He strode forwards, and had already leaped onto the damaged rock."]},{"number":4336,"title":"Chapter 4336: Ling Han makes his move","paragraphs":["Chapter 4336: Ling Han makes his move","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I thought you didn’t want to fight me?” Origin asked with a smile.","Ling Han rubbed his hands together, and said, “I’ve already been paid enough appearance fees, so I naturally don’t mind making a move.”","“Haha!” Origin laughed loudly, but he soon shook his head, “However, there is no way you would be a match for me.”","“Oh?” Ling Han raised a brow slightly.","“At the same cultivation level, there is no one that can be my match,” Origin said calmly, as if he was just talking about something that could not be more ordinary.","Ling Han also smiled, “That’s good. I am also invincible among my peers, and can sweep aside all opposition.”","Hearing the conversation between these two people, all the Imperial Sons felt an urge to beat someone up.","You guys are really too condescending. To say such words in front of so many Imperial Sons, aren’t you afraid that they would be forced to eat their words?","But in truth, Ling Han had indeed swept aside all opponents at the same cultivation level, and Origin had also used his abilities to prove that no one was a match for him in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","Now, this was the stage for the competition between the two of them. The others were all mediocre, and were only qualified to stand below the stage and watch the battle.","“There is no first place in literature, and no second place in martial arts,” Origin said, and beckoned Ling Han over, “Between the two of us, only one can be invincible among his peers!1”","“Come!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and charged towards Origin.","How could Origin possibly dodge? He charged towards Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Neither of them used any kind of feint. The moment they started fighting, they attacked madly, unleashing their full battle prowess.","After a few moves, Ling Han had a complete understanding of Origin’s strength.","The peak stage of the ninth form of the True Self Tier, which was equivalent to Ding Shu.","Ling Han somewhat understood why he had come here to issue a challenge at the beginning. That was because this guy also had the idea of breaking through to the Tenth Form, and wanted to obtain the appreciation of breaking through by fighting with top prodigies.","He shook his head. If he wanted to break through to the tenth form, not only would he need appreciation, he would also need the Power of Dimension, and he couldn’t even have used it while breaking through to the ninth form.","What did this signify?","Origin was the master of a Genesis World!","Was that possible?","How could there be so many masters of Genesis Worlds in this universe? It should only be him and Ding Shu.","However, Origin was indeed very strong. No wonder he could fight Ding Shu to a stalemate. In fact, in the end, it was still Ding Shu that was slightly inferior.","Ling Han shook his head. If he was also in the ninth form, then Origin could be considered an excellent opponent. However, he had broken through to Spiritual Transformation Tier from the tenth form. Even if he suppressed his cultivation level to True Self Tier, he would still have the terrifying battle prowess of the tenth form.","Who could stand against him?","Ling Han instantly gained the upper hand, completely suppressing Origin.","This caused the Imperial Sons to have mixed feelings.","On the one hand, they could not bear to see how arrogant Origin was, and hoped that his arrogance would be suppressed, but on the other hand, they too did not want to see Ling Han being so awe-inspiring. In fact, they hoped to see Ling Han being defeated.","Why weren’t they the one who was so powerful?","Origin was extremely tenacious. Even though he was at a disadvantage, he still persisted, searching for a chance to turn the tables.","However, in front of Ling Han, how could such an opportunity possibly exist?","Ling Han was decisive and agile. With a few heavy punches, he defeated Origin.","This was a crushing advantage. Even if Origin still had powerful moves that he had yet to use, it would not be able to affect the outcome.","“I’ve lost.” He smiled calmly, then communicated through divine sense, “You have attained the tenth form!”","This was very obvious. To be able to crush his Ninth Form, there could only be the Tenth Form.","Ling Han neither denied nor admitted. He merely smiled slightly, turned and left.","After Origin was defeated, he quickly completed the admission procedures. He was sent here by the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. Even if the Ancestral King Academy had previously been humiliated, how could they not accept him?","Ling Han obtained ten portions of cultivation resources. Though the academy didn’t like him, it wasn’t to the extent that they would go back on their word. Thus, Ling Han refined these resources happily, but even ten portions of cultivation resources were only enough for a few months.","The Spiritual Body of Destruction was gradually becoming complete, and it wouldn’t be long before it reached the consummate level of First Change.","But what was he to do next?","Ling Han sighed. In terms of cultivation resources, it was really worrying him to death.","However, at this moment, a piece of news spread out from the academy.","The lair of an ancient Divine Beast had been discovered!","What Divine Beast?","The True Phoenix!","In ancient myths, the True Dragon and the True Phoenix were equals. If one could discover some Celestial medicine, rare treasure or whatnot in the lair of the True Phoenix, the gains would naturally be nature-defying.","After learning of the news, even the little red bird couldn’t sit still any longer. It wanted to go and explore the lair of the True Phoenix.","According to her, the Vermillion Bird and the True Phoenix both belonged to the Fire Element category. Although the True Phoenix was slightly inferior to the Vermillion Bird, their Mystical Power was similar, so it still had great value in cultivation.","Che, speaking as if once she entered into the lair of the True Phoenix, the secret technique of the True Phoenix would be placed in front of her.","Very soon, further information was revealed. As it turned out, this lair of the True Phoenix was discovered by the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. However, to enter into this lair of the Divine Beast, it was difficult!","According to the Saint’s deduction, the True Phoenix should have died here. There was a Great Emperor-level killing formation here. Thus, it was unrealistic to rely on a Saint to charge in with the Imperial Weapon.","If one wanted to enter, they would need to use the blood of a large number of prodigies to be able to create an opening.","The Thousand Bird Imperial Clan had already tried, but even all the prodigies of an entire Imperial Clan could only create a small opening, and it could not be passed through at all.","It was also because of this that the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan had come to the Ancestral King Academy. Firstly, they wanted to announce their reappearance, and secondly, they wanted the Ancestral King Academy to send out a large number of outstanding disciples to open the lair of the True Phoenix with them.","The elites of the academy discussed for a while, and then decided to send their disciples to the lair of the True Phoenix.","Thus, the next step was to select people.","Naturally, everyone wanted to go to this lair of the True Phoenix, but the more people that went, the lesser their gains would definitely be. Thus, the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan only gave them a hundred spots.","The elites made their arrangements, and as expected, Ling Han didn’t get a spot.","He wasn’t the only one. The large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the others also didn’t get a spot.","It was obviously deliberate.","In terms of talent, Ling Han was no weaker than the Golden Generation at all. In fact, he was even more talented than them. If even he wasn’t qualified to receive a spot, who else was?","However, the Ancestral King Academy was controlled by the various Imperial Clans. They didn’t want to give Ling Han and the others a spot, so what could Ling Han and the others do?","Make a protest?","Hehe, even if the Nine Mountains Saint came over with the Imperial Weapon, there was absolutely no need for them to give any face. Not killing Ling Han was their bottom line, and they still had to help Ling Han become stronger? What a joke.","This caused Ling Han and the others to feel both angered and exasperated. How could them, being as weak as they were, be able to oppose the will of Saints and Venerate Tiers?","What could they do? Could it be that they would have to miss out on such a good opportunity?","Right at this moment, someone came to visit Ling Han.","Origin.","“I heard that you were targeted, and didn’t get a spot?” Origin came straight to the point.","Ling Han smiled and said, “It can’t be helped. I am too outstanding. As the saying goes, the tallest tree in the forest will be destroyed by the wind.”","Origin laughed loudly, “I can give you a few spots.”","“Oh?”","—"]},{"number":4337,"title":"Chapter 4337: Who is mocking who?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4337: Who is mocking who?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han looked at Origin.","Ling Han didn’t doubt that the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan could give him a spot. In fact, they could even give him a few spots. He was the ideal son-in-law of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. Moreover, the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan also seemed to want to nurture him as the future Ancestral King, pouring a lot of effort into raising him.","Thus, Origin definitely had this bit of value to get a few spots.","However, he would not accept a reward without doing something for it.","“What requests does Brother Origin have?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“A favor.” Origin smiled faintly, and raised a finger.","Ling Han shrugged and said, “There are a little too many people I want to bring.”","“That would be a very big favor.” Origin’s expression did not change, and he still maintained a slight smile.","“Deal.” Ling Han stretched out his hand.","Origin also stretched out his hand. The two of them shook hands, and a deal was reached.","Next, the disciples selected through the Ancestral King Academy’s selection set out, heading first to the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan.","“Ling Han, hoho.”","“After all, they are not real members of Imperial Clans, so what right do they have to compete with us?”","“Just obediently stay home.”","“No matter how freakish you are, so what? If your cultivation level can’t keep up, what right do you have to talk about competing for the throne?”","When these Imperial Sons set out, they couldn’t help but run over to mock and ridicule Ling Han when they saw him standing at the gates of the academy.","Could you still be so awesome now?","Hehe, he was just a lowly commoner, so how could he compare to them?","Pei!","Ling Han stood calmly with his hands clasped behind his back.","“Yo, you’re still pretending to be calm?” An Imperial Son laughed loudly, an expression of disdain on his face.","“Who knows how much pain he’s feeling now.”","“That’s for sure. He could only watch us leave, while he himself could only look and sigh. If it was me, I would also feel bitter.”","These people continued to mock him. This was a rare opportunity.","“Bunch of idiots.” The large black dog gave the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters the middle finger in return. “When you’re slapped in the face later, I hope your faces are thick enough and won’t swell.”","The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters sneered at the large black dog’s provocation. With their status, how could they bicker with a demonic dog?","The hundred people were divided into ten groups, each led by a Venerate Tier elite. They tore a rip into the Void and headed towards the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan.","Because some Venerate Tiers came earlier, while some came later, a portion of them set out first.","After about half of the group had left, Origin and his wife walked over.","“Brother Ling!” Origin called out from afar.","“Brother Origin!” Ling Han nodded as well.","Yi, what was going on?","The remaining people were all watching in a daze. Wasn’t Ling Han the one who had defeated Origin? Why did the two of them look like good friends now?","At this time, Origin and hsi wife had also come close.","“Come, let me introduce. This is my wife, Lao Pengpeng.” Origin pointed at the beauty beside him.","Meanwhile, this beauty acted reserved for a while. After all, she was a member of the Imperial Clan, so she was putting on a lot of airs.","Ling Han naturally didn’t mind this. He smiled at Lao Pengpeng and said, “Miss Lao.”","“These are all of you?” Origin swept an eye over Ling Han and the others. Aside from Ling Han, there was also the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, the little red bird, the perverted pig and Ding Shu—since he had taken in this lackey, he had to take care of him.","“Too much?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“It’s fine.” Origin nodded. He didn’t even need to ask for Lao Pengpeng’s opinion, and directly agreed.","On the sidelines, Lao Pengpeng had no intention of objecting at all. The gaze she directed at Origin was filled with admiration and reverence. By the looks of it, she had already been completely captivated.","With Origin’s talent, he was completely on the level of the Golden Generation, or even surpassed it. Thus, the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan definitely placed great importance on him, and nurtured him like an Imperial Son.","“Seventh Grandfather, we can set out now,” Origin said to a certain place, his expression respectful.","Ling Han knew that the two of them had been escorted here by a Saint. Thus, this Seventh Grandfather must be the Saint of the Lao Clan.","As expected, as his words fell, a white-browed and white-bearded old man suddenly appeared. He first looked at Ling Han for a while, then tore open the Void. Then, he stretched out a hand, and grabbed Ling Han and the others. Xiu, they sank into the Void.","“Haha, you’ve become stupid, haven’t you?” The large black dog laughed loudly, his eyes sweeping over the Imperial Sosn and Imperial Daughters who were dumbfounded outside the Void.","Xiu, the rip in the Void had already closed.","The remaining Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were indeed dumbfounded. What was going on here?","At first, they had thought that Ling Han and his group could not possibly go to the lair of the True Phoenix, and the big shots from the academy had deliberately suppressed them. No matter how naturally talented Ling Han was, so what?","But who would have thought that Ling Han would actually make a connection with the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan, and directly go to the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan through this connection?","How was the academy going to stop Ling Han now?","“Perhaps... they are only inviting them as guests, and may not be able to enter into the lair of the True Phoenix.” An Imperial Son was still stubborn.","“That’s right. After all, that is the lair of the True Phoenix. One more person entering would mean a smaller share of the gains,” someone nodded in agreement.","However, most people wore gloomy expressions. If they were just going to pay a visit, was there any need to choose this kind of time?","Don’t deceive yourself.","Damn it, they had been mocking him so hard just now, but in the end, the other party did not even need to say a word, and had slapped them all in the face.","There was only one word for it: depressed!","...","Though Ling Han and his group were not the first to set out, because it was a Saint bringing them with him on their journey, their speed naturally far surpassed that of Venerate Tier. Merely three days later, they were the first to break through the Void and arrive on a planet.","This planet was enshrouded by a great formation, and from the outside, it looked completely empty, as if it did not exist at all, and if anyone dared to barge in forcefully, even a Saint would be killed.","Great Emperor killing formation!","This was the ancestral grounds of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. They had been protected by the Great Emperor killing formation for generations, and as long as there was no internal strife, they could exist for eternity.","After arriving, Ling Han and the others had accommodations arranged for them. After waiting for a few more days, the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were all in place, and they would then go to the lair of the True Phoenix.","A few days later, the first batch of people to set out arrived.","They were also arranged to stay in a courtyard nearby. The group was enraptured, and seemed to be very happy.","“... Haha, I really reminisce about Ling Han’s expression at that time.”","“He couldn’t even say a single word!”","“That’s right. A lowly commoner is a lowly commoner. The moment it comes to this, he would show his true colors. Aside from scowling, what else could he do?”","“After this adventure to the lair of the True Phoenix ends, I still have to give him a good mocking when I return.”","“En, we have to let him know what we have gained, and make him die of envy.”","These people chatted as they walked, and very soon, a figure appeared ahead of them. He was presently sitting under a large tree and drinking tea.","“Yi, why does this figure look a little familiar?”","“Impossible, we’re the first batch of people to arrive, and in the case of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan, we don’t know anyone.”","“So strange, I also feel that this person looks a little familiar.”","“Let’s go take a look.”","These people quickened their pace, and soon reached him. Then, the latter turned around to take a look.","‘F*ck!’","In that instant, everyone was turned into stone.","F***, Ling Han!","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4338,"title":"Chapter 4338: Face-slapping Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4338: Face-slapping Again","Editor: Henyee Translations","How could it possibly be Ling Han?","Shouldn’t this guy be filled with envy in the Ancestral King Academy?","But was there anyone in this world that looked so similar?","All of a sudden, these Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were all dumbfounded, completely rendered speechless.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and put down his teacup, “What is it? I haven’t seen you for a few days, and you don’t recognize me anymore?”","This tone... that’s right, it must be Ling Han!","The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were all certain that Ling Han was definitely the only one who could say such a very ordinary thing but would attract so much hatred.","“Why are you here?” Guan Xia asked.","This was also what the others were curious about. They all turned their eyes to Ling Han.","“Oh, I asked the people of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan for help, and they brought me here,” Ling Han said very casually.","Pei!","This was a chance to enter into the lair of the True Phoenix, so how precious was it? How could it be given to you just because you asked for it?","You see, the Ancestral King Academy only had a hundred slots. Furthermore, this was still because opening the lair of the True Phoenix required a great amount of blood from prodigies. Otherwise, the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan would definitely have benefited from it on their own. Why would they have taken out such a great opportunity to share with others?","However, the problem was that Ling Han was indeed sitting here. Moreover, he had arrived here before them. Thus, he had definitely been brought here by a Saint. After some calculations, the person was definitely a Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan.","‘Ah, ah, ah, I’m about to go crazy!’","These Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all wore awkward expressions. At first, they had thought that they would be able to leave Ling Han far behind them — so what if you are freakishly talented? If your cultivation level is low, you would still be trampled on by others.","But now? Ling Han had come!","Previously, they had been mocking and conceited, but now, it seemed like they were mocking themselves. How embarrassing!","“Ling Han, you’re too despicable!” Kong Wuyang shouted angrily. Previously, he had been thrashed by Ling Han, and even now, he was still unable to raise his head in the academy. Now, he had been tricked by Ling Han, which made him extremely furious.","“You clearly could have come here as well, yet chose to keep it a secret, and laugh at us. How shameless!”","Ling Han was astounded. ‘This can become a reason for you to reprimand me?’","Oh, if I can’t get a place, I’ll be mocked by you guys. If I get a place, you guys wouldn’t be able to mock me, and it’s my fault?","This was too ridiculous, wasn’t it?","“Are you asking for a beating?” Ling Han asked calmly. Towards someone who couldn’t even make heads or tails of the situation, “convincing others with strength” was the best choice.","Kong Wuyang was instantly rendered speechless. In terms of battle prowess, he was truly no match for Ling Han.","“Ling Han, you’re very arrogant!” another Imperial Son said. He was the Silver Generation elite of the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan. His name was Di Luo, and he was one of the top ten elites of the Spiritual Transformation Tier. He had most likely reached the Sixth Change or above that.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “If you have the strength, so what if you act a little arrogant?”","“You are courting death!” Di Luo’s baleful voice rang out, “If I want to kill you, it would not exceed ten moves, at most.”","This was not an exaggeration, but rather because he already knew Ling Han’s strength, and that was why he had such confidence.","“Come on then.” Ling Han crooked a finger at him, “Within ten moves, if you can even touch the corner of my robes, you win.”","Boom!","Di Luo took a step forwards, his terrifying aura surging. Even if those around them were Imperial Daughters and Imperial Sons, they still felt their scalps go numb.","Too strong!","“Brother Di, it’s time to teach this brat a lesson.”","“Humph, always avoiding battle in the academy. Now that we’re here, where else do you have to hide?”","“Beat him up!”","A considerable number of Imperial Sons hooted. Naturally, they had all been personally taught a lesson by Ling Han. For example, Kong Wuyang, Guan Xia, and Xu Youque.","The image of a silver wolf appeared behind Di Luo, and it suddenly howled at the sky. A soundless wave rippled out.","This was divine sense, and it instantly surged into everyone’s minds.","Even if this attack was aimed at Ling Han, and the others were only affected by a slight ripple, they still felt as if their souls were about to be sucked away.","This was a Mystical Power of the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan. Its name was Demon Wolf Soul Devourer, and it was an extremely terrifying Mystical Power that could penetrate one’s mind.","Boom, Ling Han’s mind rippled.","The Spiritual Body of Destruction immediately unleashed a supreme might, easily dispersing the Demon Wolf Soul Devourer.","It would be rude not to reciprocate.","Ling Han wanted to unleash his murderous aura attack, but it wasn’t as if he didn’t have soul-level attacks!","Hold on, the Imperial Son had a precious tool left behind by the Great Emperor to protect his soul. The barrage of murderous aura would not be effective. He had long since experimented with this.","Yi, that horn?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. This horn had astonishing effects on the Wolf Tribe. He wondered if it would be useful for this Di Luo?","“Die!” When Di Luo saw that the Demon Wolf Soul Devourer was ineffective, he immediately launched another attack.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He was at least a Spiritual Transformation Tier Sixth Change elite, and was also a Silver Generation elite. Thus, his battle prowess naturally far surpassed Ling Han’s. As he delivered his attack, he turned into a snow-white wolf that was formed by Regulations. High-level energy surged, and its destructive power was incredibly terrifying.","Even Ling Han didn’t dare to come into contact with it. The gap in battle prowess was too wide. If he was hit, even if he didn’t die, he would be severely injured.","His figure retreated rapidly, and with a wave of his hand, the Earth Dragon rose up, blocking that fierce wolf.","Peng!","The ferocious wolf was terrifying. With a single crash, the Earth Dragon was shattered, and it pounced towards Ling Han again.","Thankfully, with this buffer, it was enough for Ling Han to put some distance between them.","However, Di Luo continued to attack, and more and more silver wolves appeared on the scene. Each silver wolf possessed great destructive power, causing Ling Han to have less and less space to move around.","“Good one!”","“It’s time to extinguish this brat’s spirit. Does he really think that he can blot out the heavens with one hand?”","“This world still belongs to us, the Imperial Clans!”","All the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were cheering for Di Luo. Though the battle was not over yet, the result was already clear.","Ling Han had definitely lost. The only difference was when he would lose.","Was that the case?","Ling Han took out the horn, and with the help of the Earth Dragon, he quietly blew it.","A soundless shockwave spread out, and Di Luo’s attack came to an abrupt stop.","What was going on?","All the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were curious. As long as he continued to press his advantage, Ling Han’s defeat should have been within a few moves. Why had Di Luo wasted such a good opportunity?","Before anyone could ask, they could clearly see that Di Luo had suddenly sprawled out on the ground. Then, they heard pa, pa, pa.","This was the sound of clothes tearing.","Yi?","They were all dumbfounded with shock, and they could see that Di Luo’s clothes had already been forcefully torn apart, revealing his snow-white fur.","—This Silver Generation elite had actually turned back into his original form in public!","This?","The Demon Wolf Imperial Clan was a member of the Demon Race and Wolf Tribe. Everyone knew this, so it was not strange that Di Luo could take the form of a wolf.","The question is, why are you in wolf form now?","And what was even more shocking was that after Di Luo turned into a wolf, he actually wagged his tail happily, and jogged towards Ling Han, using his head to rub against Ling Han’s leg.","Are you really an Imperial Son? Are you really a member of the Wolf Tribe?","This was clearly a dog, trying to please its master!","At this moment, everyone was dumbfounded."]},{"number":4339,"title":"Chapter 4339: Imperial Son acts like a dog","paragraphs":["Chapter 4339: Imperial Son acts like a dog","Editor: Henyee Translations","In truth, Ling Han was only giving it a try. After all, Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all had treasures to protect their souls.","However, this Great Emperor Horn had extraordinary effects on the Wolf Tribe. Thus, Ling Han took it out to give it a try.","He had not deliberately targeted Di Luo, but in truth, the others were not affected at all, that all of them were howling at the skies, but Di Luo had uncontrollably taken the form of a wolf, and treated him like his master.","Hiss, this horn was really aimed at the Wolf Tribe.","Who exactly had made it?","An enemy of the Wolf Tribe?","Firstly, this had to be the bone of a Great Emperor. Otherwise, others could not possibly have obtained the bone of a Great Emperor, and refined it.","But what Great Emperor would do something so pointless?","If they were dissatisfied with the Wolf Tribe, they could directly erase them.","Could it be that this Great Emperor had a wicked sense of humor, and wanted to make the Wolf Tribe his eternal slave?","Hold on, that wasn’t right either.","You see, the power of other Imperial Clans could all resist the Great Emperor Horn, but only Di Luo could not... er, could it be that this was a technique of the Wolf Emperor?","Only if the Wolf Emperor acted, would he be able to avoid being affected by the great power of a Great Emperor. That was because the precious tool that Di Luo possessed was created by him in the first place, so he naturally could easily render it ineffective.","That should be the case.","The surroundings were completely silent, with only the sound of Di Luo continuously sticking out his tongue and wagging his tail. He could not be any more obedient.","Ling Han cracked a smile, looked towards Kong Wuyang and the others, then pointed with his finger, “Bite!”","“Ao!” Di Luo immediately pounced out.","At this moment, it was as if all his intelligence had been erased, and he had turned into a wild wolf. The only difference there was between him and wild beasts was that he would obey Ling Han’s commands.","Chaos instantly swept through the surroundings.","Di Luo was extremely powerful, ranked in the top 10 of the Spiritual Transformation Tier. If he attacked, he alone would be enough to suppress the combined forces of Kong Wuyang and the others.","“Yi!”","At this time, the second batch of Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters arrived. Seeing this scene, they couldn’t help but be dumbfounded.","—Di Luo had actually taken the form of a Demonic Beast, and was hunting down Kong Wuyang and the others?","What kind of enmity was this? Moreover, you have the absolute advantage in strength, so what do you mean by turning into the original form of the Demon Race?","“The situation is slightly off!” the Imperial Daughter of the Wentian Imperial Clan, Yan Feiyao, said. She immediately charged out, approaching Di Luo.","At present, Di Luo was no longer under the control of his reason. He was completely supported by his instincts, that he could only obey Ling Han’s commands. Seeing that someone was stopping him from completing his command, he naturally moved to attack without any reservations.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely. Yan Feiyao was similarly strong. She was also one of the top ten Spiritual Transformation Tier elites, and her battle prowess was not inferior to Di Luo at all. But now, one of them seemed to have gone mad, completely disregarding the possibility that he would be injured or crippled. Every move was fatal, and this naturally caused great pressure on Yan Feiyao.","She was still rational, so how could she possibly fight so desperately with Di Luo?","Thus, she was naturally at a disadvantage.","Thankfully, it wasn’t long before a third wave of people arrived. This time, there was a Sect Master elite that had already advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier. He moved, and directly suppressed Di Luo.","After asking about the situation, the two groups of people that came later all looked towards Ling Han.","It was already inconceivable that this guy could come here, and now, as they fought, he actually caused Di Luo to lose all reason, and directly turn into the form of a Demon Wolf?","What the hell?","Imperial Sons had a precious tool that had been personally forged by the Great Emperor. It could protect the soul, and even Saints could not affect it.","Thus, Di Luo’s sudden loss of reason was incredibly bizarre.","“Ling Han, what despicable means have you used?” the Sect Master-level the Imperial Son shouted at Ling Han, his expression extremely proud.","This was natural. He was the Golden Generation, and after advancing into the Minor Advanced Tier, a Sect Master could be called a great elite.","He was... Imperial Son Kui!","Ling Han had seen him in the True Dragon Abyss before. At that time, this person had even wanted to kill him. He had never thought that just as he was about to enter the lair of the True Phoenix, the two of them would meet again.","Was this considered fate?","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Don’t use your knowledge as a frog at the bottom of a well to guess my abilities.”","Hiss, this was publicly provoking him.","Imperial Son Kui smiled coldly and balefully. Without another word, he immediately attacked.","Boom, he was too strong. This was Sect Master-level. As he stretched out his right hand, black-coloured demonic clouds blotted out the skies and covered the earth. At least, everything within a radius of 50km was within the range of his attack.","However, Ling Han was no ordinary Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator!","He activated the Star Steps, and xiu, he instantly disappeared.","Imperial Son Kui frowned upon hearing this. He truly deserved to die. The Star Steps was far too freakish. In fact, he could even manage to escape from the hands of a Venerate Tier elite. He was only at the level of Sect Master, so it was even more impossible for him to capture Ling Han.","How could a mere SpiritTransformation Tier cultivator be so difficult to kill?","At this time, Di Luo also slowly recovered.","He did not dare take human form, because his clothes had all burst when he had “transformed” just now. If he took human form now, he would be completely naked.","Er, he might as well just play dumb.","Di Luo lay motionless on the ground, his heart filled with killing intent.","He had actually made such a huge fool of himself in front of so many people, causing him to be filled with hatred towards Ling Han. However, the moment he thought of that figure, he actually felt a sense of reverence rise up from the depths of his heart.","How was this possible?","His strength was clearly far superior to Ling Han, so why did he revere such a human?","...","After a few Star Steps, Ling Han returned to his room. The battle with Di Luo and the others could only be considered a diversion, and he did not take it to heart.","Several days later, everyone had arrived.","All right, he could go to the lair of the True Phoenix now.","The Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan moved out, bringing everyone into the depths of the universe. Not too long after, they stopped in an empty galaxy.","This was the lair of the True Phoenix?","That Saint summoned the Imperial Weapon. After awakening it, hong, a terrifying Imperial Might surged out, causing a great many people to involuntarily tremble.","And this was still because the people that had come here were all Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter-level. Otherwise, they would not just be shivering, but would directly kneel down.","Weng, at this moment, the Void in front of them seemed to have reacted. A ray of light circulated, and then a massive bird’s nest appeared.","This was really a bird’s nest, though it had been enlarged countless times over. In fact, it was even larger than most planets.","The bird’s nest was crimson red in colour, and circulated with brilliance, as if it was burning. There was an indescribable majesty about it.","This was the lair of the True Phoenix?","“Blood,” the Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan said.","Everyone had long since prepared themselves, and they all slit their wrists, squeezing out some blood.","The Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan collected all of this blood, then pressed it forwards.","Boom, the red light trembled, and a passageway suddenly appeared.","“It’s open!”","“A secret technique of the True Phoenix!”","Everyone looked expectant.","“According to legends, the most powerful secret technique of the True Phoenix is the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. This is a movement technique. In the past, when the True Phoenix ventured out, as she passed, supreme flames lit up the surrounding galaxy.”","“Not only that, but Phoenix Wings Divine Flight also possess a powerful offensive ability. The Extermination True Flames they stimulate are also incredibly terrifying.”","“We must obtain it!”","The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters’ eyes lit up.","—"]},{"number":4340,"title":"Chapter 4340: Lair of the True Phoenix","paragraphs":["Chapter 4340: Lair of the True Phoenix","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Go on.” The Saint from the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan led the way, wanting to enter into the passageway.","However, he had only taken one step when he stopped. It was not that he had changed his mind at the last minute, but rather that he had been blocked by an invisible force.","He had a feeling that if he tried to be stubborn, he would be torn to shreds.","When the Imperial Weapon awakened, he would naturally be safe. However, the problem was that a Saint couldn’t keep the Imperial Weapon in a constant awakened state. Thus, he definitely couldn’t be stubborn.","This was most likely the Great Emperor killing formation. Even though it could only act as a static defense, it was a hundred times more terrifying than the Imperial Weapon.","Saints couldn’t enter, and when the Venerate Tiers tried, their expressions also changed drastically.","Right, even Venerate Tiers wouldn’t be able to.","Then what about Sect Masters?","It still wouldn’t work.","It wasn’t until the Spirit Transformation Tiers took their turn, that they weren’t affected by the Great Emperor killing formation, allowing them to pass safely.","The Spiritual Transformation Tier was fine, the True Self Tier was fine, and even slightly lower cultivation level could enter.","In other words, this Great Emperor killing formation only placed a maximum limit on cultivation level, and had no requirements for the minimum level.","Ling Han’s heart calmed. Without a Sect Master elite competing with him, even if he was no match for a Seventh Change or Eighth Change when he encountered them, he would still be able to escape easily, and would not have to depend on the Star Steps.","It could be imagined that in this lair of the True Phoenix, ley lines should not exist.","Everyone entered one after another, and those Golden Generation elites that had long since advanced into Sect Master Tier looked livid.","Such a great opportunity, and they could only watch helplessly as it passed them by?","To say nothing of the fact that the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the other clans couldn’t possibly share their gains with them, even if it was from their own clan, who didn’t want to become Emperor? Would they take it out to share?","Thus, they could only miss out on this great opportunity.","“Humph!” The Golden Generation elites all flicked their sleeves before turning around to leave.","They had lost blood essence for nothing, yet it was only paving the way for others. They were furious.","...","Ling Han walked in front, while Ding Shu was the last. After walking for a long time, they suddenly felt a powerful suction force. Even Ling Han was unable to resist. With a xiu, they were all sucked in.","Instantly, their figures sped up, and the scene that they saw also underwent a massive change. The stars and the sun flashed past them like a revolving lantern1.","“Aiyo!”","Their bodies suddenly trembled, and they were sent flying.","Where was this?","They looked around, and saw that this was actually a primeval forest. Huge trees grew everywhere. These trees were very strange. The trunks were crimson red, and the leaves that grew were like flames. There was clearly no wind, but every single leaf was flickering and burning.","They came closer to take a look, and saw that the leaves of this tree were really flames. However, the strange thing was that though the leaves were burning flames, the tree trunk did not look like it was burning at all.","Huala, right at this moment, endless flames suddenly boiled from the forest, soaring into the skies.","No, these weren’t flames, but rather firebirds!","These birds were all formed from flames, and as they flapped their wings, they released strange screeches as they swooped towards Ling Han and the others.","Everyone hurriedly counterattacked, but the moment they came into contact, they felt tremendous pressure.","These firebirds weren’t difficult to kill, but what was terrifying was that when they were burnt to death, they would all self-explode. Terrifying energy surged, capable of easily burning a Spirit Transformation Tier elite to severe injury.","One or two was still fine, but the point was that there were too many fire birds here. If they exploded in groups, that would be terrifying.","To say nothing of Ling Han, even Spirit Transformation Tier elites such as Di Luo and the others couldn’t withstand it. They immediately turned around and fled.","However, firstly, the path of return was already gone. They had been sucked in, and secondly, even if the path that they had come from was stil there, they would not leave. Oh, they had just entered, and were already chased off, and they still wanted the secret technique of the True Phoenix?","Thus, everyone fled in all directions. At this time, it was naturally themselves that was most important, so how could they have the time to care about others?","Ling Han protected the empress and the others as they retreated. Ding Shu was his capable assistant while the perverted pig barely managed to avoid being a burden for them.. As for the others, because the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and the others hadn’t stepped into the Spirit Transformation Tier yet, they didn’t dare to make a move at all. Otherwise, if the firebird exploded beside them, that would really be a suicidal action.","As the group battled, they retreated, leaving the forest far behind. Only when a large river appeared ahead of them did those fire birds finally give up their pursuit, and turned around to return.","Everyone examined themselves, and all of them were injured.","Ling Han and Ding Shu were the main force, so they naturally bore the brunt of it. Meanwhile, the empress, the large black dog, and the others were affected because their cultivation level was too low. Merely being affected by the flames that had exploded from the firebird was enough to cause them serious injury.","They had gained some time to catch their breath, and hurriedly stopped to rest.","Thankfully, everyone had cultivated the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique. This was Body Arts, which also had astonishing effects on healing injuries. As long as their foundations were not damaged, they could still recover very quickly.","Ling Han was the first to finish resting. He stood up and explored the surrounding environment.","Soon, his attention was focused on that great river.","Previously, he had not had the time to pay attention, but from the look of things now, Ling Han couldn’t help but bare his teeth, because this was not a river, but rather surging lava!","He walked closer, and saw that there were seals continuously popping up in the lava. That was the concentrated energy of high-level flames. If he was burned, he would definitely be in trouble.","It was said that the True Phoenix had passed away in the True Phoenix’s lair. Thus, was the forest of flames and river of lava formed from the Regulations of the True Phoenix after its death?","That was the level of a Great Emperor, so no matter how powerful it was, it was understandable.","Yi?","Ling Han looked ahead, only to see that there was actually a small mountain floating in the lava river.","What kind of mountain was this, that it could actually not be melted by the lava?","Ling Han was very curious. This was no ordinary lava, but rather the condensation of high-level energy, which could easily burn Divine Metal.","Treasure?","He walked in the direction up course of the flow of the river, heading towards that small mountain.","One was going down the river’s course, while the other was going up the river’s course. Naturally, they met very quickly.","Now that they were closer, Ling Han naturally could see more clearly. This small mountain was shaped like a regular ball, but it was not rounded, and was exuding an ancient aura.","However, was there really something strange about this?","Ling Han activated his eye technique, wanting to see clearly. However, the power of the boiling flames blocked his vision, and he couldn’t see clearly.","Hua!","Right at this moment, the river of lava suddenly boiled, and a large amount of crimson lava was poured out, falling towards Ling Han.","Ling Han retreated quickly. With a swoosh, the lava landed on the bank, immediately burning fiercely.","Boom, a massive soundwave rippled out, and that small mountain suddenly rose up. Then, a massive pillar was seen crashing towards Ling Han.","This wasn’t a pillar.","This time, Ling Han could clearly see that what was floating in the river wasn’t a small mountain at all, but a fire turtle!","Presently, it was precisely this fire turtle that was attacking him. With a stomp, its skin was covered with dark red divine patterns.","Boom!"]},{"number":4341,"title":"Chapter 4341: Swarm of bees","paragraphs":["Chapter 4341: Swarm of bees","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han rapidly retreated.","This fire turtle was at the peak stage of the Spirit Transformation Tier, and it was at least on the level of the Sixth Change or even the Seventh Change. If he faced it head-on, he would only be making things difficult for himself.","Boom, the fire turtle’s leg stomped down, shaking the ground madly.","The large fellow missed its target, and immediately emerged from the river of lava, chasing after Ling Han.","“Ha, you’re getting more excited?” Ling Han chuckled lightly, and a murderous aura burst forth.","Weng, the fire turtle’s movements instantly paused.","Even if you are Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change or Seventh Change, so what? As long as one didn’t have a special technique or a treasure that could block spiritual attacks, they would still be hit.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to slash out with the divine saber. Wrapped in a cold, high-level energy, it just happened to be the complete opposite of the fire turtle’s attributes.","Pu!","The divine saber struck, but the fire turtle didn’t even sway, showing its terrifying defense.","Turtle had always been synonymous with high defense, and it was indeed true.","On the other side, the fire turtle also recovered from the barrage of murderous aura, and stepped over again.","Ling Han still didn’t face it head-on. This time, he used the black light of illusion, immediately stopping the fire turtle’s movements.","Though this fire turtle’s cultivation level was above Ling Han’s, its Spiritual Power was not all that impressive. Otherwise, even if it had been hit, the effects should not have been able to last for so long.","The heavens were just, bestowing on the Turtle Race an incredibly tough outer shell, but the soul was relatively much weaker.","Relying on the two spirit-level secret techniques, Ling Han battled with the fire turtle, not falling into a disadvantage at all. However, the fire turtle’s powerful defense also took effect, preventing Ling Han from wounding it.","This battle was boring. Ling Han feinted and turned to run.","The fire turtle only gave chase for a while, then stopped, turned and left, returning to the river of lava.","Ling Han returned to where the empress and the others were. At this time, they had mostly recovered.","“Let’s go.”","“Where are we going?”","“Let’s walk against the flow of this lava river.”","The True Phoenix was of the Fire Element, so it was extremely likely that the end of this lava river was related to the True Phoenix. In fact, it was even possible that it was born from the True Phoenix.","They did not get too close. There may be other fire turtles in the lava river. This kind of fierce beast had thick hide, and was really not easy to deal with.","They had not walked too far, when they felt waves of heat surge towards them. They could clearly see that there were sparks floating in the air. No wonder the temperature had begun to spike.","Everyone hurriedly raised their mystical power shields. Firstly, it was to resist the high temperature, and secondly, these sparks were extremely terrifying, posing a threat to them.","And even if they had put up the mystical power shield, after getting hit by the sparks, cracks soon appeared on the mystical power shield, which then shattered.","They had no choice but to decrease their speed to reduce the intensity of the sparks that they had to sustain.","“It’s so hot.” Ling Han, Ding Shu, and the perverted pig were all fine, but the empress and the others were all covered in sweat.","It made sense for this place to allow cultivators of the Spiritual Transformation Tier to enter. Those at the True Self Tier and Cauldron Forging Tier could indeed enter, but against such high temperatures, how many people would be able to resist?","Only the little red bird was like a fish in water. She was born with a natural love for fire, and not only did she not feel the slightest bit of discomfort, she instead seemed to feel very comfortable.","They continued to advance. As long as they could withstand it, they might as well challenge their own limits, which would be helpful in cultivation.","After walking for a few more days, they had not yet reached the end of the lava river, when they saw that a large field of flowers had appeared on their right side, fiery red in colour.","“Is that... the Flower of Flames?” Everyone looked over, and they all looked surprised.","This kind of plant was only knee-height in height. Its roots were like blood jade, and had no leaves. There were only flowers blooming on its top, bright red like fire. Furthermore, they were also flickering like flames.","When they got a little closer, everyone could feel the waves of fire rolling out, easily disintegrating the mystical power shield.","“Come, let’s go take a look,” Ding Shu said to Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, then looked towards the lecherous pig, “Together?”","“Wu!” The perverted pig hurriedly shook its head. It was best not to call it over for this kind of thing. If it was an invitation to go out to eat, drink, and have fun, it would gladly agree.","However, the little red bird flapped its wings and landed on Ling Han’s shoulder.","“Hey, is it appropriate for you to stand on your Master’s shoulder?” Ling Han turned his head and asked.","The little red bird pouted proudly, and did not reply.","The two of them advanced, their speed not very fast, because the closer they were to the continuous expanse of flowers, the more astonishing the waves of fire would be, causing even them to be slightly wary, and not dare to run too fast.","However, the little red bird was completely unafraid. It flapped its wings again and flew into the flower field.","This was the awesomeness of bloodline. It had a natural affinity with flames, that had nothing to do with its cultivation level.","Weng, above the flower field, fiery red Regulations would occasionally appear.","These were Regulations of Fire, and their level was considerably high, causing both Ling Han and Ding Shu to be dumbfounded. If they came into contact with them, they would probably be burnt to death in an instant.","They circled around the flower field, wanting to see if there was anything special about it. However, because they couldn’t approach, and couldn’t go deeper, they naturally didn’t discover anything.","“Let’s go.”","The two of them said at the same time. They couldn’t tell what was going on here.","They turned around, and just as they were about to return, they saw the little red bird fly up from the distance. Then, as if it was fleeing for its life, it shot towards them.","Then, they saw a large mass of fiery red things soar into the air, chasing after the little red bird.","“Save me!” the little red bird shouted as it flew.","Ling Han focused his gaze. This fiery red thing was a swarm of bees, and every single one of them was the size of a fist. However, their numbers were endless, and there were still a great many that were flying out of the flower field.","These swarms of bees had been harvesting honey, and in the end, they were alerted by the little red bird?","“Run!” Without another word, Ling Han immediately turned around and fled.","Ding Shu didn’t try to be brave either, and he similarly broke into a run.","These swarms of bees were all at the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Even if Ling Han and Ding Shu were freakishly powerful, firstly, they had just advanced to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, after all. Secondly, even if both sides were at the same cultivation level, they would only be able to fight against a thousand opponents at most.","The numbers of the swarms of bees?","As far as they could see, there were at least tens of thousands of them, what more when there was still an endless swarm of bees flying out.","Block?","How were they supposed to block this?","Neither Ling Han nor Ding Shu ran towards the empress and the others. If they attracted the swarm of bees there, the casualties would be great.","“Little Red Bird, what did you do?” Ling Han asked as he ran.","Had it dug up their ancestral grave? Otherwise, how could it have caused such a huge commotion?","“No, I just flew over to take a look. Who knew that these demonic bees would attack me indiscriminately?” the little red bird said very aggrievedly. She was also very depressed.","They ran madly, but these swarms of bees did not stop their pursuit just because they were too far away, and continued to pursue them relentlessly.","“F***!” Ding Shu was enraged. He turned around and shot out a murderous aura attack.","Instantly, weng, weng, weng! The demonic bees that were in the lead all fell straight down onto the ground.","But it was not of much use. The demonic bees behind them followed, endlessly.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4342,"title":"Chapter 4342: Stealing honey","paragraphs":["Chapter 4342: Stealing honey","Editor: Henyee Translations","“F***, damn bird, what sins have you committed!” Ding Shu couldn’t help but complain.","The little red bird was speechless. She really hadn’t done anything.","Ling Han grabbed the little red bird and threw it away.","Xiu, the little red bird deviated from its original course, and headed diagonally to the side.","It could be seen very clearly that the swarm of bees immediately changed their course, and all of them set off in pursuit of the little red bird. Not one of them charged towards Ling Han and Ding Shu at all.","As expected.","Ling Han dashed over, catching up to the little red bird and grabbing onto it.","The little red bird: “...”","‘You’re having a lot of fun.’","“As expected, you’re not a good bird,” Ding Shu immediately said.","Just look, the swarm of bees are targeting you, and you still claim that it wasn’t you who dug up their ancestral grave?","Meanwhile, the little red bird was extremely depressed. She was really very innocent.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head and said, “The swarm of bees has indeed targeted Little Red. However, it’s extremely likely because they discovered her bloodline.”","The True Phoenix and Vermillion Bird were both Divine Beasts, and they both belonged to the Fire Element, so the two had something in common.","Perhaps, this was the reason.","“No matter what the reason is, it looks like the swarm has high hopes for this little bird,” Ding Shu said. “Why don’t we just toss her back?”","When the little red bird heard this, it was so scared that it spread its wings and wrapped them around Ling Han’s wrist. It wouldn’t let go even if it died.","Ling Han turned around to look. The swarm of bees blotted out the sky and covered the earth, and there was practically no end in sight.","‘You really think I can’t deal with you guys?’","Ling Han retrieved the Great Emperor Horn, and forcefully blew on it.","A soundless wave rippled out, and instantly, the swarm of bees paused, then howled at the sky.","A group of demonic bees suddenly imitated the howls of wolves. What kind of scene was this?","In any case, Ding Shu and the little red bird were both dumbfounded, their faces twitching.","This scene, f***.","Not only them, but even the swarm itself was quite dumbfounded.","What was going on?","They were the Bee Race, so why had they howled like wolves? What reason was there? Was there something wrong with their brains?","Or could it be that our ancestors actually have the bloodline of the Wolf Tribe?","Of course, the difficult problem of reproduction could be set aside for the moment.","After a pause, the swarm of bees gave chase again.","Just see if I won’t scare you guys off!","Ling Han continued to blow, and the swarm of bees instantly howled like wolves again.","“This thing is so useful!” Ding Shu was envious. He had seen Ling Han use this precious tool in the Dark Clouds Hell. At the time, even Venerate Tiers would be affected, and now, he was facing mere Spirit Transformation Tiers, so it was naturally more impossible for them to be a match.","“Lend it to me for a few days?” he asked.","“Hehe.” Ling Han naturally wouldn’t agree.","And just like that, they continued to blow the Great Emperor Horn to stop the swarm of bees. The distance between the two sides became larger and larger, and finally, they managed to successfully break free.","“Hu!” Ling Han and Ding Shu both breathed a sigh of relief. There were hundreds of thousands of these bees, and even they felt a headache coming on.","After a short rest, Ling Han looked towards Ding Shu, and Ding Shu was also looking towards Ling Han.","“Is what you’re thinking exactly what I’m thinking?” the two of them asked at about the same time.","“Haha!” They laughed loudly.","Meanwhile, the little red bird shrugged its shoulders and flapped its wings. Men were truly strange creatures. The words they spoke were all baffling.","The two of them turned around and headed towards the flower field.","“Oi, oi, oi!” The little red bird was extremely anxious. They had just barely managed to break free from the swarm, so what was the point of them going back?","“Where there are bees, there will be honey!” Ling Han said with a smile. “Those are Spirit Transformation Tier-level demonic bees, and the honey they produce, tsk tsk!”","Ding Shu also licked his lips, and looked tempted.","This kind of honey was definitely very nutritious.","“Are you all crazy?” the little red bird shouted.","The swarm of bees was terrifying in number. Once they were surrounded, they would definitely be done for. Oh, they had just barely managed to escape, and you guys actually want to run back on your own?","‘I’ve never seen anyone like you before.’","“Then I’m not going to accompany you!” the little red bird said. It hurriedly flapped its wings and fled.","“Hehe, be loyal!” Ling Han grabbed the little red bird, not allowing her to escape.","—The little red bird was unafraid of the Regulations of Fire. In this place, she could go deeper into some places that they could not enter. How could such a good helper be wasted?","The little red bird chirped strangely, and was about to curse. However, how could it compare to Ling Han’s strength? It was tightly gripped.","The two of them returned, and soon arrived near the field of flowers.","“Let’s find out where the beehive is.”","The two of them surveyed the surroundings, while they released their spiritual bodies to increase the efficiency of their search.","After a while, Ding Shu made a discovery.","They walked over, and saw that there was a massive beehive growing on top of a rock.","This beehive was really huge. It was practically a small-scale castle. It was completely fiery red in colour, and there was also lava-like liquid flowing out of the nest. Without even coming close, they could feel a powerful wave of heat assaulting them.","Ling Han and Ding Shu were also unable to approach. That fiery red liquid should have been manifested by the Regulations of Fire, and had surpassed the level that they could touch at present. They could not block it at all.","Hence — both of them looked towards the little red bird.","“Hey, hey, hey, what do you mean by looking at me like that?” The little red bird suddenly felt a strong sense of foreboding.","Ling Han chuckled, “Little Red, do I treat you well?”","“If you suddenly ask this, how am I supposed to answer!” the little red bird said coyly. Honestly, Ling Han was still quite nice to her. Though he forcibly considered himself her Master, he did not really treat her like a servant. Furthermore, he gave her as much Divine Metal of all types as she wanted.","“Now, it’s time for you to show your worth.” Ling Han pointed at the beehive.","“F***, you’re not going to ask me to steal honey, are you?” The little red bird bristled, and hurriedly shook its head vigorously.","“You’re right.” Ling Han nodded.","“I don’t want to die at all!” the little red bird shouted.","“I’m not sending you to your death. I’m just harvesting some honey. Look at how agitated you are,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The little red bird rolled its eyes madly. Was this just plucking some honey? That was going deep into the wolves’ den!","“I’m not going!” She refused to agree.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and the little red bird instantly had a bad premonition.","“What do you want?” the little red bird asked in a trembling voice.","Ling Han raised his hand and threw it. Xiu, the little red bird was thrown out.","The little red bird was about to cry. This was the second time, b@stard!","Pa, the little red bird directly crashed into the beehive.","If it had been Ling Han or Ding Shu, they would probably have been burnt to death by now. However, though the little red bird’s cultivation level was low, it was born with a natural affinity for flames, so this was no big deal. It was just a little dizzy from the impact.","Weng, at this moment, at least over a thousand demonic bees rushed out, all of them exuding vicious might.","“Save me!” The little red bird hurriedly ran back.","Ling Han took out the Great Emperor Horn, and blew it strongly. Instantly, the swarm of bees all stopped, and then howled at the sky.","This scene, tsk tsk.","However, the little red bird flew back in a flash, and did not stop at all. It continued to flap its wings, wanting to leave Ling Han and Ding Shu, the two maniacs, far behind.","“Hehe!” Ding Shu moved, and grabbed the little red bird back. Then, he threw it back at the beehive.","Pa, the little red bird was once again dizzy from the impact.","This was the third time, and while there were some things that could be tolerated, there were some things that could not.","—"]},{"number":4343,"title":"Chapter 4343: Opening the doors to the palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4343: Opening the doors to the palace","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, the little red bird even wanted to commit murder. It secretly swore that as long as her cultivation level surpassed Ling Han and Ding Shu, it would definitely use the two of them as punching bags every day.","Of course, she was also prepared now, and knew that it was useless even if she ran back. Those two rough guys didn’t know how to treat a female tenderly at all!","As she lamented the hardship of her life, she began to harvest the honey.","One after another, Ling Han continued to blow the horn of the Great Emperor, causing the swarm of bees to howl like wolves endlessly.","Hence, in truth, the little red bird was not the slightest bit endangered. Though it looked very frightening from the surface, and she was surrounded by furious demonic bees, they would occasionally raise their heads and howl like a wolf. Taking a moment to savor it, it was actually still very comical.","Not long after, the little red bird had already emptied the beehive, and hurriedly ran back.","“Are you satisfied now?” The little red bird threw the honey at Ling Han, looking very angry.","Ling Han put away the honey, and stroked the little red bird’s head, “This little guy is quite capable.”","Damn it!","The little red bird really wanted to turn Ling Han bald with a single breath of fire. She was the daughter of a Divine Beast, and who knew how precious she was.","“Stop playing, let’s retreat quickly,” Ding Shu said.","Without the suppression of the Great Emperor Horn, these demonic bees that had their home base dug out were already about to go crazy.","“Run!”","The two of them hurriedly fled, while using the Great Emperor Horn to delay their pursuers, successfully shaking off the swarm of bees.","After going around in a circle, they found the empress and the others.","“Where did you guys go?” Hu Niu asked.","“Big Sister Niu Niu!” The little red bird hurriedly pounced over, and immediately began to tell on Ling Han. It chattered endlessly, and spoke at an extraordinarily fast speed, recounting how Ling Han had “abused” her.","“Big Sister Niu Niu, you have to seek justice for me!” she said coquettishly.","“Whatever Niu’s Ling Han wants you to do, you’ll do.” Hu Niu said with a very strange expression. She really didn’t know where the little red bird’s resentment came from.","The little red bird: “...”","‘You two are truly a family. I’m impressed!’","“Come, there’s something good.” Ling Han took out some honey, and everyone had a share.","—Most people were only at the True Self Tier, so a single piece of honey was enough for them to refine for a very long time.","“Refine it first,” Ling Han said. “Although only Spirit Transformation Tier-level vicious beasts have appeared so far, there are too many of them. At present, we are still unable to resist.”","Thus, every bit of strength that could be increased would be useful.","Everyone nodded, and began to refine it.","After a month, all the honey had been consumed, and everyone’s strength had improved greatly.","The little azure dragon had already cultivated to the Ninth Form, but the large black dog couldn’t break through the restrictions of the Eighth Form no matter what. It couldn’t be helped. Although it had also obtained a lot of opportunities, it could only match the Golden Generation at most, but couldn’t surpass it.","Actually, this was already awesome enough. However, compared with Ling Han and Ding Shu=, it seemed to pale in colour.","Ling Han also successfully advanced into the Spirit Transformation Tier. Now that he had two spiritual bodies, his battle prowess increased greatly.","Ding Shu was not outdone either. He had actually surpassed Ling Han, and had similarly advanced into the Second Change.","“What a good thing,” Ling Han said ruefully. “If we empty out a few more beehives, we’ll be able to soar to the peak stage of the Spiritual Transformation Tier.”","When the little red bird heard this, it involuntarily took a few steps back.","F***, were they planning to have designs on her again?","“Come, let’s set out.”","They continued to advance along the lava river, and after walking for about seven days, a palace actually appeared ahead of them. It was completely crimson red, as if it was burning.","“The habitat of the True Phoenix?” Everyone showed an expression of delight.","However, this was too smooth, wasn’t it? They had found it just like that?","They continued to walk forwards, and soon arrived at the great doors of the palace.","However, the palace doors were tightly shut, and a large number of people had gathered in the plaza in front of the palace doors. They were all the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters who had entered this time.","By the looks of it, no one could open the palace doors, so everyone was blocked outside.","However, because they suspected that the inheritance of the True Phoenix was here, no one was willing to give up and leave.","“Ling Han!” A cold rebuke rang out, and one of the Imperial Sons looked towards Ling Han.","One of the well-known members of the Silver Generation, Yi Xiangyang of the Blood Flame Imperial Clan, Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change!","He was Di Luo’s good friend, so when he found out that Di Luo had been humiliated by Ling Han, he was naturally furious.","“I’ve finally found you!” He moved directly, launching an attack at Ling Han.","They were all in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, so even if he killed Ling Han in public, the Nine Suns Saint wouldn’t be able to say anything.","The words of a Saint were naturally like the Regulations. If one disobeyed, they would be punished by the heavens.","Ling Han let out a battle cry and charged towards Yi Xiangyang.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them exchanged blows, but the moment they came into contact, Ling Han was at a complete disadvantage.","The Seventh Change was far too powerful. Not only did he have a crushing advantage over Ling Han in terms of power, but he also had seven spiritual bodies. Thus, the boost to his battle prowess was far too great.","Weng, right at this moment, the cracks in the tiles in the plaza lit up at the same time. Instantly, no one dared to move again. Even Yi Xiangyang suddenly stopped his attack, and stood on a tile.","“Watch your steps.” Ling Han immediately transmitted a message to the empress and the others, “Don’t place your foot over two floor tiles.”","The empress and the others naturally wouldn’t ignore Ling Han’s words, and they all acted accordingly.","Weng, the light in the crevices in the tiles suddenly rose up, which was equivalent to instantly dividing this plaza into tens of thousands of squares.","Ling Han merely swept an eye over these rays of light, and felt a strong sense of fear.","This was definitely capable of instantly piercing through his physique.","No wonder even Yi Xiangyang had stopped attacking. Otherwise, he would have been dismembered.","The beam of light rose to the height of half a human, then stopped.","At this time, everyone was sprawled out on the ground.","When Ling Han saw this, he immediately crouched down as well. There was no need to issue any further commands. The empress and the others followed suit.","Shua, the light that had risen began to spin, as if it was stirring.","If anyone was still standing at this moment, they would definitely be sliced in half.","These rays of light channelled endlessly, and kept changing shapes. However, the people here seemed to be familiar with it, and could always react in advance. Thus, it was a close call.","After about ten minutes, these beams of light disappeared.","Boom!","Yi Xiangyang charged over once more. This was not the academy grounds. In a competition over treasures in ancient sites, casualties and injuries were inevitable, and he did not have to bear any responsibility.","Ling Han didn’t take it head-on. The gap in cultivation level was really too wide.","Retreat.","Hong long long, right at this moment, a loud sound was heard, and the doors to the palace actually opened!","Yi?","At this moment, everyone withdrew their gazes from the battle between Ling Han and Yi Xiangyang, and looked towards the inside of the palace.","However, it was pitch-black inside, and nothing could be seen clearly.","Ling Han looked over, only to see the innocent little red bird standing at the entrance. It was she who had opened the palace doors just then.","—This little bird was incredibly eager to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix. Thus, she quietly ran to the doors of the palace, wanting to sneak in. Unexpectedly, the doors were unexpectedly opened.","Perhaps it was because of her bloodline.","As if fearing that Ling Han would reprimand it, the little red bird covered its mouth and hurriedly ran into the palace."]},{"number":4344,"title":"Chapter 4344: Nine Star Saint Bird","paragraphs":["Chapter 4344: Nine Star Saint Bird","Editor: Henyee Translations","With her fleeing, the others naturally could no longer hold themselves back. They all followed, and rushed into the palace.","“Humph!” Yi Xiangyang swept a cold glance at Ling Han before turning around to leave. He dashed into the palace.","He was an elite among those who had entered into the lair of the True Phoenix this time, and his abilities could be ranked in the top ten. Thus, he had a very high chance of obtaining the inheritance of the True Phoenix. In comparison, this was naturally more important. As for killing Ling Han, that could be left for later.","Most importantly, his major tier in cultivation level was the same as Ling Han’s. If Ling Han was determined to run, it would be very difficult for him to catch up to him.","The empress and the others all walked over. Ding Shu asked, “Shall we go in and play as well?”","Ling Han smiled, “Since we’re already here, we naturally have to go in.”","“That damn bird can actually open the palace?” the little azure dragon asked curiously. “Perhaps she lied? In fact, she’s not Vermillion Bird’s descendant, but the daughter of the True Phoenix?”","It was possible.","Firstly, no one had seen her original form. Secondly, she could obviously travel freely in this place, and the Regulations of Flames could not harm her. Perhaps, it was precisely because of her True Phoenix bloodline. Thirdly, the swarm of bees previously had been targeting her, probably wanting to devour her bloodline.","Fourthly, this was even more obvious. She had opened the doors to the palace that even the Imperial Sons could not open.","“After we capture her, we have to interrogate her properly,” Ling Han said with a nod.","They walked forwards, and soon arrived at the entrance of the palace.","After hesitating for a moment, Ling Han stepped forward and entered the palace.","From the outside, it was pitch-black inside, but after entering, he discovered that this place was completely bright.","This palace was very empty, and only thick pillars could be seen. It was unknown what stone they were made of, but they were exuding a faint red light. Furthermore, all kinds of patterns were engraved on these stone pillars.","Though the images were different, they had one thing in common. In every image, there was a giant purple eagle. It was either battling in the skies, descending into the Nine Seas to catch giant turtles, or being worshipped by thousands of birds.","“This shouldn’t be the Palace of the True Phoenix,” Ling Han said.","“En.” Everyone nodded.","If it was the Palace of the True Phoenix, then the main character in the stone carvings should be the True Phoenix, and not this giant purple eagle.","“Perhaps this is a subordinate of the True Phoenix,” the large black dog guessed.","This made a lot of sense. The True Phoenix was a Divine Beast, and it was an outstanding talent at that, being able to stand side by side with the True Dragon. Thus, it was very normal for it to take in a few powerful lackeys.","“Then it should be Saint-level.” Everyone deduced.","Another Divine Beast?","Impossible!","Though there were definitely differences in strength among Ancestral Kings, which one of those that could advance into this level was not proud and arrogant? Even in the ancient times, when the Divine Beasts coexisted, it was impossible that any Divine Beast would be willing to submit to another.","“Who knows what good stuff there would be.” The little azure dragon rubbed its hands together, its thieving eyes shining.","“Let’s look around.”","This palace was very big. When a few dozen people entered, it was like a few drops of water had been dripped into a lake, and they had instantly disappeared without a trace.","Ling Han and the others didn’t split up. There were many Spiritual Transformation Tier elites here, and there were even Silver Generation elites like Yi Xiangyang. If they faced them alone, the space here would be limited, and it would be difficult for them to escape. It was very likely that they would be killed.","They were very careful. After all, there were enemies everywhere.","Xiu, a red shadow flashed, as if a fiery flame was flying towards them.","Ling Han didn’t dodge. Instead, he reached over to grab it.","A small red bird was instantly caught by him. It could only flap its wings in vain, unable to struggle free at all.","Wasn’t this Zhu Hongyi?","“Hehehe!”","“Heng, heng, heng!”","Everyone rubbed their fists together. This little red bird was really too unfriendly. It had secretly gone to open the palace doors, and actually did not even inform them.","The little red bird knew that it was in the wrong, and said shamelessly with a smile, “Everyone, don’t be too excited. We can talk things out.”","“We’ll beat you up first,” the large black dog jeered.","“I surrender, I surrender!” The little red bird took out a key, “I just have to hand over what I have obtained, all right?”","Ling Han took the key and examined it carefully. He shook his head. There was nothing special about the key itself, so it seemed that only the corresponding door could possibly contain something valuable.","“Let’s go. There’s nothing left here,” the little red bird said.","“How do you know?” the large black dog asked.","“I obtained the formation hub of this palace, so I naturally know,” the little red bird said proudly.","So that was how it was.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, “Are there any mechanisms or restrictions here?”","“Of course.” The little red bird nodded.","“Little Han!” The large black dog’s eyes lit up.","Ling Han snickered, “Let’s go and trick those people!”","If they wanted to control the formations in the palace, they would definitely have to control the hub. Led by the little red bird, they headed to the second floor of the palace.","On the way, the little red bird also talked about the origins of this palace.","The giant purple eagle was a great general subordinate to the True Phoenix in the past. It was a Nine Star Divine BIrd, and its battle prowess was terrifyingly strong. It was only a sliver away from the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","It was a shame that there hadn’t been any cultivation techniques in that era. Thus, the Purple Eagle had only managed to advance from the level of One Star Divine Bird to the level of Nine Stars in the end. It hadn’t reached the level of Emperor Tier.","“This is also an awesome existence,” the little azure dragon said. “There’s also a mountain of difference among Saints. It’s child’s play for a nine-star Saint to kill a one-star Saint.”","Because the little red bird was the descendant of the Vermillion Bird, its bloodline was somewhat similar to that of the True Phoenix. Thus, she was able to open the palace doors here, and successfully obtain the approval of this Purple Eagle Palace Hall. She could control it, and also learnt so much information because of that.","They soon arrived at the second floor of the palace, and found a room that was not very eye-catching.","However, there was a person searching everywhere in the room.","Xu Youque.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. Enemies were really bound to meet on a narrow road.","Sensing that someone was approaching, Xu Youque also stopped searching, and turned to look towards Ling Han. When he discovered that it was this old enemy, he couldn’t help but reveal a hint of wariness in his expression.","“Apologies, I was the one who discovered it first!” he said calmly. As a member of the Silver Generation, he still had this bit of composure. “If you want to come in, fine. Wait until I get out.”","“It’s fine. If I kill you, there won’t be any problem,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Xu Youque couldn’t help but explode in anger, saying, “Ling Han, you’re far too arrogant! Who knows how many Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters are here? If you dare to kill them, you’ll definitely be punished!”","Ling Han nodded and said, “Thank you for your suggestion. It’s not bad. I’ve decided to kill everyone here to prevent them from leaking the secret.”","Xu Youque faltered for a moment before laughing in spite of himself, saying, “You’re far too arrogant. To say nothing of others, even Yi Xiangyang is powerful enough to kill you a hundred times over. Kill him to keep him quiet? What a huge joke!”","“Then just wait and see,” Ling Han said as he lashed out at Xu Youque.","He went all out from the very beginning, and two spiritual bodies walked out of his body respectively.","Xu Youque was only a Spirit Transformation Tier First Change. In a situation when their cultivation levels were equal, he was no match for Ling Han, what more when Ling Han had the advantage of cultivation level.","How was he supposed to continue fighting?"]},{"number":4345,"title":"Chapter 4345: Playing around","paragraphs":["Chapter 4345: Playing around","Editor: Henyee Translations","Under the destructive power of Destructive Energy, Xu Youque was quickly killed. Substitution Seal didn’t have the chance to take effect at all.","Xu Youque died with remaining grievances.","Even at the instant of death, he still didn’t believe that Ling Han would really dare to kill him. Moreover, he didn’t even have the chance to use the Substitution Seal.","“Can I control the formation?” Ling Han asked the little red bird.","The little red bird nodded, and said, “Let me hand the control over to you first.”","In a short while, Ling Han suddenly felt as if he had fused into this palace. At the same time, it was as if this palace had become an extension of his body.","It was a little similar to controlling Earth Qi.","This was a piece of cake for Ling Han. With a single thought, his divine sense seemed to have covered the entire palace.","He discovered that a great many people were presently heading in his direction.","Clearly, though he had not spent too much time killing Xu Youque just now, it had still alerted some people.","He also saw Yi Xiangyang, but when he turned his attention to Yi Xiangyang, the latter also stopped what he was doing, revealing a suspicious expression.","Obviously, he had sensed something off.","As expected of a Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change. His senses were truly powerful.","“Stop,” Ling Han murmured softly. He controlled the formation, and instantly, it was as if the people who rushed over had encountered ghosts building walls1. No matter how they walked, they would only be going around in circles.","He smiled faintly. He didn’t care about the others, but he wanted to settle a score with Yi Xiangyang.","On the other side.","Yi Xiangyang frowned slightly. He sensed that he was being monitored, but when he swept his gaze around, he did not discover anything.","Was it his misconception?","A thought flashed in his mind, and he shouted, “Come out, don’t think that you can hide your tracks in front of me!”","After a rebuke, there was no unusual movement in the surroundings.","Not falling for it?","Yi Xiangyang pondered for a moment. Could it be that he had really misunderstood?","Pa, pa, pa! Right at this moment, he heard footsteps.","Heh, he finally lost his cool and came out on his own.","Yi Xiangyang smirked coldly, then turned around, and looked behind him.","This person’s whole body was enshrouded in black cloth. Every step he took was very slow, but the sound of his footsteps was extremely heavy.","“Who are you? How dare you spy on me, an Imperial Son!” Yi Xiangyang shouted in a deep voice, appearing very displeased.","He was no ordinary Imperial Son, but rather a Silver Generation elite, and one of the strongest among them. He was close to advancing into the ranks of Sect Masters—once he became a Minor Advanced Tier elite, he would be crowned with the title of “great elite”.","The mysterious person was unmoved, and continued onwards.","Yi Xiangyang was furious, and shot out a punch, which turned into a blazing ball of light that shot towards the mysterious person.","This mysterious person had absolutely no intention of parrying or dodging this attack. Peng, he was instantly hit, and that black cloth was immediately turned into pieces, that fluttered around like butterflies.","It was resolved so easily?","Yi Xiangyang frowned, and instead became serious.","That was because it was completely empty beneath the black cloth, and there was no one there at all.","What was going on here?","To play with him like he was in the palm of his hand, who exactly was the mastermind behind all this? Furthermore, he was too outrageously bold, to actually dare to toy with even him!","Yi Xiangyang was extremely cautious. This person didn’t come with good intentions. Moreover, this was a Mystery Realm, so there were unfathomable dangers lurking around. Thus, it was best to remain cautious.","Only after a while, the sound of footsteps was heard again. Then, a person covered in a black cloth walked over.","Again!","Yi Xiangyang couldn’t help but feel enraged. ‘Have you become addicted to toying around with others?’","He threw another punch, and without a doubt, the black cloth shattered, and there was nothing inside.","“Who’s acting pretentious here!” Yi Xiangyang shouted loudly, his anger already soaring.","However, pa, pa, pa. Footsteps were heard again, and it was still that mysterious “person” that was shrouded in black cloth.","Yi Xiangyang naturally moved without any reservations, destroying it, but the result was still the same. He did not see anyone.","He couldn’t help but frown. Who exactly was the mastermind?","Again and again it happened; he became irritated.","“All right, don’t let me find you. Otherwise, you will die very horribly!” Yi Xiangyang declared harshly, then began his search. He was determined to find the mastermind behind all this.","He actually dared to toy with him? Humph!","However, he immediately paused.","He could not advance any further, because there was an invisible screen blocking his way.","What was going on?","Previously, when he had entered, there was clearly no such barrier.","He tried to break it, but there was nothing he could do.","After stopping for a moment, he turned around and walked towards the other side.","However, he soon stopped again, because he still encountered an invisible barrier.","He was actually trapped here?","“Coward, do you only know how to play tricks in the shadows?” he asked coldly.","Finally, a voice rang out, causing Yi Xiangyang to feel energized.","“If I come out, you will be afraid!”","“Ling, Ling Han?” Yi Xiangyang faltered. This was clearly Ling Han’s voice.","However, Ling Han was clearly only a Spiritual Transformation Tier Second Change cultivator. Whether it was his cultivation level or abilities, he was far inferior to him, so how could he be so elusive?","“You guessed correctly. Unfortunately, there is no reward.” Ling Han’s voice rang out again, “How is it? Are you afraid?”","“Afraid?” Yi Xiangyang couldn’t help but laugh loudly, “If you dare to appear in front of me, I will kill you with my own hands!”","He paused, then continued, “Do you dare?”","“Sure,” Ling Han’s voice rang out.","Multiple rays of light condensed, turning into a human figure that quietly appeared.","“Ling Han, you dare to trick me!” Yi Xiangyang shouted angrily.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Are you too naive, or do you think that I am ridiculously stupid to actually appear personally to battle you?”","“Humph, you should have taken control of the hub here, and that’s why you can be like a god in this place. However, ants are ants after all!” Yi Xiangyang said coldly, “Come out. If you rely on the formation, so what if you win?”","He was trying to goad him into action.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “You are truly shameless. Previously, you dared to shout in front of me, wasn’t it just because your cultivation level was slightly higher than mine? If it was a battle of equal cultivation levels, hoho, there would be no need for equal cultivation levels either. I would just let you have an advantage of two minor levels, and killing you would be as easy as killing a chicken.”","“So, why should I fall for the goading of trash like you?”","Yi Xiangyang was furious. He was a Silver Generation elite, and was already close to catching up to the tail of the Golden Generation. Yet, he was actually looked down on as trash?","“Get out here! Get out here!” he roared.","The human figure formed by the formation had already charged over, and grabbed out at Yi Xiangyang’s head.","“Damn it!” Yi Xiangyang’s expression changed drastically. This was underestimating him too much.","He grabbed the Regulations, which turned into a sharp sword, and slashed out at this human figure.","Peng!","The formation figure grabbed out with its palm, and Yi Xiangyang’s resistance instantly crumbled completely like snow that had encountered boiling soup.","Yi Xiangyang was obliterated with a single strike.","It should be known that this was the Palace of the Saint Bird, so the formation was naturally Saint-level as well. How easy would it be to kill a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator?"]},{"number":4346,"title":"Chapter 4346: Second Palace Hall","paragraphs":["Chapter 4346: Second Palace Hall","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, there were some aspects that even a Saint-level formation could not match Ling Han.","—If he was killed by Ling Han’s Destructive Energy, he would definitely be done for. The Substitution Seal would not be effective either, but it was a different story now. Yi Xiangyang immediately “came back to life”.","He obviously knew that there was no way he could match this formation, and hurriedly tried his best to break out of the siege.","However, this was a Saint-level formation. So what if he was a supreme prodigy? He was completely no match.","In just an instant, he was killed once more.","“Ling—”","“Han!”","He died twice in a row, and only then did he shout out these two words.","Ling Han stopped the formation, “You want to beg for mercy, right? Fine, hand over the Imperial Scroll and I can consider letting you live.”","“In your dreams!” Yi Xiangyang immediately said. The Imperial Scroll was the foundation of an Imperial Clan. Whoever had a deeper grasp of the Imperial Scroll would be able to obtain control of the Imperial Weapon. What kind of concept was that?","He could not possibly become the eternal sinner of the Yi Clan. Furthermore, even if he was willing to hand over the Imperial Scroll, it was not possible. A restriction had been placed on his soul by the Saint of his clan, and he would die if it was touched.","“Moreover, even if you obtain the Imperial Scroll, the clan will still kill you at all costs.”","If this hurt the foundations of the Imperial Clan, then who cares if you have the Nine Mountains Saint or Buddha Doga behind you? Kill, kill, kill, kill. Worse come to worst, they could just hide in the Imperial Clan in the future after the deed. With the dual protection of the Imperial Weapon and the Great Emperor formation, they would naturally be fine.","After all, if he wasn’t a true Great Emperor, there was no way he could break through the dual protection of the Great Emperor formation and the Imperial Weapon.","Ling Han shook his head, “Then what are you still talking about?”","“That’s right, he’s completely worthless!” The large black dog nodded.","“What Silver Generation, ptui!” The little azure dragon also spat.","This infuriated Yi Xiangyang so much that he trembled. However, the formation activated again, easily “killing” him again.","After a few more times, Yi Xiangyang was really getting anxious.","The Substitution Seal was about to be used up.","“We can talk things over peacefully!” he called out loudly, “I can buy my own life!”","Ling Han stopped the formation, and said, “Buy your life? Hehe, once you’re dead, the things on you will naturally be mine, so what need is there for me to place a price on your life?”","“I guarantee that I’ll crush my Spatial Tool before I die. In that case, the things inside will remain in the void forever,” Yi Xiangyang shouted. “Kill me, and you won’t get anything.”","Ling Han shrugged, “If I won’t get anything, then so be it!”","Boom! The formation channeled again.","F***!","Yi Xiangyang wanted to curse. How could he encounter such a character?","The formation surged over, and Yi Xiangyang was killed once more. There was no doubt about it, and now, he no longer had Substitution Seal to use.","He steeled his heart, and pa, he crushed the Spatial Tools he had on him, one after another.","If he died, then Ling Han wouldn’t be able to get any benefits either.","Boom! The formation swept over for the final time, and Yi Xiangyang was finally killed this time. His body was directly crushed into dust.","So what if he was a Silver Generation elite? He had died an extremely worthless death.","Ling Han felt rueful internally. No matter how prodigious you are, so what? In front of some irresistible power, you are so weak that it is practically laughable.","“Let’s go.”","He didn’t pay attention to the other people here. As long as they didn’t offend him, he couldn’t be bothered to target anyone. However, if anyone wanted to kill him, he definitely wouldn’t be merciful.","The group left, continuing to walk along the river of lava. After walking for a few days, they were surprised that the path ahead was blocked.","It was not that there was no path to take, but rather there was an invisible barrier blocking their way.","The scenery ahead could be clearly seen. The lava was also surging, but they were still unable to pass.","Perhaps, after entering into the lava river, they would be able to smoothly swim upstream, but with their present physique, if they were to bear the might of the lava, hoho, they would probably be incinerated into ashes in an instant.","Apart from the little red bird.","“Let’s walk around here.”","They walked around this barrier, and after a few days, another large river of lava actually appeared ahead of them.","“Yi, have we circled around so quickly?” The large black dog asked curiously.","Ling Han observed his surroundings, and shook his head, “That’s not right. We didn’t circle back. This is another lava river.”","Everyone exchanged looks, and cast their gazes downwards.","“Let’s go.”","They travelled along the river, and after walking for a few more days, a palace suddenly appeared ahead of them, laid out on top of the river.","“From the looks of the current arrangements, the True Phoenix Palace should be behind the barrier, and Purple Eagle Palace and the others are outside. If we want to break through the barrier, the key is still these palaces outside.”","“If we can obtain a key at every palace, then gathering all the keys should open the barrier, or open the True Phoenix Palace.”","Everyone gathered their thoughts to make a deduction, and all thought that this deduction was extremely logical.","They walked around to the front of the palace, which was similar to the Purple Eagle Palace from before. At the entrance of the palace, there was also a massive plaza, and there were a few dozen people standing in the plaza. The majority of them should still be members of the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan. After all, they were the ones who had discovered it, so the number of people that had entered from the clan was a good few times more.","Unfortunately, it was Spirit Transformation Tiers that had the say here. No matter how many Cauldron Forging Tiers and Core Formation Tiers came in, it would all be in vain.","Obviously, they had no way to open the palace, so they could only wait at the doors.","Since the palace hadn’t been opened, they wouldn’t know that this wasn’t the True Phoenix Palace, but rather the temporary residence of a subordinate of the True Phoenix.","Ling Han and the others walked over. By the looks of it, the way to open the palace was still up to the little red bird.","“Ling Han!” A voice rang out, filled with pleasant surprise.","Ling Han looked over, a smile appearing on his face.","Chi Menghan.","She was a noble daughter of the Donglin Imperial Clan, so it was only natural that she could obtain a spot. However, no matter how much face she had, she couldn’t bring Ling Han with her. She didn’t expect to see Ling Han here, so she was naturally happy.","It was also because she had left the Ancestral King Academy at a slightly coincidental time that she didn’t know that Ling Han had also followed her here. Otherwise, she would have long since gone to meet with Ling Han.","Yi?","Ling Han felt as if someone was staring at him, and it was as if he were being pricked by needles. He looked over, only to see a man slowly walking over from behind Chi Menghan. There was a cold expression on his face.","Did I offend you?","“If you don’t want to die, stay away from Menghan,” the man said through divine sense. Although this wasn’t a voice, it still made Ling Han feel a powerful sense of pride radiating from him.","“And this is?” Ling Han looked at Chi Menghan.","“Oh, this is my cousin, Lian Yutang,” Chi Menghan said. “I have an aunt who married into the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan. My cousin is a Golden Generation elite of the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan.”","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’. He had not thought that there would be an alliance through marriage among the Imperial Clans, and had not imagined that a clansman of the Donglin Imperial Clan would actually give birth to a Golden Generation elite of the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan.","If they had known this would happen, the Donglin Imperial Clan probably wouldn’t have married one of their daughters outside of the clan.","Judging by Chi Menghan’s expression, she most likely regarded Lian Yutang as her cousin. However, Lian Yutang clearly didn’t think so.","Hehe, he was going to battle again.","—"]},{"number":4347,"title":"Chapter 4347: Cousin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4347: Cousin","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Yutang definitely had other thoughts about Chi Menghan. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have spoken to warn him.","Such a blatant threat clearly showed his wild ambitions.","Originally, Ling Han wouldn’t have cared, but now that he had already opened his heart and confirmed Chi Menghan’s status as his wife, if Lian Yutang still dared to have designs on his woman, that was definitely impossible.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Cousin Lian, right? Nice to meet you.”","‘Who’s your cousin?’","Lian Yutang faltered upon hearing this. Only then did he realize that Ling Han was already referring to himself as Chi Menghan’s husband. Thus, he was addressing him like how Chi Menghan would address him.","F***, you are really outrageously bold!","I just warned you not to let your imagination run wild, but you haven’t even turned around, and you’ve already forgotten completely?","However, it wouldn’t be appropriate for him to lose his temper in front of Chi Menghan. He still had to squeeze out a smile, and said, “Hello.”","When he said these words, he really felt a stabbing pain in his heart.","But what was even more hurtful was the fact that Ling Han had actually turned his head away, and was now conversing with Chi Menghan, completely ignoring him.","‘F*ck!’","Lian Yutang almost flipped out immediately. He was one of the Golden Generation, a supreme prodigy that had a chance of breaking through to Emperor Tier in future! Furthermore, he was now Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change. If it was not for the fact that he still wanted to charge at the limit, he would have long since broken through to Sect Master Tier.","‘You’re nothing, yet you actually dare to ignore me?’","Why don’t you ascend to the heavens while you’re at it!","In the Ancestral King Academy, he was basically in a state of seclusion, because he had long since reached the end of the Spiritual Transformation Tier. There was absolutely no need for him to ask for anything from the Ancestral King Academy, which led to Ling Han being completely unaware of the existence of such a character.","When he came out this time, he saw his cousin that he had never met before, and his heart instantly beat wildly.","What a good match!","Thus, when he approached with the identity of a cousin, Chi Menghan was completely unguarded.","Everything had initially been fine, yet now, Ling Han had suddenly appeared.","Humph, having designs on a woman that I have my eye on?","‘You’re seeking death!’","In a mere instant, Lian Yutang had recovered. He said calmly, “Ling Han, is it? I have heard of you. A while ago, you seemed to have caused a very great commotion in the Academy.”","Ling Han turned his head, and said, “Hehe, no big deal, no big deal. How could it be worthy of such praise from Cousin Lian?”","Pei!","‘Can you f*cking be more shameless? Am I praising you? Don’t you have any idea?’ He had almost become a despised rat in the academy. If it weren’t for the Nine Mountains Saint and the Buddha Doga, he would have long since been stomped into mush.","Just how thick-skinned was he to be able to say such shameless words?","“Our Little Han is indeed a supreme prodigy. He has suppressed the prodigies of the academy to the point that they have lost their temper,” the large black dog said in a timely manner.","“En, though he’s slightly inferior to Grandpa Dragon, stepping on others shouldn’t be a problem,” the little azure dragon also said.","Lian Yutang almost spat out a mouthful of blood. How could all of you have such thick skin?","They were weirdoes.","Meanwhile, Ling Han laughed loudly, pointed at the great doors ahead of them, and asked, “What is it? Still unable to break through?”","“Those who are slightly familiar with formations are all studying it, but from the look of things now...” Chi Menghan shook her head. They had already stayed here for a great many days, yet were still unable to break open the doors to the palace.","Thankfully, they knew that the more difficult it was now, the greater their gains would be in future. None of them were discouraged.","They still had this bit of patience.","“I’ll go,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Oh, that’s right. You’re also a formations grandmaster!” Chi Menghan clapped her hands, a sliver of admiration on her pretty face.","Lian Yutang saw this, and the displeasure in his heart increased further. He couldn’t help but rain on their parade, and said, “That is a restriction laid down by an Emperor. To say nothing of formation grandmasters, even a Formation Saint may not be able to break through it.”","Ling Han looked at him, and said slowly, “Cousin Lian, should we make a bet?”","“What are the stakes?” Lian Yutang was internally angered, and immediately retorted.","“What good stuff do you have?” Ling Han, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog asked at practically the same time. Their eyes were fixed on Lian Yutang, completely treating him like a fool to be ripped off.","This... Lian Yutang felt extremely vexed. Was it really necessary for them to do this?","“I have a Jade Lotus Fruit here, which is very helpful in improving the cultivation level of Spirit Transformation Tier.” He said calmly, “However, I have already undergone Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change. For me, this is no longer of much use, but for you guys, it can be considered a precious treasure.”","He had inadvertently pointed out the fact that he was a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, which naturally did not lack the intention to show off his might.","“Thank you,” Ling Han, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog said in unison.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Lian Yutang really wanted to move, and smack all three of them to death.","‘Why are you thanking me? Do you think you’ve already won?’","This was too detestable.","Ling Han grabbed the little red bird and strode forward.","“You still haven’t said what your wager is,” Lian Yutang said from behind.","“No need to go to so much trouble. In any case, I’m definitely going to win,” Ling Han said with a smile. In just a few steps, he had already walked to the side of the main doors.","“Everyone, please move aside,” he said to a few people who were studying the restriction.","“Ling Han!” When they saw him, those people all showed an unfriendly expression.","—Since the Ancestral King Academy was jointly established by the various Imperial Clans, then with the relationship between the Imperial Clans and Ling Han, it was natural that the majority would be displeased with him.","“Why should I?”","“If we don’t leave, are you planning to use force?”","There were two people here who were Silver Generation elites. Their cultivation level was as high as Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change, and they could suppress Ling Han in a one-on-one battle, let alone two people working together.","“Cousin Lian, come and clear the area,” Ling Han turned around and said. He didn’t waste his breath on them.","Shua, instantly, a great many people turned their eyes on Lian Yutang.","Cousin?","At this moment, Lian Yutang really wanted to commit murder, but he still wanted to humiliate Ling Han after Ling Han was unable to break through the restrictions. Thus, no matter what, he had to swallow this anger.","“Move aside,” he said calmly. Though his voice was not loud, it was filled with intimidation.","Now that the Golden Generation had spoken, so what if they were the Silver Generation? They could only obey obediently. This was not only a gap in natural talent, but most importantly, it was a gap in cultivation level. There was too much of a gap.","Though those people were dissatisfied, they could only glare at Ling Han, then turn and leave.","“You may begin.” Lian Yutang stated calmly. He did not even care that Ling Han would renege on the bet after losing, and not take out any stakes — he was about to advance into Minor Advanced Tier, so what good stuff could Ling Han take out for him?","Thus, all he wanted was to humiliate Ling Han, so that he would be embarrassed in front of Chi Menghan.","“Please step aside first,” Ling Han said to Lian Yutang. “I’m using a secret technique that belongs solely to me. I can’t allow others to learn it.”","Lian Yutang almost exploded in anger again.","He was the dignified Golden Generation, so what did he care about this kind of technique?","Meanwhile, the little red bird’s expression was filled with disdain. He was clearly going to make use of the power of her bloodline, yet still said it so boldly and confidently. He was really too shameless."]},{"number":4348,"title":"Chapter 4348: A sure win","paragraphs":["Chapter 4348: A sure win","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Yutang stepped aside, while Ling Han stood at the door.","“Little Red, it’s all up to you now,” Ling Han said. Then, he added, “You definitely can’t create any trouble. Otherwise, the consequences would be very serious.”","The little red bird indeed wanted to mess around with Ling Han and watch him be humiliated, but after being frightened by Ling Han, she couldn’t help but shudder.","She had best behave herself.","Ling Han held her in his hands, then she stretched out two wings, and pressed them on the palace doors.","A light that was very hard to see with the naked eye surged past, and with a bang, the doors of the palace were instantly opened.","Yi?","Ah!","Seeing this scene, everyone was dumbfounded.","How long had they been in here? All of them were busy here, yet it was only a waste of effort. However, what about Ling Han? He had not been here for more than half an hour, and the doors were already open.","You have no choice but to admit defeat!","“Cousin Lian, thank you.” The large black dog stretched out a hand, and demanded the stakes from Lian Yutang.","Though Lian Yutang was extremely displeased, in front of Chi Menghan, how could he possibly lose face?","He retrieved the Jade Lotus Fruit and tossed it toward the large black dog.","There was only one thought in his mind—this bunch of shameless people!","The large black dog snickered. Now, Little Han’s cultivation level could increase by another level. This was naturally a very good thing.","However, after everyone was stunned for a moment, they hurriedly rushed into the palace.","However, Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to enter. This was because he had already told the little red bird to be go on ahead. As long as he obtained the key, what was the point of exploring this palace?","In the face of the temptation of the secret technique of the True Phoenix, even Lian Yutang could not remain calm. He hurriedly said to Chi Menghan, “Cousin, we should move.”","Though his strength could overwhelm everyone else, the majority of them were members of the Imperial Clans. If he was too forceful, it was inevitable that he would be targeted when he left.","—The Imperial Clan had long since reached an agreement, and that was when they were fighting over the treasures from the ancient sites, they could fight with all their might, but if one of them had already obtained it, the other Imperial Clans would not be able to make another move.","It was also because of this agreement that the various Imperial Clans maintained a relatively friendly relationship.","Chi Menghan smiled faintly, and said, “I still have something to say to Ling Han. Cousin, you can go in first.”","Lian Yutang couldn’t help but feel his expression darken. They still had something to say between the two of them?","Killing intent rose up in his heart, but his expression did not change. He merely nodded, “All right, then please be careful, cousin. This place is dangerous, after all.”","Chi Menghan nodded with a smile, and said, “Alright, thank you, Cousin.”","Though Lian Yutang wanted to stay behind as a third wheel, he could not resist the temptation of the inheritance from the True Phoenix. For now, he had best abandon his beauty. In any case, he only had to kill Ling Han in the future.","After Lian Yutang leaped into the palace hall, Chi Menghan also walked gracefully towards Ling Han.","“Why aren’t you guys going in?” She was extremely curious. With her understanding of Ling Han and the others, shouldn’t they be the most proactive?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Little Red has already gone in. She alone is enough.”","“What’s going on?” Chi Menghan asked.","Ling Han related the matter, and Chi Menghan couldn’t help but shake her head. This guy was too mean. Poor Lian Yutang, being screwed over by him just like that.","“Let’s go in and put on an act.”","They entered the palace as well. Meanwhile, Ling Han found a corner to refine the Jade Lotus Fruit.","Ding Shu thought for a moment, and decided to temporarily part ways with Ling Han and the others. That was because he was also a prodigy, and together with Ling Han, his effects were actually suppressed. Furthermore, there was also the problem of allocating resources for cultivation.","Thus, it was more appropriate for him to act alone. In any case, everything depended on fate. He was also a person with great fortune.","Ling Han swallowed the Jade Lotus Fruit and channeled the Imperial Scroll to refine it.","In the heaven and earth, a mysterious power was extracted by him. In his mind, the second spiritual body was accelerating its evolution into a complete state.","Unfortunately, when the medicinal effects were completely refined, he was still unable to cultivate to the end of the Second Change.","One Jade Lotus Fruit was still too little. He needed at least four, and only then would he be able to completely cultivate a minor level.","“Cousin Lian isn’t awesome enough,” Ling Han said with a smile. He was thinking about how he could trick this guy again and earn more benefits.","At this moment, the little red bird pounced back.","“Success,” she said. As expected, she took out another key.","This was already two keys.","Ling Han and the others walked around in the palace. The layout here was similar to the first palace, but the main character engraved on the stone pillars was a peacock.","“In the past, Peacock didn’t become Emperor. Instead, a Saint Emperor appeared in the future generations!” Ling Han mused ruefully.","He had dealt with the Peacock Imperial Clan before, and he had almost beaten the Silver Generation Imperial Son of their clan, Kong Wuyang, into a retard.","Not long after, Lian Yutang and the others returned one after another. Looking at their expressions, it was clear that they must not have gained anything.","Of course, the expressions of Ling Han and the others were also solemn. They naturally couldn’t give themselves away.","“Strange, this is actually an empty palace.”","“We’ve wasted so much of our time!”","A great many people were complaining. They had gained nothing, and wasted their time for nothing.","Of course, there were also a great many people that turned to look at Ling Han.","This was opened by Ling Han, and the speed was astonishingly fast. Could it be that this guy knew this place like the back of his hand?","Thus, even if others entered first, the most important thing was still obtained by Ling Han.","Ling Han acted as if he didn’t know they were looking at him. Since everyone had finished exploring, it was about time for them to leave.","Since Chi Menghan had encountered Ling Han, she was naturally leaving with Ling Han. Moreover, Lian Yutang would definitely be dissatisfied, so he naturally followed her.","Thus, even though Ding Shu had left their team, with the addition of Chi Menghan and Lian Yutang, they had one additional person joining their team.","They didn’t walk up the lava river again. Instead, they calculated the direction and distance and walked towards the third palace that existed.","This was how Ling Han explained things to Chi Menghan. When all the palaces were opened, perhaps the barrier at the lava river would disappear.","This was indeed his deduction, and in the case of the key, it was probably to open some secret trove of the True Phoenix Palace. He naturally would not say this.","Regarding Ling Han’s deduction, even Lian Yutang felt that it was reasonable, and did not speak out in objection. Instead, he quietly followed Ling Han and the others.","Right now, he was pondering on how he could find a chance to kill Ling Han without letting Chi Menghan notice anything off.","It would be best if they encountered a pack of ferocious beasts. That way, he only had to trip him up, and kill Ling Han sneakily. Wouldn’t that be fine?","En, he would just wait until all the palace halls were opened.","They travelled for two days, and with a ‘ang’, they heard a terrifying roar that shook the heavens and earth.","Everyone shuddered, but they did not show any hint of fear. Instead, they looked intrigued.","In these two days, they had seen all the fiery red plants, and had not encountered a single living creature. Now, they suddenly heard a beast’s roar, which instead made them feel a sense of life.","“Let’s go and take a look,” Lian Yutang said.","No one objected. So be it if they went to take a look. Who knows, there might be some gains.","They followed the roar of the beast, but they had not walked too far, when they saw a shadow streak past in the skies.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4349,"title":"Chapter 4349: Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4349: Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone raised their heads to look.","That was a massive fierce beast that looked like a lion. Its neck was covered with a fiery red mane, and there were two massive wings growing on its back. When they spread open, it was as if they could blot out the skies and cover the earth.","Even if Ling Han and the others were very far below, when the ferocious beast flapped its wings, they could still feel a very strong gust of wind sweep over, like a hurricane.","“Flame-Winged Lion!” Lian Yutang immediately said to Chi Menghan. “It’s a very rare beast. It’s said that they have long since gone extinct. The Flame-Winged Lion has the Heart of Seven Apertures, which is extraordinarily effective in healing dao injuries. Thus, the majority of them have been poached a long time ago. I didn’t expect to encounter one here.”","Naturally, he was deliberately showing off his knowledge in order to gain the astonished and impressed gaze of the beauty.","However, before Chi Menghan could say anything, the little azure dragon and the large black dog, the two jokers, were already “shocked”.","“Cousin Lian, you know so much!”","“I’m impressed!”","There were stars in the eyes of these two b@stards, and they looked like they had been enchanted to death, causing Lian Yutang to get goosebumps.","This Flame-Winged Lion’s claws also held a wild bull, obviously its prey. This wild bull was obviously thirty feet long, but in the Flame-Winged Lion’s claws, it appeared very insignificant.","“Where there is a Flame-Winged Lion, there would definitely be Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit.”","“That’s good stuff.”","Lian Yutang continued, appearing slightly excited.","The Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit could allow his cultivation level to advance by leaps and bounds after he advanced into Minor Advanced Tier. Thus, even he was tempted.","“Let’s go.”","He issued commands. As a Golden Generation, as well as a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, it was only natural that he considered himself the captain of this team.","Ling Han didn’t object, because he was also very interested in the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit.","However, if he really defeated the Flame-Winged Lion, how was he supposed to snatch it from Lian Yutang’s hands?","As he pondered, he followed the others in their pursuit of the Flame-Winged Lion in the skies.","—If Lian Yutang knew what he was thinking, he would definitely scoff and laugh loudly.","Haha, this was really too laughable. A mere Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change actually wanted to snatch something from a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change? He was dreaming!","Not too long later, this Flame-Winged Lion’s figure descended, entering into a valley.","Everyone hurriedly followed, but slowed down their speed, and quietly entered into the valley.","The lair of the Flame-Winged Lion was very easy to find. It was on a large rock that jutted out of the cliff, and this Flame-Winged Lion had landed on it, and was currently feasting to its heart’s content.","—That wild bull was not dead yet, and released a mooing sound.","On the cliff to the left of this large rock, there was an old vine that was completely crimson in colour. It had borne nine bright red fruits.","“Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit!” Lian Yutang immediately exclaimed, a hint of pleasant surprise on his face, “What great luck. This Celestial medicine has grown its ninth vine, and the number and quality of the fruits it bears have reached the peak stage.”","The Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit sprouted out of the ground. Only one vine would grow out of it every three thousand years, and then it would blossom and bear fruit. However, there would only be one fruit. Then, another three thousand years later, a second vine would grow out of it, and two fruits would be borne.","It would take close to 30,000 years to grow nine vines and bear nine fruits. Even for Saints, this was a considerably long time.","Even at such a far distance, they could still smell a refreshing fragrance, causing everyone’s pores to open up. The Regulations seemed to be right in front of their eyes, within reach.","Without another word, Lian Yutang immediately dashed out.","He was very conceited, and did not use any ultimate moves. He merely delivered a palm strike, which turned into a blade of Regulations that was as long as three hundred meters, slashing out at the Flame-Winged Lion.","This naturally enraged that fierce beast. With a flap of its wings, it pounced towards Lian Yutang.","It was very fierce. With a wave of one claw, it sent out a crescent-shaped force, which blasted towards the blade of Regulations that was attacking.","Pu!","The force clashed with the blade of Regulations, and both instantly crumbled.","“En?” A hint of surprise appeared on Lian Yutang’s face. His attack had actually been resolved?","At this time, the Flame-Winged Lion had already pounced. With a wave of its claws and a flap of its wings, endless Regulations turned into sharp swords that swept madly towards Lian Yutang.","Lian Yutang humphed, and used his bare fists to exchange blows with the Flame-Winged Lion.","The Golden Generation was truly powerful. Under the barrage of punches, the Flame-Winged Lion was completely outmatched.","One had to realize that the most powerful trait of cultivators was that they could summon their spiritual bodies for battle. Summoning one would double their battle prowess, and if there were nine... just how terrifying would that be?","What was the strength of the wild beasts?","Individual battle prowess, tough physique!","Thus, the fact that Lian Yutang could suppress the Flame-Winged Lion in close-quarter combat without using his spiritual body was proof of how freakish his battle prowess was.","The Golden Generation Generation cultivated Body Arts as well, maintaining it at an equal level to their cultivation level. They were not just cultivating around randomly.","Because the value of the Flame-Winged Lion lay in its heart, there was absolutely no need for Lian Yutang to be merciful. Under his forceful suppression, in just a dozen over moves, he had killed this Flame-Winged Lion.","Peng!","The wild bull that had been treated as prey actually leaped down from the large rock on the cliff. A large hole had been torn in its abdomen by the Flame-Winged Lion, and some of its internal organs had also been eaten. However, the vitality of a Spirit Transformation Tier beast was incredibly tenacious, and with the hope of survival, it was determined to flee from this place.","“Ling Han, meat! Meat!” Hu Niu hurriedly exclaimed, her eyes shining.","Ling Han nodded, and moved to take down this wild bull.","“Moo!” The bull called out. Even if it had not gained intelligence, there were probably 10,000 curse words racing through its mind.","It was still inevitable that it would be eaten.","Lian Yutang released a battle cry, and leaped towards that large rock on the cliff.","His target was naturally the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit.","The air here was filled with Fire Element, and as long as their speed was slightly faster, they could sweep past like a knife, possessing astonishing destructive power. However, this naturally was no problem for a Golden Generation and a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, whose physique was tough enough.","“Wu!” However, when he stretched out his hand to pluck the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit, he couldn’t help but grunt, and hurriedly withdrew his hand, showing an expression of pain.","He looked at the palm of his hand, and saw that there was shockingly a burn mark on it.","What was going on?","He sensed with his divine sense, and only then did he discover that there was a layer of Regulations sealing off the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit in front of him. Just now, when he had touched it, it was precisely this Regulations that had burned him.","No wonder the fruits on the vines had already ripened, but the Flame-Winged Lion had not eaten them. It was not that it did not want to, but rather it could not.","He tried to unravel the Regulations, but it was useless. The level of these Regulations was at least on the level of Sect Master, or even a higher level, and was far from something that he could stand against.","However, there were clearly nine Treasured Fruits right in front of his eyes, yet they could only be seen but not plucked. Just how annoying was this?","He tried repeatedly, but there was nothing he could do at all. He could only leap down again.","“It can’t be helped,” he said. “With the powerful Regulations of Flames sealing them off, those fruits can’t be harvested at all.”","“Too bad!” He shook his head.","If he managed to harvest it, he would give one to Chi Menghan. As for Ling Han and the others, they naturally shouldn’t even think about it.","“Can I give it a try?” Ling Han asked."]},{"number":4350,"title":"Chapter 4350: Make another Bet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4350: Make another Bet","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Yutang was taken aback. ‘You want to give it a try?’","“Haha, even I can’t do anything, so what can you do?” He couldn’t help but mock, because Ling Han saying that he wanted to give it a try was equivalent to provoking him.","“Cousin Lian, don’t forget that it was Ling Han who opened the doors to that palace previously,” the large black dog said from the sidelines.","Cousin your sister!","Lian Yutang really wanted to stomp the large black dog to death. He was a human, and the large black dog was a demon. ‘Calling Cousin repeatedly, why are you calling me so familiarly?’","He humphed, and said, “The palace was the palace, and the formation is a restriction, but this place is completely different. That is Regulations of Fire, which has blocked the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit behind it. As long as your strength is not strong enough, it is impossible to break through.”","This was raw strength, and had absolutely nothing to do with whether one understood formations or not.","“Then let’s make another bet,” Ling Han said.","Speaking of betting, Lian Yutang’s expression became awkward.","Previously, he had also made a bet with Ling Han, yet had suffered a terrible defeat. And now, he was going to do it again?","Looking at how confident Ling Han was, he really felt a little nervous.","“How do we bet? What are we betting?” Of course, he definitely couldn’t back down.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Bet if I can obtain the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit. If I can, then the Treasured Fruit will all belong to me. If I can’t, hehe, then there’s naturally no need to mention anything else.”","Lian Yutang pondered for a moment. He naturally did not believe that Ling Han would be able to break through the lockdown of the Regulations of Fire. This was completely based on brute strength. However, if Ling Han failed, he would not lose anything either.","Asking the other party to admit that he was trash?","No.","He similarly could not open the Regulations of Flames, so wouldn’t that mean that he would be cursing himself as well?","“All right.” He considered for a moment, then nodded. This brat was really too smug. Did he think that just because he had opened the great doors of the palace, he had extraordinary means?","Humph, I’ll let you have have a good encounter with a dead end.","Ling Han smiled, and began to climb towards the cliff.","He had long since brought the little red bird with him, and she was presently using its claws to grab onto his shoulder. Meanwhile, her expression was filled with disdain, because she knew that Ling Han was going to use her to show off again.","It wasn’t long before Ling Han climbed onto the large rock.","“Little Red, it’s all up to you now,” Ling Han said.","The little red bird rolled its eyes at him before flapping its wings and flying away.","She flew towards the Regulations of Fire, then slowed down. Carefully, she plucked a feather, and stretched it forwards.","The feathers touched the Regulations of Fire, but did not cause any commotion.","Ling Han also saw this, and couldn’t help but nod his head. The little red bird was indeed born with a natural affinity with Regulations of Fire. For example, Lian Yutang’s hand was directly burned, but the little red bird was completely unharmed.","The little red bird sighed in despair. Sigh, having encountered such a guy, he did not treat it like the descendant of a Divine Beast at all. Instead, it was like a coolie, doing this and that.","What could be done?","She began to harvest the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit. In a few moments, the nine celestial fruits had all fallen into her hands.","“Here, take it.” She tossed the celestial fruits to Ling Han.","Unlike the others, she fed on Divine Metal. Celestial fruits like this could not increase her cultivation level, and could only satisfy her cravings.","The coordination of man and bird was very good. With Ling Han blocking her, the people below could not see what was happening above at all.","Ling Han leaped up and landed on the ground.","“You—” Lian Yutang was speechless. He saw that on the vines above, the nine fruits had already disappeared.","He could not understand. What was going on here?","Destroying the Regulations of Fire required complete strength, and definitely not some cheap tricks. Thus, he couldn’t figure it out. Ling Han was clearly much weaker than him, so how could he do something that he couldn’t?","He wanted nothing more than for Ling Han to hand over the nine celestial fruits. However, he had personally agreed to a bet with Ling Han, and it was in front of Chi Menghan at that. He naturally couldn’t bring himself to do so.","If Chi Menghan was not here, he would have directly killed Ling Han in his anger and embarrassment.","“Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit... is it for sale?” he asked Ling Han, feeling extremely sullen. This was the celestial fruit that he had discovered, him that had killed the vicious beast, so the celestial fruits should have belonged to him as well. Why did he have to turn around and beg Ling Han for them instead?","Ling Han shrugged, “Apologies, I have no plans to sell.”","Having been rebuffed, Lian Yutang’s expression became even worse.","He very much wanted to kill Ling Han with a single punch, but when he saw Chi Menghan, he forcefully suppressed this urge.","He definitely had to find a chance to kill Ling Han. In that way, the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit would return to his possession.","Ling Han was extremely pleased. The Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit wasn’t a five-star celestial fruit, but rather a six-star celestial fruit. Even for a Sect Master, this fruit would be of some help.","However, now was not the time to distribute and refine them.","“Come on, let’s continue forward.”","They set out, heading towards the third palace — if there was one.","Another few days later, they finally arrived at their destination.","Just like before, there were still many people standing in the plaza here. They were unable to break through the restrictions on the main doors, and could only wait in the plaza as they continuously attempted.","“Brother Ling!” Origin was also here. He strode towards Ling Han.","“Brother Origin.” Ling Han nodded.","The two of them chatted for a while, then Ling Han said, “Alright, I have to go and open the doors.”","“Yi, Brother Ling actually has this ability?” Origin appeared very surprised.","“Hehe.”","Ling Han brought the little red bird and headed towards the main doors of the palace, causing the little red bird to stick out its tongue. He was going to use it to show off again.","Using the same trick, the great doors of the palace easily opened. After everyone was shocked, they immediately surged in.","It was very likely that this was the Palace of the True Phoenix.","Though Lian Yutang had already been disappointed once, he still couldn’t help but search again. What if it was?","After these people had left, Ling Han took out the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit and distributed them.","Hu Niu, the empress, Chi Menghan, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, and even the perverted pig received one. The remaining three all belonged to Ling Han. This was a unanimous decision of the others.","They immediately started to refine the celestial fruits. If these people wanted to search the entire palace, they would need at least a few days.","Time was precious, and could not be wasted.","Everyone ate the fruits, then sat down in cross-legged positions.","With the support of the Imperial Scroll, they refined the celestial fruits extremely quickly.","Merely two days later, the medicinal effects were completely absorbed, and the large black dog and little azure dragon were no longer able to suppress their cultivation level. They had to break through.","If they broke through here, there would be some flaws. After all, this was not the real world, but with the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit, especially one that had been produced from these old vines that were close to thirty thousand years old, its effects were astonishingly strong.","Thus, even if the little azure dragon and the large black dog broke through, it wouldn’t be a big deal. After they went out, they could re-establish their foundations and solve the problem.","Meanwhile, Ling Han advanced triumphantly. He first reached the end of the Second Change, then leaped over, forming a third spiritual body.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4351,"title":"Chapter 4351: Flame Skin Race","paragraphs":["Chapter 4351: Flame Skin Race","Editor: Henyee Translations","Unfortunately, after consuming all the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruits, Ling Han’s cultivation level only stopped at the late stage of Third Change. He was still some distance away from breaking through to Fourth Change.","“However, my battle prowess—” Ling Han casually did a sweep with his fingers, as if there was a harp in front of him. Pa, pa, pa! The Regulations circulated between his fingers, and power was exploding, which was indescribably terrifying.","“Now, even if it was a Sixth Change Silver Generation elite, I have the confidence to take him down!”","Ling Han broke into a smile. Furthermore, this was still because the Imperial Son had the Great Emperor-level means that could defend against spiritual attacks. Otherwise, if he used the murderous aura attack and the black light of illusion as support, it would probably be no problem for him to defeat even a Seventh Change.","He naturally had to thank “Cousin Lian” for this. Without his hard work, how could Ling Han have possibly obtained the Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit?","After all, a wild beast that was comparable to the level of Ninth Change was too terrifying. At that time, Ling Han, who had only been at Second Change, would definitely have to turn around and run.","When they finished refining the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit, the people who had gone to the palace to search also returned one after another. They were all frowning slightly, appearing very despondent.","This was natural. Everyone had spent months here, but what had they gained?","Zero!","They had harbored boundless hopes, and wanted to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix, yet in the end, it was all for naught. This kind of contrast between their expectations and reality was too strong.","These people naturally did not know that the little red bird had long since returned with the third key.","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t make a fuss. After excusing himself, he left with the others.","Chi Menghan was naturally with them, so even though Lian Yutang’s expression was slightly dark, he still followed.","They set out to search for the fourth palace that could possibly exist. On their way, they also discovered a Five Star Celestial medicine. Unfortunately, the fruits that the Celestial medicine had borne had already been harvested.","There was nothing else that could be done, so they could only continue their journey.","After spending a few days, they indeed discovered the fourth palace.","However, what surprised Ling Han was that though this palace was practically the same as the previous three, there were not many people waiting at the plaza.","That was because the doors to the palace were wide open.","Yi?","Ling Han looked at the little red bird, and asked, “Do you have any other siblings?”","“Humph, I am the only one of my kind!” The little red bird was very proud.","Then who had opened this palace?","“Those people... didn’t come in with us,” Chi Menghan quickly said.","Ling Han nodded. Though there were also a few people standing in the plaza, they were not waiting, but rather sparring with each other. Surging power blasted past, yet it was difficult to injure a single floor tile.","Looking closely at their attire, it was a completely different style. Looking closely at their skin, there were fiery red veined patterns.","“Could it be—”","“Natives!”","Everyone was surprised. The other three palaces were all tightly shut, and natives had actually appeared here. Furthermore, they looked to be humans.","“Let’s go take a look,” Lian Yutang said. He was skilled and courageous, and had a high opinion of himself. He was completely unconcerned about the opinions of Ling Han and the others, and directly leaped out, heading towards the plaza.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before nodding at the empress and the others. He then walked out as well.","“Yi, more people have come.” When they saw Ling Han and his group, those natives that were sparring stopped.","“Beauty!” When one of them saw Chi Menghan’s features clearly, his eyes involuntarily lit up, and he hurriedly elbowed the person beside him.","“Mine!”","“No, mine!”","“I’m the first one to spot her, so she is naturally mine!”","There were a total of five of them, and they all called out, scrambling over one another, as if as long as they agreed, Chi Menghan would belong to one of them.","“Humph, how dare you!” Lian Yutang smirked coldly. A mere native actually dared to have designs on someone he had his eye on?","“You’ve come all the way here, and you still dare to be arrogant?” one of the natives sneered.","Lian Yutang couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. He was the Golden Generation, and now someone actually dared to reprimand him?","What a colossal joke!","“You are courting death!” He stretched out a hand, and delivered a palm strike at those five natives.","Boom, a terrifying power surged. The Golden Generation cultivated Body Art at the same time, and even if he didn’t use Regulations, his battle prowess was still chillingly strong.","The five natives joined forces to parry the attack, but as soon as their power came into contact, they all threw up blood, and were sent flying.","And this was still because Lian Yutang had held back. Otherwise, these five people would definitely have all died. The gap in abilities was too wide, and they could only be insta-killed.","After all, this was their territory, and Lian Yutang did not know what elites were hidden in this palace. Thus, he did not deliver a fatal strike, to avoid a life-or-death enmity.","He was indeed proud, but if he didn’t have a brain, how could he possibly become a Golden Generation?","“Hehe, daring to make trouble with our Fire Skin Race, you are really bold!” Amidst a cold laugh, a young man walked out, his arms crossed behind his back. He was tall and slender, his arms bared, and it could be seen that there were flame-shaped tattoos on his arms.","Ling Han swept an eye over it, and felt that this should have been natural, and not engraved afterwards.","Lian Yutang swept an eye over this young man, and smiled faintly, “You are no match for me. Go and switch with someone who can make decisions.”","The young man exploded in anger, “I, Nalan Feiyue, am the second strongest elite of the younger generation of the Flame Skin Race, and you actually dare to look down on me?”","“Hehe, the second strongest elite?” Lian Yutang shook his head, “Go and switch to the top elite.”","He casually sent out a palm strike. Hong, Regulations intertwined, turning into a jade-coloured giant palm.","Nalan Feiyue’s expression involuntarily changed drastically. The other’s strength was too terrifying. He was definitely no match for him.","“There really is an elite.” Another voice rang out. Xiu, a figure seemed to have appeared out of thin air here.","It was also a young man, filled with heroic spirit. He was shirtless, and there were two tree-like tattoos on his arms.","Lian Yutang’s eyes narrowed slightly. This person was definitely not ordinary.","“I am Lian Yutang, how should I address you, sir?” he asked calmly.","“Nalan Huoshu.” This young man smiled, “The top elite of the younger generation of the Flame Skin Race.”","Lian Yutang didn’t dare to be careless. The top elite of the younger generation was Spirit Transformation Tier Eighth Change and above, so if a member of the older generation came, then what cultivation level would they be at?","Sect Master Tier?","Though he was the Golden Generation=, and was very awesome, it was still impossible for him to match Sect Masters, even if it was the weakest of Sect Masters.","“These people humiliated my companion, so I made a move to teach them a lesson.” It was rare for Lian Yutang to explain.","Nalan Huoshu looked at the five people from before, “What’s going on?”","The five of them spoke at once, and actually did not add or subtract the facts.","When Nalan Huoshu heard this, he couldn’t help but laugh, “Brother Lian, you don’t know much about our Flame Skin Race. In our race, women are a kind of wealth, so a woman without an owner naturally can be fought over by anyone.”","“However, since they are Brother Lian’s companions, then I am really sorry. I shall apologize to you on their behalf.”","Ling Han and the others exchanged looks. This Flame Skin Race was a little too primitive, weren’t they? They actually treated women like wealth?"]},{"number":4352,"title":"Chapter 4352: Trump Card","paragraphs":["Chapter 4352: Trump Card","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, since that was their custom, their previous offense could only be considered a clash of cultures, and could not be blamed on them.","What Ling Han did not understand was that the top elite of the younger generation was already so strong, and the older generation should be even more awesome. Why was this Nalan Huoshu so polite towards Lian Yutang?","He did not believe that this Flame Skin Race was a reasonable group. Faced with a group of strangers, strength was naturally the best intimidation.","“Where have you all come from? Have you ever seen a palace like this?” Nalan Huoshu asked, pointing at the palace behind him.","“We have come precisely from a palace.” Lian Yutang spoke as their representative, and it was naturally him who had bestowed the title on himself.","The eyes of the few members of the Flame Skin Race instantly lit up, revealing an obvious excitement. Even though Nalan Huoshu had hidden it very well, he still couldn’t help but look tempted, and asked, “You guys opened the doors to the palace?”","Lian Yutang nodded, “It would be a piece of cake.”","F***, how shameless.","The palace doors were clearly opened by Ling Han, so what did it have to do with him?","The little red bird was also disdainful. She was clearly the one who had opened it, yet the shameless Ling Han insisted on taking credit for it.","This time, Nalan Huoshu’s excitement could not be concealed, “Then did you guys find anything in the palace?”","Lian Yutang was no fool, and immediately countered with a question of his own, “Is there anything in the palace that is worthy of Brother Huoshu’s attention?”","Nalan Huoshu pondered for a moment, then said, “If Brother Lian can show me what you have obtained from the palace, I will be able to tell Brother Lian the method to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix and leave this place.”","These words directly struck Lian Yutang’s heart, and his expression also changed slightly.","Why had he come in?","Wasn’t it for the True Phoenix inheritance? Now that he had finally gotten a clue, his emotions fluctuated.","But the problem was, he had not obtained anything from the palace previously, so how was he supposed to get information out of him?","“Brother Lian, have you made your decision?” Nalan Huoshu asked, his eyes burning.","Lian Yutang smiled faintly, “It is of great importance, and I need to think about it some more.”","Though these words were meant to be a rejection, it was not an absolute refusal. Furthermore, these words also revealed a piece of information, and that was he actually had “that thing” in his possession.","Right now, he was actually trying to gain something without risking anything.","Meanwhile, a thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. Since this palace had been opened, the corresponding key should be in the hands of the Flame Skin Race.","Negotiate with them?","Ling Han shook his head internally. Negotiations were based on the prerequisite that the abilities of both sides were equal. Otherwise, what was the point of negotiating? They could just directly make a move to snatch it.","You expect them to reason with you?","Hehe, even their wives had come from being snatched!","Ling Han decided to stay put for the moment. He would figure out the situation of the Flame Skin Race first.","Furthermore, with a fool like Lian Yutang standing in front of them to attract firepower, they should be very safe.","They did not rashly enter into the palace, but rather rested outside. In any case, they were all cultivators, so there was absolutely no need to be picky about the environment.","After staying for two days, they had more or less figured out the Flame Skin Race’s situation.","...It was unknown what the reason was. In this Mystery Realm, whether it was wild beasts or cultivators, the upper limit of cultivation was Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Thus, even the older generation of the Flame Skin Race was only in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and did not have a Sect Master-level existence.","Because of this, Lian Yutang’s attitude immediately changed drastically, no longer being cautious.","He was the Golden Generation, a Spirit Transformation Tier elite. He was invincible in this cultivation level, and it was definitely no problem for him to fight against ten people alone.","He directly turned hostile, and demanded that the Flame Skin Race reveal all their secrets.","Of course, they couldn’t come to an agreement, and a battle immediately broke out.","Nalan Huoshu moved, exchanging blows with Lian Yutang.","This top elite of the younger generation of the Flame Skin Race was truly extraordinary. He was shockingly also a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change—this was actually not difficult to achieve. As long as one could form nine True Selves in the True Self Tier, it would be much easier than reaching Eighth or Ninth Form.","However, the quality of the True Self also greatly affected the might of the spiritual body. Thus, even though they had both undergone Ninth Change, Nalan Huoshu was slightly weaker than Lian Yutang.","Added with the gap in the celestial technique, the battle prowess gap was even more disparate.","However, in a situation where battle prowess was at a disadvantage, the tattoo on Nalan Huoshu’s arm seemed to come to life, twisting and leaping. Boom, he shot out a punch, and blazing flames blazed, turning into a firebird.","The firebird flapped its wings, and charged towards Lian Yutang. The terrifying Regulations of Fire fluttered, even warping space.","Even Lian Yutang did not dare to be careless, and had no choice but to channel out the Imperial Technique, and just barely managed to match it.","Ling Han and the others were all surprised, shocked by the battle prowess of Nalan Huoshu.","To be able to match the Golden Generation in such a powerful manner, he was a little fierce.","However, this was only short-lived. Nalan Huoshu’s burst of power only lasted for less than half a minute, and his aura was completely exhausted.","Right at this moment, nine old men suddenly scuttled out of the palace. Without another word, they all brandished the walking sticks in their hands and struck out at Lian Yutang.","Boom, these walking sticks were obviously Spirit Tools, and were extremely powerful at that. As they waved their staffs, the whole sky was filled with dancing firebirds, covering heaven and earth.","This might was too great, that even Lian Yutang did not dare to oppose it. He had no choice but to retreat, temporarily dodging the attack.","“Kid, it’s better to follow the rules,” an elder said calmly.","Lian Yutang’s expression was tense, and it was clear that he was slightly hesitant. However, in the end, he did not make a move.","In a one-on-one battle, he could suppress any old man single-handedly. In fact, even if these nine old men joined forces, they would not be a match for him. The problem lay in the walking stick in their hands. It was definitely a Seven Star Spirit Tool. With the activation of their secret technique, it could unleash power on the level of Pseudo Sect Master-level.","This caused him to feel wary, especially when he was facing nine opponents at the same time, which made it inevitable that he would be in a dilemma.","“Apologies!” Lian Yutang clasped his hands in obeisance.","The reason why he had to use force was actually because he had no choice. That was because he had not obtained anything from the palace previously, so what could he use to exchange for information?","The storm had temporarily dispersed, but everyone knew that how could a gulf between the two sides be so easily resolved?","On the second day, Lian Yutang sought out Ling Han.","“Follow me!” he commanded directly. He did not say where he was going, nor did he say why he was to go with him.","“Why?” Ling Han naturally wouldn’t submit.","Lian Yutang looked impatient, “Of course to find the fifth palace.”","This time, he definitely had to obtain the item inside.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “Firstly, you’re no one to me, so you don’t have the right to command me. Secondly, just because of your attitude, hehe, you’d better find someone else.”","“Ling Han, don’t be ungrateful!” Lian Yutang said balefully.","It should be known that a great many Imperial Clans wanted Ling Han’s life. If he killed Ling Han, he would be able to trade for a considerable favor. Thus, the fact that he did not make a move to kill him was already giving Ling Han enough face.","What else do you want?"]},{"number":4353,"title":"Chapter 4353: Forced","paragraphs":["Chapter 4353: Forced","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han shook his head and said, “You can find someone else. I’m not interested.”","“I have already spoken, and you still have all kinds of excuses?” Lian Yutang humphed, and moved aggressively, grabbing out at Ling Han.","A mere Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change cultivator, was naturally someone he could take down with a stretch of his hand.","Ling Han’s eyes turned cold. He activated Destructive Energy, which transformed into a sharp sword that slashed over.","“Yi?” Lian Yutang couldn’t help but let out a muffled groan. A crack had actually appeared on the palm he had struck out. Though it was not ripped apart, it still stunned him. Furthermore, it had also caused a certain backlash to himself.","A mere Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change, he was actually this powerful?","He didn’t know that Ling Han had already advanced to the Third Change.","But even if it was the Third Change or even the Fourth Change, he shouldn’t have been so powerful. The gap in cultivation level was still as wide as the sky, and he was the Golden Generation!","No wonder this boy was called the Imperial Son Killer. He was truly extraordinary.","Lian Yutang felt that he had really underestimated Ling Han. It could not be helped. The Golden Generation had been wearing a brilliant halo since birth. They were the generation that had the highest hopes of becoming Emperor, so it was only natural that they would be proud.","Now, however, he finally realized that those who came later were launching powerful attacks at him and the Golden Generation.","If they were at the same cultivation level, would he be a match for Ling Han?","This caused him to become doubtful, and lose his confidence.","Lian Yutang took a deep breath. As a dignified Golden Generation, he actually did not have the conviction that he would definitely win at the same cultivation level?","Merely for this reason, he had already lost.","His desire to kill Ling Han intensified. As long as he had taken advantage of Ling Han’s value, he would make his move without hesitation. Whether it was because of Ling Han’s natural talent, or because of Chi Menghan.","“I have already made my move, and you still want to refuse?” Lian Yutang smirked coldly, and made another move.","Ling Han did not confront him head-on. Merely exchanging a single blow allowed him to know that Lian Yutang’s strength was still far superior to his. It was definitely not a good idea to confront him head-on.","He retreated, and definitely would not take it head-on.","However, the movement technique that Lian Yutang had grasped was superior to his. In such a short distance, Lian Yutang naturally had the complete upper hand, giving Ling Han great pressure.","“You don’t know how to appreciate kindness!” Lian Yutang humphed, and with a flash, his spiritual bodies appeared, one after another.","This was what it meant to be serious!","Previously, it had been a one-on-one battle, but now? Ten against one, it naturally could further increase his advantage.","“Cousin, what are you doing!” Chi Menghan’s voice rang out, and her figure appeared gracefully.","Lian Yutang forcefully stopped his movements, and smiled faintly at Chi Menghan, “I am sparring with him; what need is there for Cousin to be nervous?”","“I’ll find another chance next time.” After saying this, he turned around and left.","Ling Han stared at his receding figure, killing intent flashing in his eyes.","He definitely had to increase his cultivation level as soon as possible, and kill this guy.","“Cousin’s animosity towards you is very strong,” Chi Menghan said. She wasn’t stupid, so how could it be that she couldn’t tell after such a long time?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “If I kill him, you won’t blame me, right?”","Chi Menghan grimaced. This guy really didn’t take the Imperial Son seriously at all. He would kill and slaughter one at the drop of a hat.","“You decide for yourself,” she said. She would not deliberately influence the decision that Ling Han had made.","Ling Han laughed loudly. This Imperial Daughter did not have the proud personality of the other Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters at all. She was really understanding.","Actually, this was only in relative terms. If it was someone else, just see how proud Chi Menghan would be.","However, he couldn’t stay here forever. Horses couldn’t grow fat without night grass, and without natural treasures, it would be a pipe dream for him to advance to the Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change and above in a short period of time.","He had to go out and search for opportunities. As long as he could get some honey, Nine Vines Fire Origin Fruit, and so on, his cultivation level would be able to soar again.","He discussed with the empress and the others, and decided to set out immediately.","After packing up a little, he was about to set out.","“Hold it right there!” Unexpectedly, before they could even move, they saw Nalan Feiyue running over with a few people, blocking their path.","“There’s no need to trouble you guys to send us off,” the large black dog said with a smile.","Nalan Feiyue ignored the large black dog’s ridicule, and said proudly, “You men can leave, but the women have to stay.”","In the Flame Skin Race, women were a kind of wealth, a tool to pass on their seeds and carry on the line!","This was just like how bandits blocked the way to rob others of their wealth. If they wanted to pass this path, they would have to leave some money behind to buy passage.","“Shameless, you dare to have designs on Niu?” Hu Niu placed her hands on her hips, her face filled with fury.","“Zhi, zhi, zhi, zhi!” The little red bird also called out excitedly. She was also a female.","Meanwhile, Ling Han asked curiously, “Is your ancestor the cook who fetched water and cooked for the True Phoenix? See, isn’t this deduction very logical? Firstly, your names sound similar, and secondly, it’s as if you’ve never seen a woman in eight lifetimes.1”","When these words fell, Nalan Feiyue and the others were all angered.","“You dare to mock us?” they shouted.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “It was you people who insulted my family first. It’s impolite not to reciprocate.”","“They’ve got big heads and thick necks, so they must be cooks,” the large black dog immediately concluded.","“Why don’t we capture one and bring him back? We’ll have someone to cook for us in the future,” the little azure dragon suggested.","How could Nalan Feiyue tolerate this? He immediately moved, and shot out a punch at Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed and replied with a punch of his own.","Peng!","A loud bang rang out, and the two of them exchanged a punch. Both of them trembled, and took a few steps back.","Nalan Feiyue was surprised. He was a Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change elite, and Ling Han’s aura was clearly inferior to his, but his power was actually not the slightest bit inferior, which surprised him.","However, after only a slight hesitation, he charged over again.","Previously, they had restrained themselves because they were wary of Lian Yutang, a Golden Generation of Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change. Only the elders of their clan could suppress him with the Firebird Staff, so they did not dare to cause too much offence.","However, Lian Yutang had already left, and he had also made it very clear that Chi Menghan was the only one who couldn’t be touched.","Thus, when they saw that Ling Han and the others were about to leave, Nalan Feiyue and the others immediately moved. They had not thought that Ling Han would be so troublesome, that they would not be able to deal with him in a short while.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely, and very soon, all their ultimate moves were used. The battle had become incredibly dangerous.","“Humph!” Nalan Feiyue’s figure trembled, and multiple spiritual bodies walked out of his body. There were a total of seven, and added with him, there were eight of them.","Boom, the eight Nalan Feiyues attacked again, and their power naturally increased explosively.","Ling Han still didn’t use his spiritual body. He could disperse all attacks within six Heavens, and he had cultivated Body Arts as well. With the two combined, the strength of his defense was definitely freakish.","So what if it was one against eight? Though he was at a slight disadvantage, he could completely withstand it.","“See if I won’t beat you to death!” Nalan Feiyue roared. Boom, the flaming tattoos on his arms flickered, and his aura instantly increased greatly.","This was a technique similar to the Imperial Clan burning their Imperial Blood to increase their battle prowess. However, in comparison, whether it was in terms of duration or effects, this was far inferior to burning Imperial Blood.","It could not be helped. After all, he was the descendant of the cook.","Ling Han thought to himself, and directly shot out a murderous aura attack.","“Wu!” Nalan Feiyue immediately let out a muffled groan, looking like he was in pain."]},{"number":4354,"title":"Chapter 4354: Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4354: Deal","Editor: Henyee Translations","As long as one didn’t possess a Great Emperor-level treasure, they would definitely be struck by the murderous aura. There was no exception.","Unless, that was, the other party had also grasped the barrage of murderous aura. Only then would they be able to clash with each other, and it would depend on whose Spiritual Power was stronger.","However, Nalan Feiyue was a Seventh Change elite, after all. Moreover, he was a prodigy, so his Spiritual Power was extremely powerful. After being affected for a short while, he recovered and didn’t immediately withdraw.","Ling Han charged over, and Destructive Energy surged, launching a powerful counterattack.","Nalan Feiyue had the help of the seven spiritual bodies, but the spiritual bodies were constructed from the soul as their main component, so they naturally had to suffer the barrage of murderous aura. Furthermore, the effects were especially great. The spiritual bodies could not even unleash 20-30% of their full battle prowess.","In just a few moves, he was completely at a disadvantage, and could only be trampled on by Ling Han.","The members of the Flame Skin Race were all transfixed with shock. They couldn’t believe their eyes.","The second strongest elite of their clan’s younger generation was actually inferior to Ling Han?","Were these outsiders all so awesome?","“Enough!” A cold humph rang out, and Nalan Huoshu appeared, directly interfering. Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change’s battle prowess surged out, and even Ling Han dared not face it head-on. He could only retreat.","He glanced at Nalan Feiyue in displeasure, with a hint of rebuke and disdain.","Then, he looked at Ling Han, and revealed a smile, “Brother Ling Han, right? You have already proven your strength, and can possess these women!”","In the Flame Skin Race, women were a kind of resource, and their ownership would be decided by strength.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Could it be that he still had to thank him?","He led the others away, heading to the next palace.","Probably, aside from the little red bird, no one else would be able to open the palace.","However, the main target of Ling Han’s trip was not the key to the fifth palace, but rather to find the Celestial medicine, so as to increase his cultivation level as soon as possible.","However, Celestial medicines could only be found by chance. Previously, he had only encountered the swarm of bees and the Flame-Winged Lion by chance. Now that he had taken the initiative to search for them, he had only wasted his energy.","“Can we do business with the Flame Skin Race?” the large black dog suggested.","“What is it? Do you want to buy their women?” the little azure dragon teased.","“Go away. When the adults speak, the kids should stay on the sidelines.” The large black dog kicked the little azure dragon first, then continued, “The Flame Skin Race is the local tyrant here. After so many years, they must have a considerable amount of savings.”","“En.” Everyone nodded.","Otherwise, with how young Nalan Feiyue and the others were, they should not have been able to reach the height of Spiritual Transformation Tier.","“However, we still have to go to a palace first and obtain that key. Otherwise, the fact that we obtained the keys in the palaces can’t be hidden any longer.”","They continued onwards, and when they arrived at the next palace, they saw that there were indeed a great many people standing guard here, just like before.","Ling Han stepped forwards, and used the little red bird to easily open the great doors. Naturally, he had also successfully obtained the key.","They returned, and a few days later, they returned to the Flame Skin Race.","Ling Han directly requested to see the nine elders, saying that he had obtained something from the palace.","Not long after, an elder appeared, and stood in front of Ling Han.","“Tell me first, what was that thing you obtained?” That elder was ranked fifth, and his upper body was bare. There was a large patch of tattoos on his back.","Ling Han now knew that the size of this tattoo directly determined the strength and time of the Flame Skin Race’s burst of power. Thus, though this old geezer might only be a Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change or Eighth Change, his burst of power might not be inferior to Nalan Huoshu.","He smiled faintly, “A key.”","When these words fell, the Fifth Elder immediately smiled, and nodded, “Very good. We can have a good talk. Young man, what do you need in exchange?”","“Firstly, I want to know the functions of the key.”","“Secondly, there is no problem for you to take the key. You can use celestial fruits to exchange for it.”","Ling Han made a condition. He really didn’t mind handing over the key, because he believed that just one key was useless. Otherwise, what need was there for the Flame Skin Race to have other keys?","Fifth Elder pondered for a moment, then said, “This is the lair of the True Phoenix. You naturally know about it already, and in the past, Lord True Phoenix had a total of nine generals under his command, and they were all Saint-level.”","“The Nine Generals live here with Lord True Phoenix and guard Lord True Phoenix.”","“Thus, the True Phoenix Palace is in the center of this place, and the Nine Great General Palaces are distributed in the surroundings.”","“Right now, the central area has been sealed off by the Great Emperor Formation. Only by opening the Nine Great General Places can we break through the formation.”","“Additionally, there is a key hidden in each palace. If you gather all nine keys, you would be able to open the True Phoenix Palace and obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix.”","After saying this, Fifth Elder smiled slightly, “Young friend, are you satisfied?”","This was more or less the same as Ling Han’s deduction, but Ling Han was sure that this Fifth Elder would definitely not be so honest as to reveal all the information.","However, he naturally couldn’t know what the other party was hiding.","“All right, let’s talk about the deal.” Ling Han cracked a smile.","“We can provide you with three Crimson Ground Fruits,” Fifth Elder said. Seeing the puzzled look on Ling Han’s face, he explained, “Crimson Ground Fruit is a Five Star Celestial medicine, and is extremely beneficial to your cultivation level.”","“How great are the benefits?” Ling Han asked. If the growth of every spiritual body was divided into a hundred steps, how could a step be the same as a fifty steps?","Fifth Elder paused, then said, “Thirty Crimson Ground Fruits can increase one’s cultivation level by a minor level.”","Ling Han immediately shook his head, “Three is too little. Three hundred should be about enough.”","Fifth Elder almost spat out a mouthful of blood. ‘You’re really asking for an exorbitant price. 300? Why don’t you demand for all the wealth of the Flame Skin Race instead?’","“Impossible!” He shook his head resolutely. Even if he had lost his mind and agreed to Ling Han’s request, the Flame Skin Race would not be able to produce so many Crimson Ground Fruits.","“All right, we’ll each take a step back, 150,” Ling Han said with a smile. He naturally knew that his offer was something that the other party could not possibly accept, and was merely an exorbitant bid.","“Ten.” Fifth Elder also raised the bid. This was called bargaining.","“Show some sincerity,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The Fifth Elder humphed, “It should be known that there are a total of nine keys. Even if we obtain the one that you have, if we don’t gather all the other keys, it would be equivalent to useless.”","Ling Han nodded, “That’s right, but without this one from me, even if you get eight, it would be useless.”","This was the reason why Ling Han was willing to sell. In any case, there was already a key in the hands of the Flame Skin Race. Thus, he only had to ensure that he had a key in his possession, and he could still grasp the initiative.","Fifth Elder considered again. This time, he named a “high price”, “Fifty.”","Ling Han took a look, and felt that this was close to maximum that the Flame Skin Race was willing to offer.","“Eighty.” Of course, he still had to continue fighting for more."]},{"number":4355,"title":"Chapter 4355: Sudden advance of cultivation level","paragraphs":["Chapter 4355: Sudden advance of cultivation level","Editor: Henyee Translations","Finally, Ling Han and the Fifth Elder reached an agreement.","Seventy Crimson Ground Fruits.","For Ling Han, this was more or less enough to increase his cultivation level by two minor levels, and for Fifth Elder, though paying this amount of Crimson Ground Fruits was a little painful, it was not to the point of serious injury, and was within acceptable limits.","Thus, the two of them were very pleased.","Ling Han deliberately ran out for a while, pretending to retrieve the key. Then, he completed the deal with the Fifth Elder.","He held these Crimson Ground Fruits, and was very satisfied.","After refining and absorbing the medicinal effects of these celestial fruits, his cultivation level should be able to reach the peak stage of the Fifth Change or even the early stage of the Sixth Change.","If he could reach Sixth Change, then when he met Lian Yutang again, he would completely be able to compete.","Why could he be so strong?","That was because he was Tenth Form, which had never been seen before. The quality of the True Self was too high, so high that even the Ninth Form could not hope to catch up to him.","Thus, with every level that he advanced, the increase in strength would naturally be terrifying.","Of course, he was only in the late stage of the Third Change now, so it was a little too early to talk about this.","Ling Han didn’t distribute these Crimson Ground Fruits to the others.","Among them, there had to be one that could stand alone. Thus, Ling Han was determined to shoulder this responsibility.","He spoke with the empress and the others for a while, then went to find a place to refine the Crimson Ground Fruits.","He took out one, washed it with clear water, and began to gnaw on it.","The fruit wasn’t big, and it was completely swallowed in a few bites. Not long after, Ling Han felt a warm sensation in his body. There was a mysterious power taking effect, and the effects were somewhat similar to the Nine Vine Fire Origin Fruit, though it was much inferior.","This medicinal power did not surge out in a single breath, but was rather slowly, slowly released.","This also caused Ling Han to cultivate the Imperial Scroll for nothing; he could only let the medicinal effects to take effect slowly.","A whole day later, the medicinal effects of this Crimson Ground Fruit were finally fully unleashed. It was absorbed by Ling Han, allowing his cultivation level to improve slightly.","Going by that calculation, if he wanted to refine all these Crimson Ground Fruits completely, he would need seventy days.","All right, in this period of time, he would keep a low profile first.","Two days, three days, four days... Time passed quietly, and Ling Han’s cultivation level was also steadily improving. Eight days later, he finally reached the consummate level of Third Change. Without any need to settle down, he immediately began to break through to the Fourth Change.","And this had still taken Ling Han some time. Three days later, Ling Han finally managed to successfully cultivate the fourth spiritual body.","Spirit Transformation Tier Fourth Change.","Ling Han’s strength had improved greatly again. However, if he wanted to defeat Lian Yutang, this was still far from enough.","“Sixth Change, at least, I have to reach Sixth Change.”","Ling Han stayed patient, and began to eat the Crimson Ground Fruits again.","His cultivation level rapidly increased again. Not only was it an increase in terms of mystical power, but he also Body Arts. If he channeled the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique, he would also be able to absorb the medicinal effects of the Crimson Ground Fruits.","A month passed, and he cultivated his fourth spiritual body to consummate level.","After settling down for a few days, he began to break through to the Fifth Change.","This took him four days, and he successfully broke through to the Fifth Change.","“Fifth Change, I still have 31 Crimson Ground Fruits in my possession, so reaching the end of the Fifth Change is completely no problem.”","“With another Change, I would be qualified to stand against the strongest level.”","“The inheritance of the True Phoenix, hehe, I am finally no longer paving the way for others.”","Ling Han first went to see the empress and the others. He hadn’t seen them for quite a few days. Furthermore, he also wanted to share some good news with them.","However, when he arrived at where the empress and the others were, he saw that there were a few strangers here. They seemed to be guards, and were standing in different directions.","These were all members of the Flame Skin Race, and they all had flaming tattoos on their arms, which could be distinguished with a single glance.","“Stop right there!” Seeing Ling Han walk over, the person standing in his direction immediately stretched out a hand towards him, indicating for him to stop.","Yi, what was the meaning of this?","“Why?” Ling Han asked.","“Lord Huoshu has already taken a fancy to these two beauties, so if you don’t want to die, then get lost,” that person explained, but at the same time, he was also filled with threat.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. Again?","Previously, it was Nalan Feiyue who had blocked their way, preventing them from leaving, and now, it was Nalan Huoshu?","He smiled faintly, “Let me offer a compliment first. Nalan Huoshu has good taste. However, he has his eye on my women, and I have never liked others coveting my women.”","“Your women?” That person couldn’t help but laugh coldly, “Since Lord Huoshu has his eye on them, then they no longer have anything to do with you!”","“Whether there is relation or not, it’s up to me to decide!” Ling Han said. “Now, step aside. Don’t force me to kill someone!”","That person instantly looked scared. After all, he knew that Ling Han had defeated even Nalan Feiyue, and there was absolutely no way that he would be a match for him.","He stepped aside, but then added, “Don’t forget who you are competing with!”","Ling Han glanced at him coldly. If it was not for the fact that this person had obediently stepped out of the way, he would definitely have moved by now, and knocked out all the teeth in this guy’s mouth.","At this moment, the empress and the others also approached.","“Little Han, someone has designs on your wives,” the large black dog immediately said.","Ling Han nodded, “I knoe.”","“What do you plan to do?” the little azure dragon asked. “How about it? Should we make a big fuss?”","He knew that Ling Han had the Great Emperor Horn, so influencing the Flame Skin Race was naturally a piece of cake for him. Thus, there was absolutely no need to worry.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Don’t be rash. I’ll wait for him to deliver himself to me.”","Right now, he was only at the Fifth Change. If he could reach the Sixth Change, then whether it was Nalan Huoshu, or the nine elders, he would be able to rival or even suppress them.","Ling Han took out the Crimson Ground Fruit, and began to eat again.","Nalan Huoshu, on the other hand, was very patient. He actually did not appear, or perhaps he did not take Ling Han seriously at all. As long as the empress and the others had not left, he would not mind waiting a few more days.","For Ling Han, this was a good thing, giving him enough time to increase his cultivation level.","10 days, 20 days, 30 days!","Ling Han finally cultivated the fifth spiritual body to consummate level, but he was still a little bit away from breaking through.","He was stabilizing, and he was accumulating power. However, previously, he had relied on the celestial fruits to rapidly increase his cultivation level, breaking through repeatedly in a short period of time. Now, he actually couldn’t find the feeling of breaking through even after so long.","However, it was at this moment that Nalan Huoshu arrived.","“I’ll give you two choices. One, get lost! Two, die!” he said to Ling Han. “Choose for yourself.”","He was really arrogant.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I’ll also give you two options. Firstly, get lost, and secondly, kneel on the ground and proclaim your defeat.”","“Haha, who do you think you are?” Nalan Huoshu laughed, “The Golden Generation?”","“Yo, you’re quite progressive with the times. You even know of the Golden Generation?” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Looks like you have chosen the path of death.” Nalan Huoshu shook his head, “How foolish.”","He had lost interest in speaking, and stretched out a hand to deliver a palm strike at Ling Han.","—"]},{"number":4356,"title":"Chapter 4356: Battling Nalan Huoshu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4356: Battling Nalan Huoshu","Editor: Henyee Translations","Nalan Huoshu was overbearing.","Previously, the Flame Skin Race didn’t know who had the palace key, so they were still quite polite to everyone. However, after Ling Han completed the transaction, his value for exploitation was also gone.","—Could it be that you have two keys?","Thus, Nalan Huoshu no longer concealed himself. However, after all, it was not the time to completely turn hostile yet. Thus, he only kept watch over the empress and the others, to prevent them from escaping.","When he obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix and left this place, the empress and Hu Niu would be his best reward.","But now, Ling Han actually dared to provoke him?","What was this!","Boom! He launched a palm strike, and Regulations intertwined. Divine patterns lit up, and their might shook the heavens.","Ling Han also replied with a punch of his own. He wanted to test out Nalan Huoshu’s strength.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, Ling Han’s figure trembled, and he took a few steps back.","He couldn’t help but feel surprised. This Nalan Huoshu was really quite awesome. He had probably cultivated to Seven Forms or even Eight Forms when he had been in the True Self Tier, and his power was really very strong.","However, his physique was extremely tough, and he was more so able to dissipate the power of attacks within six Heavens. Thus, this strike was only able to push him back.","However, in the eyes of Nalan Huoshu, Ling Han was naturally outmatched.","A haughty expression appeared on his face, and he immediately charged forward, saying, “I really don’t know where you got the courage to challenge me.”","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He was extremely domineering, and he unleashed all of his attacks, whether it was his fists, his palms, or his legs.","Ling Han was unafraid in the slightest. He moved casually, seeming to be indifferent, but the might was astonishing.","This was precisely because he had taken the first step to create his own path, so his battle prowess was naturally stronger.","After exchanging several dozen blows, Nalan Huoshu couldn’t help but frown.","Logically speaking, Ling Han having taken his attacks head-on every time, he would be sent flying every time. Ling Han’s battle prowess was far inferior to his, so after sustaining so many attacks, his internal organs should have long since exploded.","Why was this guy still able to hold on? Furthermore, he looked like he was completely fine. He was completely capable of continuing to hold on like this?","He didn’t understand, but a sense of urgency rose up in his heart. He couldn’t continue to tangle with Ling Han like this.","He would kill this opponent instantly in a single stroke.","Weng, nine spiritual bodies instantly walked out of his body, every spiritual body exuding seven colours.","Seven colours!","This meant that when he was in the True Self Tier, he had reached the height of Seven Forms or even Eight Forms.","In a Mystery Realm, there was actually such a prodigy?","No wonder Nalan Huoshu was so proud, and no wonder he could exchange a few blows with Lian Yutang. Indeed, his strength was really not weak.","Once the nine spiritual bodies appeared, it instantly became a battle of ten against one, causing Ling Han to be flustered.","With a thought from Ling Han, five spiritual bodies similarly walked out of his body.","“Fifth Change?” When Nalan Huoshu saw this, his expression involuntarily changed.","Just Fifth Change alone was enough to oppose him, a Ninth Change. Just how f****** freakish was this?","Of course, it was also possible that Ling Han was actually a Sixth Change, Seventh Change, Eighth Change or Ninth Change. It was just that he deliberately didn’t release the remaining spiritual bodies. He was just deliberately trying to scare him.","“You can’t possibly be a Fifth Change!” he immediately said. There was no such freak in this world!","He was already the strongest freak, so how could anyone surpass him?","“Frog at the bottom of a well!” Ling Han said calmly, bringing his five spiritual bodies with him as he launched a counterattack.","In terms of spiritual bodies, Ling Han was naturally no match for Nalan Huoshu. However, his spiritual body was superior in quality. Thus, even if it was a battle of six against ten, it still did not mean a one-sided defeat.","Of course, in terms of power, Nalan Huoshu was still superior. Ling Han and his spiritual bodies were all sent flying left and right.","After battling for so long, Ling Han had a complete understanding of Nalan Huoshu’s strength, and instantly lost his patience.","Weng, his spiritual bodies released a mysterious pulsation. The battle prowess of Nalan Huoshu and his nine spiritual bodies instantly dropped drastically, falling all the way by three Heavens.","What!","Nalan Huoshu paled in shock. How had his battle prowess suddenly fallen all the way by three Heavens? It should be known that though he was stronger than Ling Han, he was only stronger by four to five Heavens at most. Now that his battle prowess had been weakened by three Heavens, his advantage was very small.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, he had only sent Ling Han flying a few meters away, and was no longer as powerful as before.","He paled in shock. What kind of monster was this?","“I can’t let you live!” he said balefully, leading the nine spiritual bodies to launch a fierce offensive against Ling Han’s main body.","Capture the ringleader before capturing the lackeys. As long as Ling Han was killed, what could his spiritual bodies do?","Ling Han smiled faintly, activating the barrage of murderous aura. Weng, Nalan Huoshu was instantly hit, revealing a pained expression, his expression becoming incredibly twisted.","His nine spiritual bodies were even weaker, and they all trembled lightly.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to counterattack, especially the Spiritual Body of Destruction. As he shot out a punch, black-colored energy surged. This would also have terrifying destructive power on the spiritual body.","Nalan Huoshu’s cultivation was astonishing, and after crossing into the True Self Tier, the cultivator began to cultivate the soul. Thus, the strength of the soul was naturally greatly increased. Though he was affected by the barrage of the murderous aura, it only lasted for a while.","He immediately launched a counterattack.","However, the second wave of murderous aura assaulted him again, causing him to once again reveal an expression of pain.","Thankfully, he was already prepared. Though his mind was close to chaos, he still instinctively went into a defensive stance.","Peng!","Ling Han unleashed a mad barrage of attacks, especially when the Spiritual Body of Destruction targeted one of the spiritual bodies and attacked with all its might. Destructive Energy surged, posing a great threat to the spiritual body.","After a dozen over moves, Nalan Huoshu couldn’t hold on any longer.","One of his spiritual bodies had been blasted by Destructive Energy, and was severely injured, so he had no choice but to withdraw it back into his body.","His spiritual body had been damaged, and his own battle prowess had also declined greatly.","One had to realize that his battle prowess was only one or two Heavens above that of Ling Han’s. Now that his spiritual body had been wounded, his advantage was naturally further reduced.","He frowned. Previously, when he had been in his prime, he had still been unable to take down Ling Han. Now that a spiritual body had been damaged, if they continued to fight, wouldn’t he be at more and more of a disadvantage?","“Damn it!” he roared loudly. Boom, the fiery tree tattoos on his arms immediately released a blinding light.","He had exploded!","The most powerful trait of the Flame Skin Race was that they could activate their explosive power by combusting their tattoos. However, this was at the cost of sacrificing their lifespan. Even though their explosive power could only last for half a minute, the amount of lifespan they expended was in the hundreds of years.","Unless they had no other choice, the Flame Skin Race was naturally unwilling to do so.","But now, he definitely had to win!","Boom! His aura instantly soared, and he unleashed another palm strike. The Regulations transformed into a gigantic sword that slashed down at Ling Han.","Even Ling Han didn’t dare to face this attack head-on.","Under the explosive power, the battle prowess of Nalan Huoshu had already surpassed Ling Han by six Heavens. Thus, if he took this attack head-on, he would definitely be injured. In fact, it was not impossible that he would be insta-killed.","However, Ling Han had at least two ways to resolve this situation.","With a thought from Ling Han, the black light of illusion was unleashed.","Nalan Huoshu’s movements instantly paused, as he sank into his own beautiful dream. In this dream, he naturally had successfully killed Ling Han."]},{"number":4357,"title":"Chapter 4357: Another Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4357: Another Deal","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was in no hurry. He knew that the burst of power from Nalan Huoshu could only last for a while, so he only had to drag things out for half a minute.","As expected, after only a while, the tattoos burning fiercely on Nalan Huoshu’s arms dimmed, as if dead silent.","The burst of power had ended.","Ling Han smiled, and threw a punch.","Peng!","The danger was close at hand, and Nalan Huoshu instinctively parried. Then, he broke out of the illusion.","“You dare to trick me!” he roared in fury, appearing to be extremely furious.","A hundred years of lifespan had actually been wasted just like that.","Ling Han’s eyes turned cold, and he said calmly, “Scram immediately. Otherwise, I will definitely kill you!”","Nalan Huoshu gritted his teeth, his whole body trembling.","He wanted so much to kill Ling Han, but he no longer had any explosive power. If he forced himself to face it head-on, the result could possibly be his spiritual bodies being destroyed one after another, and finally, it would be the main body’s turn.","He had to endure this humiliation.","Nalan Huoshu took a deep breath, turned around abruptly, and left angrily.","Killing intent flashed across Ling Han’s eyes, but he didn’t give chase.","It wasn’t that he didn’t want to kill Nalan Huoshu, but that he was presently in the territory of the Flame Skin Race. If he really killed him, would those elders of the Flame Skin Race sit by and watch?","Though the battle prowess of these elders themselves was not all that impressive, the walking sticks in their hands were very frightening. They could blast out power on the level of Pseudo Sect Master, and even Lian Yutang did not dare to trifle with them.","Ling Han was only at the peak stage of the Fifth Change. If he were to face battle prowess of such levels now, he would be at a huge disadvantage.","Thus, he decided to endure for a while, because after this battle, he suddenly gained inspiration for breaking through.","He immediately sat down in a cross-legged position, attempting to break through to Sixth Change.","—Others would definitely not think that he was presently breaking through to Sixth Change.","Who would be so bold, and so rash?","They would assume that he was recovering. After all, he had just experienced a great battle.","He had made the right bet. No one from the Flame Skin Race came out to provoke him, as if he and Nalan Huoshu had only had a small conflict.","However, the empress and the others were very familiar with Ling Han. They all sat around him, protecting him in the center.","Five days later, the sixth spiritual body had already formed into an embryonic form, and developed into a mist-like shape.","Sixth Change!","Ling Han’s eyes snapped open, and two streaks of divine light shot out. It was as if they could penetrate the heavens, but it was only an instant. All the divine light had disappeared, and his eyes had returned to normal. They were very ordinary, and looked no different from any ordinary person’s. There was only a hint of gentleness in them.","“Ling Han, you’ve broken through?” Hu Niu asked.","“En.” Ling Han nodded, “Sixth Change.”","“That’s great!” Hu Niu clapped her hands, “Let’s go fight, and beat those b@stards to death!”","“That’s right! Kill them! They’re far too arrogant!” the large black dog roared.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, and said, “Don’t be anxious. Let’s go and discuss a business deal first.”","The large black dog’s eyes immediately lit up. With his understanding of Ling Han, this was Ling Han trying to scam others again.","“Alright, alright, alright.”","Ling Han stood up and left. The large black dog hurriedly followed him. The little azure dragon naturally wouldn’t miss out on this kind of excitement, so it hurriedly followed behind him.","They walked to the entrance of the palace, and Ling Han casually found a member of the Flame Skin Race, and said, “I want to see your elder.”","That member of the Flame Skin Race had witnessed the battle between Ling Han and Nalan Huoshu, so he naturally didn’t dare to be negligent. He hurriedly ran into the palace.","Ling Han and the others didn’t enter. They naturally knew that there was a Saint-level formation in the palace. If they entered, their lives would be in the hands of the person controlling the formation.","Not long after, an old man whose upper body was bare walked out with a cane in hand.","It was still Fifth Elder.","“Young friend, come in for a chat,” Fifth Elder said with a wave and a smile, looking very gentle.","How could Ling Han possibly agree? Previously, there was no animosity between them, and the other wanted to obtain the key from the palace, so he naturally wouldn’t do anything to him before he obtained it.","It was different now. He would definitely not walk right into a trap.","“The ventilation indoors isn’t good, so let’s just walk outside and chat,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Young friend, you are really careful!” Fifth Elder shook his head, “What is it? Are you still worried that I will harm you?”","Ling Han merely smiled, and did not continue the conversation.","Thus, they casually strolled around the plaza, admiring the scenery, and had some meaningless chatter.","“Young friend, what are you trying to say to me?” In the end, Fifth Elder couldn’t take it anymore. This guy clearly looked to be only in his twenties, but why was he so calm?","Ling Han smiled, and said, “I want to do another business deal with Fifth Elder.”","“Oh, could it be that you have another key?” Fifth Elder also said with a smile. This naturally was a teasing remark.","He refused to believe that Ling Han’s luck would be so good. One had to realize that Ling Han definitely couldn’t be regarded as the number one elite among those who entered this Mystery Realm. In fact, it was already extremely difficult for him to enter the top 10. And this was due to him having obtained Crimson Ground Fruits at that.","Ling Han spread open his hand, and there was an ancient-looking key in his palm.","This!","Fifth Ekder instantly looked surprised. Wasn’t this the key that they had been searching for all this while?","This brat was really amazing. He had actually obtained two keys.","“Same old rules, seventy Crimson Ground Fruits,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Fifth Elder gritted his teeth, feeling a deep pain in his balls.","Actually, as long as all the keys had not been gathered, there was not much difference between having one or eight.","Thus, if Ling Han had taken out two keys before, he would probably only be willing to give out 70 Crimson Ground Fruits, at most.","This guy clearly had two keys, yet sold one at a time. Wasn’t this clearly trying to screw him over?","“Young friend, this is a little inappropriate of you.” Fifth Elder shook his head, a hint of displeasure on his face.","He wanted Ling Han to know.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t give in just because of this, and he asked, “What’s inappropriate?”","“Young friend, you should also know that there is not much difference between possessing one key and two keys.” Fifth Elder said, “Thus, to sell two keys for the same high price, there is naturally a lack of fairness.”","Ling Han nodded, “If that’s the case, then fine. Let’s go.”","He nodded at the large black dog and the little azure dragon.","“Yi, where are you guys going?” Fifth Elder hurriedly asked.","“Of course I’m going to find someone who can afford the price,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Someone not so stingy,” the large black dog added.","Fifth Elder instantly wanted to slap someone. Was this called being stingy?","You guys screwed us over first, all right?","He humphed, and said, “Young friend, don’t refuse a toast only to be forced to drink a forfeit!”","“What is it? Want to turn hostile and make a move?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Fifth Elder smiled faintly, “These few days, you are all trying to probe our background, but aren’t we the same? Young friend Ling, I have heard that you are not very well-liked in the Ancestral King Academy.”","“Is that so?” Ling Han pretended to be surprised, and looked towards the large black dog, “Old Black, what do you think?”","“How could that be!” The large black dog’s expression was filled with anger, “Our Little Han is too popular, and is loved by everyone. Where did this rumor come from? This is practically a serious slander against our Little Han.”","—"]},{"number":4358,"title":"Chapter 4358: Falling Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 4358: Falling Out","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing these words, Fifth Elder did not know how to complain.","Slander?","Was everyone slandering them?","It was fine if only one or two of them said this, but more importantly, everyone was saying the same thing. How could it be faked?","Fifth Elder forced out a smile, and said, “Young friend Ling, a person should still have some principles. Hand the key over to me, and it can be considered that our clan owes you a favour, all right? At that time, when the Palace of the True Phoenix opens, there will be no shortage of benefits for you.”","Ling Han also smiled, “Then why don’t Fifth Elder give me the keys that your Flame Skin Race have? At that time, when I return from the Palace of the True Phoenix, I will definitely give you all some benefits.”","‘Holy f*ck!’","The Fifth Elder finally couldn’t laugh anymore. Why was this brat so stubborn?","“Young friend, are you forcing me to make a move?” He revealed a baleful expression.","“Finally showing your true colours?” Ling Han said with a smile. “Come, I also want to see how strong you are.”","He gave a signal with his eyes, and the large black dog and little azure dragon immediately retreated.","They were too weak, and could not help Ling Han. Instead, they would only be a burden.","The Fifth Elder did not stop them. In his eyes, Ling Han was the real thorn in his side. As for the others? Hehe, their abilities were too weak, and he could easily capture them with a stretch of his hand.","“Young friend, you’re a little arrogant,” the old geezer said slowly.","“Old geezer, you’re taking advantage of your seniority a bit,” Ling Han retorted.","Fifth Elder was taken aback. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so rude. He humphed, and directly brandished his walking stick, which swept towards Ling Han.","He knew himself well. His own strength was far inferior to Nalan Huoshu. Thus, even Nalan Huoshu had been defeated by Ling Han, so he was naturally even less of a match for Ling Han.","However, this didn’t matter. The walking stick in his hand was a Six Star Spirit Tool, and could unleash the might of Pseudo Sect Master-levl.","Could it be that it was still unable to suppress Ling Han?","Boom, this walking stick glowed all over, and as it shot out an attack, a firebird flew out, blasting towards Ling Han.","Pseudo Sect Master-level!","Ling Han was eager to give it a try, and greeted it with a punch.","“You’re seeking death!” Fifth Elder couldn’t help but scoff.","Peng!","A punch landed on the firebird, and Ling Han instantly felt a strong burning pain rise up in his fist. A massive power assailed him, causing him to be sent flying into the air.","He spat out a mouthful of blood, then straightened his back and stood firmly.","F***, he was still unable to withstand a Pseudo Sect Master-level attack.","Ling Han looked at his right hand. There was a burnt mark on his fist, and under the shockwave of power, the skin on his arm and chest also cracked, with blood seeping out.","“Young friend, why are you so stubborn?” Fifth Elder asked hypocritically, as he once again brandished his walking stick to strike Ling Han.","Since he had already made his move, he naturally would not show any mercy.","With the two of them fighting, the people in the surroundings also came closer to watch the battle, but they did not dare to get too close. The power of Pseudo Sect Master-level, was too terrifying. If they came into contact with that, they would definitely be out of luck.","Hence, it was fine to watch the show, but no one wanted to be implicated.","“As expected, it’s Ling Han again!”","“I say, who would be so outrageously bold to dare oppose Pseudo Sect Master-level? Aside from Ling Han, who else could it be?”","“However, I can’t help but admire this guy’s courage. He really dares to trifle with anyone.”","Everyone discussed spiritedly. While they were hostile towards Ling Han, they had no choice but to show some respect.","However, how could Ling Han get through this?","Without another word, Ling Han immediately turned around and fled.","“Trying to escape?” Fifth Elder humphed. Since he had made a move, he would definitely capture Ling Han — the key was still in Ling Han’s hands.","One fled, while the other pursued. Very soon, they had disappeared from the plaza.","At this time, another eight old men leaped out of the palace, looking towards where Ling Han and the Fifth Elder had disappeared.","“There’s no problem with Old Fifth, right?” an elder asked.","“Though that brat is very strong, Old Fifth has the Firebird Staff in hand. In this place, he is invincible,” another old man said.","“We only need to wait for a while, and Old Fifth will return with that brat’s head.”","...","Ling Han ran like crazy, seeming to be in a panic, scrambling towards places with complicated terrain.","The Fifth Elder naturally pursued him relentlessly. This involved the inheritance of the True Phoenix. No matter what, he would not allow Ling Han to escape.","After chasing for a very, very long time, he discovered that Ling Han had suddenly stopped, and had even turned around.","“Ha, now that you know that it is impossible for you to escape, you want to fight to the death?” Fifth Elder asked smilingly, but he did not dare to be careless. After all, his own strength was not very strong. He had to guard against Ling Han’s dying counterattack, and himself being dragged down with him.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “There is no one here, so it would be convenient for me to make a move.”","If the large black dog was here, he would definitely know Ling Han’s intentions. This was obviously Ling Han hiding his strength, so that he could screw others over in future.","“I really don’t know where you get your confidence from.” Fifth Elder humphed, and waved his walking stick again. Hong, a firebird flew out, pouncing towards Ling Han.","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower suddenly appeared, floating above Ling Han’s head.","Peng!","The firebird struck, causing the precious tower to tremble slightly, but that was the extent of it.","“What!” Fifth Elder instantly revealed an expression of shock.","What kind of precious tool was this, that it could actually withstand an attack from the Firebird Staff?","“You’re not the only one with a Spirit Tool,” Ling Han said with a smile. “How about it? This Spirit Tool of mine is kickass, right?”","The Fifth Elder frowned. Merely this attack was not enough to explain the might of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. However, this precious tower was exuding an aura of Primal Chaos, and there were flashes of lightning flickering on the body of the tower, giving him a supreme pressure.","It should be known that even the Firebird Staff could not be so awesome.","“What kind of weapon is this Spirit Tool?” he couldn’t help but ask.","“This...” Ling Han paused for a moment before continuing, “This is a Spirit Tool forged from Origin Gold. In other words, it’s a future Imperial Weapon!”","Pu!","The Fifth Elder instantly spluttered. What, Imperial Weapon!","No, no, no, this wasn’t an Imperial Weapon. It was only forged from the Origin Gold, but what grade of material was the Origin Gold? No wonder it gave him such a solid feeling of majesty.","All of a sudden, greed rose up in his heart.","The inheritance of the True Phoenix was only a legend. It had been talked about for generations, but they had never seen it until now. On the other hand, the Flame Skin Race had been trapped here for generations, and it was unknown when they would be able to leave.","However, the precious tool in front of him was real.","“Give it to me, and I can spare your life,” Fifth Elder said.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “Do you think I’m stupid? I give it to you, and then you turn around and kill me? Heh, do you think I summoned the Imperial Weapon to beg you for mercy? Wrong, I only don’t want others to know that I have an Imperial Weapon.”","As long as others saw it, it would expose the fact that the Nine Mountains Saint didn’t actually possess an Imperial Weapon. Then, whether it was him or the Nine Mountains Saint, or even the Nine Suns Holy Land, they would all be in danger.","Thus, since Ling Han was going to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he definitely couldn’t use it in front of everyone else. Moreover, since he was going to use it, he definitely had to kill him to keep him from leaking the secret.","“Come battle!” Ling Han commanded the Pseudo Imperial Weapon, blasting it towards Fifth Elder.","—"]},{"number":4359,"title":"Chapter 4359: Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4359: Killed","Editor: Henyee Translations","In terms of the might of a Spirit Tool, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was actually no match for the Firebird Staff.","After all, the Firebird Staff was Six Stars, while the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was linked to Ling Han’s cultivation level, and could only be considered Five Stars.","However, Fifth Elder was only Spirit Transformation Tier. He couldn’t unleash the full might of the Firebird Staff, while Ling Han could maximize the might of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and completely unleash it.","Moreover, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was forged from Origin Gold, after all, and was the emperor of all weapons. It naturally countered all Spirit Tools that weren’t Imperial Weapons.","As time passed, the might of the Firebird Staff was no stronger than the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Then would Ling Han still be at a disadvantage?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The firebird attacked, and it was all blocked by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Moreover, under the Origin Gold’s suppression, the firebird’s power was greatly decreased.","Meanwhile, Ling Han bombarded Fifth Elder madly. Without the Firebird Staff, this old geezer’s strength was only on the level of Nalan Feiyue, so how could he possibly be a match for him?","However, after only a few moves, a punch landed on Fifth Elder’s chest, causing him to throw up blood madly. All his organs had turned into pieces, spluttering out together.","Fifth Elder paled in shock. He had never imagined that he would fall into such a dangerous situation.","But at this time and place, who could he ask for help from?","He could only depend on himself.","He roared loudly, and instantly, the flaming tattoo burned fiercely. He directly unleashed a hundred years of lifespan in exchange for a burst of power.","‘Die!’","Brandishing the Firebird Staff, he charged towards Ling Han.","But Ling Han had already advanced into Sixth Change, and completely overwhelmed him in terms of strength. So what if you got a burst of power?","Boom!","Ling Han forcefully suppressed him. Fifth Elder was no match for him at all, and his injuries continued to worsen.","And this was still because Fifth Elder had the Firebird Staff. Otherwise, in a battle that was completely based on his own strength, he would probably be insta-killed.","“Damn it!”","Half a minute’s time passed very quickly. Fifth Elder’s burst of power had passed. He cursed lowly, but without the slightest hesitation, seven figures darted out of his body, and together with his main body, fled in eight different directions.","The strength of Spirit Transformation Tier lay in the fact that even if they were killed, as long as they left behind a spiritual body, they could still live as long as they found another host to possess.","Of course, this would definitely be a serious injury, and there would be no possibility of further improvement in the future.","But now, the most important thing was to stay alive.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He wanted to flee?","Weng, the barrage of murderous aura activated, and the movements of the eight Fifth Elders faltered at the same time, as an expression of pain appeared on their faces.","Ling Han also summoned his spiritual bodies. The six spiritual bodies charged out, channeling Destructive Energy and beginning a massacre.","Pa, pa, pa! One after another, spiritual bodies were instantly destroyed. When Fifth Elder recovered from the barrage of murderous aura, there were already four spiritual bodies that had been destroyed, causing him to pale in shock.","This was too fast, wasn’t it?","However, he didn’t have the time to worry about this, and he and the remaining spiritual bodies hurriedly continued to flee for their lives.","Ling Han did not use the murderous aura to attack again. Instead, three spiritual bodies pursued the three spiritual bodies of Fifth Elder respectively, while he himself pursued Fifth Elder himself.","Fifth Elder brandished the Firebird Staff, struggling at death’s door, but in only a few breaths’ time, he sensed that his spiritual bodies had been destroyed.","Not one, but all the three that had escaped.","If he was also killed, then he would be completely done for.","When he thought of this, Fifth Elder became even crazier.","He did not want to die. He did not want to die at all.","However, this was only his unrealistic fantasy. Ling Han’s every move was swift and fierce. In just a few moves, Fifth Elder was killed with a single punch.","Right at this moment, another spiritual body shot out from Fifth Elder’s body, rushing out in the instant before his mind was destroyed.","As it turned out, Fifth Elder was not a Seventh Change, but rather an Eighth Change!","He had deliberately hidden a spiritual body in order to lull Ling Han into a false sense of security. If Ling Han was caught off guard, he might be able to escape.","“As expected!” Ling Han said with a smile. Eighth Change wasn’t Eight Forms, and those who could reach Eight Forms had to be the Golden Generation or the most outstanding of the Silver Generation. However, in the case of Eight Forms, hehe, one only had to form eight True Selves in the True Self Tier.","As long as one was a prodigy, they would basically be able to achieve this.","Thus, when Ling Han saw that Fifth Elder only had seven spiritual bodies, he had already begun to wonder if the latter had deliberately hidden one or two spiritual bodies. By the looks of it now, that was indeed the case.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, as fast as lightning, and instantly grabbed the last spiritual body of Fifth Elder.","“Don’t kill me!” Fifth Elder begged, “As long as you spare my life, you can do whatever you want.”","“Crimson Ground Fruits, as many as you want!”","Ling Han shook his head, “No need!”","His fingers tightened. Peng! The last spiritual body of Fifth Elder was also forcefully crushed.","“Should I lure out a few more elders to kill?” Ling Han thought for a moment, then shook his head. This was very difficult.","Because only he had returned, yet Fifth Elder had disappeared. Everyone would be suspicious, right?","If that was all, then so be it. Most importantly, there were Saint-level formations in every palace. Ling Han did not dare to enter. If he was targeted, he would die a very tragic death.","“I’d better meet up with Old Black and the others first.”","Ling Han had already discussed this with the large black dog and the others. Thus, he didn’t return to the Flame Skin Race. After collecting all of the treasures from Fifth Elder, he set off to look for the empress and the others.","Very quickly, he found the empress and the others, and the two sides successfully reunited.","He explained what had happened, then took out the Spirit Tool that he had obtained from Fifth Elder. Previously, he had not had the time to examine it.","With this look, he revealed a smile.","There were nineteen Crimson Ground Fruits inside.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then distributed the Crimson Ground Fruits to the empress and the others. It wasn’t that he didn’t need them, but rather firstly, this number was too small, and it wouldn’t increase his cultivation level much. Secondly, the speed of his cultivation level increasing in a short period of time was too fast, so he had to slow it down a bit to avoid spoiling things and damaging his foundations.","“Let’s go find the sixth palace?”","“M-hm.”","Ling Han nodded. Only after opening all the palace halls would the True Phoenix Mystery Realm truly open. Only then would the eight elders of the Flame Skin Race come out of the palace halls.","The empress and the others continued to advance as they ate the Crimson Ground Fruits. Because the medicinal effects of this fruit were relatively weak, they didn’t need to channel the cultivation technique to refine it. Thus, absorbing the medicinal effects as they traveled didn’t affect them at all.","Several days later, they arrived at the fifth palace, but this place had already been visited by Ling Han and the little red bird. Thus, they did not stop here, and continued onwards.","Another four days later, they found the sixth palace.","This was a familiar scene. Many people were standing in the plaza, studying the method to open the palace doors.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over the surroundings, and saw a few familiar faces here, such as Lian Yutang.","“Let’s go.”","Ling Han brought the little red bird with him, and walked over very quietly. He opened the main doors, and then had the little red bird retrieve the key. The whole process took less than five minutes.","Then, he quietly returned, and set out once more with the others, heading towards the seventh palace."]},{"number":4360,"title":"Chapter 4360: Big Loss","paragraphs":["Chapter 4360: Big Loss","Editor: Henyee Translations","The journey was very smooth. After the seventh palace hall opened, it was the eighth. Then, they arrived at the ninth palace hall.","After opening this palace, according to the words of the Flame Skin Race, the invisible barrier in front of them would disappear, and they would be able to advance into the True Phoenix Palace.","Of course, if one wanted to open the True Phoenix Palace, he still needed to gather all nine keys.","—This was the theory of the Flame Skin Race, but who knew how much of it was true.","Ling Han and the others opened the ninth palace. After opening the doors and obtaining the key, they quickly left, going against the flow of the lava river.","True enough, they did not encounter that invisible barrier again.","Calculating the distance, they should have encountered it long ago, but their path was smooth and unobstructed, which meant that the barrier from before must have disappeared.","The group set out on their journey at full speed. Perhaps, the Flame Skin Race had concealed some important information, so it was best that they were in place to observe the situation first.","Huala, the river of lava surged, seals rising, then rapidly shattering, exuding an indescribable might.","Though Ling Han’s cultivation level had greatly improved, he still did not have the slightest bit of confidence to touch this lava — even if it could not insta-kill him, it would at least cause serious injury.","A thought flashed in his mind. He had already used up his Heavenly Dao Flames, so could he collect some lava?","This might not be as awesome as the Heavenly Dao Flames, but its might was at least on the level of Sect Master, or even more terrifying.","He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, beginning to collect the lava.","However, it was as if this lava had a life of its own. If one wanted to suck up a little, there would be endless lava pulling at it, not allowing that little bit of separation.","After trying many times, Ling Han didn’t gain anything at all.","“Yi, what is that?” The large black dog pointed ahead.","Everyone looked over, only to see what looked like a floating island floating down from the upper reaches of the lava river.","“Fire turtle!” Yet Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He had seen it before.","“Let’s fight it!” Ling Han rolled up his sleeves. Previously, he was no match for it, but now that he had advanced into Sixth Change, who among Spirit Transformation Tiers could not be touched?","“You guys step back a little, or you’ll be hurt by the lava,” he said to the empress and the others.","The might of this lava was too terrifying. If one was splashed by it, that would definitely not be a joke.","Ling Han charged forwards, his speed increasing, getting closer and closer to that “floating island”.","“Old fire turtle, come, let’s have another battle!” He laughed loudly, and took the initiative to attack, throwing out a punch.","Hua!","The lava broke apart, and a massive turtle emerged. The shell of the turtle was covered with dark red veined patterns.","Yi, there seemed to be something off?","Ling Han thought internally, but he had already shot out a punch, so how could he withdraw it?","The fire turtle seemed to have been angered. It raised a giant foot and stomped down on Ling Han. Hong long long, it was extremely terrifying.","‘Holy f*ck!’","The moment this fire turtle made its move, Ling Han knew what was off.","It was not the same one at all!","This one was larger, and its cultivation level was naturally higher.","Not just a little bit higher, but a whole lot higher!","Sect Master-level.","It should be known that this place restricted the cultivation level of those who entered, and the creatures inside were only Spirit Transformation Tier. It seemed like there was a strange power restriction, and it was impossible for creatures that surpassed Spirit Transformation Tier to appear.","Who would have thought that a living being on the level of Sect Master would suddenly appear?","He understood now. This was the world behind the barrier, so it was completely different.","First impressions killed people!","Ling Han sighed as he hurriedly unleashed his full power.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The six spiritual bodies all appeared. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also appeared. The Ice Moon Saber slashed out, and Destructive Energy surged.","He had used all of his trump cards at this moment, such as the barrage of murderous aura, the black light of illusion, and the horn of the Great Emperor.","It couldn’t be helped. Who asked him to launch a charge of death at a creature on the level of Sect Master?","Now, he had to do his best to save his life!","Peng!","The fire turtle stomped down, and Ling Han’s resistance was like a mantis trying to stop a chariot. He couldn’t even withstand a single blow, and without a doubt, he was stomped down, instantly disappearing without a trace.","“Ling Han!” everyone shouted.","What was going on here? Ling Han had charged out so confidently, yet in the end, he had been defeated with a single move?","At this time, the fire turtle also raised its giant foot. Xiu, a figure quickly scuttled out.","It was Ling Han.","However, though he hadn’t been killed by this attack, he still looked extremely miserable. The six spiritual bodies were all extremely dispirited, and the main body was also covered in blood. In fact, even his eerie white bones could be seen. Clearly, he had been severely injured.","However, his life was more important at this moment, so Ling Han immediately started to flee.","Fortunately, they hadn’t come too close before. Now that they saw Ling Han fleeing, how could they hesitate any longer? They immediately turned around and fled as well. However, they maintained a fair distance from Ling Han, lest the fire turtle suddenly turn around to pursue them.","Ling Han continuously blew the horn of the Great Emperor, blocking the fire turtle’s pursuit time and time again. After about an hour, the fire turtle finally stopped its pursuit, turned around and returned.","Pa, Ling Han flopped onto the ground, baring his teeth, feeling extremely terrible.","At this moment, the empress and the others also ran over and stepped forward to ask.","Ling Han was truly severely wounded. Several of his bones were broken, and his internal injuries were quite severe. His spiritual bodies were also greatly damaged. However, he didn’t die in the end, and he wasn’t left with any irrecoverable dao injuries either.","That was good.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief, and then began to tease him.","“What’s wrong with you?” The large black dog pretended to be curious, and asked, “Weren’t you going to beat the turtle? Why were you almost trampled to death by the turtle?”","The little azure dragon laughed loudly, and said, “This is called being struck by lightning for showing off too much.”","“Hahaha!” Everyone laughed loudly. All of them were delighting at his misfortune, causing Ling Han to feel gloomy. These bad friends!","“I won’t allow you guys to bully Niu’s Ling Han!” Hu Niu placed her hands on her hips, furious.","Ling Han felt greatly gratified. His beautiful wife was still the best.","“Ling Han can only be bullied by Niu alone!” Hu Niu continued.","Ling Han: “...”","Sigh, his image had really been ruined this time.","He had been brilliant and mighty all his life, yet in the end, his reputation was completely ruined just because of an old turtle. How depressing, how very depressing.","“All right, I’ll remember this, you guys,” Ling Han said.","“Hahaha.” Everyone laughed loudly.","Ling Han immediately began to ingest alchemical pills. Then, he channelled the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique. This was Body Arts, which was also extremely helpful in healing injuries.","At this moment, everyone naturally wouldn’t laugh at Ling Han anymore. Instead, they would stand guard nearby for him.","A whole five days passed, and Ling Han had finally recovered more than half, but if he wanted to completely recover, it was impossible without two to three months.","“It’s all right. I can at least battle now,” Ling Han said. Though Ling Han could only unleash 50% of his battle prowess, as long as he did not encounter a Golden Generation like Lian Yutang, the rest were mediocre, and he would be able to sweep aside all opposition.","“Is there really no problem?” the large black dog asked seriously.","“Of course.”","Everyone set out and continued to advance. However, after suffering a loss once, they naturally didn’t dare to approach the lava river again.","He had actively provoked a Sect Master-level existence, yet he had actually not died. This was really good luck, but one could only have so much good luck, so he had best behave himself."]},{"number":4361,"title":"Chapter 4361: Kidnap?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4361: Kidnap?","Editor: Henyee Translations","If they didn’t walk along the river, they would definitely have to enter the primitive forest.","Actually, this place was not necessarily safe either. Multiple great trees rose from the ground, their leaves like fire, and there were firebirds perched on them. The slightest movement would alert them, and they would pounce over in large groups.","The battle prowess of the firebird itself was not strong, but after it was killed, it would self-explode. That was no joke. Probably, even great Sect Master elites would have to avoid it, and would rather encounter the great fire turtle.","Ling Han and the others were all cautious, not wanting to alert these firebirds in the slightest.","They continued to advance, and after a few days, they discovered that the firebirds had disappeared.","The trees were still the same trees, but the firebirds were gone.","At first, they did not dare to be careless, but as they walked, they discovered that the firebirds had really all disappeared.","However, Ling Han frowned upon seeing this.","“Little Han, why do you look so distressed?” the large black dog asked with a smile.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “The firebirds have disappeared, so it’s extremely likely that there’s an even more terrifying existence here.”","“Hey, don’t scare me!” The large black dog shuddered.","The perverted pig squeaked even louder, meaning that if he had known this earlier, Grandpa Pig should have stayed in the academy to court girls, b@stard.","“Didn’t you already know how to talk? Why are you pretending to be mute?!” The large black dog kicked him.","“Be careful, I am not mistaken,” Ling Han said solemnly.","Thinking about Ling Han’s words, they did indeed make sense. Furthermore, there was nothing wrong with being careful. It was ultimately better than regretting if something happened.","After walking for a while, Ling Han heard the rustling of tree leaves.","He stretched out a hand and pressed down, indicating for everyone to stop.","“What did you discover?” Chi Menghan asked.","Ling Han looked upwards, “There seems to be something up there.”","“What is it?” Hu Niu was curious, “Can it be eaten?”","Ling Han activated his eye technique, allowing his vision to see through the leaves. After a thorough search, he revealed an astounded expression.","“Monkey,” he said.","Monkey?","Everyone looked at each other. Would monkeys be very scary?","Right at this moment, sha, sha, the sound of leaves rubbing against each other was even louder. Then, a monkey’s head stretched out. It was small, only the size of a fist. Its fur was as red as fire, and the color of its eyes was similar. They were looking this way and that quickly, and it appeared extremely lively.","Because of Brother Monkey, Ling Han had an automatic favorable impression of monkeys. Hence, he broke into a smile and waved at the little monkey.","The little monkey imitated him and waved its hand at Ling Han.","“Little monkey, this is for you.” Hu Niu took out a chicken drumstick, and pa, threw it at the little monkey.","However, the little monkey didn’t take the chicken drumstick. Instead, it seemed to have been angered. It hugged the branch and began to shake it. Hua, hua, hua! The fiery red leaves instantly fell like rain.","These were no ordinary leaves, but rather burning flames!","Ling Han hurriedly spread out the Starlight Screen, protecting everyone within.","The leaves fell, hong, hong, hong. The Starlight Screen continued to explode with light, and there were even signs of melting.","What a terrifying melting power!","Hua, hua, hua! The little monkey was still shaking, and more leaves fell.","‘F*ck! Are you done yet?’","Ling Han immediately shot out a murderous aura attack. Weng, the little monkey’s movements suddenly stopped, and it directly fell down from the tree.","Hu Niu’s eyes were sharp and her hands were quick. With a scoop, she had already grabbed the little monkey.","“Hehe, fun,” she said with a smile, her eyes crinkling into crescent moons.","“It’s truly dangerous here,” Chi Menghan said with emotion. This monkey was only at the Core Formation Tier, yet it could pose a great threat to them. If they were careless, they might even be wounded by it.","Sha, sha, sha! The sound of tree leaves rubbing against each other rang out again, causing everyone to tense.","“Not good!” Ling Han’s gaze swept over, and couldn’t help but pale in shock. “A group of monkeys has come!”","This monkey’s individual battle prowess was not strong, but just like how the firebird would self-explode, when the monkey shook the leaves, it could also pose a great threat.","With a thought from Ling Han, he used his palm like a saber, and delivered a slash at the large tree beside him.","A terrifying power swept past, and the great tree was instantly severed in half, collapsing with a loud rumble.","When everyone saw this, they immediately understood, and began to make a move on the large tree beside them.","After a few times, the nearby trees had all fallen, clearing out a large area of empty land.","In this way, the monkeys would not be able to shake off the tree leaves to attack them.","On the surrounding trees, monkeys crouched on the branches, all of them squeaking at Ling Han and the others, baring their fangs, looking extremely unfriendly.","These monkeys were probably also very depressed. They hadn’t even launched an attack, and their offensive weapon was already gone.","These monkeys were slightly bigger, and with the comparison, it was clear that the little monkey just now was really a little guy. It was a baby monkey.","No wonder the monkey army was alerted.","“Why don’t we return the little monkey to them?” the little red bird suggested.","Hu Niu instantly hugged the little monkey tightly, “No, Niu wants to play!”","“Zhi!” The little monkey was originally in a coma, but after being strangled too tightly by her, it instantly woke up. It stuck out its tongue, looking like it was about to die.","This enraged the monkeys, and they all shook their branches, releasing squeaking sounds.","The sky was filled with fiery red leaves, balls of blazing flames. Though they were incredibly dangerous, they also had an indescribable beauty to them.","Fortunately, Ling Han and the others had already cleared the nearby fire trees in advance. Although the range of these flaming leaves was very large, there were only a limited number of them that could approach Ling Han and the others, so dealing with them was easy.","Xiu, at this moment, a monkey leaped down from the tree. One front paw gripped tightly, while the other three paws supported themselves on the ground, as it walked towards Ling Han and the others.","This monkey was clearly larger than the other monkeys, exuding the aura of a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator. Moreover, it was an extremely powerful one at that.","It was probably at the level of Ninth Change.","Monkey King?","This giant monkey stopped in front of Ling Han and the others. Then, it spread open its tightly clenched claw, and in its palm, there was actually a light yellow fruit.","Yi, as expected of a monkey. Even if it was a ferocious beast, it actually knew how to negotiate.","His meaning was very clear. He wanted to use the fruit to exchange for the little monkey.","Ling Han hadn’t planned to kidnap him in the first place. Thus, he smiled at Hu Niu and said, “Niu, return the little monkey to him.”","“No, Niu wants to play!” Hu Niu couldn’t bear to. The little monkey was so cute.","“Be good,” Ling Han advised.","Hu Niu pouted, then her eyes lit up, “Unless you agree to have another child with Niu.”","Pu!","The large black dog and little azure dragon both spluttered in laughter. Meanwhile, Chi Menghan covered her beautiful face, feeling a little embarrassed.","This was Hu Niu, doing whatever she liked, upright and frank from the start.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. “Alright.”","Hearing Ling Han agree, Hu Niu finally revealed a happy smile, and tossed the little monkey over to Ling Han.","Ling Han walked forwards, and completed the transaction with the Monkey King. Er, one handed over the monkey, and one handed over the fruit.","The Monkey King immediately brought the little monkey back. After climbing onto a tree, a female monkey came over and carried the little monkey away.","However, the monkeys didn’t retreat. Instead, they stared at Ling Han and the others, revealing their ferocious nature.","C"]},{"number":4362,"title":"Chapter 4362: Killing a bird","paragraphs":["Chapter 4362: Killing a bird","Editor: Henyee Translations","The matter was not so easily resolved.","By the looks of it, now that the problem of the hostage was resolved, the monkeys were about to launch a revengeful offensive.","However, the nearby fire trees had already been cleared, and there were no weapons that could be used for attack. Thus, these monkeys only glared at them angrily, but did not immediately attack.","It was also because of this that Ling Han didn’t pay much attention to them. He simply looked at the fruit in his hand.","“Luan Xing, here.” He stuffed the fruit into the empress’ hands. Because this was a Four Star Celestial medicine, it could benefit a True Self Tier, but the effects would be much worse for a Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Hence, to make the most of it, it must be given to the empress or Hu Niu.","“Since these monkeys can bring a celestial fruit, I believe that they can bring a second and third celestial fruit.” Ling Han’s eyes shone, “Who knows, there may even be Five Star celestial fruits!”","If it was five stars, then he, the large black dog, Chi Menghan and the others would be able to consume it.","He strode forward, planning to rob a few more “monkeys”.","The large black dog and little azure dragon followed. The perverted pig naturally wouldn’t do anything dangerous even if he was beaten to death. Meanwhile, Chi Menghan stayed behind to guard the main camp, preventing the monkeys from turning the tables and taking a hostage themselves.","Ling Han had already walked to the tree. At this moment, with a command from the Monkey King, the monkeys in the vicinity immediately began to shake their branches.","The fiery leaves fell, and it was as if the whole world were on fire.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he unleashed his murderous aura into the sky.","Pa, pa, pa! Like raindrops, the monkeys instantly fell from the trees.","Most of these monkeys were at the True Self Tier, so how could they possibly block the murderous aura’s attack? Upon contact, they naturally fell unconscious.","This time, the monkeys were dumbfounded.","Er, just now, only one of his companions had fallen into Ling Han’s hands, but now, there were as many as... ithey could not be counted on one hand.","Ling Han returned with his “trophies”, then crooked a finger at the Monkey King.","‘Come, go and get some fruits to trade.’","If the fierce beasts he was facing were like the firebirds, they would definitely not know what he meant, but monkeys were different. They were very smart.","The Monkey King let out a sharp cry, and instantly, all the monkeys retreated one after another like birds startled by a bowstring.","It could be clearly seen that there was a commotion on the treetops, which was rapidly disappearing into the distance.","Like the firebirds, these monkeys were naturally immune to fire attacks.","Not long after, the monkeys had already returned.","This time, not only did the Monkey King land, but there were also seven giant monkeys following behind it. All of them were walking on three paws.","Coming close, the monkeys spread out their tightly clenched claws one after another. As expected, there was a fruit in every claw.","After completing the transaction again, Ling Han was very satisfied. Though the fruits he had traded were still only Four Star-level, it was still profitable to gain something without risking anything.","This time, after returning the “monkey hostages”, the monkeys no longer wanted to take revenge. With a whistle, they left one after another.","They couldn’t afford another loss.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “This kind of monkey is indeed cute, so there’s no harm in giving me more.”","Everyone laughed as well. This time, it was a close call, and they had even earned a few Four Star celestial fruits.","They advanced very carefully, because the monkeys lived on the trees. If they were deliberately lying in ambush, it was really possible that they would catch them off guard.","After walking for a while, they heard a sharp whistle. A black dot appeared in the skies, and was presently moving rapidly.","Very quickly, the black dot enlarged. It was actually a giant bird with fiery red feathers. Its tail was extraordinarily long, and was at least four times the length of its body.","This giant bird descended rapidly, then stretched out its claws, and suddenly stopped on the tree trunk.","After the fiery tree trembled violently, a monkey appeared in the giant bird’s claws. It screamed a few times, and its body was pierced through by claws like Divine Metal. Its limbs instantly drooped.","All around them, the monkeys were in an uproar, screaming endlessly. However, the giant bird raised its head, looked around for a while, then lowered its head and used its sharp beak to tear open the monkey’s body, beginning to eat.","“Monkeys are so cute, why do you have to eat them!” Hu Niu called out from below.","Ling Han sighed. This girl was the least qualified to say such words. Along the way, who knew how many types of vicious beasts had been eaten by this little girl.","Now, it was rare for her to find a conscience.","Although the monkeys were furious, it was meaningless for them to charge forward to fight, whether it was because they were afraid of the giant bird or because their companion was already dead. Thus, they only let out sharp cries, but not one of them rushed over to fight.","“Ling Han, Niu wants to eat bird meat!” Hu Niu said as she pointed at the large bird, drooling. In the next instant, she returned to her gluttonous nature.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded. Relatively speaking, he was definitely more inclined towards the monkeys, even if the monkeys had made a move on him previously.","He leaped up, and xiu, he had already arrived at the top of the tree.","The giant bird stopped for a moment, and glanced at him. Then, it ignored him and began to eat on its own.","“Big bird... ptui!” Ling Han felt that this name was a little dirty, so he simply didn’t say anything else, and directly rushed up to make a move.","The giant bird stopped eating, opened its mouth, and hong, a flame shot out, turning into a spirit snake that pounced towards Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t stop. Starlight Screen spread out. Peng, the flames hit him, yet they spread out in all directions, unable to wound him in the slightest.","In an instant, he had arrived in front of the giant bird, and brandished his fist in a punch.","They were both in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, so Ling Han was naturally unafraid of any opponent.","The large bird seemed to be shocked. Its attack was actually ineffective?","This time, it didn’t spit fire anymore. Instead, it directly pecked at Ling Han’s fist.","Spirit Transformation Tier vicious beasts didn’t have spiritual bodies, but in comparison, their own attacks were extremely powerful.","The sharpness of its beak was completely not inferior to a Celestial Tool of the same level!","“Heh, let’s compete.” Ling Han naturally wouldn’t cower, and he faced it head-on.","Peng!","The beak of the bird landed on the fist, and a blazing light exploded. Then, the giant bird was sent flying. Its beak was crooked, and blood was gushing out.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Though he had not recovered yet, and could only unleash half of his battle prowess, suppressing this giant bird was a piece of cake for him.","The large bird was shocked, and hurriedly flapped its wings. It did not even want its food anymore, and only wanted to leave this place.","“My Hu Niu still wants to eat bird meat, so how could I possibly let you go?” Ling Han shouted loudly, unleashing the barrage of murderous aura. Weng, the giant bird directly fell down from the skies.","It was dead.","Previously, those monkeys had only fainted and not died, completely because Ling Han had held back.","Ling Han brought the giant bird back to the ground, and Hu Niu was instantly overjoyed. Soon, she would be able to feast to her heart’s content.","Huala, the sound of rustling leaves could be heard, and the monkeys actually climbed down from the trees. Led by the Monkey King, they walked in front of Ling Han. They all stood on their hind legs, making a few gestures of bowing.","Ling Han chuckled, “If you want to thank me, bring more fruits.”","The monkeys didn’t understand. They bowed for a while longer, and this time, they dispersed quickly.","“Sigh, we’re talking a different language.” Ling Han shook his head, and began to pluck the feathers of the giant bird, preparing food.","To be honest, he was also a little hungry.","After a while, the tree leaves fluttered again, and the monkeys returned.","—"]},{"number":4363,"title":"Chapter 4363: Strange Pearl","paragraphs":["Chapter 4363: Strange Pearl","Editor: Henyee Translations","The monkeys had come again. Furthermore, the majority of them had brought celestial fruits.","Oh, he had wronged them.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be reserved. He accepted all of them, and took all of the celestial fruits.","The monkeys thanked him again before leaving.","“Sigh, even fierce beasts know how to repay kindness better than some that have developed intelligence,” Ling Han said, sweeping an eye over the perverted pig.","The perverted pig humphed. So what if I am lazy and gluttonous? In the past, you have used me quite a few times like a shield, and I have yet to call you to account, b@stard.","There were indeed a lot of celestial fruits this time. Though most of them were Four Star celestial fruits, there were still three that were Five Stars. Their effects were about the same as Crimson Ground Fruit, and Ling Han distributed them to Chi Menghan, the large black dog, and the others.","As the main force, he had already matured, and he was now able to arm others.","He was responsible for cooking. There was a lot of bird meat. One portion was used to make soup, while another was used for barbeque. There was still a lot left over.","When the meat was ready, the monkeys also ate happily.","This was their mortal enemy, and who knew how many of their companions he had eaten. Now that they were eating bird meat, they were naturally venting his anger.","After eating and drinking to their heart’s content, Ling Han and the others continued on their way. Meanwhile, the monkeys escorted them off from the trees. After escorting them out for 50km, they let out another sharp cry and turned around to return.","Ahead of them was no longer their territory, but belonged to another group of monkeys.","Ling Han and the others were relatively low-key, and after walking for another dozen over days, they finally walked out of this massive forest. A lake appeared ahead of them. The lake waters were dark green, and calm and without ripples, like a piece of agate.","This surprised everyone. There were flames everywhere in this place, and even the flowing river was filled with lava. Now, a lake had actually appeared. How could this not be strange?","“Is it really a lake, and not a massive agate?”","They walked forwards, and arrived at the banks of the lake. True enough, this was really a lake.","They hadn’t seen water for so many days, and the appearance of the lake energized them. They all took off their shoes and placed their feet in the lake. A coldness assaulted them, and they felt indescribably comfortable.","As their feet moved, the lake water also rippled, spreading into the distance. Clear layers could be seen.","“Hopefully, there won’t be any monsters in the water.” The little red bird didn’t go into the water. She was completely fire-element, and bathing in the flames was the most comfortable thing for her. For her to go into the water?","Hehe.","Boom, a loud bang rang out, and the surface of the lake split open. A colossal lobster floated up, its body as long as three hundred meters, and its two massive pincers were also three hundred meters long. It was completely dark green in colour, the same colour as the lake.","“You jinx!” Ling Han slanted a look at her.","The little red bird was dumbfounded. She had only spoken casually, and had not thought that a ferocious beast would actually appear. Was this going to confirm her identity as a bringer of misfortune?","“Haha, there’s lobster to eat again!” Hu Niu’s reaction was the complete opposite, as she began to drool.","“Charge!” Chi Menghan, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon charged out to battle the giant lobster.","Though this giant lobster was also a Spiritual Transformation Tier, it had reached Seventh Change or Eighth Change, so its battle prowess was quite astonishing. Chi Menghan, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon were only barely able to match it when they joined forces.","That was because Ling Han did not make a move. He couldn’t possibly be the one to take care of everything, right?","He was not a babysitter, and everyone would have to stand alone in future.","Under their combined attacks, the giant lobster was still unable to escape death. Its mind was shattered, and just as its massive body was about to sink, the large black dog and little azure dragon dragged it onto the shore.","“Why is there a lake in this place?” Everyone was curious.","This place was extraordinarily hot, and the plants that grew here were all fire trees. The river was also surging with lava, and a real lake had suddenly appeared here. This was too strange.","“Could it be that there is some kind of treasure underground that is incredibly cold?”","“Let’s go down and take a look.”","The True Self Tier cultivators were responsible for cooking, while the others all jumped into the lake and searched everywhere.","The lake water was warm, with a slight chill. In such a hot environment, it could be said to be very comfortable.","The visibility of the lake was very high, and added with the fact that everyone was in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, they could naturally see further.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, allowing him to see through the ground layer and search at a deeper level.","The lake was huge, so the speed of searching was naturally a little slow. Two days later, Ling Han suddenly made a discovery.","He arrived at the bottom of the lake, then dived downwards.","Not long after, he surfaced, and a jade bead appeared in his hand. It was only the size of a longan, exuding a cool feeling.","When he returned to the shore, a change immediately took place.","The entire lake began to boil, with steam rising from it. Furthermore, the water level was also rapidly falling. Going by the look of things, in less than a day, the whole lake would be completely evaporated.","All this was because of this pearl?","Ling Han was surprised. This bead seemed to be very ordinary, and it wasn’t extremely cold either. It was just very cool, so how could it form such a large lake?","“What’s going on?”","“Why is the lake water starting to evaporate?”","Chi Menghan and the others all returned to the shore, extremely confused.","Ling Han spread open his palm, and said, “Here, it’s because of this thing.”","Everyone took it over, and looked at it, but they did not discover anything amazing.","After a round, the bead returned to Ling Han’s hand.","“Forget about it for now. Let’s continue on our way.”","Xiu!","They were just about to set out, when they saw a figure sweep past, and then descend from the skies.","Lian Yutang.","“Yo, Cousin Lian,” the large black dog immediately said.","“Hello, cousin.” The little azure dragon was also very polite.","“Hello, cousin.” The pervert pig also joined in on the excitement.","Lian Yutang’s expression instantly darkened. To be addressed as cousin by a dog, a snake, and a pig, how could he accept this?","‘You people must have done this on purpose.’","“Cousin, I’ve been looking everywhere for you,” he forced out a smile and said to Chi Menghan.","Chi Menghan merely smiled faintly, “When I left, Cousin wasn’t here, and I was in a rush, so I had no choice but to leave without saying goodbye.”","It was inevitable that Lian Yutang would suffer another blow. He paused for a moment, then said, “All right. Now that we’ve met, come with me.”","“There’s no need for Cousin to worry. I can take care of myself,” Chi Menghan refused.","“It’s too dangerous here, so it’s better for me to protect you,” Lian Yutang emphasized.","Ling Han couldn’t bear it any longer, and interrupted, “You’re really quite shameless. She already said she didn’t want to, so why are you still blabbering? Do you think you can definitely succeed just by pestering her? Heh, I really don’t know what third-grade novel you’ve read.”","Lian Yutang was already filled with anger after being rejected by Chi Menghan. Now that Ling Han was mocking him, he naturally couldn’t control his anger any longer.","“You’re seeking death!” He no longer had any reservations, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","Previously, he had been tolerant because he wanted to maintain his demeanor in front of Chi Menghan. Now, however, he couldn’t hold back any longer.","Kill, kill this damn guy.","He smirked coldly. With his own strength, wouldn’t it be a piece of cake for him to kill Ling Han?","Boom!"]},{"number":4364,"title":"Chapter 4364: Reversal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4364: Reversal","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han approached.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, Ling Han’s body involuntarily trembled, and he stumbled backwards.","It couldn’t be helped. His injuries hadn’t healed completely, so he could only unleash half of his battle prowess. It was normal that he was no match for Lian Yutang.","Lian Yutang, meanwhile, looked surprised. Previously, when he had been battling with Ling Han, he had possessed a crushing advantage, but now, he had actually only managed to force Ling Han to retreat?","This was inconceivable.","How terrifying had this guy’s cultivation level increased in a short few months’ time?","A sliver of regret flashed through his mind. If he had known this would happen, he wouldn’t have cared about Chi Menghan at all. He would have killed this freak no matter what.","Thankfully, it was not too late now. He was still on the upper hand.","‘Die!’","Hong, killing intent boiled within his body, and there was a seven-coloured brilliance flickering.","Ling Han swept an eye over it with his eye technique, and nodded internally. This was not Lian Yutang’s true body, but rather a spiritual body.","True, he was presently searching for Chi Menghan. He must have projected his spiritual bodies to increase the efficiency of his search.","But even if it was only a spiritual body, Lian Yutang’s battle prowess was still incredibly terrifying. Though he was a seven-coloured spiritual body, when he was in the True Self Tier, he had cultivated to Eight Forms, so the spiritual body he formed was naturally of extremely high quality.","The spiritual body and the main body were practically equal in battle prowess. Thus, Lian Yutang was so confident that he could kill Ling Han.","“Cousin, stop!” Chi Menghan hurriedly shouted. She was naturally on Ling Han’s side.","How could Lian Yutang possibly reply? Ling Han gave him a strong feeling of pressure and threat, so he definitely had to kill Ling Han.","If he didn’t kill him now, there would be endless trouble in the future.","“An ant is an ant after all,” Lian Yutang said disdainfully. “What Imperial Son Killer? Humph, in front of a true Imperial Son, what are you worth?”","Seeing Lian Yutang act so arrogantly, everyone was indignant.","“What’s so great about bullying others with your high cultivation level?”","“I really don’t know where this feeling of superiority comes from.”","“Golden Generation? More like a generation of eating sh*t.”","The little azure dragon and the large black dog exchanged a few words. If they were talking about bickering, who would they be afraid of?","This caused Lian Yutang’s expression to turn livid, but this was indeed the truth. Though the two of them were both Spirit Transformation Tier, one of them was Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, and the other?","In the first place, the Golden Generation should be able to defeat those at a higher cultivation level. Now, the cultivation level of the Golden Generation elite was clearly at an advantage, but in terms of battle prowess, the Golden Generation elite was only barely on the upper hand. This was indeed embarrassing.","He simply chose not to speak any further, and merely used the Imperial Technique, wanting to kill Ling Han.","No matter what, he had to kill Ling Han’s main body, so that he would hurt his dao foundations.","After Ling Han exchanged a few blows, he felt that his internal injuries were showing signs of worsening.","He had also battled before, but his opponents were too weak. He had practically insta-killed all of them, so he was naturally unconcerned. However, it was different now. His opponent’s battle prowess was even slightly stronger than his, so he was naturally under great pressure.","He couldn’t continue playing like this.","Using his spiritual body?","He only had to summon one spiritual body, and it would be a two-on-one battle. If all six of them were summoned, it would be a seven-on-one battle. He didn’t believe that he couldn’t defeat this guy.","Or?","With a thought from Ling Han, the murderous aura activated.","“Wu!” Lian Yutang’s expression immediately became twisted. In fact, even his body started to undulate like water.","As expected.","Ling Han smiled internally. At present, Lian Yutang was only a spiritual body, and would a spiritual body still have the precious tool of a Great Emperor to resist soul-level attacks?","How could there be so many rare treasures!","Thus, the moment he used the murderous aura to attack, he immediately succeeded.","Lian Yutang was a Golden Generation after all, and he recovered in an instant. However, how could a battle between elites afford such a mistake? The power of his attack was instantly weakened by a significant amount.","“You...” There was a hint of surprise in his eyes as he looked at Ling Han. Ling Han had actually mastered the technique of spiritual attack?","More importantly, he was actually affected!","It should be known that the spiritual body was with the True Self as the bones, and his True Self had undergone eight evolutions, so how tough was it? It could be said that the spiritual body’s resistance against spiritual attacks was far stronger than the main body.","However, he had still been hit.","Just how terrifying was this guy’s secret spiritual attack technique?","“Damn it!” he cursed lowly, and charged over again. Endless Regulations surged, their might shocking the heavens.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and shot out another murderous aura attack. Weng, Lian Yutang was hit again. His body trembled like water, almost about to collapse.","This was a spiritual body, not a physical body.","“Fun, right?” Ling Han said with a smile. “There’s something even more fun.”","He took out the Great Emperor Horn, and blew on it.","A soundless wave rippled out, and Lian Yutang couldn’t control himself. He raised his head and howled.","Even he was stunned for a moment. What was going on? He wasn’t a member of the Wolf Tribe, so why was he howling like a wolf?","However, with how smart he was, he immediately realized that this was related to the horn that Ling Han was presently holding in his hand.","“What kind of precious tool is this?” he asked darkly. This f****** Spirit Tool was really too indecent. It actually only made people howl like wolves, and was purely playing around with people.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Of course, it’s an Imperial Weapon!”","Imperial Weapon your sister, is there such an Imperial Weapon?","Lian Yutang mocked internally, but involuntarily, he began to howl like a wolf again.","“I’m asking if it’s fun!” Ling Han charged over, the Great Emperor Horn in his left hand, blowing occasionally, while his right hand clenched into a fist, blasting towards Lian Yutang.","The pitiful Lian Yutang was just about to raise his arms to parry, yet he couldn’t help but raise his head and howl like a wolf. This wasn’t the end. He was struck by the murderous aura again, and couldn’t help but waver. He was completely unable to form an effective attack.","How was he supposed to continue fighting like this?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He naturally became Ling Han’s punching bag, and the only thing left for him was to be beaten.","“Ling Han!” Lian Yutang said through gritted teeth. A Golden Generation was actually being pummeled?","He had definitely set a new record, a record of humiliation that would bring shame to the entire Golden Generation.","“You want to beg for mercy?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“You are seeking your own death!” Lian Yutang said balefully. His main body and the other eight spiritual bodies were rushing over. Once they arrived, Ling Han would definitely not be able to escape death.","“Heh, don’t think that I don’t know what you’re thinking,” Ling Han said with a smile. “You’re waiting for your main body to come over? Heh, you won’t get the chance.”","He channeled Destructive Energy. He had already humiliated Lian Yutang enough. Moreover, it was indeed not advisable to waste too much time.","Then he’d just have to wrap things up.","Boom, Destructive Energy blasted out, instantly causing a massive blow to Lian Yutang’s spiritual body.","He couldn’t withstand it.","Lian Yutang finally looked terrified. What was this kind of high-level energy? It was too terrifying, to actually be able to cause destruction to a spiritual body.","If he was hit a few times, his spiritual body would definitely be destroyed.","He was astounded. If his spiritual body was destroyed, his losses would be great. This was not something that could be recovered just by nurturing it for a while, but would cause his cultivation level to permanently drop to Eighth Change.","An Eighth Change Golden Generation? Hehe, was this even qualified to be called a Golden Generation?","He hurriedly turned around, wanting to flee."]},{"number":4365,"title":"Chapter 4365: Amazing Use of the Bead","paragraphs":["Chapter 4365: Amazing Use of the Bead","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han activated the Great Emperor Horn. Weng, a soundless wave rippled out, blasting towards Lian Yutang.","“Ao!” Lian Yutang immediately began to howl like a wolf, completely unable to control himself.","Ling Han caught up to him, and shot out a punch with his right fist.","Die!","Destructive Energy surged, and even Lian Yutang was instantly severely injured. He opened his mouth and spat out a mouthful of blood, which immediately turned into pure energy that dissipated.","The spiritual body wasn’t made of flesh and blood, so the blood he spat out was actually his spiritual power.","Ling Han continued to attack, and under the endless barrage of blows, Lian Yutang was finally unable to hold on any longer. This spiritual body was forcefully destroyed.","“This enmity... is huge!” Chi Menghan said solemnly.","One could imagine how furious Lian Yutang would be after having one of his spiritual bodies destroyed. He would definitely fight Ling Han to the death.","Ling Han smiled calmly and said, “Even if I don’t destroy his spiritual body, he won’t be polite to me either. So, why hold back?”","Everyone nodded. Lian Yutang had obviously realized how freakish Ling Han was. Next, he would definitely kill Ling Han at all costs. Thus, it was naturally fine for Ling Han to destroy a spiritual body of his first. Furthermore, it could weaken Lian Yutang’s strength.","“Let’s go.”","If he continued to stay here, Lian Yutang’s main body would probably charge over.","If Ling Han hadn’t been injured, he would naturally be unafraid. Now, however, it was best for him to avoid this battle for the moment. Once his wounds healed, who would he need to fear?","Everyone left, while Ling Han played with that pearl.","What in the world was this?","He tried to inject mystical power into it. Weng, the bead instantly lit up, forming a ball that wrapped around him. It was clear and cool, and very comfortable.","It should be known that because of this bead, a large lake had been formed in this perilous land.","With a thought, Ling Han leaned towards the lava river.","In the end... he didn’t feel any heat at all.","This emboldened him, and he reached a hand into the lava river.","He was still unaffected.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and his whole person jumped in.","This gave the empress and the others a scare, but when they saw that the orb of light formed by the bead had not broken through, they were relieved.","Ling Han swam freely in the lava river, as if this was an ordinary river.","Very quickly, he leaped out.","“This bead is too awesome!” the large black dog said. He took the bead, and after activating it, he proudly said to the little dragon, “Come, beat Grandpa Dog.”","The little azure dragon raised its paw and swatted at the orb of light. Peng! The orb of light instantly shattered, and the large black dog was also sent flying.","Pu!","The large black dog vomited blood, and he was also dumbfounded.","What was going on?","This shield of light managed to block even the terrifying might of the lava, yet was unable to block a casual attack from the little azure dragon?","Ling Han also gave it a try, and discovered that it really was so.","The light shield formed by this bead could resist the waves of heat, but it was completely ineffective against attacks that were launched.","“Could it be that it can only resist natural threats?” Ling Han guessed.","For example, the waves of heat and cold that were naturally formed by heaven and earth. However, as long as an external force was added in, the defensive shield would be ineffective.","“Even so, this is already good enough.” Everyone nodded. If it could block all attacks, how amazing would it be?","They went up the river, believing that the True Phoenix Palace was at the end of the lava river.","A day later.","Xiu, a figure streaked through the air.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over, and he said, “Lian Yutang is about to arrive.”","“Was that one of his spiritual bodies just now?” the empress asked.","Ling Han nodded. Though it was only an instant, he had activated his eye technique and seen it clearly.","“Then what do we do?” Chi Menghan was a little nervous. Ling Han’s injuries hadn’t recovered yet, so if they started fighting, he would definitely be at a disadvantage.","“It’s fine,” Ling Han said with a smile. “I have this thing now. If I can’t beat him, I’ll just run. I really want to see if he dares to chase me into the lava.” He tossed the bead in his hand.","Everyone nodded. Once this powerful move was unleashed, it was guaranteed that even Lian Yutang would not dare to face it head-on.","And as long as Ling Han recovered from his injuries, what would he have to fear from Lian Yutang?","In just a short while, xiu, another figure streaked past in the skies, and then swooped downwards.","It was Lian Yutang!","Without another word, he directly used the Imperial Technique, which blasted towards Ling Han.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and charged forwards.","The two of them battled fiercely. In just a few moves, they had both used powerful moves.","Lian Yutang’s eight spiritual bodies all shot out, launching a bombardment of attacks at Ling Han.","Ling Han also summoned his six spiritual bodies. However, even when he was at his best condition, his abilities were only on par with Lian Yutang. Now that he was severely wounded, not only was he affected, but even his spiritual bodies were affected.","This caused him to be at a complete disadvantage.","He unleashed a murderous aura attack, but this time, it was completely ineffective.","“Humph!” Lian Yutang sneered, “The Great Emperor Spirit Tool on me can also protect my spiritual bodies. However, it was too far last time, so I fell into your trap.”","Oh, so that was the case.","“Ling Han, I will send you on your way to the afterlife today!” Lian Yutang said harshly, “To dare damage one of my spiritual bodies, I will grind your bones into dust!”","This would directly affect his battle prowess after he became a Sect Master, and would be a destructive blow to his future attempt to break through to Emperor Tier. He would have to re-cultivate True Self Tier again. Not only would that need a great amount of time, he might not even be able to succeed.","“Die! Die! Die!” He was incredibly furious.","Ling Han didn’t try to be brave. Instead, he turned around to flee. He had already reached an agreement with the empress and the others. They didn’t need to worry about him, and they could directly meet up at the True Phoenix Palace.","“Where do you think you’re going!” Lian Yutang immediately set off in pursuit. His hatred for Ling Han was bone-deep, and had completely surpassed his desire for Chi Menghan.","The movement technique he cultivated was Emperor Tier-level. Especially after advancing into Spiritual Transformation Tier, the gap between Emperor Tier-level and Saint Tier-level cultivation technique further widened, and in a few steps, he caught up to Ling Han.","Ling Han could only turn around to face this attack. Boom, boom, boom! After exchanging a few blows, he turned around to flee again.","Lian Yutang chased after him, catching up with him in a few steps, and another battle ensued.","One ran, while the other pursued, repeating the process endlessly.","“Ling Han, even if you flee to the ends of the world, I will not let you go,” Lian Yutang said. “So, you had best resign yourself to your fate. Let us have a vigorous battle, so that you can die with more dignity.”","“Alright, let’s have a battle here. Let’s see if you dare!” Ling Han laughed loudly, and with a leap, tong, he had leaped into the lava river.","F***, what was going on?","Lian Yutang faltered for a moment before immediately stopping in his tracks.","He had not lost his reason, and would leap into the river with him. That would be courting death.","As he saw it, though Ling Han was in an extremely poor situation, it was not to the extent that he would jump into the river and commit suicide.","However, he had seen Ling Han jump into the river with his own eyes. Furthermore, that was definitely not a spiritual body.","Thus, Ling Han was definitely going to die. There was no doubt about this.","He couldn’t figure it out, but it didn’t matter. It was fine as long as Ling Han died.","Lian Yutang glared hatefully at the river. It was a pity that he hadn’t been able to kill Ling Han with his own hands.","“I definitely have to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix!” he muttered. “Perhaps it can heal my Dao injury. Otherwise, I would definitely have no chance of becoming the Emperor.”"]},{"number":4366,"title":"Chapter 4366: True Phoenix Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4366: True Phoenix Palace","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Yutang left very quickly.","After a long time, further down the lava river, Ling Han floated out of the boiling lava.","Of course, there was a shield of light around him, blocking the lava from his body.","With a light leap, he had already arrived on the bank.","“Hehe, the next time you see me, you’ll probably be shocked,” Ling Han murmured to himself. “Not only will a ‘dead’ person come back to life, but my battle prowess will also give you a scare.”","He continued to advance, worried that Lian Yutang would cause harm to them if he caught up to the empress and the others.","However, he was sure that with the large black dog’s experience, he would definitely find a place to hide. He would rather take a detour than follow the lava river.","Ling Han, on the other hand, went against the flow of the river. He had to save time, so he could reach the True Phoenix Palace as soon as possible.","This trip was a long one.","After a whole 39 days, Ling Han finally saw the end of the lava river.","Gazing into the distance, he could see that nine surging rivers of lava were all converging at one place, and the source of this was a massive palace in the shape of a phoenix.","This palace had been built in the shape of a phoenix that spread its wings and flew high. Not only was it lifelike, there was also a powerful pressure that made people want to kneel down and worship it.","The True Phoenix Palace.","When he got closer, he could see that there was also a massive plaza in front of the True Phoenix Palace. A great many people were standing there, and because the doors to the palace were not open, they could only wait here.","At this moment, Ling Han’s injuries had already recovered, so he was naturally unafraid. Even if he encountered Lian Yutang or the elders of the Flame Skin Race, he was confident that he could still fight.","He strode forward and arrived at the plaza.","Yi, Lian Yutang wasn’t here?","Ling Han’s eyes swept over the surroundings, and did not find any trace of Lian Yutang. Instead, there were a lot of people from the Flame Skin Race.","“Ling, Ling Han!” A Flame Skin Race member discovered Ling Han’s presence, and his face was filled with surprise. This was because both of them had disappeared after Fifth Elder set off to pursue Ling Han.","In everyone’s minds, Ling Han must have fled, and Fifth Elder was chasing after him. That was why he had not returned for so long. They had not even considered the possibility that Fifth Elder would die.","But now, Ling Han had suddenly appeared, yet Fifth Elder had not followed closely behind. What kind of logic was that?","“Where’s Fifth Elder?” he couldn’t help but ask.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Oh, he’s complaining about the bad air here, so he’s gone somewhere else for a holiday.”","The Flame Skin Race cultivator was instantly stupefied. A holiday? What holiday?","After being stunned for a moment, he finally came to his senses. Hurriedly, he faced the sky and roared, sending out a signal.","Instantly, the nearby Flame Skin Race members all leaped over, including Nalan Feiyue.","“Ling Han!” He was also startled, “Where is Fifth Elder?”","“Oh, he’s gone on a holiday,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Nonsense!” Nalan Feiyue immediately rebuked.","“Sigh, I can’t deceive you,” Ling Han said with a smile. “Then I’ll just tell the truth. I killed him.”","“Bullsh*t!” Nalan Feiyue was even more disbelieving. Fifth Elder who possessed the Firebird Staff had battle prowess of Pseudo Sect Master-level. It wasn’t like he didn’t know Ling Han’s strength. It was absolutely impossible for him to match a Pseudo Sect Master.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Hey, hey, hey. Just look, I’m being polite to you, yet you’re treating me like this. This makes me very angry!”","“You still dare to be angry?” Nalan Feiyue said with a cold smile. “You already have no more value to be exploited, yet you still come here to seek death.”","He moved aggressively. This was the territory of the Flame Skin Race, so even if his abilities were inferior to Ling Han’s, what did he have to fear?","The elders would immediately arrive.","Ling Han shook his head, and threw a punch.","Peng!","Those Flame Skin Race beings could all see clearly. When this punch landed, Nalan Feiyue’s whole person exploded, turning into a shower of blood.","“You, you, you—” They pointed at Ling Han, not knowing whether they should be shocked by Ling Han’s battle prowess, or his outrageous boldness.","Xiu, another figure flew over.","Nalan Huoshu.","He didn’t see the scene of Nalan Feiyue being obliterated, but he could sense the blood in the air, which made him frown. “What’s going on?”","“Feiyue, Feiyue was killed by him!” The members of the Flame Skin Race all pointed at Ling Han.","“How bold you are!” Nalan Huoshu said coldly.","“So-so.” Ling Han shrugged, “Are you dissatisfied? I can kill you too, believe it or not?”","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Another member of the Flame Skin Race arrived. This time, it was the elders. One or two... Very soon, all eight elders had arrived.","“Where’s Old Fifth?” an elder asked, his eyes fixed on Ling Han.","“Is this the attitude of asking questions?” Ling Han shook his head, “I am very displeased.”","“You’re just a caged bird. Is there any need to be concerned about you?” Fourth Elder humphed, “Tell me quickly, where is Old Fifth!”","“Killed him,” Ling Han said. “Given your attitude, I’ve decided to send you to reunite with Old Fifth.”","“Haha, what a great joke.” Fourth Elder nodded at Nalan Huoshu, “Kill him!”","“Understood!” Nalan Huoshu nodded, and immediately charged towards Ling Han.","With the eight senior elders keeping watch, suppressing Ling Han’s battle prowess, he would definitely be able to kill Ling Han.","“Die!” He launched a palm strike at Ling Han.","Ling Han brandished his fists, and a terrifying power surged. This time, he did not hold anything back, and released all his power.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Nalan Huoshu instantly stumbled back in retreat. When he retreated to the seventh step, one of his arms exploded, followed by the other. Then, his left leg exploded, his right leg exploded, and he collapsed onto the ground.","“Huoshu!” the eight senior elders exclaimed in unison. They knew that Ling Han’s battle prowess was formidable, and were already prepared to summon the Firebird Staff to suppress Ling Han’s battle prowess.","However, they had never imagined that Ling Han’s strength would actually be so strong. With a single punch, he had severely injured Nalan Huoshu.","F***, they had not managed to make their move in time.","“Die!” The eight senior elders attacked at the same time, brandishing the Firebird Staff and attacking Ling Han.","One after another, firebirds flew out, pouncing towards Ling Han.","Ling Han tried to use the bead to form a shield, but in front of the firebird, this shield was practically useless. It would be shattered with a single strike, and would not have the slightest defensive effect at all.","As expected, this could only block the power naturally formed by heaven and earth.","Ling Han sighed, and directly took out the Great Emperor Horn. Weng, a soundless wave rippled out. All of a sudden, everyone in the vicinity, including the eight senior elders, all raised their heads and howled like wolves.","In this way, the attacks they shot out were naturally a mess, and the threat that they posed to Ling Han decreased drastically.","However, Pseudo Sect Master-level attacks were still quite sharp. Furthermore, after the firebirds shot out, they possessed a certain level of self-attack ability, and was not affected by the Great Emperor’s horn, which made Ling Han feel very troubled, and he had no choice but to soar through the air to dodge.","There were too many people here. Unless Ling Han planned to kill all of them to keep the secret, the moment he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, that would definitely leak the secret.","This was far too important, and it also involved the Nine Mountains Saint and the Nine Suns Holy Land. Thus, Ling Han didn’t dare to act recklessly.","“Ling Han!” With a loud roar, Lian Yutang arrived through the air, his face filled with shock.","‘You’re actually still alive?’"]},{"number":4367,"title":"Chapter 4367: Opening of the Palace doors","paragraphs":["Chapter 4367: Opening of the Palace doors","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Yutang had finally arrived.","He was extremely stunned. He had clearly seen with his own eyes how Ling Han had “died” in the lava, so how had he now reappeared completely unscathed?","This, this, this, he practically could not believe his own eyes.","But in the next instant, his killing intent immediately became severe.","Since that was the case, he would kill him again. This time, he was definitely going to blow up Ling Han’s head with his own hands.","Boom, he joined the battle.","Ling Han was already struggling to fight against the eight elders all by himself. After all, the Firebird Staff was extremely powerful. If it weren’t for the fact that he had the Great Emperor Horn that could affect the eight elders, without using the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he would have no option but to turn around and flee.","And now, there was Lian Yutang?","It should be known that Lian Yutang’s strength was not the slightest bit inferior to his.","Lian Yutang’s attack arrived, yet Ling Han was unafraid as he faced it head-on. ‘Do you really think you’re that awesome?’","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, the two of them trembled at the same time, and were both sent flying backwards.","“What?!” Lian Yutang exclaimed in astonishment. He had actually tied with Ling Han?","How was this possible?","Ling Han’s aura clearly hadn’t changed at all, so why had his abilities suddenly improved by so much?","Could it be that Ling Han had deliberately concealed his abilities during their last battle?","But why?","And he would rather jump into the river than reveal his strength?","Or had this guy gotten a fortuitous encounter after jumping into the lava river, which allowed his strength to have such an inconceivable increase?","Yet Ling Han was in an incredibly sorry state, because the eight senior elders were not just standing at the sidelines and watching the show, but were also attacking.","If it was only Lian Yutang, then he would not be afraid at all, and would be able to match them. And if it was only the eight senior elders, then he could use the Great Emperor’s Horn, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to stand against them. In fact, he could even achieve victory in this battle.","However, with these two factors added together, Ling Han really couldn’t do anything.","The murderous aura activated. Weng, weng, weng! The eight senior elders groaned at the same time, their faces twisting. This was still because their cultivation levels were higher than Ling Han’s. Otherwise, if they were struck by the murderous aura, all of them would die immediately.","The eight senior elders were completely caught off guard, and naturally suffered a great loss. Thankfully, they did not release their spiritual bodies, which acted as defense in their minds, cancelling out a portion of the impact.","Ling Han was just about to take advantage of the opening to make a move on the eight senior elders, but how could Lian Yutang possibly allow him to do as he wished? He immediately intercepted him and launched a fierce offensive at him.","His strength was not inferior to Ling Han at all. After channelling the Imperial Technique, his attack power was incredibly frightening. Even Ling Han did not dare to be careless. He could only give up on his counterattack, and disperse Lian Yutang’s attack.","After this attack, the eight senior elders also recovered, and launched another attack. It became nine against one again.","Ling Han unleashed his full abilities, yet Lian Yutang was no weaker than him. The Firebird Staff in the hands of the eight senior elders was even more terrifying. If Ling Han was struck by it, even his freakish physique would be severely wounded.","After a few moves, Ling Han was completely at a disadvantage.","However, whether it was the eight senior elders or Lian Yutang, none of them could laugh.","Ordinarily, any one of them would be able to easily suppress Ling Han, but the present situation was that with the nine of them working together, Ling Han could still resist tenaciously, which made their jaws drop, and at the same time, they inhaled sharply.","This guy was too freakish, wasn’t he?","They definitely had to kill him!","The killing intent of the nine people intensified. The more freakishly Ling Han behaved, the more they wanted to kill him.","Their attacks became even more rapid. Though they had not worked together previously, and Lian Yutang had even fought a battle with the nine senior elders previously, but now, for the sake of a common goal, they resolutely worked together. Furthermore, as time passed, they gradually developed coordination, and showed more and more tacit understanding.","The pressure on Ling Han became greater and greater. If it was not for the fact that his physique was astonishingly strong, and could disperse the attacks of power within six Heavens, he would probably be lying on the ground by now.","Even so, he was still under great pressure.","“Hehe, do you think I don’t have a Spirit Tool?” Ling Han took out the Firebird Staff.","“What!” When the eight senior elders saw this, they all looked shocked.","It was the Firebird Staff!","There were a total of nine Firebird Staffs, one for each of the nine senior elders, no more and no less.","But now, one of the Firebird Staffs had appeared in Ling Han’s hands. What did this mean?","The odds were against Fifth Elder.","Thinking back to what Ling Han had previously said, the Flame Skin Race was all shocked. How could it be that Ling Han had not lied? Had he really killed Fifth Elder?","Heavens, how had he done it?","With the Firebird Staff in hand, shouldn’t he be invincible in this place?","“What did you do to Old Fifth?” After the eight senior elders faltered for a moment, they immediately launched another powerful offensive.","“The Firebird Staff has already fallen into my hands. Is there any need to ask further?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“How is this possible!” The eight senior elders were still unwilling to believe it.","This was the battle prowess of Pseudo Sect Master, so how could you match it?","“Nothing is impossible!” Ling Han brandished the Firebird Staff. Unfortunately, this required a special technique to be able to control it. Thus, though he brandished it, no firebird flew out.","“Haha, it was a mistake, a mistake. Please don’t take it to heart.” He smiled at everyone.","The eight senior elders were already prepared to flee. They were the standard example of being strong in attack and weak in defense. If they were faced with the attack of a Pseudo Sect Master, they definitely wouldn’t be able to block it like Ling Han.","‘Are you f*cking toying with me?!’","The eight old geezers flew into a humiliated rage, and brandished their walking sticks towards Ling Han again.","Pu, pu, pu! The firebirds pounced.","Ling Han had no choice but to turn around and flee.","This battle of nine against one was too disadvantageous.","“Don’t even think of running!” The eight senior elders and Lian Yutang immediately set off in pursuit.","However, right at this moment, the bricks in the plaza lit up one after another. A red halo of light soared into the sky, like flames.","This change was too sudden, and everyone stopped.","A Mystery Realm was filled with danger.","Pa! Ling Han suddenly discovered that one of his Spatial Spirit Tools had suddenly shattered. Meanwhile, the items inside it hadn’t been annihilated into the Void. Instead, they rose up and shot toward the palace gates like a sharp arrow.","The keys from the palaces!","Not only him, but two other keys also flew out from the eight senior elders’ hands, and similarly shot towards the great doors of the palace.","One, two, three... eight, nine.","The nine keys were all here.","These nine keys were all stabbed into the doors of the palace. There were nine holes on them, which corresponded to each of them.","Yi, why had there suddenly been a change?","Ling Han’s eyes swept over the surroundings, and caught sight of a few familiar auras.","—The empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and the others.","Ling Han finally understood why there was such a sudden change. That was because the little red bird had arrived, and her bloodline had caused an unforeseen event here.","The nine keys were set at the same time, and they automatically inserted themselves into the corresponding positions. Then, they all began to turn.","Ka, ka, ka! The sound was transmitted.","Everyone stopped what they were doing, and looked towards the main doors.","Was it about to be opened?","The inheritance of the True Phoenix was about to appear?","The keys spun, and finally stopped. Then, the great doors slowly opened, and a dark and eerie entrance appeared."]},{"number":4368,"title":"Chapter 4368: I have returned","paragraphs":["Chapter 4368: I have returned","Editor: Henyee Translations","The palace had opened!","Everyone’s eyes were burning. The inheritance of the True Phoenix was hidden inside.","Imperial Technique, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, the most awesome movement technique in the world. It was rumored that a great many Great Emperors wanted to study it, but they were ultimately unable to find the secret lair of the True Phoenix. Unexpectedly, they encountered such a great opportunity.","Everyone was incredibly excited, and at the same time, their killing intent was also firm. A deadly weapon quietly appeared in their hands. There was naturally nothing else left to say, and the only thing left was battle.","Faced with this kind of Imperial Technique, even blood brothers could possibly become enemies.","Lian Yutang no longer attacked. He looked towards the main doors of the palace, and the strong longing in his eyes could not be concealed.","As he saw it, in terms of individual battle prowess alone, he was undoubtedly the top elite. Thus, his only worry was the eight elders. After all, they had a deadly weapon like the Firebird Staff, which could deliver a Pseudo Sect Master-level attack.","He had to be on guard against them, and the others were all mediocre, and he did not take them to heart.","Ka, ka, ka! The doors to the palace were completely open, but the contents could not be seen at all. There was only complete darkness.","“Die!”","It was unknown who was the first to rush out, and run towards the palace.","It was inevitable that a chaotic battle would break out. They pushed one another, and attacked one another. All of them wanted to be the first person to charge into the palace.","“F*ck off! This is the great opportunity that our Flame Skin Race has painstakingly waited for countless years for!” The eight senior elders couldn’t care less about Ling Han anymore, and they all charged toward the large hall.","They brandished the Firebird Staff, and began to attack indiscriminately.","—The members of the Flame Skin Race had long since retreated out. Thus, no matter how reckless they were, the ones they injured were still outsiders.","This time, the scene was extremely chaotic.","Pseudo Sect Master-level attacks were too domineering. As the firebirds pounced, masses of people collapsed one after another, completely unable to withstand a single blow.","Dao Child, Imperial Son, and even Silver Generation were really too fragile in the face of a Pseudo Sect Master-level attack. If it wasn’t for the fact that a great many people still had Substitution Seals, the mortality rate would have been at least three times higher by now.","This caused great shock to the Imperial Sons. Though an Imperial Technique was good, if they were not alive to enjoy it, then wouldn’t that be all for naught?","They regained their senses, and retreated outside.","At present, only the eight senior elders were still barraging the main doors, Lian Yutang and also another Golden Generation called Shi Ze, who was also respectfully addressed as Imperial Son Ze. Additionally, Ling Han was slightly behind. He did not think that simply charging in would allow one to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix.","The nine palace halls had been opened by the little red bird, so how could it be that it had nothing to do with the little red bird now?","Thus, he had the little red bird come over, and the man and bird chose to watch from the sidelines.","‘You guys can just fight to your heart’s content.’","At this time, because the number of people had further decreased, the situation had also become clearer.","The eight senior elders teamed up to battle Lian Yutang and Imperial Son Ze.","These two people were the only two in the Golden Generation that were still stuck at the Spiritual Transformation Tier. However, it wasn’t that their natural talent was slightly weaker and they couldn’t advance into the Minor Advanced Tier. Rather, it was because they wanted to cultivate their cultivation level to perfection, so they suppressed their cultivation level and didn’t break through.","The two Imperial Sons joined forces, exchanging blows with the eight senior elders.","In terms of strength of attack, it was definitely the eight senior elders that had the upper hand. The Firebird Staff could unleash the might of Pseudo Sect Master-level, and this was something that even the Golden Generation could not match. However, Lian Yutang and Shi Ze had the advantage in their individual battle prowess, so their movements were more agile.","Thus, one side’s attack power was strong, while the other side’s movement was agile. They both had an advantage, and it was just enough for them to fight to a tie.","The problem now was whether the eight senior elders would be unable to activate the Firebird Staff first, or Lian Yutang and Shi Ze would be exhausted first. After all, the pressure on both sides was extraordinarily great.","When the battle became intense, both sides summoned all their spiritual bodies. It was clearly a battle of ten people, but there were about a hundred people on the scene, which became incredibly lively.","“Come, come, come. Who wants to place a bet? Bet on the side that wins.” The large black dog immediately said, “One to three on the Imperial Sons’ side, and one to four on the old geezers’ side.”","“Pei, despicable dog, then wouldn’t it be a sure win and no loss if I place a bet on both sides?” An Imperial Son immediately rebuked, “You are clearly trying to get out of paying up.”","This was indeed a very simple logic. The large black dog’s loss was assured, so why did he still want to open a round of gambling?","He was clearly trying to scam them out of their money.","“How despicable!”","“How despicable!”","Everyone shook their heads. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han was still beside him, they would definitely rush forwards and smack the large black dog to death.","The large black dog felt gloomy. Since when had these guys become smarter?","Sigh, there were too few fools these days. It was so difficult to earn money.","Weng, right at this moment, an aura suddenly surged out of the palace, spreading out in all directions. With a boom, everyone felt a powerful sense of helplessness rise up from the depths of their hearts.","Instantly, a great many people looked shocked.","This aura was too powerful, far surpassing their level of being. At least, it had to be a Venerate Tier-level existence.","A Venerate Tier elite had appeared in this place?","Just the thought of it was terrifying.","The battle between the eight senior elders, Lian Yutang and Imperial Son Ze naturally came to an abrupt halt. They were fighting for the inheritance of the True Phoenix, but now that a variable had clearly appeared, they were naturally apprehensive, and could no longer bother about the battle.","Nothing was as important as their lives.","Weng, at this moment, that aura fluctuated again, like a ripple.","“He’s become stronger!”","“This aura has become stronger!”","“Heavens!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. This was too obvious. It was clearly the same aura, but it had become stronger.","Weng, that aura came again.","Ling Han frowned. The strength of this aura had indeed increased further, and what made him feel even more uneasy was the fact that the frequency of these ripples was also becoming faster.","This was like waking up from a deep slumber. There was a process from sleep to awakening, and in this process, one’s aura would naturally become stronger and stronger.","The problem was this was the True Phoenix Palace.","There was an existence inside that was at least Venerate Tier-level, so who could it be?","‘True Phoenix?’","Impossible!","Firstly, even if the True Phoenix was a Great Emperor, it could not possibly live for so long. Furthermore, the Great Emperor was so strong that even the Regulations of heaven and earth could not suppress it. THey could not possibly suppress its life force, and have endless years pass.","Secondly, if it was the True Phoenix, this aura wouldn’t only be Venerate Tier-level, right?","He had not even finished the thought, when weng, that aura came again. It had clearly strengthened further.","No one made a sound, nor did anyone move. They were all looking in the direction of the palace, feeling an indescribable fear.","Weng, weng, weng! The fluctuation of this aura became more and more rapid, and also stronger. Finally, it broke through to Saint Tier in a single leap.","Saint Tier!","Everyone’s feeling of unease became even stronger. Now that a Saint had appeared, even the Imperial Clans would have to be polite. If a Saint suddenly appeared here, and killed all of them, then even the Imperial Clans would not know whom they should seek out for revenge.","Boom, this aura rippled out like an ocean, causing everyone to feel suffocated.","“I, have returned!” A voice suddenly rang out in everyone’s hearts."]},{"number":4369,"title":"Chapter 4369: Remnant Soul of the True Phoenix","paragraphs":["Chapter 4369: Remnant Soul of the True Phoenix","Editor: Henyee Translations","‘I’ve returned?’","Who was this “I”?","At the entrance of the palace, a shadow walked out.","This was the True Phoenix!","Everyone could clearly see that this was a phoenix. It was indescribably gorgeous, but this phoenix’s body was almost transparent, and completely did not seem like a real entity.","“This isn’t the True Phoenix, but the remnant soul of the True Phoenix!”","The Imperial Son Ze said darkly. As expected of the Golden Generation. Even at this moment, he still maintained a considerable amount of composure.","Ling Han also had the same feeling. This was definitely not the Divine Beast, True Phoenix, that had commanded the whole world in the ancient times. That was too unrealistic. Furthermore, it was definitely not a complete soul. When the Great Emperor died, the soul would be assimilated by the heaven and earth. This was inevitable.","However, the Great Emperor’s methods were extraordinary. It was still very possible that he had retained behind a tiny bit of his remnant soul.","Even so, this was still extremely terrifying.","The True Phoenix actually left behind a remnant soul, and the fluctuation exuding from it was as strong as Saint Tier!","Everyone was speechless. They still wanted the inheritance of the True Phoenix?","The True Phoenix hadn’t died at all, so how could anyone obtain it?","“After slumbering for so long, I’ve finally waited until today!” The True Phoenix’s remnant soul stared directly at the little red bird.","Yi?","“Come!” The True Phoenix’s remnant soul flapped its phoenix wings, and the little red bird flew out uncontrollably.","Ling Han wanted to make a move, but he had just taken a step, when he felt a terrifying aura pressing down on him, causing him to throw up a mouthful of blood. It was indescribably painful, and he was completely unable to make another move.","“Save me!” the little red bird screamed. No matter how it thought about it, this was not a good thing.","“You bear my will, and you are my manifestation. What do you have to fear?” the True Phoenix’s remnant soul said. With a xiu, he turned into a streak of light that shot towards the little red bird.","Like a clay ox sinking into water, this soul immediately sank into the little red bird’s body.","Seeing this, how could everyone not understand?","It was unknown what method that True Phoenix from the ancient times had used, but there was actually a remnant soul that had not died. It had slumbered in this True Phoenix Palace for countless years, and only awoke at this moment.","And he had spent so many years with only one purpose, and that was to find a body that could bear his soul.","The little red bird was a descendant of the Vermillion Bird and possessed the bloodline of a Divine Beast. Moreover, it was also a bird and a fire-element beast, so it was naturally the best container.","No wonder when the little red bird arrived, the nine palaces immediately opened up without any effort.","This was practically a trap!","It was at this moment that Ling Han’s thoughts drifted for a moment.","Why did the Genesis World also have True Dragons and True Phoenixes?","Judging by the current situation, the Genesis World was like a miniature version of this great world, but the problem was, why would so many races appear in the Genesis World?","Unknowingly, could it be that there was a force controlling and influencing it?","Looking at the appearances of the Four-Legged Snake, the little red bird, and the True Phoenix’s remnant soul, they were all the same as the Dragons, Vermillion Birds, and Phoenixes that corresponded in the Genesis World. What was going on here?","Ling Han was certain that the Genesis World was definitely not a Mystery Realm like the lair of the True Phoenix. Instead, it was a real world with its own independent and complete Regulations of heaven and earth. However, in terms of level, the Genesis World’s Regulations were much, much lower.","After letting his thoughts drift for a while, Ling Han hurriedly came back to his senses. Was this the time to think about these things?","However, the remnant soul of the True Phoenix had returned after countless years, and its power was as high as Saint Tier. Was this something that Ling Han could stand against?","No matter how he thought about it, this was like a mantis trying to stop a chariot.","What could he do? What could he do?","Ling Han frowned deeply. Although the little red bird had a toxic tongue and always complained that it wanted to run when there was trouble, since it had joined his team, it was one of them.","—He had never watched his own people suffer!","If the True Phoenix entered the body, then it would definitely be the True Phoenix’s remnant soul taking the initiative. The little red bird’s soul would definitely be destroyed. Thus, the little red bird was equivalent to dead, and all that was left was her body.","Weng!","Right at this moment, a sudden change took place.","Ling Han felt as if the Firebird Staff in his hand was actually glowing. Its whole body was blazingly bright. Xiu, then it shot up into the skies on its own.","Not only that, but the Spatial Spirit Tool also shattered on its own. The bead of unknown origin also floated up, and fled with the Firebird Staff.","Yi?","In the area where the eight senior elders were, the other eight Firebird Staffs were no longer under their control, and floated into the air.","Then, the nine Firebird Staffs were all gathered, and actually fused into one. That mysterious bead was also embedded, and fused into a completely new staff. However, unlike its original blazing red colour, this staff was now completely dark blue in colour, exuding a warm and cool feeling.","“True Phoenix, I submitted to you as my master, and followed you everywhere you go. However, when you arrived, you mercilessly killed your nine brothers for the sake of your own reincarnation!” A shadowy figure walked out of the staff. This was a human figure. Although he was also a remnant soul, he could be seen clearly. His arms were bare, and there were flame-shaped tattoos on his arms.","“Ancestor!” Seeing this figure, the eight senior elders and the Flame Skin Race were all excited. This was their ancestor, and he had always been worshipped in the Flame Skin Palace. Who hadn’t seen him before?","But who would have thought that this ancestor was actually still alive!","Just listen to him. At that time, it seemed like the nine Great Generals had been personally killed by the True Phoenix. Meanwhile, the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor had had a backup plan. He had actually left behind a remnant soul that was revived today.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Just how many years had this enmity spanned?","The remnant soul of the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor gripped the staff and pounced at the little red bird. The top of the staff glowed, and a Saint-level aura surged.","This was a Saint Tool!","If the True Phoenix was at its prime, it naturally wouldn’t need to worry about this at all. A single breath from the Great Emperor would be enough to kill a Saint a few times over. Now, however, the True Phoenix was only left with a wisp of its soul. Moreover, it was at the most critical moment of fusing with the little red bird!","The timing that the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor chose to attack could be considered just right.","The little red bird flapped its wings and shot out a ray of light that transformed into countless divine patterns. Peng! The staff was instantly sent flying, and the remnant soul of the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor also swayed like a candle in the wind.","After all, he had only been a Saint in his prime, and now he was only left with a remnant soul. How much might could he still have left?","However, the ancestor of the Flame Skin Race laughed loudly, and said, “True Phoenix, oh, True Phoenix, you didn’t expect this, did you? You’ve schemed for millions and millions of years, yet all your efforts have come to nothing. Your heart must be filled with bitterness, right? That’s right, I want you to have a taste of despair and betrayal!”","“Sigh!” With a soft sigh, the remnant soul of the True Phoenix floated out of the little red bird’s body. It had clearly become slightly more transparent. He looked at the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor, and shook his head. “Old friend, you’ve misunderstood me.”","“Misunderstanding?” The ancestor of the Flame Skin Race sneered, and said, “Could it be that when I personally witnessed you killing the nine of us, that was a misunderstanding? Fortunately, I had a premonition and made preparations in advance. Otherwise, I would truly be dying with a grudge and wouldn’t have gotten my revenge today.”","The True Phoenix’s remnant soul threw its head back and roared with laughter. “Heavens, heavens, I wanted to create the Rising From The Ashes Technique to live a second life. However, I was rendered divine punishment, and suffered a fatal dao injury. Before I died, I made arrangements for the overall situation, hoping to find someone with a bloodline connection in this world to inherit my will and start a new life.”","“Who would’ve thought? It’s all for naught!”"]},{"number":4370,"title":"Chapter 4370: All for naught","paragraphs":["Chapter 4370: All for naught","Editor: Henyee Translations","The ancestor of the Flame Skin Race delivered an attack at the most crucial moment, completely interrupting the fusion of the True Phoenix’s remnant soul and the little red bird. There was only one chance, and it was also the only chance that the True Phoenix’s remnant soul had obtained in millions and millions of years to deceive the heavens.","If he missed this opportunity, there would be no next time.","“Man proposes, God disposes,” the True Phoenix’s remnant soul said with a sigh. There was an indescribably tragic expression on his face.","“Hahahaha, you’ve finally tasted the bitter fruit, haven’t you?!” The Flame Skin Race’s ancestor laughed loudly, and said, “Come, kill me. In any case, I’ve already ruined your plans to reincarnate, so I can leave with no worries. I’m going to meet my eight old brothers!”","They were both damaged souls, and he was only a manifestation of a Saint. How could he compare to the True Phoenix? He naturally couldn’t withstand a single blow.","However, the True Phoenix’s remnant soul didn’t attack. Instead, it simply shook its head.","“What is it? Still hypocritical?” The Flame Skin Race’s ancestor scoffed. “Or are you thinking about how you’re going to torture me? It doesn’t matter. Right now, my only feelings are happiness and pleasure.”","“Old friend!” The True Phoenix’s remnant soul shook its head, “You have misunderstood me! Years ago, I wanted to rise from the ashes, but was interrupted by the heavens, so I began to lay out plans for my next life. I am 100% sure that I can create it successfully in my next life, and in order for you all to return to glory with me, I have taken away your souls, so that you can once again battle the world with me.”","“Hahaha!” The ancestor of the Flame Skin Race laughed loudly. “You still want to lie at a time like this? This has no meaning, not the slightest bit!”","The True Phoenix’s remnant soul wasn’t angered. With a flap of its wings, nine almost transparent figures immediately appeared beside him. They were humanoid, but the majority of them were bird-like.","This time, the ancestor of the Flame Skin Race was instantly dumbfounded.","He naturally recognized that eight of these nine figures were his companions who had fought alongside him, and one of them was his own soul. However, these soul fragments were presently rapidly dying.","The True Phoenix was right. He had indeed preserved the souls of the nine Great Generals, but now, the True Phoenix’s attempt to snatch the little red bird’s physical body had failed. The remnant soul did not have a physical body to bear, and would die not long after. Naturally, it was impossible for the souls of the nine Great Generals to remain alive.","How could this be?","The ancestor of the Flame Skin Race was rendered speechless. He had always harbored a grudge against the True Phoenix, and he believed that the True Phoenix had betrayed them and mercilessly slaughtered his loyal subordinates. Thus, he had also laid out plans to deal with this.","He had never imagined that the truth would actually be like this!","It couldn’t be helped. This remnant soul of his had always been hidden inside that pearl. In fact, in order not to let the True Phoenix discover any clues, he had even severed this part of his memory from the main body.","It was possible that in the end, the main body had long since known about the plans of the True Phoenix, but because he had thought himself clever, not only had he killed himself, he had also caused his eight companions to lose the chance to come back to life forever.","It was not that the True Phoenix had betrayed them, but rather that he had caused their deaths!","The ancestor of the Flame Skin Race gaped, completely at a loss for words.","“I, I, I—” He suddenly knelt down, and howled loudly.","At present, he was only a remnant soul, and could not shed any tears. However, his voice was incredibly shrill, and reverberated in everyone’s minds. A boundless sense of grief rose up in them, and they could feel his pain deeply.","He had killed himself and his companion with his own hands. What kind of feeling of self-criticism was this? Who could understand that?","“Old friend, don’t be sad, and don’t blame yourself.” The True Phoenix’s remnant soul was much more carefree, “Fighting with the heavens is filled with variables in the first place. If I win, we will restart our second life, and if I lose, everything will be for naught.”","“Old friend, let’s die together.”","The Flame Skin Race’s ancestor had only managed to survive for millions and millions of years thanks to the support of hatred, yet now, it had become endless self-criticism. How could it be resolved just because of a few words from the True Phoenix?","He continued to kowtow to the True Phoenix’s remnant soul and the nine remnant souls of his brothers that were about to disappear. It was as if doing so would diminish that piercing self-blame just a little.","However, as he continued to kowtow, his soul began to fade, and finally, it completely disappeared. Only that endless feeling of regret still reverberated in everyone’s hearts, and could not dissipate for a long time.","The True Phoenix’s remnant soul also shook its head and sighed. The nine souls around it had more or less dissipated, and he was only forcefully holding on with the cultivation level of Great Emperor of ancient times. He wouldn’t be able to maintain it for long.","He looked at the little red bird, and smiled faintly, “Descendant of Vermillion Bird, though you have suffered a little, my martial intent has also been passed on to you, so it can be considered that our grievances have been settled.”","At this moment, the little red bird was in a coma, so it naturally couldn’t respond to him.","“How lamentable, detestable, and pitiful!” The True Phoenix’s remnant soul sighed repeatedly, and its figure gradually faded. In the end, it could no longer be seen.","Boom, that powerful aura also receded like floodwaters.","All of a sudden, the eight senior elders of the Flame Skin Race, Lian Yutang and Imperial Son Ze all looked at the little red bird with heated gazes.","Just now, the True Phoenix’s remnant soul had clearly said that its inheritance had already been obtained by the little red bird. Thus, as long as they captured the little red bird and searched its soul, they would naturally be able to obtain the True Phoenix’s inheritance.","This was really an unexpected turn of events. At first, they had thought that when the True Phoenix’s remnant soul appeared, everyone would only have come up empty-handed. It would be good enough if they could keep their lives, but they had never imagined that things would develop to this extent.","Since the True Phoenix’s remnant soul had already disappeared, there was no longer any overwhelming existence. Whoever could obtain the True Phoenix’s inheritance would naturally have to depend on their own abilities.","Ling Han humphed and leaped out, greeting Lian Yutang and the others.","The murderous aura charged onwards!","Boom, the eight senior elders all grabbed their heads and screamed in pain. Without the Firebird Staff, they were actually far inferior to even the Silver Generation, so how could they possibly match Ling Han?","However, Lian Yutang and Imperial Son Ze couldn’t be ignored, especially Imperial Son Ze. He hadn’t had a spiritual body destroyed, and his battle prowess was at its peak. When he used the Imperial Technique, it was incredibly terrifying.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a few blows with the two Imperial Sons, creating a boundless shockwave of energy.","The little red bird finally came back to its senses after being shaken. With a cry, it hurriedly flapped its wings and fled.","Though she had obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix, her cultivation level had not increased in the slightest, so how could she possibly match the might of Imperial Sons?","However, before she could even take two steps, she saw that the eight senior elders had already charged back. Moreover, they were carrying that blue staff with them.","At this moment, she faltered for a moment before pointing at the senior elder who was wielding the staff and saying, “Go.”","A strange scene appeared. The senior elder’s whole person suddenly disappeared into thin air, leaving only the staff that fell from midair onto the ground with a pa.","Yi, what was going on here?","The remaining seven senior elders, including the Silver Generation elites that were rushing over, were all shocked. This was too bizarre.","The little red bird laughed loudly, “Get lost, get lost, get lost!”","With a tap of a finger, the seven senior elders disappeared into thin air.","Everyone was astounded. Had they been teleported to a certain place, or had their bodies and souls been directly destroyed?","Though the little red bird was only in the True Self Tier, she had obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix, which was equivalent to becoming the owner of this place. Then, with the Great Emperor-level formation, it would be easy for her to kill a few Spirit Transformation Tiers."]},{"number":4371,"title":"Chapter 4371: Going all out in battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4371: Going all out in battle","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han looked at the little red bird, and asked through divine sense, “You can control the formations here?”","“En, I can throw people out of the Mystery Realm.” The little red bird nodded, and also replied via divine sense.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said, “Aside from this person, throw everyone else out.”","He was referring to Lian Yutang.","“All right,” the little red bird nodded without hesitation. Before she had fallen unconscious, she had seen Ling Han rush out to save her.","The request of a friend naturally had to be fulfilled.","With a thought from her, xiu, xiu, xiu, everyone here disappeared, aside from Lian Yutang.","Yi?","Lian Yutang frowned. Why had the others all disappeared?","He was a little nervous, but there was also a burning desire in his heart.","He was the only one left. This was naturally a little strange, but at the same time, without a powerful competitor like Imperial Son Ze, he only had to kill Ling Han, and the inheritance of the True Phoenix would naturally be obtained by him.","Ling Han strode towards Lian Yutang and said, “Come, let’s have a great battle.”","“All right. I’ll kill you first, then take the True Phoenix inheritance.” Lian Yutang smiled.","“In your dreams!” Ling Han charged over, unleashing his full battle prowess.","Boom!","Lian Yutang’s expression changed drastically when he saw this.","So strong.","Previously, though he had also battled with Ling Han before, with the help of the eight senior elders at that time, Ling Han was obstructed and unable to unleash his full abilities. However, it was a different story now. Ling Han was completely free of pressure, so he naturally could unleash his full abilities.","Peng, peng, peng! The two of them continued to exchange blows. In terms of power, it was still Lian Yutang who was slightly superior. However, his superiority was truly limited. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s physique was tough, and his advantage of being able to disperse attacks automatically was clear for all to see. He was not the slightest bit inferior.","In fact, he didn’t even need to rest and reorganize at all. He pursued closely with every move, and his attacks surged forth like a flood.","Lian Yutang didn’t cower either. He had also cultivated Body Art, and his physique was extremely tough. He was completely capable of withstanding such an exchange of blows.","However, the toughness of his physique did not mean that his body was indestructible. After several hundred moves, traces of blood appeared on his skin. That was blood vessels bursting.","It could not be helped. He was unable to disperse the attack within six Heavens. In this aspect, he was at too much of a disadvantage. As a result, he had naturally sustained some injuries from the prolonged battle. Thankfully, this was only a superficial wound, and would not affect his battle prowess at all. It was just that it looked a little ugly.","What depressed Lian Yutang was the fact that Ling Han was actually unscathed.","This was a huge blow to him.","He could accept being injured, but that was under the condition that he had an advantage, and the other party’s injuries were heavier than his. But now? Ling Han was completely unwounded, which was something he could not accept.","Ling Han was stronger than him?","This meant that if the battle continued, he would lose, or even die!","How could that be allowed?","He humphed as he retrieved his Spirit Tool.","Before this, he couldn’t even be bothered to use his Spirit Tool, believing that he was invincible among his peers. Now, however, it was clear that he was no match for Ling Han. This caused him to swallow his pride.","Kill the enemy, and snatch the inheritance.","Boom, he brandished a crimson long sword. As he slashed out with the sword, Sword Qi was three thousand meters long, bringing with it a fierce light, as it slashed out towards Ling Han.","This was a Six Star Spirit Tool, and could blast out Sect Master-level power. However, limited by Lian Yutang’s cultivation level, the upper limit of attack power had dropped to Pseudo Sect Master-level. However, was Pseudo Sect Master-level battle prowess not enough to kill Ling Han?","The Sword Qi slashed over, extremely terrifying.","Ling Han humphed and said, “Do you think you’re the only one with a Spirit Tool?”","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared above his head.","The Sword Qi slashed over, and was naturally blocked by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Endless power and Regulations landed on the tower, causing the precious tower to tremble slightly, but that was it.","“En?” Lian Yutang couldn’t help but be startled. What was going on here?","This tower?","He focused his gaze, and suddenly paled in shock, “Imperial Weapon!”","The moment these words left his mouth, he immediately shook his head. This wasn’t the Imperial Weapon. It was far from having the domineering aura of the Imperial Weapon that could crush all life, but from a certain aspect, this was no different from the Imperial Weapon.","He understood now, and his eyes burned with desire. “A precious tool forged from Origin Gold!”","“You’re envious, right?” Ling Han said with a smile. “Unfortunately, not only will you not be able to obtain it, you’ll even be killed by me here.”","Lian Yutang immediately came to a realization. “As it turned out, the Nine Mountains Saint doesn’t possess the Imperial Weapon. Instead, he possessed this Spirit Tool that was forged from Origin Gold!”","All the Imperial Clans had been deceived. What a joke, they had actually been deceived by a paper tiger for so long. If they had known this earlier, the Imperial Clans would have launched an attack. Whether it was the Nine Suns Holy Land, or Ling Han, they would have become history long ago.","It didn’t matter. When he killed Ling Han and obtained this Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, he would be able to gain a lot.","“You’re still daydreaming,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head. He had the little red bird send everyone away, only leaving Lian Yutang behind. This would make it easier for him to silence Lian Yutang.","“It’s only forged from Origin Gold, and it’s not a real Imperial Weapon. What do I have to fear?” Lian Yutang charged over, the sword in his hand slashing repeatedly, Sword Qi soaring into the sky.","He still had his trump card, so he was filled with confidence.","Ling Han controlled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to resist the Sword Qi. Meanwhile, he brandished his fists and clashed head-on with Lian Yutang. He was going to exhaust Lian Yutang to death no matter what.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The battle continued, and after half a day, Lian Yutang’s battle prowess started to decline.","In such a fierce battle, his reserves of mystical power could no longer keep up. On the other hand, Ling Han’s mystical power stores were the dimensions in his body. It could be said that they were as vast as the universe, and there was absolutely no need to worry that it would be exhausted.","Lian Yutang also realized that Ling Han was far too freakish. Not only was Ling Han’s physique even more freakish than his, but his mystical power was also endless and boundless.","If this continued, he would be exhausted to death.","He could only use his trump card!","“Ling Han, you forced me to do this,” he said balefully. Boom! A powerful aura suddenly surged from his body.","This wasn’t because he had ignited his Imperial Blood, but rather... because he had broken through!","Minor Advanced Tier, Sect Master!","Ling Han was astounded. Breaking through here? Could he do it?","Lian Yutang was a member of the Golden Generation, and Ling Han believed that he had the aptitude and ability to break through in battle. However, this was the Mystery Realm, and the Regulations of heaven and earth were incomplete. How could it be that Lian Yutang wasn’t affected?","However, sensing Lian Yutang’s aura, there was indeed an earth-shattering change. It was definitely not something that a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator could compare to.","It could only be said that the Imperial Clan’s methods were nature-defying.","“Hahaha, there is no way that you would know. I have long since had one foot into Sect Master Tier, but for the sake of pursuing perfection in Spirit Transformation Tier, I forcibly suppressed it.” Lian Yutang said proudly, “Thus, I can also advance into this cultivation level at any time, but after this, I will no longer be able to suppress it.”","This was the strength and background of the Imperial Clan. If this were an ordinary person, this would be completely unimaginable.","The current him was already a Pseudo Sect Master, so he could completely activate the precious tool in his hand to unleash the true might of Sect Master-level. How could Ling Han block this?","No matter how rare and precious the Origin Gold was, without being refined by an elite, it was ultimately unable to unleash its full might.","“Ling Han, do you... regret it now?” Lian Yutang asked, looking down at Ling Han with disdain.","The present him had indeed grasped an absolute advantage.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said to the little red bird, “We should leave.”"]},{"number":4372,"title":"Chapter 4372: Banished Forever","paragraphs":["Chapter 4372: Banished Forever","Editor: Henyee Translations","Leave?","‘What do you mean?’","Lian Yutang faltered upon hearing this. However, Ling Han, the little red bird, the large black dog, and the others all disappeared without a trace.","Now, he was the only one left standing all alone in the secret lair of the True Phoenix.","He was shocked, and then became anxious.","He was trapped here!","Now that he could unleash the battle prowess of a Sect Master, he should be invincible in this place, but what was the use?","Fight with the firebirds? Or fight with the fire turtle?","This was the Mystery Realm, and there was a shortage of Regulations. The reason why he could ascend to Sect Master-level was because he had long since entered into this cultivation level and forcibly exited. Thus, even if he advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier, there was no special requirement for the environment.","However, if one wanted to reach the level of Venerate Tier, they would definitely need the complete Regulations of heaven and earth.","If he was trapped here, he would only be able to hover around the level of Sect Master for the rest of his life, never to cross over to the next level.","“Ling Han, come out! Come out!” he shouted loudly.","However, only his echo reverberated in the surroundings.","Lian Yutang revealed a terrified expression. He had really been abandoned here. He was all alone, yet this kind of perception was even worse than killing him.","He was the Golden Generation, an existence that wanted to contend for the position of Emperor. Even if he died, he should have died on the Imperial Path, and not be trapped in this place, idling around and living out the rest of his life in a mediocre manner.","As Sect Master, he could live for about 40,000 years. Now, his long lifespan had only passed over a hundred years. The rest of his life was so long, and he had to spend it here?","He would go crazy. He would definitely go crazy.","“Ah, Ling Han, I’m going to tear you into pieces!”","“Come out, come out!”","“Let us have a vigorous battle. Do you dare?”","“Coward! Coward!”","However, the only response he received was an echo.","...","With Ling Han’s reminder, the little red bird teleported everyone out of the lair of the True Phoenix and into a remote galaxy.","Ling Han immediately took out the Void Beast hide, covering everyone inside.","“Banish this lair, and never let anyone find it again,” Ling Han said.","“All right,” the little red bird agreed happily. With a thought, this lair of the True Phoenix disappeared into the Void. Unless she took the initiative to summon it, it would never appear again.","—Either a Great Emperor would appear, and conduct a search in a specific location. It was also possible that they would find the lair of the True Phoenix. Aside from that, it was absolutely impossible.","“Haha, Cousin Lian is going to stay in the Mystery Realm forever just like that?” The large black dog couldn’t help but laugh.","“Who asked him to be so determined to kill our Little Han? It’s already good enough that we didn’t kill him,” the little azure dragon said in an old-fashioned manner.","“Sister-in-law, you’re not feeling resentment, are you?” The large black dog turned to look at Chi Menghan.","Chi Menghan smiled faintly. She was very clear about the process of Ling Han and Lian Yutang becoming enemies. Though Ling Han’s words were indeed very infuriating at times, if others didn’t trifle with him, he wouldn’t take the initiative to trifle with anyone either.","Thus, Lian Yutang had brought this upon himself.","Ling Han had the large black dog connect to the Galaxy Network and communicate with the Nine Mountains Saint to help them return.","It could be imagined that by now, everyone knew that the little red bird had obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix. Thus, next, it would be the Imperial Clans that would not be able to hold back, and search everywhere for the little red bird, so that they could force out the secret of the inheritance of the True Phoenix.","True enough, after a few days, a Saint appeared, sweeping his powerful divine sense over the Void, searching for the whereabouts of Ling Han and the others.","If they were not too far away from each other, the hide of the Void Beast would definitely not be able to deceive the eyes or divine sense of a Saint. But now, the distance was really too far, and even Saints had their limitations.","Thus, the Saints came and went, one after another. None of them discovered Ling Han and the others.","On the seventeenth day, the Nine Mountains Saint finally arrived.","The old man waved his hand, and immediately brought Ling Han and the others back to Nine Suns Holy Land.","In this way, the trip to the lair of the True Phoenix could be considered to have concluded completely.","After learning of the fateful encounters of Ling Han and the others, the Nine Mountains Saint couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. Ling Han was truly a man of great fortune.","If it was not for the fact that he had entered into the Ancestral King Academy, he would not have been able to encounter the little red bird, and without the little red bird, it would be useless even if he entered into the lair of the True Phoenix. Everyone would only be trapped inside.","With this thought, everyone broke out in a cold sweat. They had almost been eternally trapped in the lair of the True Phoenix, just like Lian Yutang.","“Thank me!” The little red bird acted like a savior.","Peng!","The consequence of being too smug was naturally to be harshly taught a lesson.","However, the little red bird had also formed a strong friendship with Ling Han and the others, and very readily handed over the inheritance of the True Phoenix, sharing it with Ling Han and the others.","Imperial Technique, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight!","None of the first-generation Divine Beasts had the Imperial Scroll. They had been nurtured by heaven and earth, and lacked the experience of advancing step by step towards the strongest. Thus, they were also unable to leave behind the Imperial Scroll. For example, the fact that the True Dragon could create the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique was proof that he really lived up to the title of the strongest Divine Beast.","Everyone immediately began to cultivate. This could be said to be the strongest movement technique in the world. Even the Great Emperors of the past era all wanted to study it. After all, this was an ability bestowed by heaven and earth on the True Phoenix.","The Ancestral King was indeed powerful, but was he more powerful than the heavens?","If he was really stronger than the heavens, then wouldn’t the Ancestral King be able to live forever?","Ling Han handed the combined staff over to the Nine Mountains Saint and asked him to study it. This was a valuable item, and the little red bird naturally wouldn’t forget to take it with them when it teleported them away.","The Nine Mountains Saint agreed. He was already a Saint now, and had a very long life ahead of him. Furthermore, it would be extremely difficult for him to take another step further. He had a lot of time to study other things.","Moreover, comprehending by analogy might give him inspiration, right?","Ling Han immediately started to cultivate Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","This movement technique was extremely mysterious. Even with Ling Han’s comprehension ability, he was still unable to comprehend it in a short period of time.","Three months later, everyone did not make much progress. Even the genuine successor, the little red bird, had made very little progress.","“Let’s return to the Ancestral King Academy first,” Ling Han decided.","“Why?” the large black dog asked. “Aren’t you afraid that they’ll come and demand forcefully we hand over the inheritance of the True Phoenix? This is the secret technique of the Great Emperor, the strongest movement technique in the world. I’m sure that even if a Great Emperor appears, they’ll still be interested to read it.”","Ling Han smiled and said, “That’s indeed the case. However, as long as we don’t bring Little Red with us, it’s fine as long as we deny it. After all, we still have the old man’s intimidation, and added with the potential threat of Buddha Doga, I’m sure they won’t dare to do anything to us.”","“This is still a little risky,” the large black dog said.","“It can’t be helped. I have to get some cultivation resources.” Ling Han spread out his hands.","“Brat, you’re really going all out,” the large black dog said with a shake of his head.","After some discussion, they all agreed to return to the Ancestral King Academy.","If he wanted to eternally rid himself of the threat posed by the Imperial Clans, he could only improve his cultivation level as soon as possible, and the Ancestral King Academy was undoubtedly a very good choice. With Ling Han’s present battle prowess, he was already qualified to aim for the strongest of Spirit Transformation Tier.","Led by the Nine Mountains Saint, they soon returned to the Ancestral King Academy. Meanwhile, the little red bird stayed behind at the Nine Suns Holy Land.","—"]},{"number":4373,"title":"Chapter 4373: Top of Spirit Transformation Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 4373: Top of Spirit Transformation Tier","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han and the others entered the academy, attracting the attention of many people along the way.","Hiss, this guy still dared to return to the academy?","Not long after, a Venerate Tier appeared, and found Ling Han.","“Ling Han, hand over the inheritance of the True Phoenix.” This Venerate had the title of Heavenly Stone, and went straight to the point.","A Venerate Tier versus a Spirit Transformation Tier... was there any need to beat around the bush?","Ling Han pretended to be surprised, and said, “Senior Heavenly Stone, everyone knows that the inheritance of the True Phoenix was obtained by a little red bird. Why are you asking me for the inheritance of the True Phoenix?”","“Humph, aren’t you on the same side as it?” Venerate Heavenly Stone asked coldly.","Ling Han smiled and shook his head, saying, “Senior, you’re wrong to say this. We’re in the same group, so we should share it? Going by that logic, I’ll be able to force out the Imperial Technique and Imperial Scroll of your clan by simply capturing one of Senior Heavenly Stone’s clansmen?”","How was this possible!","The Imperial Technique, especially the Imperial Scroll, was the most core and most valuable inheritance of an Imperial Clan. Only the most core people could cultivate the Imperial Scroll, so how could any random person know it?","And what Ling Han said was precisely this logic. Even the Imperial Clans had such strict barriers, what more when he and the little red bird were not of the same race at all.","Venerate Heavenly Stone couldn’t help but feel stifled. Imperial Techniques were extremely valuable, especially when it was such an amazing technique like Phoenix Wings Divine Flight that even a Great Emperor wished to survey.","Who would teach it to outsiders?","“Then where’s the little red bird?” he asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I don’t know. I also want to find her! She ran off on her own after obtaining the True Phoenix inheritance. Who knows where she went to cultivate in seclusion. She’s so disloyal!”","‘You’re quite clean with your excuses!’","Venerate Heavenly Stone naturally didn’t believe Ling Han’s words. If it were any other person, he could have used torture to extract a confession, or even directly searched Ling Han’s soul. However, Ling Han was far too unique. He had a Saint standing behind him, and it was suspected that he also had a Pseudo-Emperor supporting him.","With such a background, who would dare to easily use force against Ling Han?","Unless he was absolutely certain that the inheritance of the True Phoenix was in Ling Han’s possession. Then, after he obtained it through interrogation, he would conceal his identity and roam the universe.","However, Ling Han’s words made some sense. The inheritance of the True Phoenix was extremely precious. If it was him, would he pass it on to those close to him?","Even if it was his own son.","“Humph!” With a flutter of his sleeve, he strode off.","After this Venerate Tier elite left, no other Venerate Tier elites came over to interrogate him. Presumably, when Venerate Heavenly Stone came, the other Venerate Tier elites were all watching from the shadows. If Ling Han handed over the inheritance of the True Phoenix, they would definitely jump out to share it.","However, Venerate Heavenly Stone had left empty-handed. If it were them, the situation wouldn’t change much, unless they were willing to go all out.","To throw everything on the line just for the slightest chance, they did not have such determination.","Soon, the monthly exam came again.","One cultivation level after another competed, and very soon, it was Ling Han’s turn.","With his current strength, he was naturally going to sweep aside all opposition in the knockout battles, and advance into the challenge group with an absolute advantage. Additionally, Origin had actually advanced into Spiritual Transformation Tier as well, and like Ding Shu , showed great might, similarly advancing into the challenge group.","After Ding Shu and Ling Han separated, Ding Shu also obtained a great opportunity. His cultivation level advanced rapidly, catching up to Ling Han. He similarly was Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change, and Origin was even more terrifyingly powerful. He was only a step behind, reaching Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change.","The challenge began.","Ling Han directly challenged Imperial Son Ze, who was ranked first.","“How dare you!” Imperial Son Ze smirked coldly, and slowly walked out. He crossed his arms behind his back, looking disdainfully at Ling Han.","“Enough with the nonsense. It’s better that you kneel down and proclaim your conquest,” Ling Han said as he lashed out at Imperial Son Ze.","The two of them battled fiercely, and very soon, powerful moves were used one after another. The situation immediately became tense and intense.","Everyone was watching in a daze.","How long had it been? Yet, Ling Han’s strength had already increased by such an astonishing amount.","In the lair of the True Phoenix, just how many natural treasures had this guy obtained? His improvement was practically soaring!","Imperial Son Ze’s battle prowess was truly no weaker than Ling Han’s. Moreover, the Golden Generation had also cultivated Body Art, and had continuous power with tough physique. Yet this was still not as awesome as Ling Han’s ability of neutralizing attacks within six Heavens of power.","In a head-on clash of blows, it wasn’t long before Imperial Son Ze fell into a disadvantage, throwing up blood continuously.","Everyone who saw this could not believe their eyes. Imperial Son Ze was from the Golden Generation.","What kind of concept was the Golden Generation?","Invincible among his peers!","But now? A Golden Generation was about to be defeated by Ling Han.","Did this signify that a new legendary star was about to rise?","After battling for a while longer, Imperial Son Ze could only helplessly admit defeat. Unless he broke through to Minor Advanced Tier, he would no longer be a match for Ling Han in this cultivation level.","Ling Han was ranked first!","Everyone was stunned for a long time. Just how long had passed? He had already defeated the Golden Generation?","Everyone frowned. If Ling Han was allowed to ascend to the throne, he would definitely settle the score. At that time, even if it was the Imperial Clans, so what? Would they be able to escape from this tribulation?","Ding Shu and Origin also shone brilliantly with iridescent light, taking third and fourth places respectively — the second place was still taken by Imperial Son Ze.","Everyone exclaimed in shock. Was a new era about to arrive?","A hundred years ago, the Golden Generation appeared out of nowhere, causing a great commotion. All the Imperial Clans were certain that their glory would rise to another level, breaking the curse that the Imperial Clan could not produce another Great Emperor,","But now, three great young prodigies had appeared, and it seemed like they all had the potential to surpass the Golden Generation.","Were they going to crush the Golden Generation into dust in this era that was rolling out?","Ling Han had obtained a large amount of cultivation resources, so he was naturally very happy.","As he refined these resources, he continued to cultivate Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","A month passed, and when Ling Han participated in the monthly exam again, he discovered that Imperial Son Ze was no longer here.","He had broken through to the level of Sect Master Tier.","Ling Han smiled. If it weren’t for him, Imperial Son Ze probably would have stayed in the Spiritual Transformation Tier for a while longer, cultivating his cultivation level to perfection as much as possible. However, after losing to Ling Han, he had probably felt humiliated, so he directly advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier.","However, it was also because he had defeated Imperial Son Ze that the Golden Generation was extremely displeased with him. They were a united force, and one of them had been defeated, which was a complete humiliation!","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. If you can, come and bite me.","Ding Shu and Origin both issued challenges to him, but they were both easily defeated by him. He had once reached Ten Forms, and if one wanted to defeat him, even for freaks like Ding Shu and Origin, they would have to surpass him in terms of cultivation level.","A battle of equal cultivation levels?","Sorry, he was absolutely invincible.","One month after another, time passed very quickly. Ling Han kept occupying the throne of number one in the Spiritual Transformation Tier. A whole year had passed, and he had refined a great amount of cultivation resources, advancing into the Seventh Change.","And what made him the happiest was that he finally had a breakthrough in the cultivation of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","On a barren planet, Ling Han was presently advancing at a high speed. If he wanted to cultivate Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he naturally could not possibly be seen by others. Otherwise, it would mean great trouble.","Boom, his figure actually sped up inconceivably, and the image of a fire phoenix appeared behind him, leaving behind endless flames."]},{"number":4374,"title":"Chapter 4374: Visitors from the Wolf Tribe","paragraphs":["Chapter 4374: Visitors from the Wolf Tribe","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han’s speed was already fast enough, but on this foundation, he had exploded ten times faster. What kind of concept was that?","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, the world’s strongest movement technique.","Why was it that even the movement technique created by a Great Emperor couldn’t surpass it?","That was because the True Phoenix had been nurtured by heaven and earth. This was an ability that heaven and earth had bestowed on the True Phoenix. Just like how the True Dragon’s Body Art was naturally incomparable, and even a Great Emperor could not reach such heights.","Ling Han was clearly streaking through the skies, but his speed was so fast that it was as if he had teleported, appearing and disappearing in quick succession. If it was not for the fact that there was a brilliant flame left behind in the skies, one would not be able to tell that he was actually moving smoothly.","“As expected of the True Phoenix!”","Ling Han praised. Not only was his speed extraordinarily fast, but the flames that were left behind behind also had terrifying destructive power. It was not inferior to using his full strength.","It could be imagined that the True Phoenix had only needed to fly past at a high speed, and the flames would have been able to incinerate his enemies. There would have been no need for him to make another move.","Being able to stand side by side with the True Dragon, the True Phoenix was indeed outstanding.","“Now, I can only be considered to have just barely begun, and even if I continue to cultivate diligently, it is still impossible for me to reach the ultimate height.”","“Firstly, I’m not a True Phoenix, so I’m naturally limited. Secondly, it’s also because my cultivation level isn’t high enough. When I advance to Sect Master Tier, I’ll be able to break through to the next level and increase my speed again.”","Ling Han felt slightly regretful. This meant that even if he had reached the level of Great Emperor, he could not possibly possess the extreme speed that the True Phoenix had once possessed.","However, after a moment of disappointment, Ling Han became energized again.","If he became Emperor, then there would be no one in this world that could be his match. Would there still be anyone that could escape from his hands?","In this era, the Great Emperor was destined to be lonely.","Invincibility was also a kind of loneliness.","Ling Han returned to the Ancestral King Academy. Since he had already successfully cultivated Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he was also thinking of going around somewhere.","Although he could also obtain a considerable amount of cultivation resources at the Ancestral King Academy, it was naturally incomparable to what he had obtained from the lair of the True Phoenix.","Thus, if such historical sites opened again, Ling Han was naturally willing to make a trip.","He searched on the Galaxy Network, but it seemed to have been especially peaceful recently. There was no news of such a thing happening anywhere, which made Ling Han feel very disappointed.","“If I stay here, I’ll need at least 10 years to reach the Ninth Change.” Ling Han counted on his fingers. “To my lifespan, this is really no big deal. However, a great era has already arrived, so perhaps I really can’t afford to miss out on these 10 years.”","However, there was no extra income to be made, so it was useless no matter how anxious he was.","Another month later, someone suddenly came to the Ancestral King Academy.","The Demon Wolf Imperial Clan!","A Saint had arrived, and there was also a Sect Master junior with him. He was only over 500 years old, and could be considered very young. His natural talent was astonishing, but in the case of the Ancestral King Academy, there were many hundred-year-old Sect Masters, and there were even Venerate Tier elites.","This junior’s name was Di Jia. He did not want to enter the Ancestral King Academy to become a disciple, but rather had other missions.","Ling Han was admiring the flowers in the courtyard. This was his daily routine. Cultivating the Dao of heaven and earth, he needed a heart that could accept the nature of heaven and earth. Unexpectedly, he felt a powerful pressure assault him.","Boom, in the courtyard, the trees, flowers, and grass, all the leaves wilted in an instant.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. He leaped up and stood atop the wall.","Outside, there was a grey-robed young man standing proudly. When he discovered that he had appeared, he immediately cast a baleful gaze filled with killing intent.","“Ling Han, I am Di Jia!” the young man said.","Ling Han humphed, and said, “Who cares who you are? Compensate me for my flowers!”","Di Jia faltered upon hearing this. ‘Are you stupid? Didn’t you realize that I’m at the level of Sect Master?’","He coughed and said, “I’m a Minor Advanced Tier!”","“So what?” Ling Han retorted.","Di Jia’s anger naturally rose. In the cultivation world, every gap of a major tier meant a world of difference.","“Humph, you are indeed as the legends say, having a stinky mouth!” he said balefully, and moved directly, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Boom! Even though he wasn’t the Imperial Son, just how powerful was the attack of the Sect Master?","He stretched out a hand, which seemed to have turned into a small mountain. Regulations were entwined around his fingers, which turned into multiple divine patterns.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t fight him head-on. No matter how confident he was, there was no need for him to go head to head with a Sect Master when he was at the Spiritual Transformation Tier Seventh Change—no matter what, he had to wait until after Ninth Change to see if he was strong enough to stand against a Sect Master.","Boom, the large hand descended, and Ling Han’s courtyard was instantly shattered.","Di Ya withdrew his hand, and frowned. He could sense very clearly that he had not managed to smack Ling Han onto the ground.","Xiu, with a flash, Ling Han appeared once more.","He had used the Star Steps twice in a row. One time, he had left, and the other time, he had returned, so he naturally managed to dodge this attack from Di Jia.","This was not a sparring match, nor was it in a Mystery Realm like the lair of the True Phoenix. The Star Steps naturally could show its full might.","Astonishment flashed through his mind. Why was this Di Jia so insolent?","Firstly, this was the Ancestral King Academy, so there were still some rules that he had to adhere to. Secondly, the Nine Mountains Saint had already announced that if anyone dared to bully Ling Han with a higher cultivation level, he would bring the Imperial Weapon and pay them a visit.","Faced with this kind of threat, even the Imperial Clan elites would have to consider carefully. Then, even if Di Jia was rash, would the Saint from the Demon Race Imperial Clan not consider the consequences?","However, it just so happened that no one had stepped forward to stop him.","Could it be that... there were already members of Imperial Clans that were suspicious of the Nine Mountains Saint? This was a probe, so they had mobilized a clansman that was not too important like Di Jia.","Sigh, there was no concealing the truth. Ling Han knew that the fact that the Nine Mountains Saint didn’t actually have an Imperial Weapon would definitely be exposed, but the problem was that he hadn’t earned enough cultivation resources yet. It was really too early to expose the truth now.","“Ling Han, what tricks have you played, that you can actually affect the Imperial Son of our Clan!” Di Jia asked.","This was the mission of his trip, and that was to find out the truth behind how Di Luo was howling like a wolf and treated Ling Han as if he was his master.","To the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, this was really too terrifying. It was equivalent to someone having hold of their lifeline. If even Saints would be affected, then wouldn’t the whole Imperial Clan have to bow down to Ling Han?","Thus, after much consideration, the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan finally decided to make a move on Ling Han. No matter what, they had to get to the bottom of this.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Are you talking about this thing?”","He took out the Great Emperor Horn, and spread it out in his hand.","“What is this thing?” Di Jia asked.","“You want to know?” Ling Han countered.","“Enough with the nonsense!” Di Jia said impatiently.","“All right, then I’ll let you know.” Ling Han blew the horn. Weng, a soundless ripple spread out, and instantly, Di Jia howled at the sky. His body uncontrollably sprawled out on the ground. Peng, his clothes were torn apart, and silver fur covered his entire body.","He transformed into his wolf form.","A conflicted look flashed across Di Jia’s eyes, but he still walked to Ling Han’s side. Sticking out his tongue, he licked the instep of Ling Han’s foot, as if he was a tame dog.","This crisis was easily resolved."]},{"number":4375,"title":"Chapter 4375: Demonic Mist Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4375: Demonic Mist Planet","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hiss, higher-ups in the academy were secretly observing them, and they were all stunned upon seeing this scene.","What was going on?","He had only blown a horn, and Di Jia was as obedient as a dog?","There were a few Venerate Tiers that were burning with desire. If they could obtain this treasure, would they be able to command the entire Demon Wolf Imperial Clan?","With this in mind, they all felt an urge to charge out and snatch the treasure. However, they also recalled that if they had made a mistake in their estimation, and this would not affect the Saint at all, then, how badly would they be beaten by that Saint from the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan?","The Saint of the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan, Xuan Mo, also frowned slightly.","Should he step out?","He had reservations in his heart. If he was also affected, then it would be a big joke. The entire Demon Wolf Imperial Clan would be facing a great crisis.","At that time, it was very likely that the other Imperial Clans would also be fighting over this opportunity. The temptation of being able to control an Imperial Clan was far too great.","What did this signify?","They could obtain all the wealth of the other Imperial Clan, including the Imperial Scroll, the Imperial Technique, the Imperial Weapon, as well as endless resources.","Which Imperial Clan was capable of resisting this kind of temptation?","Even if they had reservations, they could only snatch the treasure and not kill anyone. How could it be that the Nine Mountains Saint and Buddha Doga would make a move because of this?","It was precisely because of such scruples that Saint Xuan Mo did not make a move. It was not that he was not resolute enough, but rather the consequences were really too serious.","“Here, go and play with the bone.” Ling Han tossed out the remaining chicken drumstick bone that he had eaten. Di Jia’s wolf form immediately pounced over, biting on the bone as it did so.","There was a strong fury and defiance in his eyes, but an instinctive obedience made it impossible for him to resist.","Ling Han called someone over to renovate the courtyard.","For cultivators, building a side courtyard was extremely easy.","Ling Han looked calm on the surface, but internally, alarm bells were already ringing loudly.","He had indeed survived this crisis, but it was obvious that the Imperial Clan would not spare him. That was because of the Great Emperor Horn in his hands. They would definitely probe him in every way possible. Next time, it would probably be a Venerate Tier.","As long as it was proven that a Venerate Tier elite would not be affected, or had a certain amount of resistance, the Saint of that clan would definitely make a move. They could not possibly allow this treasure that had such a great influence on the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan to fall into the hands of an outsider.","The Nine Mountains Saint definitely couldn’t make a move. He knew very well that the old man was truly a paper tiger. He was only a One Star Saint, and without an Imperial Weapon, how could he do anything?","At that time, the members of the Imperial Clans would all reveal twisted expressions.","Sigh!","Ling Han had the intention to leave. It was time for him to leave. If he stayed any longer, it would be too dangerous.","However, even if he left, he couldn’t leave in a panic. That would be a sign of guilt. Instead, it would speed up the Imperial Clans’ attack.","Now, even if there were suspicions, they would only be suspicions. There would always be misgivings like this and that. Moreover, the threat of Buddha Doga was genuine. He was a Pseudo-Emperor; what Imperial Clan would dare to face this kind of threat?","Ling Han immediately took action, informing the empress, the large black dog and the others. They really didn’t have much time left in the Ancestral King Academy.","He would find a chance to leave.","They had to let nature take its course. Otherwise, the academy would definitely think that they were fleeing for their lives. Then, with furhter thought, the truth of the matter would undoubtedly be exposed.","And this opportunity had really been encountered by them.","In the distant galaxy, a planet appeared out of thin air!","Was it a newly born planet?","No.","This was a planet that had existed for a long time. It was covered densely with vegetation. Some people easily found high-level Celestial medicines, and there was also a large number of fierce beasts. Their abilities varied greatly.","What was going on?","Had this planet been here all this while, just that it had not manifested previously? Or had it suddenly teleported here from somewhere else?","No one could answer this question. The answer might be on this planet, or it might never be found, because the ferocious beasts had not developed intelligence, so how could they answer?","But no matter what, this was a resource planet, and its grade was not low either. Taking advantage of the fact that no great force had announced that they were taking possession of it yet, various minor cultivators all moved out, wanting to get a share of the loot. If they could find a Great Herb, they would be rich.","Ling Han was already in Spirit Transformation Tier, so the requirement for the quality of the Celestial medicine was naturally extraordinarily high. He did not think that an ordinary resource planet could be of any help to him, but this was a reason for him to leave the academy in broad daylight.","Thus, he made some arrangements, and everyone set out on their way.","This did not arouse the suspicion of the Academy, because there were a great many disciples that had set out on their journey, and it was not just Ling Han and the others.","This group included Ling Han, the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, the perverted pig, and the seven babies. As for Ding Shu and Chi Menghan, Ling Han didn’t invite them.","That was because the two of them could completely stay in the academy, and would not have to be burdened by him.","Especially Chi Menghan, who was the daughter of an Imperial Clan. How could it be that she had to worry about other Imperial Clans harming her?","On the other hand, Lian Yutang’s disappearance caused a great commotion in theacademy. Someone had once suspected that Ling Han had assassinated him. After all, he had already proven his strength, and even Imperial Son Ze had been defeated.","However, Lian Yutang’s life token hadn’t shattered, which meant that he was still alive. Then, it should have nothing to do with Ling Han, right?","He was probably hiding somewhere to cultivate, waiting to return to amaze the world with a single feat.","Yet Ling Han knew that Lian Yutang would never be able to return.","Unless he committed suicide, this guy would have to spend about 40,000 years in the lair of the True Phoenix.","Halfway there, the empress, Hu Niu, and the babies turned towards the Nine Suns Holy Land. Ling Han, the little dragon, and the large black dog continued to head towards that newly appeared planet. Perhaps their gains wouldn’t be great, but there was no harm, so they might as well go and take a look.","This planet was named the Demonic Mist Planet, because there was a fog that enshrouded a certain part of this planet all year round. Up until now, no one had been able to enter or exit alive.","Aside from that, this planet was still quite safe.","After a month of intergalactic teleportation, they finally arrived at the Demonic Mist Planet. However, there was no Transfer Formation set up here yet, so they could only board a warship after arriving at a nearby planet.","Of course, there was no need for a Sect Master to go to so much trouble. He could directly tear a rip into the Void and arrive directly.","This made Ling Han very envious. To say nothing of convenience, the key was that he could save money. Did one think that the formation foundations were free?","Now, this planet was very lively, and as more and more news spread out, more and more cultivators came.","On the third day after Ling Han and the others came here, a huge piece of news appeared on the Galaxy Network.","Someone had discovered a Saintly medicine!","This was the Saintly medicine. There were not many such Great Herbs in the whole universe, and only the top grade mother tree could nurture such a Great Herb.","But since it was a Saintly medicine, it was naturally extraordinary. According to eyewitnesses, he had discovered this Saintly medicine near the demonic mist. It had taken the form of a white-bearded old man, and was presently inhaling and exhaling Earth Qi. After it was discovered, it immediately turned into a pony and fled.","Because the demonic mist was too dangerous, that person did not give chase."]},{"number":4376,"title":"Chapter 4376 Saintly medicine","paragraphs":["When the news spread out, everyone was excited.","A Saint-level Great Herb, what kind of concept was that?","Saints would also be tempted, and if a Venerate Tier managed to obtain it, he may be able to break through the restriction on his cultivation level, and thus break through to Saint Tier in a single stroke.","There was even less need to mention the others. As long as they could eat a small piece, their improvement would be measured in leaps and bounds.","Instantly, a considerable number of people headed in the direction of the demonic mist.","Ling Han was also very surprised. He had come out this time mainly for the purpose of fleeing, and to earn some extra resources while he was at it. He had not thought that a Great Herb would actually appear here.","\"Little Han!\" The azure dragon and large black dog looked over, their eyes burning brightly.","Ling Han nodded, \"Let's go and take a look, but it is best to be careful. After all, Saintly medicine has appeared, which would draw out Saints. Our abilities are really not enough.\"","\"We still need to change our appearance,\" the little azure dragon said.","\"What is it? Do you have too many enemies? Are you afraid of being hacked to death?\" the large black dog teased.","The little azure dragon sneered, \"Those who hope to kill you and eat your dog meat are definitely ten times more than Grandpa Dragon's enemies.\"","\"Four-Legged Snake, your skill of speech has improved!\" the large black dog said with a smile.","\"Naturally.\"","The two of them started to bicker again. Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Disguise is fine; it can save us some trouble.\"","Di Jia moved. Though Ling Han had perfectly resolved the matter of his assault, the Nine Mountains Saint did not have any reaction at all. This naturally would cause suspicion.","Was it because Ling Han hadn't suffered any losses, so he couldn't be bothered to make a move? Or was it that the Nine Mountains Saint didn't have an Imperial Weapon in his possession?","These Imperial Clans all saw very clearly that the Nine Mountains Saint had never used the Imperial Weapon in the Mountain Sea Heaven. He would always use all kinds of excuses to avoid using it. Thus, once the number of times increased, it was naturally inevitable that it would draw suspicion.","That was why the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan had probed him. Firstly, it was because of the Great Emperor Horn in Ling Han's hand, and secondly, it was because they suspected the Nine Mountains Saint.","Under such circumstances, Ling Han didn't dare to bet on the reactions of the Imperial Clans.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, or even against a Sect Master-level opponent, he could use the Star Steps to save his life. However, in the case of a Saint... he didn't have any confidence at all. A Saint was far too powerful.","Seeing that Ling Han had already agreed, the large black dog naturally wouldn't object anymore. The three of them changed their appearances one after another.","Ling Han and the little azure dragon were relatively normal. They were both youngsters who looked to be in their twenties. The large black dog was even more exaggerated. He looked like an extremely vulgar middle-aged man. One look and one could tell that he didn't look like a good person.","\"As expected, a natural villain,\" the little azure dragon took the opportunity to tease him, \"Old BLack, no wonder you rarely take human form. As it turned out, it is because you look too vulgar.\"","\"Go to hell!\" The large black dog humphed, \"You have no taste!\"","\"All right, let's set out.\"","Ling Han interrupted the bickering of these two jokers, and the three of them set out, heading towards the area where the demonic mist was located.","This planet was very big, but Ling Han had already grasped the ley lines here. Thus, as he used the Star Steps, he soon arrived with the large black dog and the little azure dragon.","The area affected by the demonic mist was very large. Ling Han brought the little azure dragon and the large black dog to the border, but didn't dare to barge in rashly.","Even though this area was huge, there were still more people rushing over. In this place, Ling Han could still see a few people, though they were sparse and few in number.","Ling Han sensed for a while, but whether it was his divine sense or the ley lines, they all came to an abrupt stop when they arrived here. It was as if they had been cut by someone. After entering into the demonic mist, everything had been severed.","It should be known that he was presently in the Spiritual Transformation Tier. No matter where he was, he could be considered an elite, but he could not sense anything at all inside the demonic mist. Hiss, what level was this demonic mist?","As time passed, more and more people ran over, which also caused more and more people to gather in the vicinity.","Everyone knew that the demonic mist was extremely dangerous, so no one dared to take the risk of barging in.","Since this Saintly medicine had come out, they were sure that it would come out again.","They just had to wait for it.","Even if it was a Saintly medicine, it could not possibly have much battle prowess. Even a Foundation Building Tier cultivator could easily deal with it. The problem was that the Saintly medicine ran very fast, and that was the real difficulty.","Thus, everyone found a place to hide, planning to launch a sneak attack on the Saintly medicine.","After waiting for a long time, Ling Han and the others didn't discover anything. On the other hand, on the fifth day, they heard the people beside them say that the Saintly medicinehad really walked out of the demonic mist. However, after being attacked, it ran extremely quickly, and instantly fled into the demonic mist.","Some people could not hold back their greed, and rushed into the demonic mist, wanting to pursue the Saintly medicine, but in the end, they did not come out again.","Meanwhile, Ling Han continued to observe the demonic mist. Just what in the world was this?","Why could one be lost within? Or perhaps, there was some terrifying existence here that had swallowed all those who entered?","However, he did not manage to come up with anything.","\"I wonder if the old man will come over?\" Ling Han asked. To the Nine Mountains Saint, the effects of the Saintly medicine were immense. It was extremely likely that it would push him to the level of two stars, or even three stars.","Most importantly, the staff that he had previously obtained from the lair of the True Phoenix was also with the old man, and there was a mysterious bead in the staff. It had the effect of resisting the natural power of heaven and earth, and it was unknown whether it would have extraordinary effects here.","\"If the old man gets the news, he should come over.\" The large black dog thought for a moment.","\"En, let's get in touch with the old man.\"","They connected to the Galaxy Network, but were temporarily unable to contact the Nine Mountains Saint. The old man was either in seclusion, or hurrying through the Void, so he was unable to connect to the Galaxy Network.","After a few days, more and more elites arrived. The great elites of Sect Master and Venerate Tier all arrived, especially the Venerate Tier elites. Quite a few of them couldn't hold back and drew their Spirit Tools, forcefully barging into the area of the demonic mist.","They had to hurry. Otherwise, when the Saints arrived, would they still have a share of the Saintly medicine?","However, Venerate Tier elites entering would only lead to one result—no return.","This stunned everyone. Could it be that another deadly zone was about to appear?","Ling Han, meanwhile, felt a sense of deja vu, and couldn't help but think of the Yin River in the Dark Clouds Hell, as well as that sea of blood.","Hiss, could it be that there was also an incredible existence inside?","However, if such a being existed, why didn't they harvest the Saintly medicine?","\"Let's walk around somewhere else first,\" Ling Han said.","At present, they were unable to enter into the area of the demonic mist, so they could only wait aimlessly here. They might as well go and try their luck. After all, this was a great planet that had suddenly appeared, and great opportunities were everywhere.","The three of them roamed around. Setting aside the area of demonic mist, it was still very safe here. The wild beasts that rampaged were mostly True Self Tier, and there were very few that were Spiritual Transformation Tier, and Sect Masters were even rarer.","Thus, Ling Han and the others were powerful enough to sweep aside all opposition. In just a few days, they had already obtained a considerable number of Celestial medicines. However, their grade wasn't very high.","In the blink of an eye, another seven days had passed, and finally, a Saint had arrived.","This was the leader of a Holy Land. He had just advanced into this level, and was respectfully called the Azure Wood Saint. The moment he appeared, he directly headed towards the demonic mist. He held a jade porcelain bottle in his hand, and there was a willow in it."]},{"number":4377,"title":"Chapter 4377 Saint suffers losses","paragraphs":["The Azure Wood Saint took a step, and a green light surged out, turning into a streak of great dao that headed into the demonic mist.","This great dao of green light was incredibly sacred. Even the demonic mist could not suppress it. It could be clearly seen that there were rocks and trees in the demonic mist. That was not a desolate area.","\"If Saint Master makes a move, the Saintly medicine will definitely fall into the hands of Saint Master.\"","\"Aren't you guys going to disperse?\"","\"Let's go, let's go.\"","A dozen or so disciples arrived with the Azure Wood Saint. They were filled with confidence in their Saint, and looked down at the surrounding people.","Indeed, they had the backing of a Saint, so they were qualified to be so arrogant.","When Ling Han and the others heard that a Saint had come, they also rushed over to watch the excitement. They just happened to witness the arrogant scene of these juniors.","Most people remained silent, not bothering to drop down to their level. However, there were also some who wore expressions of disdain. It wasn't them that were awesome, so what was there to be proud of?","\"What is it? Are you dissatisfied?\" A disciple of the Azure Wood Sect suddenly walked in front of Ling Han and questioned him.","Yi, where had this sudden calamity come from?","Ling Han couldn't help but feel startled. Who had he offended?","Oh, he understood now.","These people from the Azure Wood Sect wanted to establish their might, and it was probably because of his poor standing that he had become the target of their might.","He shook his head. This was really an undeserved calamity.","\"Are you deaf or mute?\" That disciple was overbearing, and completely unreasonable.","He wanted to be as arrogant as possible. The Azure Wood Sect had a Saint in their ranks, so they were completely capable of being as domineering as this.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"To a Saint, I am naturally impressed. However, to you guys, hoho.\"","\"What is the meaning of this?\" That disciple humphed, \"To look down on us is equivalent to looking down on Saint Master!\"","The large black dog couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself, \"You really dare to flatter yourself. Even you can represent a Saint?\"","\"You're seeking death!\" The disciples of the Azure Wood Sect all walked over and surrounded Ling Han and the others.","It should be known that the Azure Wood Saint had only been Venerate Azure Wood Tier five years ago. Thus, having advanced from Venerate Tier to Saint Tier, the disciples of the Azure Wood Sect wanted nothing more than to show off their awesomeness in front of the whole world.","The Saintly medicine this time was just right. They could use this opportunity to publicize the Azure Wood Sect.","The three people in front of them were the best targets.","\"Little Han, you truly have a halo of trouble,\" the large black dog delighted in his misfortune.","The little azure dragon also laughed loudly. This was a rare opportunity to tease Ling Han, so it naturally couldn't be missed.","Ling Han felt a little gloomy. This time, he really hadn't wanted to attract any animosity. He had only come to take a look at the situation of the Saint challenging the demonic mist, so why had he been targeted for no reason?","\"Are you guys... sick?\" he asked kindly. \"If you're sick, hurry up and treat it. Don't drag it out, it'll harm others and yourself!\"","\"You f******!\" A disciple was immediately angered, and waved a hand to deliver a palm strike at Ling Han.","Boom, he should be a proud heir of the Azure Wood Sect. At such a young age, he was already a True Self Tier. He shot out a palm strike, his momentum vast and mighty.","\"Watch Grandpa Dragon's Divine Dragon Tail Slash!\" The little azure dragon was the first to move. Peng, a kick landed on the disciple's lower abdomen, and the disciple was sent flying like a cannonball.","Thankfully, the direction he flew out of was not in the area of the demonic mist. Otherwise, he probably would not have the chance to come out.","Even so, when this disciple fell onto the ground, his eyes closed, and he had passed out.","\"Eldest Senior Brother!\" The disciples of the Azure Wood Sect all called out, their faces filled with shock.","However, there was also a middle-aged man with baleful eyes that swept over Ling Han and the others.","This was a powerful Sect Master elite.","\"How dare you hurt a disciple of our Azure Wood Sect!\" This man said coldly. Sect Master-level aura fluctuated, and the air instantly seemed to boil, rippling out in waves.","\"Reflect on yourself. Is it really good to be so arrogant?\" Ling Han shook his head, \"Even the Imperial Son would be killed, what more you guys.\"","This infuriated the middle-aged man who was a Sect Master. He was just about to attack, yet he suddenly saw a streak of green light spread out from the demonic mist. In an instant, the Azure Wood Saint had already appeared outside the demonic mist.","However, the Saint-level elite who had been radiating with brilliance just now was now in an extremely sorry state. His hair was completely disheveled, and there was even a green-coloured handprint on his neck, but looking at the length of those five fingers, it did not look like something a normal person should have at all!","The willow in the porcelain vial that he was holding had also been broken in half. Its branches were drooping, and it was on the verge of death.","Not only that, but the Saint's clothes were also torn and tattered. It was as if he had just experienced a great battle. Furthermore, it was the kind of street brawl that involved hooligans. They would pull at his clothes around and beat him up, and that was why his clothes were torn.","\"Saint Master!\" the disciples of the Azure Wood Sect exclaimed in astonishment upon seeing the miserable state of the Azure Wood Saint.","They all knew that the porcelain vial that this Saint had held was a Saint Tool, yet half of the Saint Tool had already been destroyed. Just how terrifying was this?","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and saw even more than the others. He saw that there was shockingly a layer of black substance entwined around this Saint.","Was it the demonic mist?","In any case, Ling Han only took a glance at it, and felt so disgusted that he would never want to be touched by this thing again.","\"Saint Master, what happened?\" they all asked.","This was too terrifying, wasn't it? Now that there was no Emperor in this world, shouldn't Saints be the strongest?","Even their Saint had been wounded, so the members of the Azure Wood Sect naturally couldn't care less about Ling Han anymore. They all surrounded the Azure Wood Saint.","\"Saint Master, what happened?\" they all asked.","This was too terrifying, wasn't it? Now that there was no Emperor in this world, shouldn't Saints be the strongest?","But now, this confidence and superiority of theirs had been dealt a heavy blow, so it was naturally inevitable that a powerful panic would rise up in them.","The Azure Wood Saint did not speak. He merely stared at the area of demonic mist, his eyes filled with confusion and bafflement, as well as a sliver of indescribable fear.","\"Let's go!\" he said darkly, not bothering to explain at all.","\"But, Saint Master—\" All the disciples were surprised. Yi, hadn't they agreed to make use of this opportunity to spread the name of the Azure Wood Sect? Why had he given up just like that?","\"En?\" The Azure Wood Saint's eyes swept over them. Since the Saint had spoken, who would dare have any objections?","Instantly, everyone fell silent out of fear.","This Saint directly tore a rip into the Void, and led everyone away. He left very resolutely.","Seeing this scene, a great many people inhaled sharply.","What was going on here? Even a Saint had been scared off?","At present, the Azure Wood Saint was the only one who had managed to walk out alive after entering into the demonic mist. As expected of a Saint. He was really kickass. But what exactly had this Saint experienced? What kind of being had fought with him, causing this Saint to be in such a sorry state? Furthermore, he had left without a second thought. He did not even want the Saintly medicine anymore?","A great many people had dismissed the idea of obtaining the Saintly medicine. Even a Saint had returned in defeat. If they still did not dismiss this idea, wouldn't that be courting death?","At this moment, a message suddenly came from the large black dog's Galaxy Network connection device.","The Nine Mountains Saint had arrived.","\"Come, let's go and meet the old man first.\" Ling Han and the others immediately set out, meeting up with the Nine Mountains Saint, before they made further plans.","At the same time, more Saints also appeared."]},{"number":4378,"title":"Chapter 4378 Joint efforts","paragraphs":["Ling Han and the others successfully reunited with the Nine Mountains Saint.","The Nine Mountains Saint frowned upon hearing them relate the present situation.","In terms of abilities, he should be stronger than the Azure Wood Saint. Firstly, he had advanced earlier, and secondly, he had cultivated the Imperial Scroll. However, with both of them being One Star Saints, the gap between them would not be too big.","Thus, he wouldn't be much better off than the Azure Wood Saint after entering the demonic mist zone.","\"What about using the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?\" Ling Han asked.","The Nine Mountains Saint didn't know either.","If the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was an Imperial Weapon, then being activated by a Saint should be enough to protect them, and if it completely revived, it would be equivalent to a Great Emperor coming back to life, so they would naturally be unafraid of all enemies in the world.","Unfortunately, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower wasn't a real Imperial Weapon. It was only forged from Origin Gold, and there was still a large difference between the two.","\"Oh, that's right,\" the Nine Mountains Saint said as he retrieved his staff. \"I've already found out that the orb here is a natural treasure. It's called the Formless Pearl, and it's nurtured by heaven and earth. It can avoid all natural damage in the world.\"","\"Of course, there is still an upper limit to this. It can only be Saint Tier.\"","Ling Han and the others all nodded. This was only normal. Otherwise, a Great Emperor would definitely snatch it at all costs. Then, when they went to the edge of the universe to seek the art of immortality, their chances of success would naturally be greatly increased.","In the case of Saints, they would be completely useless against this demonic mist, because even Saints would suffer misfortune.","\"Take it.\" The Nine Mountains Saint handed the staff over to Ling Han. Firstly, this was Ling Han's staff in the first place, and he was only examining it on Ling Han's behalf. Secondly, he also had a Saint Tool in his possession, so wielding two Saint Tools might not increase his battle prowess much.","Ling Han didn't stand on ceremony and put the staff away.","This was a Saint Tool, and even if it couldn't unleash saintly might in his hands, it should be no problem for it to reach the level of Pseudo Sect Master. Moreover, after he advanced into the level of Sect Master, he should be able to unleash power on the level of Pseudo Venerate Tier.","Trump card, trump card.","\"Then we can only try using the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower,\" Ling Han said.","The Nine Mountains Saint nodded as he accepted the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","The Saintly medicine was really too valuable. Even with his temperament, he could not possibly say no so easily. No matter what, he had to give it a try. Whether he succeeded or not, he naturally would not have any regrets. Otherwise, every time he thought of it in future, he might be filled with regret. Why had he not persisted in the past?","He was just about to move, when he was startled, and looked towards his left.","Ling Han and the others also looked over, but they didn't see anything.","However, after only a while, the space was suddenly torn apart by a large hand, and an imposing old man walked out.","This elder stepped out, and there were three young people following behind him. They were two men and one woman, and they were all brimming with heroic spirit, exuding a captivating brilliance.","\"Friend Nine Mountains!\" The elder smiled, and nodded at the Nine Mountains Saint.","\"Friend Black Flames.\" The Nine Mountains Saint also nodded.","Black Flames Saint!","Ling Han's eyes swept over them, and a smile appeared at the corners of his lips, because he recognized one of these three young people.","Niu Tengfei.","He was the Imperial Son of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan, and he had been beaten up by him before. However, because he had changed his appearance, the Imperial Son had not recognized him. Otherwise, Niu Tengfei's expression would probably be very awkward at this moment.","\"Friend, have you just arrived?\" the Black Flames Saint asked.","\"Yes, I just arrived,\" the Nine Mountains Saint said. \"Should we team up?\"","\"Sure,\" the Black Flames Saint said with a nod. He had seen very clearly that the Nine Mountains Saint had already unleashed his \"Imperial Weapon\". Although he hadn't released it, the might that radiated from it was clearly Emperor Tier-level.","This demonic mist was extremely strange, and it had already caused a Saint to return in defeat. Thus, he was naturally happy to team up with the Nine Mountains Saint. With two Imperial Weapons, was there anything in this world that couldn't be resolved?","Who said that the Imperial Weapon of the Nine Mountains Saint was fake?","This demonic mist was extremely strange, and it had already caused a Saint to return in defeat. Thus, he was naturally happy to team up with the Nine Mountains Saint. With two Imperial Weapons, was there anything in this world that couldn't be resolved?","The two Saints conversed, and Ling Han and the others also \"met\" Niu Tengfei and the others.","Aside from Niu Tengfei, the other two naturally belonged to the Demon Ox Imperial Clan. They were Niu Zhengzhi and Niu Feixu, while Ling Han and the others each gave a false name.","Niu Tengfei kept glancing at Ling Han, because he kept feeling that Ling Han looked familiar.","It had to be admitted that an Imperial Son's instincts were quite amazing, but for the moment, he still did not think of Ling Han. That was because the Nine Mountains Saint was just beside him, so what was there to be afraid of?","The two Saints unleashed their Imperial Weapon, which hovered above their heads and exuded a precious aura that protected them and the six juniors.","\"Friend, this Imperial Weapon of yours is truly extraordinary,\" the Black Flames Saint praised. He naturally knew what it was. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower exuded Primal Chaos Qi, while the tower was entwined with supreme lightning.","Getting one of the two was already terrifying enough, what more when it was a combination of both?","He was naturally fishing for information. How could a Saint-level force possibly possess an Imperial Weapon?","The Nine Mountains Saint merely smiled faintly, and did not reply.","He was a Saint, and he was more than powerful enough to unleash the might of the Origin Gold. Thus, as long as he didn't engage in battle, it would be extremely difficult for Saints to detect what was off about it.","The eight of them walked into the demonic mist. Even a Saint didn't dare to walk too fast.","This demonic mist was truly dense. Even the brilliance exuded by the Imperial Weapons could only penetrate a distance of about 30 meters. If one went any further, they would be enshrouded in fog, and would not be able to see anything clearly.","The environment was very oppressive. It was incredibly dark, and it was definitely difficult to feel happy.","\"Yi?\" The two Saints both exclaimed in shock, and then sped up slightly.","After walking for more than 30 meters, they saw a corpse lying on the ground.","Ling Han couldn't help but sigh internally. Saints were Saints, after all. His divine sense and vision had been completely limited to a range of 30 meters, and Saints could break through this limit.","With this thought in mind, he immediately turned his attention to the corpse in front of him.","This was actually a complete corpse, but it was even more terrifying than a shattered corpse.","—This corpse was covered with black palm imprints. The palm was normal size, but the fingers were astonishingly long, at least three times the size of the palm. This appeared very strange.","\"His physical body is practically unharmed, but his mind has been obliterated,\" the Black Flames Saint replied.","The Nine Mountains Saint nodded in agreement. This was the conclusion that the two Saints had reached together, and the authority of their answer was naturally unquestionable.","However, this couldn't explain the black palm print.","Just what kind of existence did this belong to?","\"By the looks of it, this person has been dead for a very long time. Moreover, he's only a Core Formation Tier cultivator. It's strange that his body hasn't decayed even after such a long time,\" the Nine Mountains Saint said with a frown.","Even if a Saint had died, his body would not be able to remain uncorroded through the ages. Only the corpse of a Great Emperor could do so.","Ling Han could see very clearly. There was a strong fear on the dead man's face, as if he had experienced something incredibly shocking before his death.","\"Let's continue.\"","They temporarily set down this corpse, and continued onwards.","They had not walked too far, when they discovered another corpse. Similarly, the corpse was covered with black palm imprints, but there were no injuries all over the body. It was just that the mind had been shattered.","Similarly, this person had been dead for a very, very long time, not in terms of ten thousand years, but in terms of hundreds of millions of years."]},{"number":4379,"title":"Chapter 4379 Strange Appearance.","paragraphs":["All the way forwards, there were corpses.","There were men and women among the corpses, old and young. The difference in cultivation level was also very wide. There were those who had just reached the Foundation Building Tier, and there were even mortals among them. And in the strongest case, there were even Sect Master-level corpses, but in this place, they all died the same way, regardless of status.","\"This definitely wasn't a war.\"","\"It's extremely likely that this demonic mist suddenly surged out and instantly covered the entire area. Thus, when these people fled, they were all hit and died on the ground.\"","The two Saints were deducing what had happened all those years ago. Perhaps this was the truth.","They walked for a while longer, when they suddenly heard a strange sound.","It was a little like the sound of grinding teeth, but also like a strange laugh. It could not be accurately described.","The Black Flames Saint humphed coldly, and said, \"Who's playing tricks? Show yourself!\" With a flutter of his sleeve, boom! Mist billowed into the surroundings, instantly clearing a 60-meter radius in front of him.","However, he couldn't see anything strange at all.","The two Saints frowned upon hearing this. They were certain that what they had heard wasn't an illusion. However, what kind of being was capable of playing tricks on them?","They continued onwards. They had not taken too many steps, when that strange sound rang out again.","This time, they were sure that this should be laughter, though they did not know what kind of monster could release it.","This mysterious being seemed to be toying with them. No matter how the two Saints searched, \"he\" would always be able to react in advance, and they would not be able to discover its presence at all.","Thus, it was unknown whether this was a man or a woman, or even a human.","The two Saints couldn't help but speed up involuntarily. What kind of existence were they? They were the strongest great elites in the world, so how could they accept such humiliation?","For Saints, they were only slightly faster, but for Ling Han and the others, it was very straining.","\"So heavy!\" Niu Feixu, the only woman among the eight of them, exclaimed.","The gravity fields here seemed to be extremely strong. Previously, she could still hold on, but if she had to travel quickly as well, she wouldn't be able to hold on any longer.","In truth, Ling Han and the others were the same as well. However, they were all men, so they were too embarrassed to speak up.","Hearing her say this, they all looked towards Niu Feixu.","And with this look, everyone felt their hair stand on end.","—On Niu Feixu's back, there was shockingly a black shadow lying there. When it saw everyone look over, it actually raised its head, and smiled at them, releasing a strange sound that sounded like it was grinding its teeth.","This smile was too terrifying, because it was a black shadow in the first place. It had no facial features, but when it smiled, it actually revealed a mouth. There were two rows of teeth that were triangular in shape, and there was a blank at the back of the mouth.","Ling Han noticed that the fingers of this black shadow were especially long, about three times the length of his palm.","Hiss, this guy was the murderer who had killed those people previously.","No, no, the two Saints had already said that these people had been dead for at least several hundred million years. If this black shadow was the culprit, it would be even more powerful than the Great Emperor. It was actually able to survive for so many years.","Like Buddha Doga, had he lived a second life? Or had he suppressed himself, and had only just been released recently?","It was also because of the appearance of this black shadow that this planet was no longer hidden and appeared in the world?","\"Humph! Demons and monsters, you actually dare to commit violence!\" the Black Flame Saint roared. He made a grabbing motion at the air.","\"Zhi!\" The black shadow instantly released a terrible scream. It was far from having the power of a Saint, and with this attack from the Saint, it was instantly shattered into pieces, turning into clouds of black mist that fused into the surrounding demonic mist.","Was this black shadow a part of the demonic mist?","Everyone shuddered in apprehension. This was far too uncanny! There were clearly Imperial Weapons here, and there were clearly two Saints standing guard here. Yet, this black shadow had snuck onto Niu Feixu's body without anyone noticing.","Hold on!","Everyone shivered, and looked at each other. They inhaled sharply again, breaking out in a cold sweat.","That was because there were black shadows lying on top of their bodies as well!","When had they lain on their backs? Why had they not sensed anything at all?","The two Saints moved at the same time, and killed the black shadows on everyone's bodies.","Though none of them had sustained any injuries, a black palm print had been left on their necks. The palm was very normal, but their fingers were frighteningly long, making one's hair stand on end.","\"This thing isn't very powerful,\" the Nine Mountains Saint said.","\"That's right. It's possible that they are only True Self Tier, but the strange thing is that they don't seem to exist at all. Even our divine senses have been deceived,\" the Black Flames Saint said.","And this was still the True Self Tier. If it was a Venerate Tier, or even a Saint Tier, then with such a sudden strike, even a Saint would probably be out of luck, right?","It was no wonder that the Azure Wood Saint, who had been the first to enter, could only flee in a sorry state. They had the Imperial Weapons protecting them, and it still happened to them, so it was naturally even worse for the Azure Wood Saint.","\"Humph! Do you really think that I'm a weakling if I don't unleash my might?\" the Black Flames Saint said coldly. Boom! He unleashed the unique aura of a Saint, and it instantly surged into the surroundings like a vast river.","Under the barrage of his aura, the demonic mist was instantly forced back.","Previously, it was only the Saint that had not wanted to waste his energy, but now that he had become serious, and unleashed the might of a Saint, that was no joke either.","However, even if the Saint unleashed its might, it could only push the demonic mist 300 meters away, and could not take another step further.","\"Neigh!\" Three hundred meters away, balls of black mist condensed, turning into multiple human figures. However, they were only human figures. Their facial features could not be seen, and their limbs were extraordinarily long, far from the proportions of ordinary people.","These black shadows stared at Ling Han and the others. Some opened their mouths, and their triangular teeth were incredibly sharp.","\"Die!\" the Black Flame Saint roared as he charged over and unleashed a palm strike. Saintly power surged into the surroundings.","Peng, with a palm strike, those black shadows all crumbled, fusing into the demonic mist.","A scene that shocked everyone appeared. A black shadow appeared behind the Black Flame Saint, then stretched out its astonishingly long five fingers, and slowly grabbed out at the Black Flame Saint's neck.","However, it was as if the Black Flames Saint hadn't noticed this. Even someone as powerful as the Saint hadn't noticed that a black shadow had appeared behind him.","This caused everyone's hair to stand on end. This was too shocking. How could it be that even the Saint did not react at all?","\"Friend!\" the Nine Mountains Saint hurriedly shouted. \"Watch your back!\"","The Black Flames Saint didn't turn around. Instead, he directly launched a palm strike behind him. The Regulations transformed into a supreme divine blade that could even sever the sun and moon.","Sure enough, the black shadow was obliterated. It was no match at all.","However, after this incident, the two Saints were also frowning deeply.","It was as if this black shadow had a unique ability that could cut off divine sense. It could only be seen directly by the naked eye. Thus, even Saints would be unable to guard against its stealthy appearance.","Were they going to go any deeper?","The two Saints hesitated. This area of demonic mist was really too big, and their divine sense could only cover a limited area. If they wanted to find the Saintly medicine in such a large place, that was practically looking for a needle in a haystack.","Furthermore, it was impossible to guard against the black shadows in the demonic mist. Who could guarantee that there would never be any mistakes?"]},{"number":4380,"title":"Chapter 4380 Sparring","paragraphs":["However, Saints naturally had their own pride. Were they going to retreat just like that without figuring out anything?","The two Saints both decided that they wanted to walk further ahead and see what secrets were hidden in this place.","They continued onwards, watching over each other's backs.","The black shadow here was really too strange. Even the divine sense of a Saint could not sense it, and it could only be seen with the naked eye.","They advanced step by step, and the strange black shadows continued to appear, crawling on everyone's backs.","Ling Han and the others looked after each other. The moment they discovered the appearance of the black shadow, they immediately launched an attack.","These black shadows appeared and disappeared unpredictably, but their abilities were not strong at all. They were only True Self Tier-level, and could very easily be destroyed.","However, as they ventured deeper and deeper, the situation became more and more strange.","The black shadow that appeared became stronger and stronger. Very soon, it had reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier. So be it. Ling Han was strong enough to destroy it, but the next to appear would be Sect Master-level. No junior would be able to stand against this.","The two Saints could only step forward to help them deal with this. This was no big deal. In front of a Saint, wasn't a Sect Master like an ant?","But soon after, a Venerate Tier black shadow appeared.","The two Saints finally stopped in their tracks.","They couldn't advance any further. Otherwise, it was hard to guarantee that there would not be Saint-level shadows appearing. At that time, they would be in big trouble.","Imperial Weapon?","The Imperial Weapon was indeed impressive, and could sweep aside all opposition. However, the problem was that the Saint couldn't keep the Imperial Weapon awakened forever. At that time, the issue of safety would become a great problem.","They could only turn back. First, they would bring Ling Han and the other juniors out of the area of the demonic mist, then the two Saints would enter into the demonic mist. Without any further worries, they may be able to barge into the depths of the demonic mist area with the help of the Imperial Weapons, and discover the secrets of this place.","After watching the two Saints enter into the zone of demonic mist, Ling Han and the others all sat down. Now, all they could do was wait.","Since they had nothing better to do, it was naturally inevitable that they would chat, and as cultivators, it was inevitable that they would talk about abilities. No one was convinced, so it was natural that they would be angered.","\"Hehe, the Nine Suns Holy Land only produced a Nine Mountains Saint. Otherwise, they wouldn't even be considered a third-tier force,\" Niu Tengfei said calmly. This was beginning to attack indiscriminately.","This naturally made the little azure dragon and the large black dog extremely displeased. They all slanted their eyes at him.","\"What is it? Are you all still unconvinced?\" Niu Feixu asked disdainfully, \"Come, I will give you a handicap of one hand. Whoever can last a hundred moves from me will be considered to have won.\"","This was truly an undeserved calamity.","The little azure dragon sneered, \"Grandpa Dragon has never liked hitting women. However, being so ugly and having such a smelly mouth, hehe, looks like Grandpa Dragon is going to make an exception.\"","\"How dare you!\" Niu Feixu sneered, and immediately moved, blasting towards the little azure dragon.","She was actually more than seven hundred years old, and had cultivated to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Wherever this natural talent went, she could be called a prodigy. Her battle prowess was indeed very strong, and among Spirit Transformation Tiers, she could be considered powerful.","However, the little azure dragon was a first-generation descendant of the True Dragon. Its bloodline was extremely pure, and could completely compare to, or even in fact surpass, the Golden Generation. How could Niu Feixu compare?","However, this guy was devious. It was clear that his abilities were far superior, but he did not use his full strength at all. He only maintained a battle prowess that was equal to Niu Feixu, or even slightly weaker.","In this way, Niu Feixu felt that it was completely possible to defeat the little azure dragon within a hundred moves, but as she used one move after another, she was still unable to succeed.","Very quickly, the hundred moves had finished.","\"Hehe, Grandpa Dragon doesn't seem to have lost.\" The little azure dragon spread its hands, looking very despicable.","Ling Han sighed. In the past, the little azure dragon only had a bad mouth, but now, even its expression was like this. Clearly, it had been too deeply influenced by the large black dog.","Niu Feixu was seething with anger from the mockery, so how could she still bother with the boasts she had previously made? She stretched out both hands, unleashing her full battle prowess, which blasted towards the little azure dragon.","\"Yi, can't hit me! Hey, you missed a bit! Hey, you missed again.\" The little azure dragon dodged left and right, dodging all of Niu Feixu's attacks, and if you dodged, that was fine, but as he dodged, he kept talking, which naturally made Niu Feixu even more furious.","\"Feixu, step back. You are no match for him,\" Niu Tengfei said solemnly.","He was a Silver Generation elite, so his eyes were naturally sharp.","Previously, Niu Feixu had given way, and the little azure dragon was only at a slight disadvantage. Now that Niu Feixu was attacking with her full strength, the little azure dragon was able to fight her to a tie. This clearly meant that it had hidden a lot of its strength.","\"Imperial Son!\" Niu Feixu was unconvinced. She felt that as long as she exerted a little more force, she would be able to crush this despicable guy into dust.","\"Zhengzhi, you go,\" Niu Tengfei said to Niu Zhengzhi.","Though they were both in Spiritual Transformation Tier, Niu Zhengzhi's strength was obviously superior.","\"All right.\" Niu Zhengzhi nodded.","Niu Feixu had no choice but to withdraw from the battle, allowing Niu Zhengzhi to take her place.","However, so what if it was Niu Zhengzhi? In front of the little azure dragon, he couldn't even withstand a single blow. In less than ten moves, he was beaten to the ground.","The little azure dragon said proudly, \"Grandpa Dragon doesn't hit women, but men... Hehe, forget it.\"","Niu Feixu was dumbfounded. As it turned out, the little azure dragon was actually this powerful. To think that she had thought that she was only slightly weaker.","However, you are really too despicable, aren't you? Your abilities are clearly so strong!","Niu Tengfei took a deep breath, his heart filled with shock. What was going on with the Nine Suns Holy Land? Aside from Ling Han, there actually appeared an incredibly freakish guy.","This clearly was not Ling Han, because though Ling Han was detestable, he was definitely not as despicable as this.","\"So you are pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger!\" He strode out, \"Then allow me, the Imperial Son, to be your opponent.\"","The little azure dragon crooked a finger at him. \"I'll let you have a handicap of one hand. If you can last a hundred moves, I'll count it as your victory.\"","F***, wasn't this what Niu Feixu had just said?","Niu Tengfei was instantly enraged.","He was a Silver Generation elite, and now, he was actually being looked down on like this. If this spread out, he would really be laughed at.","\"You are really arrogant!\" he said in a baleful voice.","\"With strength, that's called confidence,\" the little azure dragon said proudly.","\"Alright, then let me shatter your confidence,\" Niu Tengfei said with a humph. He then launched an attack at the little azure dragon.","The Imperial Son moved, and that was naturally out of the ordinary. The Regulations slashed towards the little azure dragon like a divine sword.","Yet the little azure dragon was completely unafraid. Though it was also a Spiritual Transformation Tier, it was one or two minor levels higher than Niu Tengfei.","Even when their cultivation levels were the same, Niu Tengfei was no match, what more when Niu Tengfei's cultivation level fell behind?","Sure enough, the little azure dragon was only using one hand. However, its terrifying power surged, and Regulations intertwined, forcefully suppressing Niu Tengfei.","This caused Niu Feixu's eyes to almost pop out of her head. Only now did she know that she had not lost no reason. The little azure dragon's strength was superior to hers.","Niu Tengfei tried his best to resist, yet he was under immense pressure. Every move he blocked was done with great difficulty.","However, a hundred moves passed in the blink of an eye, and he finally managed to block all of them."]},{"number":4381,"title":"Chapter 4381 Identity Exposed.","paragraphs":["\"Hu!\"","The little azure dragon stopped, and deliberately rubbed its forehead. \"I underestimated you. You actually managed to block a hundred moves from Grandpa Dragon.\"","He had won?","Niu Tengfei didn't look happy at all, only feeling endless humiliation.","As a dignified Silver Generation elite, in a one-on-one situation, he could only barely block a hundred moves, and that was under the condition that the other had given him a handicap of one hand.","This was practically a great humiliation!","\"Yi, Brother Niu?\" At this moment, a voice was heard, causing everyone to turn around and look.","A group of seven people walked over from the left. The person who had spoken was tall and slender, with a dignified bearing. There were two snakes of light entwined around him, one silver and one gold, and they evolved into all kinds of mysterious manifestations.","Niu Tengfei glanced at him and nodded. \"Brother Lian.\"","The young man with the golden and silver twin snakes was the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan's Silver Generation, Lian Xiangjie.","Niu Tengfei forced himself to regain some vigor. He didn't want more people to know that he almost lost to the little azure dragon, so he hurriedly asked, \"Why is Brother Lian here?\"","\"Oh, the Saint of our Clan is currently exploring in the demonic mist, so we have nothing to do, so we walked around in the vicinity. Unexpectedly, we just happened to encounter Brother Niu,\" Lian Xiangjie said. Then, he swept an eye over Ling Han and the others, \"And these three are?\"","\"Oh, from the Nine Suns Holy Land,\" Niu Tengfei said casually.","Lian Xiangjie immediately looked disdainful. Holy Land?","Hehe, since when could the Holy Lands be on equal footing with the Imperial Clans?","\"Brother Niu, you really have the leisure to chat with a few trash from a Holy Land?\" he said without any reservations.","\"Oi, oi, oi, who are you talking about, trash?\" the large black dog immediately retorted.","Lian Xiangjie's eyes were baleful as he stared at the large black dog, \"If it was not for the sake of Brother Niu, just because of these words from you, I, an Imperial Son, would kill you.\"","Ling Han humphed and said, \"Oh, why don't you give it a try?\"","\"You think I don't dare?\" Lian Xiangjie said proudly.","The other six members of the Lian Clan all smirked coldly. This was their Imperial Son, and a Silver Generation at that. In this world, only the Golden Generation could defeat him at the same cultivation level.","Obviously, Ling Han wasn't a Golden Generation.","\"Brat, immediately kneel down and apologize to our Imperial Son!\"","\"If you want to live, you had best know who you are!\"","\"Imperial Clans are high and noble, revered by the Nine Heavens!\"","They spoke one after another, their expressions filled with pride.","Meanwhile, the three members of the Niu Clan kept their mouths shut. They had no intention of stoking the flames, but also had no intention of interfering, looking like they would stay out of this matter.","They had suffered a loss, so they naturally would not mind having the Lian Clan suffer a loss as well. That way, neither side would laugh at the other.","\"Kneel!\" Lian Xiangjie shouted lightly. Weng, a small mountain appeared out of thin air, and pressed down on Ling Han, wanting to make him submit without a fight.","This was actually a mountain of Spiritual Power. As long as a person's willpower crumbled, no matter how strong you were, so what?","Ling Han stood proudly. The small mountain of Spiritual Power hovered above his head, yet it couldn't suppress him no matter what.","This caused those members of the Lian Clan to click their tongues in amazement. Hiss, this brat was a little strong, to actually be able to match the spiritual pressure of their Imperial Son.","Lian Xiangjie also looked slightly surprised. Though this was only the suppression of Spiritual Power, as a Imperial Son, his Spiritual Power was naturally astonishingly strong. Faced with those that were not Imperial Sons, he would usually be able to deal with his opponent with a spiritual attack.","And now, this opponent was actually capable of matching him. This really gave him a shock.","\"Who would've thought that a prodigy would appear among the members of a Holy Land!\" he said calmly. It could be said that he somewhat approved of Ling Han. \"However, now that I, an Imperial Son, have moved, how many strikes can you block?\"","Ling Han couldn't help but smile, \"How about this? I'll give you a handicap of one hand, and if you can block three moves from me, it'll be considered your victory.\"","Pu!","Hearing these words, the first to splutter weren't the members of the Lian Clan, but rather Niu Tengfei and the others.","Hey, hey, hey, aren't you all a little too arrogant?","Just now, the little azure dragon said he would give him a handicap of one hand, and left him room for a hundred moves, and you actually only said three moves?","He was too arrogant!","The seven members of the Lian Clan were furious, especially Lian Xiangjie. A dignified Silver Generation cultivator was actually looked down on like this, so how could he not be furious?","\"All right!\" He stared at Ling Han, his eyes baleful. \"If you can't block three moves from me, then just wait for death!\"","He moved aggressively, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Pa!","A crisp sound rang out, and Ling Han very casually delivered a slap, which landed on Lian Xiangjie's face.","It was crisp and loud.","Heavens!","This time, the members of the Niu and Lian Imperial Clans were trembling, feeling an indescribable chill.","What do you mean by three moves? Just one move.","The dignified Silver Generation actually couldn't even withstand a single strike from him, and was directly slapped in the face.","This, this, this!","Lian Xiangjie covered his face with one hand, while his eyes were fixed on Ling Han. After a while, he gritted his teeth and exclaimed, \"Ling, Han!\"","Aside from Ling Han, there was no other person in the world that could be so freakish, especially when these three people had come from the Nine Suns Holy Land. If he still hadn't realized it by now, then he would really be too stupid.","\"Little Han, how did your disguise collapse so quickly?\" The little azure dragon immediately sneered. \"Just look at Grandpa Dragon. He similarly beat up the Silver Generation, yet his identity hasn't been exposed!\"","Ling Han sighed as well. He was really too impatient. Otherwise, he would be like the little azure dragon, dragging it out a few hundred moves before defeating the enemy. Then, there would naturally be no need for him to expose his identity.","However, this didn't matter. The Nine Mountains Saint was presently here, and he had the \"Imperial Weapon\" in his hands. Who would dare to mess around?","With a thought, he had already returned to his original appearance.","\"It really is you!\" Lian Xiangjie gritted his teeth, his hatred soaring sky-high.","Ling Han had already developed. Everyone knew that the Silver Generation was no longer a match for him. In fact, he had even defeated one of the Golden Generation, who was forced to break through to Sect Master-level in advance.","Thus, it wasn't embarrassing for the Silver Generation to lose to Ling Han. However, the problem was that he had actually been slapped by Ling Han. With such great humiliation, how could he face others in the future?","\"Little Jiejie, you should feel honored,\" the large black dog said with a serious expression. \"In the future, you can tell others that I'm someone who survived Ling Han's strike with my face!\"","\"That's right, that's right, that's enough to leave your name for eternity,\" the little azure dragon immediately nodded.","These two b@stards had extremely toxic mouths, and their words could drive anyone crazy.","Lian Xiangjie trembled with anger, and suddenly drew out a green gong and drum.","The large black dog couldn't help but say with a smile, \"Little Jiejie, don't be so high-profile. After all, Little Han hasn't become a Great Emperor yet. It's still too early for you to beat a gong and drum and announce that you took a palm strike from the Great Emperor Ling Han with your face.\"","Kuang!","Lian Xiangjie suddenly struck the gong and drum, and instantly, soundwaves spread out, rippling out in multiple layers.","It wasn't long before the ripples transformed into swords and sabers that radiated with divine light as they slashed toward Ling Han and the others.","Ling Han was astonished. This attack had actually reached the level of Pseudo Sect Master.","By the looks of it, this drum and gong was a Sect Master-level Spirit Tool. It was stimulated by Lian Xiangjie, and could unleash the might of Pseudo Sect Master.","With a thought, Ling Han summoned the staff.","Who was afraid of who?"]},{"number":4382,"title":"Chapter 4382 Battle spoils","paragraphs":["This staff should continue to be called the Firebird Staff.","The Firebird Staff was a Saint-level weapon. Even if it was limited by Ling Han's cultivation level and could not unleash its full might, how difficult would it be to stand against a Pseudo Sect Master?","Ling Han brandished the staff, and instantly felt a large portion of power in his body being absorbed. Then, the Firebird Staff was activated, shooting out a blue-coloured light that slashed towards Lian Xiangjie.","Peng!","The blue light clashed with the sabers and swords, and both were destroyed.","In this exchange, the two of them were evenly matched.","It could not be helped. They both had the might of Pseudo Sect Master, so it was natural that neither was inferior to the other.","Lian Xiangjie was taken aback. He had not thought that Ling Han would also have a Sect Master-level Spirit Tool on him.","It should be known that he had only obtained this Celestial Tool from his clan after Lian Yutang had been lost in the lair of the True Phoenix. That was because it was possible that he would have to bear the banner of the Heavenly Sorrow Imperial Clan in future, so they naturally had to begin arming him.","But what basis did Ling Han have to possess this?","How could a mere Saint-level force have such deep roots?","\"Come!\" Ling Han stimulated the Firebird Staff, and struck out at Lian Xiangjie.","Multiple flashes of blue light slashed out, and at the same time, he also controlled the staff to smash towards Lian Xiangjie's head.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled fiercely. On the one hand, it was the clash of the might of the Spirit Tools, and on the other, it was a clash of their own strength. In terms of the former, Lian Xiangjie was not inferior, but in terms of the latter, he really could not compare to Ling Han.","After only a few moves, Lian Xiangjie evaded Ling Han, and did not dare to face him head-on at all. He merely stimulated the Spirit Tool with all his might.","He was extremely sullen. He similarly controlled a Spirit Tool, but why was he still at a great disadvantage?","Moreover, a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator activating a Sect Master-level Spirit Tool would consume an astonishing amount of mystical power. Even though he was a Silver Generation cultivator who had perfected his cultivation level and broken through his limits time and time again, there was still a limit to his power.","At this rate, it would only take half an hour at most, and his mystical power would definitely be completely exhausted.","Competing in stamina with Ling Han?","Hehe, hadn't it already been tried out before? This guy's mystical power reserves were practically freakish, and there was absolutely no way they could outlast him.","He wanted to stop the battle; he would definitely be at a disadvantage and not at an advantage. What was the point of continuing the battle?","But how could Ling Han possibly let him do as he wished!","Oh, if you want to fight, just fight. If you don't want to fight, just leave?","You are deluding yourself!","Ling Han aggressively attacked, forcing Lian Xiangjie to have no choice but to resist with all his might. Furthermore, he had to continuously dodge left and right. He felt very sullen, but had nowhere to vent his frustration.","Half an hour later, Lian Xiangjie's mystical power was completely exhausted, and he was no longer able to control the Spirit Tool. He was smacked onto the ground by Ling Han. He was just about to get up, but a foot stepped on his head, making him unable to raise his head.","Pu, Lian Xiangjie instantly spluttered out a mouthful of blood.","He was a mighty Silver Generation, yet his head was actually being stepped on by someone else. Did he still have any future?","How was he supposed to face others!","Niu Tengfei secretly expressed thanks for his good fortune. Thankfully, he didn't provoke Ling Han. Otherwise, he would probably be one of the people being stepped on.","The members of the Lian Clan were also rendered speechless. Their Imperial Son had lost, and it was under the condition that he had used a deadly weapon.","Meanwhile, Ling Han forcefully snatched the gong and drum from him. Then, he tossed it over to the large black dog, \"Take it and play with it.\"","\"Alright.\" The large black dog naturally wouldn't be reserved, and he accepted the gong and drum.","\"Ling Han, how dare you! That belongs to our clan!\" a member of the Lian Clan hurriedly shouted.","\"I won, so this is naturally my spoil of battle,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"Which of you from the Lian Clan can defeat me? Then come and take this Spirit Tool back.\"","When these words fell, the Lian Clan was speechless.","This was very common in the cultivation world. The losing party would leave behind a treasure or a cultivation technique or whatnot. Years later, the descendant of the losing party would come again to challenge them, and if they won, they would be able to retrieve the item.","But the Lian Clan was an Imperial Clan, and you even dare to seize something belonging to the Imperial Clan?","Thinking about it again, who was Ling Han?","The well-known Imperial Son Killer, who really lived up to his name. A good number of Imperial Sons had died by his hand, so what was the loss of a Spirit Tool worth?","Ling Han was just about to speak, when he suddenly felt a powerful chill. He moved, and grabbed the large black dog and little azure dragon. Using the Star Steps, they instantly disappeared without a trace.","Shua, a flash of sword light slashed out, and it was precisely where Ling Han had disappeared.","If Ling Han's reaction had been just the slightest bit slower, he would definitely have been struck by this sword strike, and if he had sustained this strike, he would definitely have died.","That was because the person who had made a move was Sect Master-level.","An assassin from the Battle God Palace.","The assassin had been patient enough. He was clearly at the level of Sect Master, yet he had remained hidden all this while. He had only drawn his sword when he had reached the most optimal position, intending to kill Ling Han with a single strike. However, he still hadn't imagined that Ling Han's divine sense would be so sharp.","Firstly, Ling Han could use the ley lines as eyes and ears, greatly increasing his senses, and secondly, he had also grasped the Strange Shadow Steps of the Battle God Palace, and someone else wanted to use it to get close and kill him? Wasn't that a joke?","This scene had really happened too suddenly, right until the sword swept past. Only then did the members of the Lian and Niu Clans come back to their senses, and they were all secretly exclaiming in pity.","Just a little bit more, and Ling Han would have been killed.","If there was any force in the world that was unafraid of the threat of a Saint and the Imperial Weapon, it would definitely be the Battle God Palace. That was because they had always appeared and disappeared mysteriously, and did not have a single disciple that travelled the world with their true identities. Thus, the Battle God Palace did not have to take the words of the Nine Mountains Saint to heart at all. They could still ambush Ling Han and kill him however they liked.","However, you guys are really too weak, aren't you?","The first time they attacked, what was Ling Han's cultivation level? And now?","'Are you guys really trying to assassinate Ling Han, and not just wanting to be his sparring partners?'","The Sect Master's attack missed, and he immediately fled into the darkness again. This was the habit of all the assassins in the Battle God Palace. Once they attacked, whether they hit their target or not, they would immediately leave.","After the assassin left, everyone breathed a sigh of relief. After all, this was a Sect Master-level existence, so killing them would be as easy as the turn of a palm.","Could you hope to reason with an assassin?","...","On the other side of the Demonic Mist Planet, the figures of Ling Han and the others appeared.","\"F***, the Battle God Palace is really like a lingering ghost.\" The large black dog bared his teeth, \"If Little Han had reacted slightly slower just now, he would have already become a corpse by now.\"","\"With Grandpa Dragon here, the auspicious bringer of good fortune, everything can be turned into good luck,\" the little azure dragon shamelessly snatched the credit.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, \"I can't stay on the back foot forever. I need to think of some way to find the Battle God Palace and let them have a taste of being hunted by everyone in the world.\"","\"Unfortunately, the secrecy of this organization is really too good.\" The large black dog shook his head.","Since ancient times, there were quite a few forces that wanted to destroy the Battle God Palace, but which of them had succeeded?","Ling Han was still a little confident. After all, he had stayed in the Battle God Palace before. If worse came to worst, he could investigate all the star charts in the future, and he would definitely be able to find some clues.","Boom!","At this moment, a huge commotion suddenly erupted in the area of the demonic mist. Bursts of fog surged, and the ground trembled madly."]},{"number":4383,"title":"Chapter 4383 A visitor from the demonic mist","paragraphs":["The demonic mist boiled, but only after a while, it returned to calm.","It wasn't long before the Nine Mountains Saint contacted Ling Han and the others. The four of them reunited.","\"Old man!\" When the three of them saw the Nine Mountains Saint, they were all stunned.","This was because there were several black palm marks on the Nine Mountains Saint's exposed skin. His clothes were also torn and tattered, and he appeared especially disheveled.","\"It's fine,\" the Nine Mountains Saint said with a wave of his hand. \"I fought a few times with the being in the demonic mist, yet I wasn't wounded.\"","The old man had said that when they arrived at the central area of the demonic mist, there was actually a silver mountain there. However, they could not enter the mountain, because there were a great number of black shadows there, and they all had Saint-level battle prowess.","It didn't matter if there were one or two, but the scale was tens of millions, so how could they withstand it?","The Saints also teamed up, but in the demonic mist, even the Imperial Weapons were greatly affected, unable to unleash their full might. Furthermore, those black shadows were undying, and as soon as they were dispersed, they merged into the demonic mist, reappearing in the blink of an eye.","How could this be tolerated?","Thus, the Saints could only give up their plans of seizing the Saintly medicine, and retreat out of the area of the demonic mist.","Was this scene especially familiar?","That's right. It was completely the same as the Yin River and sea of blood.. There were a great many corpses of Saints or Saint Tier-level battle prowess within, and they could not be killed no matter what.","Hiss, in the demonic mist, could it be that there was another Pseudo-Emperor in the silver mountain?","It was also because of this consideration that all the Saints retreated without hesitation. If they really attracted the attention of a Pseudo-Emperor, they would probably become corpses, and remain inside forever.","However, the various great Imperial Clans had all suffered losses before. What if there really was a Pseudo-Emperor here, who, like the Yin River Master and the like, supported Yin souls?","If they left it unattended, it would definitely become a great calamity in future.","Hence, some people suggested that they seek out Buddha Doga, and have him be the main force. Coupled with Saints and Imperial Weapons like them, it should not be a problem for them to raze this place to the ground.","However, where were they supposed to find Buddha Doga?","After the battle of the Mountain Sea Heaven, the whereabouts of the Buddha Doga were unknown. Furthermore, as a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, if he did not want to be found, who would be able to discover his whereabouts?","There were also suggestions that if they couldn't find Buddha Doga, they could set up a Great Emperor-level killing formation here. In that way, even if you were a Pseudo-Emperor, so what? Could it be that it could resist the Great Emperor killing formation?","Of course, to set up such a great formation, not only would it take a very, very long time, it would also require an astonishing amount of natural treasures. It would definitely need the combined efforts of the various Imperial Clans to bear the burden together. Otherwise, no specific Imperial Clan could possibly possess such wealth.","Thus, after this suggestion was made, none of the Imperial Clans responded at the first instant.","If they agreed, that would be a huge loss.","However, the brutal battle of the Mountain Sea Heaven was still vivid in everyone's minds. If another Pseudo-Emperor appeared, the world would really be in chaos.","Thus, after some discussion, all the Imperial Clans agreed.","Next, it would be wrangling. Which clan was in charge of producing the ingredients, and every Imperial Clan wanted their own clan to contribute less. Thus, this naturally would take a lot of time and last longer.","But just as the Imperial Clans were wrangling, an old man suddenly walked out of the demonic mist.","This old man was dressed in a long grey robe. One look and one could tell that he was the type to serve others, but no one dared to underestimate him.","That was because he was shockingly a Saint!","A Saint... was actually a servant?","Hiss, everyone was shocked.","They had not guessed wrongly. Was there really a Pseudo-Emperor here? Otherwise, even a Nine-Star Saint would not be qualified to have a One-Star Saint become his servant.","All of a sudden, all the Saints present walked out.","\"Dare I ask how I should address you, friend?\" The Black Flames Saint was the first to speak.","\"This old man's surname is Yue, and as for my name, it's been too long since I last used it. This old man has also forgotten,\" the grey-robed old man said calmly.","Hehe, who would forget their name because it had not been used for too long?","The Saints naturally didn't believe him. However, names didn't matter. This was only a code name.","\"Friend Yue, have you come from that silver mountain inside?\" the Divine Fluid Saint asked.","Saint Yue nodded, \"My Master has said that he bears no malice towards all of you, so there is no need for all of you to be so nervous. Additionally, even if all of you really want to lay out some Great Emperor killing formation, it would not be able to withstand a single blow from my Master.\"","The first few words caused all the Saints to feel proud. So what if you are a Pseudo-Empero? Knowing that the Great Emperor killing formation would trap you to death, you immediately sent someone out to express goodwill, but the last few words caused their expressions to darken.","The Great Emperor killing formation was also unable to withstand a single blow?","What kind of arrogant words were these?","You are only a Pseudo-Emperor, and not a real Great Emperor.","However, since he already knew of their plans, wanting to complete the arrangements right under the nose of a Pseudo-Emperor, the chances of success were pitifully small — how could it be that this Pseudo-Emperor would watch just them set up the formations?","And when the Pseudo-Emperor appeared, who in the world could stop him?","But why had this powerful existence not appeared?","Not only him, but the Lord of the Blood Sea and the Lord of the Yin River also did the same. This meant that they could not possibly appear casually, or they would definitely have to pay a huge price.","With such thoughts, the Saints were naturally filled with courage.","The Saint Yue saw the reactions of the Saints, and he smiled faintly, \"I have another mission for this trip, and that is to escort Young Master into the world, and meet the younger generation of the present era.\"","The demonic mist surged, and a young man strode out. He was dressed in a dark golden Battle Armor, and Regulations were interwoven all over his body. With a step, hong, it was as if the heavens and earth were trembling.","Everyone could clearly see that the young man's Battle Armor was actually already damaged, and it was also covered with spots of blood. Obviously, he had experienced countless battles.","\"Spiritual Transformation Tier,\" a Saint replied. However, there was a strange look in his eyes, and this was because he felt as if this young man possessed a ferocious beast inside his body. Once it exploded, it would definitely be extremely terrifying.","Ling Han was also looking at this young man. He had a strange feeling. This young man looked young, yet had a feeling of having experienced vicissitudes. This was a contradiction, but it was very harmonious with this young man.","He couldn't help but think of the little azure dragon and the little red bird. These two guys were actually a little \"old-fashioned\", because they had been sealed by the Primordial Source Clay while they were still yet to be born, and an incredibly long time had passed.","Though in this state, their lifespans were practically not decreased, in truth, they had indeed existed for innumerable years. No matter what, they would still be tainted with some \"age\".","This young man... was precisely so.","So strange. Why did so many elites insist on squeezing into this era?","The Buddha Doga, the Lord of Yin River, and the Lord of the Blood Sea were all such beings. How could such elites do something with no goal?","Thus, since they were so determined to come to this lifetime, they must have an obvious goal in mind.","Becoming Emperor?"]},{"number":4384,"title":"Chapter 4384 Yang Yihuan","paragraphs":["Ling Han's thoughts wandered. Golden Generation, old monsters and little monsters from endless ages ago all appeared in this era. It shouldn't be a coincidence, right?","While he was thinking, the young man wearing the Battle Armor also walked out of the demonic mist. His lanky figure was exuding an unyielding killing intent, causing others to involuntarily tremble.","\"I am Yang Yihuan.\" This young man smiled, appearing very gentle, \"Greetings, seniors.\"","All the Saints nodded slightly. After all, there was a Saint standing right next to him. Furthermore, it was very possible that Yang Yihuan's elder was a Pseudo-Emperor. Thus, they still had to give him some face.","Yang Yihuan looked towards those youngsters, \"I would like to issue a challenge to all the young prodigies. Is there anyone willing to bestow a move on me?\"","The Imperial Sons exchanged looks, and for a moment, no one spoke.","They had all received a message through divine sense from the Saint of their clan, telling them not to be rash. This Yang Yihuan's abilities were still unfathomable, so they had best let others test out his abilities. If he was frighteningly strong, wouldn't they be embarrassed in public?","Yang Yihuan showed a hint of surprise, \"No one?\"","When these words fell, the Imperial Sons all looked slightly livid.","What kind of disdainful expression was this?","Did he think that no one could match him?","Just because you came out of the demonic mist, you are already awesome, and no one can match you?","\"Let me experience it!\" An Imperial Son stepped out. He was Yi Taiming of the Blood Flame Imperial Clan, and was not the Golden Generation, nor was he the Silver Generation, but rather an ordinary Imperial Son.","However, the title of Imperial Son was the most resounding title, representing an absolute prodigy.","Yang Yihuan was still smiling calmly, and raised his clasped hands in Yi Taiming's direction, \"Please.\"","Yi Taiming shouted lightly, and charged towards Yang Yihuan.","Yang Yihuan attacked. It was just an ordinary punch, but this punch seemed to be capable of shattering heaven and earth. It was indescribably terrifying.","With a bang, Yi Taiming collapsed onto the ground, directly passing out.","Seeing this scene, everyone frowned.","In truth, Yi Taiming had only just advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Though he was the Imperial Son, even if he encountered a Dao Child prodigy at the Fourth Change or Fifth Change, he would still be outmatched.","But this punch from Yang Yihuan... it was too terrifying.","Not only power, but also that kind of aura. That kind of aura that carried supreme confidence, as if even the heaven and earth could collapse, causing one's scalp to go numb.","Just how broad-minded was he?","Yang Yihuan smiled faintly, \"Is there anyone else that is willing to bestow a move on me?\"","The members of the Silver Generation looked at each other. How could it be that after Ling Han, Ding Shu, and Origin, another freak was going to appear?","But to just let him continue acting arrogant like this?","The Silver Generation of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan, Hang Weili, walked out. He also smiled, \"I am Hang Weili, and would like to ask Brother Yang for some guidance.\"","\"Please.\" Yang Yihuan was very polite, and was a little too gentle.","Hang Weili immediately charged out. At the first instant, he summoned his seven spiritual bodies, each using a powerful move, which blasted towards Yang Yihuan.","Clearly, he was very wary of this opponent, and had already gone all out in his first move.","Yang Yihuan still threw a punch. It was the same as before, but its might had increased by who knew how many times.","Peng, Hang Weili was sent flying, and fell heavily onto the ground, similarly unconscious.","Hiss, he had defeated two Imperial Sons with two punches.","Moreover, what was even more astonishing was the fact that the might of the second and first punches differed greatly, as if they had been adjusted according to the strength of the opponent.","Yang Yihuan smiled faintly, and said, \"I'm Ninth Change, but I definitely won't suppress others with my cultivation level. Thus, I'll suppress my cultivation level to the corresponding level of my opponent.\"","Thus, the power of the second and first punches were so different.","Hearing these words, everyone became even more serious. In fact, they actually felt a kind of fear.","If you relied on the fact that your cultivation level was high, it would not be strange for you to defeat the Imperial Son with a single punch. There were too many Spiritual Transformation Tier elites that could do that. However, on the premise that their \"cultivation level\" was similar, it was terrifying that he could still defeat the Silver Generation with a single punch.","Could he do the same... to the Golden Generation?","At this time, everyone's eyes all turned towards Ling Han.","This guy had done it before, defeating the Silver Generation in a single go.","Heavens, another freak had really appeared.","Yang Yihuan was still nonchalant, \"How about this? You guys can have a few more people attack at the same time. It doesn't matter even if there are ten or twenty of you.\"","His expression was gentle, and he appeared calm. However, his words were extremely forceful and haughty.","He actually asked for the Imperial Sons attack him at the same time, and it was not just two or three of them either. It did not matter even if there were ten or twenty of them.","Just how arrogant was he?","Such provocation caused those Saints of the Imperial Clans to feel slightly embarrassed. They represented the strongest in the world, yet now there was someone provoking their authority. If they did not counter harshly, wouldn't that become a joke to the whole world?","\"Heh, since Young Friend Yang is so confident, just attack together,\" a Saint said with a chuckle.","F***, don't you have the nerve?","But upon further thought, in a one-on-one battle, who could be a match for this freak?","The Silver Generation was insta-killed with a single punch. In a one-on-one battle, wasn't that just delivering himself up to die?","Furthermore, firstly, the Golden Generation wasn't here, and secondly, the weakest of the Golden Generation had also advanced into the level of Sect Master. So what if they came? Were they going to pick on the weak?","Then what was the point of winning?","It would be better to gang up on him. Though this would also be embarrassing, it could at least dampen Yang Yihuan's spirit. Furthermore, wasn't this something that he had personally requested?","It wasn't long before Imperial Sons walked out one after another. Most of them were Silver Generation elites, and there were 22 of them.","\"Come on then,\" Yang Yihuan said with a smile, appearing extremely gentle.","The Imperial Sons looked at each other. This was an unprecedented situation where more than twenty people joined forces.","But now that the arrow was nocked, they had no choice but to fire.","\"Die!\"","They all rushed out, unleashing their Imperial Techniques at the same time. They were indescribably terrifying.","However, Yang Yihuan strode forwards, his fists attacking at the same time, completely unafraid.","At this moment, his hair was flying, and his expression was also flying. He was no longer that gentle young man, like a treasured saber that had been unsheathed. In the end, he was still exuding a piercing fighting spirit that soared into the sky.","Arrogant, domineering, and completely unrestrained!","Peng! Peng! Peng!","One punch from him, one after another. So what if the Silver Generation elites joined forces? They were no match for a single punch from him. Figures flew everywhere, and after 22 punches, the whole world became silent.","Everyone was dumbfounded, completely unable to believe their eyes.","They had lost, they had lost. In just a few breaths' time, the 22 Imperial Sons had all lost.","Would anyone believe him if he told them?","This was too shocking!","Yang Yihuan retracted his fist, causing his fluttering hair to flow down his back. He returned to his previous gentle and aloof demeanor, and asked softly, \"Is there anyone else who can bestow a move on me?\"","When his words fell, no one answered.","If the Golden Generation didn't appear, who would be able to resist?","In fact, even if the Golden Generation appeared, would they really be a match for him?","But the Golden Generation was already comparable to the Great Emperors of the past. If this person was even more powerful than the Golden Generation, then wouldn't he have surpassed all the previous Great Emperors?"]},{"number":4385,"title":"Chapter 4385 Arrogance under a gentle demeanor","paragraphs":["Ling Han also saw very clearly.","Yang Yihuan had indeed not won by depending on his power — indeed, his power far surpassed the corresponding cultivation level. In that case, he had definitely not gone all out. This was something that could be confirmed.","Most importantly, each of his attacks had an indescribable charm to them, as if they were secretly aligned with the Heavenly Dao. Thus, their might could be greatly increased, and naturally, battle prowess would also rise accordingly.","Ling Han couldn't help but feel his fists itch, wanting to fight with this rare opponent.","This person was very strong, so strong that Ling Han's fighting spirit blazed.","They may all be in Ninth Change, but this guy was much stronger than even Lian Yutang and Shi Ze. Even if he had already advanced into Seventh Change, he should still be no match for him.","Asking him to suppress his cultivation level?","Ling Han shook his head. What was the point of fighting like this? Only if he went all out could he truly unleash his full strength. Otherwise, he would be tied up.","\"Grandpa Dragon will fight you.\" The little azure dragon couldn't hold back anymore and jumped out.","Seeing the little azure dragon, Yang Yihuan didn't look down on it as a four-legged snake like others had when they first saw it. Instead, he stared at it for a while longer before breaking into a smile. \"Descendant of the True Dragon?\"","His eyes were really sharp!","The little azure dragon said proudly, \"That's right, it's your Grandpa Dragon! Since you know, why don't you kneel down and call me grandpa?\"","Yang Yihuan was not angered. He did not seem to have that kind of emotion, and said calmly, \"I once reared a dragon, and its bloodline is quite pure. Of course, it is still slightly inferior to you.\"","These words!","The little azure dragon's face immediately crumbled. 'What do you mean?'","Oh, you want to take me as your beast pet?","\"Come battle!\" He charged out. Boom, his battle prowess was fully unleashed.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Yang Yihuan lowered his own cultivation level, clashing with the little azure dragon.","At this moment, the freakish nature of the little azure dragon could finally be seen. Previously, even when the Silver Generation elites had joined forces, they had still been defeated by Yang Yihuan with a single punch. However, the little azure dragon could still clash head-on with Yang Yihuan, and they were even exchanging blows.","The elites of the Imperial Clans were all stunned. This Four-Legged Snake was actually a descendant of the True Dragon?","According to legends, the physique of the True Dragon was unparalleled, and its power was number one in the world. From the look of things now, the legends weren't false.","Yet Ling Han's brow wrinkled into a frown. The little azure dragon was the most direct heir of the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique. Furthermore, he was the son of the True Dragon. Logically speaking, his cultivation of Body Art should be incredibly awesome.","If it was not for the fact that Ling Han had also mastered Destructive Energy and could use a higher level of energy to temper himself, his Body Art should not have been as awesome as the little azure dragon.","However, Yang Yihuan was able to fight head-on with him, not falling into a disadvantage at all. This was terrifying.","Of course, this guy's cultivation level was higher, and while this power could be suppressed, the toughness of his physique could not possibly be weakened as well, but being able to cultivate his physique to this extent in Spirit Transformation Tier, this was really an inconceivable thing.","\"Interesting, quite interesting.\" Yang Yihuan broke into a smile. His hair began to fly again, and his gentle eyes shone, exuding a wildness. His whole aura changed immediately.","He became flamboyant and domineering, launching an aggressive offensive. Wonderful moves were used repeatedly, completely suppressing the little azure dragon.","Although the little azure dragon was fighting with all its might, it was still a hair's breadth away from being suppressed to a disadvantage.","\"I'm done fighting.\" This guy wasn't stupid. Since he couldn't beat him, he naturally had to stop.","\"Why don't you follow me so we can battle all around the world?\" Yet Yang Yihuan did not stop fighting. Every move was powerful, forcing the little azure dragon to have no choice but to continue fighting.","This seemed to be a very tempting invitation, but the words \"follow\" spoke of Yang Yihuan's ambition — you can only follow in my footsteps, and become my right-hand man.","\"F*** off!\" How could the little azure dragon possibly agree? Just look at Little Han. Although his words could drive people to death sometimes, he truly treated him as a friend, unlike you—the pride hidden in your bones, the disdain!","Following you, heh, that would really be degrading oneself.","Yang Yihuan was still not angered, and merely attacked aggressively, as if he wanted to use his powerful strength to make the little azure dragon submit.","\"He already said he doesn't want to fight you anymore, so why are you still being so overbearing?\" Ling Han charged out and threw a punch at Yang Yihuan.","\"Seventh Change?\" Yang Yi smiled and replied with a punch of his own. His power suddenly soared by a significant amount.","Towards anyone, he would use the power corresponding to his cultivation level, which seemed very fair, and also showed his strong confidence.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and a terrifying power reverberated. Teng, teng, teng! The two of them swayed, and then both retreated.","One step, two steps, three steps... seventeen steps!","When he reached the seventeenth step, Yang Yihuan was the first to steady his footing, while Ling Han took a total of 22 steps back.","Ling Han had lost?","However, Ling Han didn't think so. When the two of them exchanged blows, Yang Yihuan had indeed used the power of the Seventh Change. However, when he retreated, he couldn't help but use more than the power of the Seventh Change. Only then did he manage to stabilize his footing before Ling Han did.","Even so, it was enough to show how terrifying this guy was.","Taking advantage of this opening, the little azure dragon retreated, breaking away from Yang Yihuan.","Yang Yihuan did not pursue him relentlessly. Instead, he looked towards Ling Han, and asked with a smile, \"Come and have a spar?\"","\"Not interested,\" Ling Han rejected directly. What was so interesting about fighting a battle, and eventually using power that surpassed his cultivation level?","Yang Yi smiled faintly, a hint of curiosity in his eyes. Who was this person that could actually stand against him?","Others might not know, but he naturally knew just how strong he was. That was a height that an Imperial Son could not reach through ordinary means.","Yet he had actually encountered a rival!","Others didn't know. They only thought that Ling Han had been at a disadvantage in their first exchange, and that was why he was afraid to fight.","As it turned out, Ling Han was also someone who would bully the weak but fear the strong.","What right did such a person have to attempt to aim for the imperial throne?","Yang Yihuan surveyed the surroundings again, and asked calmly, \"Is there anyone else that would like to provide guidance?\"","No one answered. Yang Yihuan was unreasonably strong, invincible among his peers.","This was truly tragic. There were so many Imperial Clan elites here, yet they actually couldn't find a single prodigy that could rival him.","The expressions of these Imperial Clan elites were all ugly. Were they really going to be humiliated?","'Hmm?'","All the Saints faltered upon hearing this. They then looked toward a certain direction.","In the blink of an eye, the space was forcefully torn apart by a large hand, and then a sturdy old man walked out.","Beside the old man, there was also a young man with a lanky figure. His appearance was ordinary, but there was a golden pattern on his forehead.","A Saint!","The elites were all very curious. Saints were not cabbages that could be found anywhere. There were only so many of them in this world, and they really could be counted on one hand. But they had never seen this Saint before, which naturally made them feel very curious.","\"How should I address you, friend?\" the Shattering Stars Saint asked immediately.","The burly old man smiled, \"I am the Jade Drop Saint.\"","Jade Drop? Jade Drop Saint?","Everyone exchanged looks, all of them completely at a loss. It was as if they had never heard of this Saint with the title.","The Jade Drop Saint pointed at the golden-veined young man beside him, and said, \"I went everywhere today because I wanted to broaden the horizons for this little guy.\"","Yi?"]},{"number":4386,"title":"Chapter 4386 Era of crying Imperial Sons","paragraphs":["Everyone wore strange expressions.","A Saint walked out of the demonic mist, bringing a young man with him. He said that he wanted to show him the prodigies of the world, and now? A Saint that they had never seen before had appeared, and he also brought a young man with him, saying that he wanted to broaden his horizons.","The two Saints had the same intention. They both wanted the youngsters with them to appear in this world.","What could be more famous than defeating the Imperial Clans?","This infuriated the Saints. F*ck! What did they think the Imperial Clans were? A stepping stone?","Yang Yihuan looked at the golden-veined young man, and smiled, \"I am Yang Yihuan. How may I address you, brother?\"","\"Only those who can win my approval are qualified to know my name,\" the golden-veined young man declared proudly.","Everyone's expressions were strange. Yang Yihuan's strength had already been verified, and pummeling he Silver Generation was like child's play to him. Could you be as strong as that?","Without enough strength, yet looking down on everyone else, that was an extremely idiotic action.","They were also curious about the origins of this Jade Drop Saint. He was actually unafraid before the Imperial Clans.","No wonder; he hadn't even heard of Imperial Clans, had he?","\"Such an arrogant tone!\" An Imperial Son couldn't help but humph. He leaped out, and charged towards the golden-veined young man.","Arrogant, arrogant, arrogant. Did he really think that just because the Imperial Clans did not show their might, he could treat them like sick cats?","Peng!","A figure flashed past, and someone was sent flying.","This!","Everyone was gritting their teeth, because the one who had been sent flying was precisely the Imperial Son who had charged out just now.","Er... it must be that this golden-veined young man's cultivation level was high, and was just using his cultivation level to bully others.","Xiu, another Silver Generation attacked, but the result was the same. He was still sent flying with a punch from the golden-veined young man.","What was even more terrifying was the fact that the golden-veined young man's battle prowess had clearly soared several times over in this exchange.","What did this signify?","Like Yang Yihuan, he had also suppressed his cultivation level. He didn't use his cultivation level to overwhelm his opponent.","This was too terrifying, wasn't it? How could there be so many freaks!","The golden-veined young man shook his head, \"Are there any more decent opponents?\"","They were both freakishly strong, but he was completely different from Yang Yihuan. He was extremely arrogant, and his words did not leave any face for others at all.","Thus, this naturally incited everyone's anger.","However, what could they do? Could it be that they had to ask a Sect Master to make a move?","Meanwhile, Yang Yihuan showed a hint of fighting spirit, and said, \"I will battle you.\"","Only then did the golden-veined young man look towards him. Then, his eyes focused, \"Your strength is not weak.\"","\"Being your opponent shouldn't be a problem for me.\" Yang Yihuan was still as lukewarm as before.","\"All right, let's battle!\"","The two of them immediately exchanged blows. Boom, in an instant, battle prowess was fully unleashed, and very soon, they were fighting from the ground all the way to the skies, and from the skies back to the ground, and then blasted into the ground.","Everyone was watching with captivated eyes.","Heavens, Spirit Transformation Tier could actually be so strong!","\"Battle prowess on the level of Pseudo Sect Master!\" All the Saints commented.","This was truly an astonishing battle prowess.","However, their power was stronger, far surpassing the normal Ninth Change, and that was how they could blast out battle prowess on the level of Pseudo Sect Master.","The Saints all looked livid. They knew that their Golden Generation had not possessed such strength when they had been at Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change.","For example, though Lian Yutang had also attained Pseudo Sect Master-level battle prowess before, that was because he had already advanced into Sect Master-level, and forcibly retreated. Then, he temporarily stepped in again.","However, these two people... were genuine Spirit Transformation Tiers.","However, their power was stronger, far surpassing the normal Ninth Change, and that was how they could blast out battle prowess on the level of Pseudo Sect Master.","The Saints all looked livid. They knew that their Golden Generation had not possessed such strength when they had been at Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change.","Perhaps the top three, such as Lin Xuan and the others, may have reached this kind of height, but as for the others... hoho, they really could not attain such heights.","What was wrong with this world?","There had never been so many prodigies gathered together in a single era. In the past, Lin Xuan and the others would all have the aptitude to become Great Emperor, and in an era, being able to produce two or three such outstanding figures could already be considered a golden age.","But now?","Ling Han, Ding Shu, Origin, which one of them was weaker than Lin Xuan and the others?","This wasn't the end yet. Yang Yihuan and the golden-veined young man seemed to be even stronger!","Heavens, what kind of era was this?","The two young prodigies unleashed their trump cards one after another. Both unleashed their nine spiritual bodies, and the ten \"selves\" all blasted out Imperial Techniques respectively. The battle was truly world-shaking. If it was not for the unique nature of this planet, it was probable that after this great battle, the Demonic Mist Planet would have been more than half destroyed.","They both unleashed their brilliance, causing others to exclaim in shock and despair. With such prodigies, others would only be mediocre in comparison. How could they possibly catch up?","...Were you born to deliver a blow to others?","After battling for over an hour, the two of them stopped at the same time.","\"Hahaha, great! Great!\" They all laughed loudly, appearing to be extremely pleased.","They were evenly matched!","\"Right now, you're qualified to know my name!\" the golden-veined young man said. \"My name is... Myriad Dao!\"","Pu!","These words caused everyone to gasp in astonishment.","What, he was Myriad Dao! The Myriad Dao that had created countless records on the Galaxy Network, and was on the same level as Origin, Heaven Crushing and Number One in the Galaxy?","Hiss, the members of the Imperial Clans all hissed.","The Galaxy Network didn't have any Imperial Clans, so no matter what kind of astonishing record they created on the Galaxy Network, the Imperial Clans wouldn't take it to heart. This was because without their participation, they could only be considered second grade.","However, reality slapped them heavily in the face.","At that time, Origin had blocked the entrance to the Ancestral King Academy. If it weren't for Ling Han's interference, the Imperial Clans would have been utterly humiliated. And now? Yang Yihuan had beaten them into submission, yet this Myriad Dao was able to fight him to a tie.","What else could they say?","Ling Han was also surprised. This was Myriad Dao?","Of the four people who had caused a stir in the Galaxy Network, only Heaven Crushing still hadn't appeared. Judging by the strength of Myriad Dao and Origin, this person definitely wasn't weak.","Hehe, this was really an era that would make the Imperial Sons weep.","In this battle, Yang Yihuan and Myriad Dao became renowned throughout the world, and correspondingly, Ling Han paled in comparison. In fact, he didn't even have the courage to battle, and was belittled by countless people.","Cultivators who didn't even have the courage to battle were naturally despicable.","Yet Ling Han did not take it to heart at all. He followed the Nine Mountains Saint back to the Nine Suns Holy Land. Afterwards, the Nine Suns Holy Land also temporarily disbanded, because the truth that the Nine Mountains Saint did not possess a real Imperial Weapon would probably be exposed very soon.","—When they were on the Demonic Mist Planet, the Nine Mountains Saint was only putting an act with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and did not really awaken it.","How could it be revived?","This was naturally temporary. When Ling Han became Emperor, no, no, no, when Ling Han became a Saint, with his strength, he would have no need to fear any Imperial Clan. At that time, the Nine Suns Holy Land would be reestablished.","Calculating the time, Ling Han was already in Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change. Minor Advanced Tier kept him away from Saint Tier. It was only two major tiers of fourth pinnacle level.","Calculating the time, Ling Han was already in Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change. Minor Advanced Tier kept him away from Saint Tier. It was only two major tiers of fourth pinnacle level.","Of course, this \"only\" was very possibly tens of thousands of years.","The higher the cultivation level, the harder it was to cross over.","\"They actually dare to look down on our Little Han!\" The large black dog said angrily, \"If it was a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han would have no problem fighting the two of them alone!\"","It paused, and looked towards Ling Han, but its expression was slightly uncertain, \"Right, Little Han?\""]},{"number":4387,"title":"Chapter 4387 The Imperial Path opens","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, Ling Han showed a confident smile, \"Of course!\"","When he was at the peak stage of the True Self Tier, he already possessed the strength to match Spirit Transformation Tier, because he was an unprecedented Ten Forms! Then, when he completed the Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, it would definitely not be something as simple as possessing the battle prowess of Pseudo Sect Master. Instead, he would truly be capable of matching Sect Master-level!","Even if it was only the weakest Sect Master-level.","Ten Forms, this was unprecedented. This foundation was solid.","Yang Yihuan and Myriad Dao were indeed strong, but in a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han had 100% confidence that he could defeat them.","\"Compared to Myriad Dao, I'm now 20 years behind,\" Ling Han murmured. If he didn't have enough supply of natural treasures, and only ate alchemical pills to increase his cultivation, it would take at least 20 years for him to reach the Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change.","Furthermore, this was still a relatively optimistic estimate.","He was now on a small planet, and the overall level of martial arts was only Spirit Transformation Tier. With his strength, that was enough to rule this place.","However, he wasn't here to be a boss, so he naturally kept a low profile.","\"After all this, we still don't know who Yang Yihuan is.\" The large black dog's expression was filled with curiosity.","Ling Han felt the same. The Demonic Mist Planet suddenly appeared, and a huge commotion was caused because of a Saintly medicine. In the end, even Saints returned in defeat. However, a young man walked out from within, easily defeating the Silver Generation.","And this Yang Yihuan had made such a grand entrance. No one pursued the matter, and asked what was hidden in the depths of the demonic mist? And what kind of supreme elite was residing in that silver mountain?","If it had to be said that Yang Yihuan's origins could still be considered \"clear\", the Imperial Clans did not dare to touch him because they were wary of a possible Pseudo-Emperor backing him. Then, what about Myriad Dao?","Though there was a Saint behind him, in front of the Imperial Clans, Saints were only considered very strong.","No Imperial Clan was willing to trifle with a Saint for no reason, but if they wanted to kill a junior, what was there to be concerned about?","However, Myriad Dao was still alive and well. Moreover, he had also joined the Ancestral King Academy, and was considered Yang Yihuan's equal. As for Ling Han and Ding Shu, their glory had already been completely replaced.","\"Myriad Dao should also have a powerful background. At least, he has the backing of an Imperial Clan, and the situation may be more or less the same as Origin,\" Ling Han estimated. Perhaps, Myriad Dao was the son-in-law of some reclusive Imperial Clan.","\"Little Han, hurry up and marry Chi Menghan. That way, we'll also have an Imperial Clan as our backer,\" the large black dog suggested.","Right now, there were already Imperial Clans reopening hunting orders for Ling Han.","That was because when the Nine Suns Holy Land was disbanded, someone had seen the little red bird.","In order to obtain the inheritance of the Nine Suns Saint, some members of the Imperial Clans had joined the Nine Suns Holy Land. Thus, they naturally wouldn't consider themselves part of Nine Suns Holy Land and be inclined towards it. Instead, they leaked this information the moment they had the chance.","Thus, these Imperial Clans still wanted to obtain the inheritance of the True Phoenix, so they naturally wouldn't give up.","At the same time, the Golden Generation also announced that as long as Yang Yihuan, Myriad Dao and Origin advanced to the Sect Master level, they would let these people know just how terrifying the Golden Generation was.","These days, Ling Han's life was considerably peaceful.","There were no flashes of saber light or sword projections, only idle conversations with his lovers and friends. He was so bored that his b*lls hurt.","However, it wasn't like they had nothing to do. They were all cultivating Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","Even if Ling Han had already comprehended this Imperial Technique, he was still far from reaching Great Accomplishment level. He had only grasped a little bit of its profoundness.","After half a year of cultivation, Ling Han finally succeeded.","As for the others, whether it was the little azure dragon, the large black dog, the empress, and the others, they were all preliminary beginners.","\"Come, Little Han, Grandpa Dog will spar with you.\" The large black dog howled. He had mastered another Imperial Technique, and it could be considered the top grade True Phoenix Technique among Imperial Techniques at that, so it was naturally very pleased with itself.","\"All right.\" Ling Han nodded.","The large black dog immediately charged over. Boom! A brilliant flame was left behind behind him, and he suddenly sped up at an indescribable speed.","Pu, Ling Han immediately spluttered in laughter.","Two flaming wings sprouted from the large black dog's ribs. They were extremely gorgeous, but the large black dog himself was extremely vulgar, and the two auras were completely incompatible with each other.","Was this still called Phoenix Wings Divine Flight?","En, Dog Wings Divine Flight.","However, regardless of whether they were a good match or not, the large black dog's speed was astonishingly fast at this moment. Moreover, wherever he passed, the air around him would also start to burn, with his own martial intent mixed within, forming an extremely terrifying destructive power.","With a thought from Ling Han, he too used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his figure instantly sped up.","His grasp of this movement technique far surpassed the large black dog's. A pair of giant flaming wings sprouted from his back, and with a flap, he was already hundreds of thousands of miles away.","Boom, fiery flames versus fiery flames, high speed versus high speed.","In just a few strikes, the large black dog howled. It couldn't hold on any longer.","The flames that Ling Han unleashed far surpassed the tolerance that it could endure. His tail was about to be burnt bald.","\"Little Han, you're using your public office to avenge a private grudge!\" the large black dog wailed in agony. This was truly a heavy loss.","\"Grandpa Dragon is coming!\" The little azure dragon also rushed out, charging towards Ling Han.","The little red bird, the empress, Hu Niu and the others also charged over. They all used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, which was incredibly dazzling as they flapped their flaming wings.","However, even if they joined forces, they would still be no match for Ling Han. There was absolutely no need for him to use any other techniques. He only had to use Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and a terrifying wave of fire rolled out, giving everyone a great pressure.","After a few moves, everyone had no choice but to admit defeat.","They were all on the same side, so there was naturally nothing to be ashamed of. Everyone knew that Ling Han's strength was heaven-defying, and in terms of cultivation level, he was indeed in the lead. It was very normal for them to lose.","They were all overjoyed. The Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was indeed awesome. No wonder the True Phoenix had been able to stand side by side with the True Dragon in the past, and this movement technique had always been coveted by the Great Emperors of later generations.","After such boring days passed for a while, an astonishing piece of news spread out on the Galaxy Network.","The Imperial Path had opened!","\"What Imperial Path?\" Ling Han was very surprised. In his understanding, the Imperial Path was the path that a Great Emperor had to walk to become a Great Emperor, but that was an abstract concept. There was no real path to walk.","But now that the Imperial Path had opened... was there really such a path?","\"Haha, you are ignorant and ill-informed, aren't you!\" The large black dog laughed loudly, \"The Imperial Path has existed since ancient times, and would open once every tens of millions of years, and after every time it opens, those who had become Emperor would definitely be among those who have walked the Imperial Path.\"","\"They're basically in the top three, and occasionally top ten.\"","Ling Han sneered, \"You just found it out on the Galaxy Network, right?\"","\"Hehe.\" The large black dog laughed drily. Ling Han had hit the nail on the head. He had indeed done his research at the last minute.","\"However, is the Imperial Path really that amazing?\" Ling Han was slightly disbelieving. Could it be that if he did not walk this path, he would not be able to become a Great Emperor in future?","\"Unless the Imperial Path did not appear in the era when the Great Emperor achieved Dao. Otherwise, all Great Emperors have walked the Imperial Path before.\" The large black dog counted on his fingers. There was information on the Galaxy Network that could be found. Out of ten Great Emperors, about eight had walked the Imperial Path before, and were basically in the top three.","\"Interesting,\" Ling Han murmured."]},{"number":4388,"title":"Chapter 4388 Same Moon Planet","paragraphs":["Practically all Emperors had walked the Imperial Path before.","Thus, the Imperial Path was extremely, extremely important. In the eyes of the world, if one wanted to become Emperor, they would have to walk the Imperial Path.","Ling Han didn't think that one could become Emperor just by walking any random path. It was probably because this \"path\" had some heaven-defying good fortune that allowed one to advance so rapidly.","\"Is this a Mystery Realm?\" he asked.","\"Grandpa Dog hasn't had the time to investigate the exact details yet!\" the large black dog said. The moment he saw the opening of the Imperial Path, he anxiously came to find Ling Han.","\"The True Dragon Abyss has opened, which means that the conditions for becoming Emperor have already been met, and the appearance of the Imperial Path means that it will not take too long for a new Emperor to rise.\" The little azure dragon suddenly appeared, shaking its head.","Ling Han sighed. What was wrong with them? Why did they all like to show off?","Where had they learnt this from?","\"Looks like you've done some research, so you're here to spread your knowledge,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The little azure dragon coughed, and began to speak, \"The Imperial Path is indeed a Mystery Realm, but unlike other Mystery Realms, it has a beginning and an end. One enters from the beginning, and exits from the end, forming a complete path. That's why it's called a 'path'.\"","\"Please continue your performance.\" Ling Han made a gesture of invitation.","\"There's practically no limit to the lower limit of one's cultivation level when entering the Imperial Path. Generally speaking, one only has to reach the Foundation Building Tier.\" The little azure dragon organized its thoughts. \"However, there's a upper limit, and that's Saints can't enter.\"","If Saints couldn't enter, then there were still Venerate Tiers and Sect Masters below them.","Ling Han pondered for a moment. In this way, his opponents would no longer just be Yang Yihuan, Myriad Dao, and the others. He would also have to face the threat of Golden Generation. Those guys were now Sect Master-level, and the few people with the fastest cultivation level had even advanced into Venerate Tier-level.","No matter how confident he was, faced with a Sect Master, he could only flee, at best. When he encountered Venerate Tier, he naturally wouldn't have the power to face them head-on.","Thus, if one entered into the Imperial Path, there was still considerable risk.","\"Is there any more detailed information about the Imperial Path?\" Ling Han asked.","\"The information can't be found on the Galaxy Network. Why don't you ask the old man?\" the little azure dragon said.","The period that the Imperial Path would stay open was too long, which basically corresponded to the appearance of the Great Emperor. Thus, it was impossible for ordinary forces to maintain records for such a long time. They had long since disappeared in the long passage of history.","Only forces like the Imperial Clans and the Holy Lands would be able to preserve their information generation after generation.","Ling Han immediately stood up and went to look for the Nine Mountains Saint.","The Nine Mountains Saint would naturally try his best to satisfy his disciple's requests. He immediately found some information and stuffed it into Ling Han's hands.","Ling Han, the large black dog, the empress, and the others all studied it with great care. They separated and read different pieces of information, and then summarized them to piece together the full details of the Imperial Path.","The Imperial Path was very difficult to walk, and there were very few who succeeded. In all the generations of prodigies of the Nine Suns Holy Land, the Nine Suns Saint had successfully completed the Imperial Path. Furthermore, he was only second to Ancestral King Lingtian.","However, the Nine Suns Saint didn't explain much about his experiences in the Imperial Path. He really only talked about a few things. On the other hand, when the later generations walked the Imperial Path, they left behind a lot of information.","Actually, they were more complaining about how they had failed.","This information did not have much significance. It only allowed Ling Han and the others to know just how cruel the Imperial Path was, and outlined just the tip of the iceberg.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"I'll only know after I walk it.\"","\"Even the Nine Suns Saint could complete it, what more us,\" the large black dog encouraged everyone.","Fortunately, the Nine Mountains Saint wasn't here. Otherwise, he would definitely beat up this unfilial disciple of his. He actually dared to look down on their ancestor like this.","Moreover, this wasn't the Nine Suns Planet, where the Nine Suns Saint's undying yin soul was located. If it was, perhaps he may visit the large black dog's dreams in the middle of the night.","Ling Han was naturally filled with confidence in taking the Imperial Path. He frowned, and said, \"Most importantly, the Imperial Clans would definitely set up a barrier, and would not allow us to enter.\"","When everyone heard this, they couldn't help but nod in agreement.","Ling Han, Ding Shu, and Origin were all powerful competitors on the Imperial Path. Thus, the Imperial Clans naturally hoped to keep all of them out, cutting off their chances of becoming Emperor.","However, Origin and Yang Yihuan had the support of the Imperial Clans, so they couldn't stop them. Myriad Dao also seemed to have a powerful background, so the ones who would be stopped should be Ling Han and Ding Shu.","These Imperial Clan elites only needed to send out Saints in turn, bringing the Imperial Weapon to stand guard there. Even the Nine Mountains Saint would only watch helplessly.","Fight head-on?","The only fate was death. If one faced the Imperial Weapon head-on, even a Pseudo-Emperor would feel weak in the knees.","It was no secret that Ling Han could disguise himself, and could even change the fluctuation of his soul. Thus, the Imperial Clans would definitely be on high alert this time, and would not allow Ling Han to take advantage of any loopholes.","It would be as difficult as ascending the heavens to deceive them.","\"Then what do we do?\" The large black dog wanted nothing more than to scratch his face in anxiety. If the Imperial Clans were really so shameless, it would really be difficult to deal with them.","\"Let's go take a look at the situation first.\" Ling Han thought for a moment.","Everyone immediately set out, heading towards Same Moon Planet.","This was the starting point of the Imperial Path. One could only enter from here, and begin the tumultuous journey on the Imperial Path.","The news of the Imperial Path had already spread out for a while. However, in truth, the Imperial Path had not officially opened yet. There was only a premonition. A boundless ancient stone door stood erect there, as if it was relating the secrets of time.","This stone door was too big. In fact, it was even larger than the Same Moon Planet.","Hence, if they were a planet away, the first thing that rushed into their vision was not that planet, but rather that massive stone door.","Perhaps, it should not be said that the Imperial Path began from Same Moon Planet, but rather that Same Moon Planet just happened to be at the starting point of the Imperial Path.","Seeing these stone doors, Ling Han couldn't help but feel his heart skip a beat.","He had seen this stone door before, or rather, he had seen a shrunken, incomplete version of this stone door.","—When he had leaped over the Celestial Gate, that fourth Celestial Gate he had encountered.","That was an ancient stone door, but it was incomplete, and he had to expend all his energy to push it open. It was also because of this that his strong foundation was established, allowing him to sweep aside all his peers.","Now, when he looked at this stone door, it gave him the same feeling.","Could it be that this Imperial Path was naturally formed by heaven and earth?","The Imperial Path was about to open, and those who wished to become Emperor would all come here. Who knows, they may be able to surpass their predecessors.","And though there were some that did not have the ambition to become Emperor, they hoped to pick up some fated opportunity on the Imperial Path, so that they could become stronger.","Thus, there were many, many people who came. Some were at the level of the Venerate Tier, while others were at the level of the Foundation Building Tier.","However, though there was practically no restriction on cultivation level for those who entered — aside from Saints, anyone with cultivation could enter. However, there was actually another implicit restriction, and that was age.","They were both 1000 years old, and a Core Formation Tier could enter, but a Cauldron Forging Tier couldn't. They were both 10,000 years old. The Minor Advanced Tier could enter, but the Spirit Transformation Tier couldn't.","In other words, only relatively young people would be qualified to walk the Imperial Path."]},{"number":4389,"title":"Chapter 4389: Another One","paragraphs":["Chapter 4389: Another One","Editor: Henyee Translations","As the days passed, more and more people arrived at Same Moon Planet.","Just how many were there?","There were people everywhere, that it was difficult to set up even a tent.","It couldn’t be helped. Although the planet colossal, almost everyone in the universe was running over now, so how could it not be crowded?","The problem was, it was one thing for youngsters like you to come, but those white-bearded old geezers also came, so what kind of excitement were they getting themselves involved in?","‘You people definitely won’t be able to enter.’","But they didn’t care, not about age, or relative age. Tons of people came, forcefully stuffing themselves in.","“Imperial Son Ze!”","“Imperial Son Xuan!”","Source: novgo.co","“Imperial Son Ming!”","Several more days passed, and the Golden Generation finally arrived one after another.","Right now, even the most powerful Golden Generation elite was only Venerate Tier. They were completely capable of stepping onto the Imperial Path and contending for supremacy. Moreover, the time was coincidentally so good. Coincidentally, they were Battle prowess, and could be regarded as the most powerful elites of the Imperial Path.","Then, who would be able to compete with them?","History had proved that those who could become Emperor were practically the first three people to complete the Imperial Path. At the very least, they would be in the top ten, and that was pitifully few.","Thus, if the Golden Generation dominated the top ten, it would be equivalent to seizing the fortune of heaven and earth. Then what about Yang Yihuan and Myriad Dao? So what if their natural talent was higher than theirs? The fortune of heaven and earth did not favor them!","Moreover, the Golden Generation was completely capable of committing murder on the Imperial Path. This was a Mystery Realm. In battles in a Mystery Realm, one was responsible for his own life and death. This was a rule that all forces tacitly agreed on.","Countless prodigies had come, but none of them was as dazzling as the Golden Generation.","That’s right. Although Yang Yihuan, Ding Shu, Origin and Myriad Dao had risen up strongly, it had only been a short while, after all. Furthermore, they had not confronted the Golden Generation head-on, so the public still thought that the Golden Generation was the most awesome.","Ling Han sat cross-legged at the side, watching as the Imperial Sons arrived, one after another. They were all incredibly domineering.","This time should be the most important selection on the path to becoming Emperor, because according to history, at most, only the top ten would be qualified to contest for the throne. Thus, after this time, the people with chances of becoming Emperor would become clear.","And this was also the last chance for anyone to take a turn and overtake them. If he obtained a great opportunity on the Imperial Path, perhaps a Silver Generation would be able to turn the tables and become the new leader.","Everyone was filled with ambition, and they all set their sights on the only position of Emperor.","Becoming Emperor, one’s name would be known for all eternity, and his might would suppress the heavens.","Who would remember a loser?","Day after day passed, and more and more prodigies came. Some of them had never been heard of before, but now, they had popped out from who knows where, causing people to exclaim in surprise. As it turned out, there were still so many low-key prodigies.","It wasn’t long before Yang Yihuan also arrived.","He was still calm and composed. Even when he faced the Imperial Path, there was not the slightest fluctuation in his emptions. This caused Ling Han to feel slightly surprised.","Because to be honest, Ling Han was still filled with imagination and longing for the Imperial Path, as well as a sliver of reverence towards the unknown.","However, wasn’t Yang Yihuan a little too calm? He was so calm that it was a little inexcusable.","He had naturally been escorted here by the Saint Yue, and that Saint was extremely low-key. He stood, arms crossed behind his back. If one had not witnessed it personally, who would have guessed that he was actually a Saint?","Space was torn apart, and a large green hand stretched out. Then, an elder in green robes walked out, while a young man followed behind him. He was dressed in a purple imperial robe, exuding an endless air of majesty.","Yi, who was this person?","The members of the Imperial Clans were also astonished. This was because this elder in black was a Saint. However, none of them recognized this elder.","“Heavens, what is going on here?”","Since when did Saints become so cheap? They were all popping out one after another?","“Brother Yang, you’re here!” Just as everyone was guessing the identity of this old man and young man, the young man in purple robes greeted Yang Yihuan.","What? This person actually knew Yang Yihuan?","Hiss, Yang Yi had walked out of the silver mountain in the demonic mist, so how could he possibly have old acquaintances?","“Brother He!” Yang Yihuan also smiled, and nodded at the purple-robed young man.","They really were old acquaintances!","This caused everyone to mumble. Who exactly was this purple-robed young man?","“Friend, how should I address you?” the Rainbow Light Saint asked the elder in green as he clasped his hands in greeting.","A hint of pride appeared on the elder’s face, yet he didn’t reply.","The Rainbow Light Saint couldn’t help but feel angry. He was also a Saint, and furthermore, he was a Saint of an Imperial Clan. Your attitude is really too arrogant, isn’t it?","“Friend, you have gone too far!” He stretched out a hand, which turned into a giant hand that blotted out the skies, grabbing out at the elder in green.","“Ignorant!” The elder in cyan humphed, and two black swords shot out of his eyes. Shua, shua, shua, shua, they slashed towards that giant hand. As the sword projections danced, that giant hand was very quickly destroyed.","“Wu!” The Rainbow Light Saint couldn’t help but let out a muffled groan as blood started to flow from his right hand.","The giant hand was destroyed, and he also suffered a backlash, suffering some light injuries.","Everyone was astonished upon seeing this. One had to realize that the Rainbow Light Saint was a three-star Saint. To wound him so easily, the elder in cyan had to be a five-star Saint, at the very least!","The Rainbow Light Saint, having suffered a loss, couldn’t help but fly into a rage out of humiliation.","I am a Saint of an Imperial Clan, and you dare to bully me?","Xiu, he took out the Imperial Weapon, a large golden cauldron.","Weng! The gigantic golden cauldron hovered above his head, branded with various weapons such as sabers, swords, axes, halberds, and so on. As it gently floated, these weapons all lit up, exuding an incredibly powerful aura.","The Imperial Weapon was about to awaken, and killing Saints was as easy as slaughtering chickens.","Yet the elder in cyan clothing was completely unmoved. A large blood-coloured umbrella was opened above his head, and there were white skulls drawn all over it. They were all flickering with a frightening baleful killing intent.","“What?!” The members of the Imperial Clans all wore expressions of shock, and they exclaimed, “Imperial Weapon!”","This was definitely an Imperial Weapon!","Who would’ve thought that a mysterious Saint would appear with an Imperial Weapon?","“Which Imperial Clan does this Saint belong to?”","“I’ve never heard of this kind of Imperial Weapon!”","“Heavens, there are actually hidden Imperial Clans?”","This stunned the Imperial Clan elites. As it turned out, aside from them, there were also other reclusive Imperial Clan.","Imperial Weapon against Imperial Weapon!","The Rainbow Light Saint instantly lost his anger. If the two Imperial Weapons clashed, the most likely result would be that both sides would be severely wounded. Moreover, he was only a Three Star Saint, so he definitely wouldn’t be able to last as long as his opponent. Thus, even if the two sides were evenly matched, the Rainbow Light Saint would still be the first to fall.","Then what was the point of fighting?","A great battle that could possibly break out had thus vanished without a trace. The Rainbow Light Saint was naturally completely humiliated. He sat down, his expression dark. If it was not for the fact that he still had the heavy responsibility of protecting the Imperial Son of his clan, he would definitely have left with a flourish of his sleeves.","—He could not afford to lose face like this!","Ling Han was also surprised. Where had this purple-robed young man popped out from?","It should be known that though Yang Yihuan had always been polite towards others, he was incredibly proud, but looking at his attitude towards the purple-robed young man, there was a sliver of wariness in his attitude.","This kind of expression would only appear on his face when he was facing a powerful opponent.","Another powerful opponent had appeared.","Ling Han thought internally, but did not feel the slightest bit of fear, only excitement.","“The Imperial Path has opened!” Someone suddenly called out."]},{"number":4390,"title":"Chapter 4390: Blocked","paragraphs":["Chapter 4390: Blocked","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hong long long, a world-shaking sound rang out, and that stone door that was larger than the planet was slowly opening.","The Imperial Path had officially opened!","All of a sudden, the Imperial Sons were the first to move, and passed through the gap in the stone doors that had only been slightly opened.","The stone door was too big. Even if it was just a crack, it was enough for people to easily enter, and there was absolutely no need for them to fight over it.","However, it would not be so easy for others to enter.","The Saints of the Imperial Clans joined forces, and all those who were not members of Imperial Clans would have to undergo a strict examination from them.","‘F*ck! Are they targeting me?’","Ling Han knew that he had killed a few Imperial Sons, and had already formed a great enmity with a great many Imperial Clans. Previously, there was still the threat of the Nine Mountains Saint and the Imperial Weapon. Now, this balance of power no longer existed, so the Imperial Clans naturally wanted to get rid of him.","Even if the universe was too big, and the Imperial Clans couldn’t find him in a short while, they definitely couldn’t allow him to enter the Imperial Path. That would be giving him great fortune for no reason.","Source: novgo.co","Ling Han could only watch helplessly as groups of people were examined by the Saints before stepping through the stone doors.","And this stone door was really too big, and the speed at which it was opened was too slow. A whole half day had passed, and the stone door was still not completely opened.","“The old man is here!” Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. He had received a message from the Nine Mountains Saint.","After announcing his location, the Nine Mountains Saint immediately arrived.","“I’ll send you in,” the Nine Mountains Saint said. There was fury on his face.","F***, they were actually so devious. They wanted to use this kind of method to cut off Ling Han’s path to becoming Emperor?","“Old man, don’t get too worked up,” Ling Han hurriedly said. “There’s a bunch of Saints over there, and quite a few of them are holding Imperial Weapons.”","The Nine Mountains Saint shook his head, and said, “It’s fine.”","He had to take a gamble. If he missed this opportunity, it was possible that Ling Han would have no chance of becoming Emperor.","Thus, no matter how dangerous it was ahead of him, he had to take a gamble.","He grabbed Ling Han and the others. Boom! His figure enlarged endlessly, and with a single step, he was heading towards the stone door.","These stone doors were even larger than the planet. Thus, the Nine Mountains Saint only had to approach slightly, and with a wave of his hand, he would be able to throw Ling Han and the others through the stone doors.","“Nine Mountains, I’ve been waiting for you for a long time!”","However, two Saints immediately stepped forward to greet him, launching an attack at the Nine Mountains Saint.","Peng!","The Regulations intertwined to form a terrifying divine light that was indestructible.","The Nine Mountains Saint had no choice but to retreat. He was only a One Star Saint, but the two people that were blasting towards him were both Three Star Saints.","It should be known that even if there was only a gap of a single star, there was a massive gap in strength between Saints, so how could one afford a gap of two stars?","If they clashed head-on, the only fate would be death.","“You should have come to escort that junior, Ling Han!” one of the Saints who had moved shouted, “Hand over that despicable brat, and we can spare your life!”","The Nine Mountains Saint naturally wouldn’t pay any heed to this. He simply continued to flee with all his might.","However, it was useless. The two three-star Saints were completely blocking his way, and even if the Nine Mountains Saint fought all out, it was still completely impossible for him to break through.","The gap in strength was really quite wide.","“Haha, don’t you have the Imperial Weapon? Why don’t you use it?” the two Saints continued to taunt.","The Nine Mountains Saint immediately turned around to flee.","—The other Saints were already reviving the Imperial Weapons, and were about to deliver a fatal blow to him.","Thus, he could only retreat now. He refused to believe that these Saints would stay here forever.","He couldn’t defend for too long, as there would eventually be flaws in his defenses.","Thankfully, the Nine Mountains Saint had left in the nick of time. If he had been a little later, the Saints would have surrounded him, and he really would have had no choice but to stay and fight to the death.","And if he fought to the death, his only fate would be death.","After the Nine Mountains Saint brought Ling Han and the others on a circle, he quietly returned to the Same Moon Planet, and prepared to wait for an opportunity to make a move.","He made a few attempts, but they all ended in failure. There were two times that he was in a perilous situation, and almost died.","Ling Han advised, “Forget it, old man, let’s not go! I don’t believe that if I don’t walk this Imperial Path, I won’t be able to become Emperor!”","He was filled with confidence. As long as his cultivation level advanced rapidly, he would definitely be able to become Emperor.","Meanwhile, the Nine Mountains Saint didn’t agree. History had already proven countless times that the Great Emperor had definitely stood out from those who had passed through the Imperial Path.","That was fine. He definitely had to create this kind of opportunity for Ling Han.","“Wait a few more days,” he said. If worse came to worst, he would just have to wait for a year and a half. Would Saints like them still stand guard here with Imperial Weapon in hand?","Because there were really too many people, even if there were Saints inspecting, this speed was still not fast enough. Same Moon Planet was still filled with people, but everyone was angry but did not dare to say anything. That was the Imperial Clan, so even if they were overbearing and unreasonable, so what?","In the blink of an eye, ten days had passed.","What surprised Ling Han was the fact that Yang Yihuan and the young man in purple were actually in no rush to step onto the Imperial Path. The two of them were whispering to each other, and it was unknown what they were talking about.","Weng, a terrifying aura suddenly appeared, making people feel as if their hearts were about to jump out of their chests.","Then, a figure appeared. It was a young monk who looked to be about fifteen or sixteen years old. He was dressed in a gray monastic robe. His small face was clearly handsome, but was filled with a murderous aura. He was showing his might without being angry.","Buddha Doga!","Why had he come?","A Pseudo-Emperor appeared, and instantly, everyone’s hearts beat like drums. Even the hands of the Saints from the Imperial Clans were covered with a layer of cold sweat.","In this world, without the appearance of a Great Emperor, Pseudo-Emperor was invincible.","In front of such an elite, the Imperial Clans could only save themselves.","“Greetings, Buddha Doga!” A young man walked out. He was actually also wearing a Buddhist robe, but his head was not completely bare. Instead, he had long black hair, and there was a Buddhist halo at the back of his head, exuding an air of peace that could enlighten all living beings.","Buddha Doga glanced at him in disgust, and said, “Which generation of disciple are you, Ah Han’s disciple?”","“The 93rd generation main disciple, Shi Jie, pays his respects to Second Founder!” This young monk performed a Buddhist bow.","Buddha Doga stared at him with a vicious glint in his eyes. However, he didn’t attack in the end. Instead, he turned around to look at Yang Yihuan and the young man in purple.","A Pseudo-Emperor was a Pseudo-Emperor, after all. Yang Yihuan and the young man in purple had previously been very calm and relaxed, but being stared at by Buddha Doga, the both of them could not help but show expressions of unease.","That was natural. A Pseudo-Emperor was practically the strongest in the world.","“Greetings, Lord Doga!” The two of them also bowed in unison, respectfully paying their respects to Buddha Doga.","Buddha Doga looked at the two of them, and after a while, he asked slowly, “How many times have the two of you walked the Imperial Path?”","Pu!","Hearing these words, everyone spluttered.","What did he mean by how many times had they walked the Imperial Path? How many more times could one walk the Imperial Path? It should be known that the Imperial Path would only open once every tens of millions of years. Thus, who could live for so long, and enter into the Imperial Path twice?","Even twice was impossible, so how many times could it be?","“Probably eleven times for me,” Yang Yihuan said calmly.","“Nine times,” the purple-robed young man replied respectfully, completely changing his arrogant attitude.","This?","How was this possible!","Of course it was possible, Ling Han thought. These two should have used the Primordial Source Clay to seal off the loss of lifespan. Thus, every tens of millions of years, when the Imperial Path opened and revived, they would naturally be able to step onto the Imperial Path again and again.","However, this was still extremely freakish."]},{"number":4391,"title":"Chapter 4391: Another door","paragraphs":["Chapter 4391: Another door","Editor: Henyee Translations","As it turned out, the Imperial Path really could be walked more than once!","Ordinary people could not imagine this at all, and could only stare in dumbfounded shock, while in the case of the Imperial Clans, all of their expressions were solemn.","One had walked the Imperial Path nine times, while the other had walked the Imperial Path eleven times. Just how many great opportunities had they obtained on the Imperial Path?","Thus, how could they not be strong?","The killing intent of Buddha Doga surged, and it was as if he were about to attack. This shocked the Saint Yue and the other Saint in green, and they both looked as if they were about to face a powerful enemy.","Who wouldn’t be afraid of the might of a Pseudo-Emperor?","“Lord Doga, for the sake of Master, please don’t start a fight,” the Saint in green hurriedly said. His tone was extremely respectful, and there was no sign of arrogance in his voice.","Buddha Doga humphed, and said, “I disdain from attacking juniors!”","The two Saints breathed a sigh of relief upon hearing this.","Source: novgo.co","The words of a Pseudo-Emperor were like the words of a law decree.","Buddha Doga looked at the Imperial Clan Saints and said, “You people have the nerve to pick on the weak with so many people!”","What did that mean?","Could it be that he was standing up for Ling Han?","Hiss, then the matter would become serious.","The fact that the Imperial Clans dared to do this was naturally because they thought that the Nine Mountains Saint was only a One Star Saint, the weakest among Saints. Furthermore, he did not have the Imperial Weapon in his possession, so naturally, he was completely unqualified to challenge the Imperial Clans.","However, Buddha Doga was different.","Pseudo-Emperor!","Right now, if Doga wanted to support Ling Han, who among them could afford to offend him?","They had not expected this. It turned out that Buddha Doga really had a high opinion of Ling Han.","However, right at this moment, Buddha Doga suddenly moved, grabbing Ling Han from afar. He then took a step, and a golden path spread out, heading directly into the boundless distance.","Yi?","To say nothing of the Imperial Clan elites, even the Nine Mountains Saint was stunned.","What was going on here?","Shouldn’t you have stood up for Ling Han? Why did you run away with him?","...","In the boundless distance, on a dark and cold planet.","Buddha Doga stopped, then tossed Ling Han aside.","“Greetings, Senior Doga.” Ling Han clasped his hands in greeting.","He did not dare to be impudent. This person had once been a bloodthirsty person, and the number of Saints that had died in his hands could be said to be frighteningly many. Though it was possible that he had optimistic expectations of him, he could not afford to take a gamble on the other party’s temperamental personality.","Buddha Doga stood with his hands clasped behind his back, and said calmly, “Are you very angry that you have been blocked from the Imperial Path?”","“Yes, a little.” Ling Han nodded honestly. In front of this Lord, it was best to be more honest. However, he immediately broke into a smile again, “However, even if I am unable to set foot on the Imperial Path, I do not think that I would be unable to become Emperor.”","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “You’re quite confident.”","Ling Han snickered, and honestly and without reservation, accepted this compliment.","Buddha Doga pondered for a moment, then said, “I can send you back, and I guarantee that no one will dare to stop you again. However, I can also guide you to another door. You too can enter the Imperial Path from that door, but it is filled with danger. You may die at any time.”","“Which one do you choose?”","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all, and he said, “I choose the second option!”","What accompanied danger was usually fated opportunities.","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but smile and say, “Very good. I wasn’t wrong about you.”","“I’ll bring you there now.”","Ling Han hurriedly asked, “Senior Doga, can I bring a few more people with me?”","There was still the empress, the large black dog and the others.","“No!” Buddha Doga refused coldly.","This person wasn’t a benevolent charity worker. Instead, he was a great demon who had killed Saints.","Ling Han didn’t say anything else. He definitely couldn’t make arbitrary requests just because Buddha Doga viewed him differently.","The latter wasn’t the Nine Mountains Saint.","Buddha Doga walked ahead, and Ling Han hurriedly followed behind him. As he sensed with his divine sense, he was surprised. This was because although this planet still had ley lines, they seemed to be on the verge of death.","This was completely unable to allow him to use Star Steps, because the Earth Qi was really too weak.","However, with Buddha Doga here, who in this world could hurt him?","However, Buddha Doga was really walking too fast, and Ling Han was gradually left behind.","Ling Han didn’t tell the Buddha Doga to slow down. Instead, he channeled Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and he instantly sped up. Not only was he no longer left behind by the Buddha Doga, but he even closed the distance between them.","Buddha Doga was slightly surprised, and he said, “Who would’ve thought? You actually obtained the inheritance of the True Phoenix.”","“It’s all luck, just luck,” Ling Han said very modestly.","Indeed, if it weren’t for the little red bird, he would have only trapped himself inside the lair of the True Phoenix. If it weren’t for the Flame Skin Race’s ancestor, the True Phoenix would have possessed the little red bird long ago. It wouldn’t have had anything to do with him either.","Unexpectedly, Buddha Doga continued, “Luck is also a part of strength.”","The corners of Ling Han’s mouth twitched, but he did not laugh out loud.","After walking for a while, Buddha Doga suddenly stopped.","He began to draw formations on the ground. They were incredibly mysterious, and even if Ling Han was a formation grandmaster, he still couldn’t understand them.","This was... Saint-level formation, or even in fact, Great Emperor-level formation.","“Senior Doga, I didn’t expect you to be so proficient in formation techniques!” Ling Han flattered.","“If you live long enough, you’ll naturally learn some other things as well,” Buddha Doga said calmly.","Ling Han thought internally. He didn’t need to live for too long, because his comprehension ability was too high. You see, in martial arts, formations, and alchemy, he was proficient in all of them. He only needed his Spiritual Power to improve further, and he would similarly be able to come into contact with Saint-level formations.","He didn’t say these words. He was showing off too much, and it was very likely that he would be beaten to death by Buddha Doga.","‘Yes, I won’t say.’","It wasn’t long before the formation was completed. Buddha Doga activated the formation, instantly forming a dark door of light that was slowly spinning.","“Come,” Buddha Doga said.","“This leads to the Imperial Path?” Ling Han asked.","“No,” Buddha Doga shook his head.","“Then where does it lead to?”","“Netherworld.”","Pu!","Ling Han instantly spluttered. Netherworld? Weren’t we looking for another route to Imperial Path? Why are you bringing me to Netherworld?","Moreover, Yin and Yang were separated, and there was the existence of the realm barrier. If you could draw a formation that led to the Netherworld, that seemed a little too casual, wasn’t it?","“This planet is one of the weakest locations in the barrier between the Yin and Yang Realms.” It was rare for Buddha Doga to be willing to explain.","Ling Han wasn’t stupid, and he immediately came to a realization. “The other path to the Imperial Path is in the Netherworld!”","It was no wonder that the ley lines of this planet seemed to have died. It must have been affected by the Netherworld.","This was a child that could be taught.","A smile appeared on Buddha Doga’s face, and he said, “That’s right. Because Yin and Yang correspond to each other, if you want to advance from the Netherworld to the Imperial Path, you’ll have to experience many obstacles.”","“I’m not afraid!” Ling Han immediately replied, appearing to be filled with confidence.","No wonder Buddha Doga didn’t allow him to bring other people with him. It was too dangerous to travel from the Netherworld. If he brought the empress and the others with him, it was very likely that they would be harmed.","Thus, it was better for him to be alone.","Buddha Doga led the way, entering the doorway of light. Ling Han hurriedly followed behind him.","After taking a few steps, a terrifying chill assaulted him, penetrating straight into his bones.","Netherworld!","A sense of familiarity rose up in Ling Han. How many times had he entered into the Netherworld?","Buddha Doga walked in front, and the Buddha Halo behind its head lit up. In this dim Netherworld, it appeared extremely dazzling.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4392,"title":"Chapter 4392: Stepping on the Imperial Path","paragraphs":["Chapter 4392: Stepping on the Imperial Path","Editor: Henyee Translations","Not long after, a large number of Yin souls appeared in the distance, pouncing madly towards them.","The aura of life of Buddha Doga was too strong, so this aggro was naturally very strong.","The strength of these Yin souls varied. There were Foundation Building Tier, Cauldron Forging Tier, Spirit Transformation Tier, and Minor Advanced Tier. They all rushed over like a swarm of bees. A Pseudo-Emperor’s life force was as vast as the sea, and for Yin souls, this was an irresistible temptation.","Faced with so many Yin souls, Buddha Doga did not make a move at all. He merely strode forwards, but any Yin soul that dared to barge within three hundred meters of him would immediately be turned into pieces, and completely return to the heaven and earth.","In the Netherworld, Buddha Doga advanced as easily as walking on flat ground.","A Yin Saint appeared, spying on them, but did not dare to make a move at all. In front of a Pseudo-Emperor, the Yin Saint was practically trash.","“You’ve watched for so long, isn’t that enough?” Buddha Doga asked calmly. The Buddha Halo behind his head suddenly lit up brightly, turning into a Skanda Staff that shot towards the Yin Saint.","Pu!","It was as if the Yin Saint’s body had been frozen in place. He was unable to dodge at all, and was directly turned into ashes.","Awesome, that was a Saint-level being. Even if the Yin Saint was not as strong as a Saint from the Living Realm, being insta-killed with a single strike was really enough to make one’s eyes pop out.","The might of Pseudo-Emperor was world-shaking.","Although this was the Netherworld, it was as if Buddha Doga was in his own backyard. He didn’t need to worry about anything at all.","After walking for a long time, a massive stone door appeared ahead of them.","Yi?","There was actually a corresponding stone door here as well?","Ling Han was surprised. This stone door was very similar to the stone door on Same Moon Planet. It was also ancient and majestic, but in terms of size, it was slightly smaller.","Now, these doors were completely open, revealing a passageway.","However, not a single Yin soul entered, as if for Yin souls, that was a Forbidden Land.","“Go on,” Buddha Doga said.","“Thank you, Senior.” Ling Han bowed respectfully. Without Buddha Doga, it was impossible for him to enter into Imperial Path.","Buddha Doga nodded, and was just about to turn around and leave.","“Senior, why are you helping me?” Ling Han couldn’t help but ask. Buddha Doga was already a Pseudo-Emperor, practically the strongest in the universe. Could it be that he wanted to ask him to repay him for his help?","“A great era is about to come, and there should be a few more talents like you. Step out to face the waves,” Buddha Doga said. Then, he took another step, and a golden path spread out, heading directly into the boundless distance.","He took another step, and instantly disappeared from sight.","‘F*ck! Why don’t you explain yourself?’","Ling Han naturally knew that a grand and expansive era was about to arrive. Just look, freaks like Origin, Myriad Dao, and Ding Shu were all appearing in batches. Wasn’t it obvious?","The question was, what was going on with this great era?","Yin soul, chaotic world, sea of blood boiling the skies, Saints as common as dogs?","Ling Han couldn’t ask any more questions. This was because with the departure of Buddha Doga, countless Yin souls had also begun to target him and were charging over.","He hurriedly broke into a run, and rushed into the stone door.","Ahead of him was a passageway with no end in sight. A cold chill assaulted him, ten times stronger than before.","Ling Han hurriedly activated his Starlight Screen to block the cold. He then strode forward, yet he didn’t unleash his movement technique or unleash his extreme speed. This was because the environment here was unclear, and there were unknown dangers hidden within. Thus, it was best to remain cautious.","Hehe, now Yang Yihuan, Myriad Dao, and the Golden Generation all thought that he had not set foot on the Imperial Path. If they suddenly came across him, would these people be shocked?","En.","With a thought from Ling Han, he changed his appearance. This kind of surprise was strong enough.","“I haven’t set foot on the Imperial Path yet, so no matter how many Imperial Sons die, it has nothing to do with me.”","He murmured to himself. At present, he was no match for the Golden Generation, but when he advanced into the level of Sect Master, he was sure that there would be a great many Golden Generations that would kneel down in front of him and proclaim their conquest.","This passage was really very long. After walking for about a day, it was finally no longer dark. Instead, there was a sliver of light. At the same time, the temperature also began to rise again.","“Yi?”","He saw a black shadow lying in front of him. It looked a little like a corpse.","Ling Han carefully walked over. It was possible that some dangerous creature was lying in ambush here. If he was careless, it was very likely that he would be caught off guard.","After a few steps, he arrived in front of the black shadow.","As expected, this was indeed a corpse. However, this corpse was different from all the corpses that Ling Han had seen.","There were many living beings in the world, so Ling Han had seen many strange corpses. However, this one was covered with red hair, and its body... was empty!","Strictly speaking, this was human skin. Red hair grew on the human skin, and other things like blood, flesh, and bones did not exist, but it had forcefully formed into the shape of a human body. Ling Han was amazed by this.","Where was his blood and flesh? Where were his bones?","Someone had removed them?","But who would be so bored as to peel off a person’s skin by force, and there was not the slightest bit of damage? Furthermore, what the hell was this red hair?","A terrifying pressure suddenly spread out, causing Ling Han to involuntarily turn pale. He retreated continuously, unable to catch his breath at all.","Hiss, how terrifying.","Ling Han was stunned. What kind of background did this red-haired human skin have? Why did he feel a Saint-level pressure? If it was not him, and if it was another person, his heart would probably have exploded from the shock.","Could it be that this was a Saint that had been skinned?","He couldn’t help but feel his heart clench. Then who was the murderer? Was it a Pseudo-Emperor like Buddha Doga, or... was it Buddha Doga himself?","This guy was really capable of doing such a thing. It wasn’t like he hadn’t seen it before.","Moreover, he had also been guided by Buddha Doga onto this path, so it was normal that there were Saints here that had been skinned by Buddha Doga.","But the problem was, why had Buddha Doga brought the Saint’s corpse here to be skinned?","That’s not right!","Ling Han looked at the human skin’s face. There was still a sliver of emotion on this face, but it was not fear or resentment. Instead, there was only a sliver of defiance.","If he had been skinned, he should have been filled with resentment and fear. Why was there only defiance?","Ling Han stayed here for quite a while, and only then did he set out again, walking forwards.","He had not walked too far, when he saw another black shadow.","Again?","He carefully approached. As expected, this was another human skin, and it was also covered with red hair.","Looking at this sheet of human skin, an indescribable chill rose up in Ling Han’s heart.","“Yi!”","He discovered a line of words carved beside the human skin.","Actually, there were only a few words written on it, “Defiant, I am really defiant...” Then, it came to an abrupt stop.","Defiant? Indeed, Ling Han could tell from his expression, but the question was, why are you defiant? Why don’t you explain clearly?","With such suspense, aren’t you afraid of having your corpse whipped by others in future generations?","Ling Han pondered for a moment before continuing to walk forward.","As expected, after another stretch of road, he saw the third red-furred corpse, and beside this corpse, there was a large number of words.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and involuntarily, his mouth couldn’t help but gape."]},{"number":4393,"title":"Chapter 4393: Reincarnation Path","paragraphs":["Chapter 4393: Reincarnation Path","Editor: Henyee Translations","These words described an astonishing fact.","The general idea was that this “person” wanted to use this path to return to life, and obtain true life.","Obtaining true life?","Why was there such a saying?","Ling Han’s heart jolted. Then there was only one possibility, and that was the person who had died was a Yin soul.","But could a Yin soul still return to the Living Realm, and obtain true life?","This was what stunned Ling Han. No wonder these corpses only had skin and red hair, but did not have blood, flesh, or bones. As it turned out... they did not have these things in the first place.","In truth, the Yin soul was only a soul, and did not have a physical body at all. Now that it had grown skin, what did that mean?","They could indeed take physical form.","F***, what exactly was this path? It was so awesome, that it could allow a Yin soul to return to the Living Realm?","However, Ling Han was certain that the one who had died was a Yin Saint. Thus, even a Yin Saint had died on the way here, which showed how difficult this path was.","Why hadn’t he encountered any danger?","Ling Han thought again. Could it be that this danger only targeted Yin souls?","This was the only explanation. Otherwise, there was no reason that even the Yin Saint had collapsed, yet he was completely unscathed.","A thought suddenly arose in Ling Han’s mind, causing him to stop in his tracks.","Was this how Buddha Doga obtained his second life?","When a person died, it would be like how a fire was extinguished. This was irreversible. Thus, how exactly were they supposed to live a second life?","Enter the Netherworld, and then take this path?","Even the Yin Saint had fallen, which showed how difficult this path was to walk. However, a Pseudo-Emperor was not a Saint, but rather had the word “Emperor” in their name.","Thus, Ling Han was absolutely confident that Buddha Doga could walk this path.","“If that’s really the case, then wouldn’t elites be immortal and indestructible?” Ling Han murmured. After death, he would walk the “Reincarnation Path” once. In any case, if he could walk it once, walking it a second time would also be very easy.","“Hence, if this Yin Saint’s message was not false, and if he had walked this path, he would indeed be able to live a second life. Then, there would definitely be very great restrictions, and it would be impossible for him to walk this path a second time.”","“Otherwise, there would really be as many top-notch elites as carp crossing a river in this world.”","Ling Han continued to advance. In fact, instead of guessing on his own here, he might as well ask Buddha Doga. This guy would definitely know. The question was, would he answer him?","After walking for a while, Ling Han discovered a new corpse on the ground.","It was still a Yin Saint, who had similarly left behind endless regrets.","Some corpses should be endlessly old. Thus, even if it was a Yin Saint, so what? The corpses were already showing signs of corrosion, and was an extremely ghastly sight.","After travelling for another half a day, the number of Yin Saint corpses that Ling Han saw was already in the tens of thousands, and when he went on further, he shockingly discovered that some of the corpses actually showed white bone!","It was very strange. Some only had spines, some had skulls, and some had leg bones. None of the corpses had complete bones.","Ling Han finally understood. The farther the Yin Saint walked, the stronger their abilities would be, and the higher the level of their “return to the Living Realm” would be. Not only would they be able to grow skin, they would also be able to grow bones.","However, from Yin to Yang, living a second life was a heaven-defying action, after all. Thus, they had all fallen on this path.","“To walk the Reincarnation Path, one would at least have to be a Pseudo-Emperor, right?”","Ling Han murmured to himself. Perhaps it would be fine even if there was an incomparably powerful Yin Saint, but the living beings of the Living Realm had never heard of this kind of thing, so they naturally could not confirm it.","As he walked forwards, he finally could no longer see the corpses of the Yin Saints, and he had finally reached the end of the passage. A plain appeared ahead of him, but peng, peng, peng! Occasionally, he would see lava breaking through the ground, soaring into the skies.","How terrifying!","Even at such a far distance, Ling Han could still sense how terrifying this lava was. It was possible that even Saints could be insta-killed by this lava, and it was on the same level as the Heavenly Dao Flames.","There was no pattern to the lava gushing out. Thus, this plain was terrifying. It could insta-kill the Saint, so how was he supposed to pass through?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Was this the danger that Buddha Doga spoke of?","Indeed, this was too terrifying. If he was the slightest bit careless, he would immediately die.","Ling Han didn’t advance recklessly. Even Saints could be insta-killed in this lava. He definitely couldn’t place his life on the line—although his luck had indeed always been very good.","He just stood there, observing, wanting to summarize the pattern.","No matter how chaotic it was, there should still be a pattern. Otherwise, this would be a dead end. Why would Buddha Doga do something so superfluous?","Ling Han had not thought to use the pearl which was a natural treasure. The upper limit was Saint-level, so it couldn’t protect him.","Thus, he could only depend on himself.","However, after observing for three days, he discovered that the lava gushing out was indeed random. There was no pattern to it at all.","F***, could it be that he was going to go back the way he came, and return home?","Yi?","He suddenly saw an ancient chariot slowly drive over from ahead of him. Boom, though lava was gushing out, and had landed solidly on the bottom of the chariot, the chariot was still stable, and did not look like it had been destroyed at all. Furthermore, it did not look like it was burning at all.","Ling Han’s eyes couldn’t help but widen a little. Wasn’t this chariot too awesome?","Was this a Great Emperor-level precious tool?","Otherwise, how could it resist the lava that could insta-kill a Saint?","In a short while, the chariot was already close enough. Ling Han could see very clearly that there was a fully armored person on the chariot, but not the slightest bit of skin was exposed. He couldn’t even see his eyes, as he was tightly suited in the Battle Armor.","This person... exuded a terrifying aura that could suppress the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","A Great Emperor?","Ling Han felt a little dizzy. On the path from the Netherworld to the Living Realm, there was actually a Great Emperor?","Impossible, impossible. There was definitely no Great Emperor that was so idle. Furthermore, if there were Great Emperors in this world, how could the True Dragon Abyss and Imperial Path be opened?","A Great Emperor’s soul?","However, the Great Emperor was far too powerful. In fact, he was so powerful that once he died, his soul would fuse with heaven and earth, becoming a part of heaven and earth. He wouldn’t even have the chance to enter the Netherworld.","Ling Han was completely baffled. He felt that his understanding of the Great Emperor was really too limited. All the deductions he could make were based on his limited knowledge of the Great Emperor, but how much understanding did he have about the Great Emperor?","While he was lost in thought, the chariot gradually drew closer, and was only about 30 meters away from him.","This was astonishing. With the chariot’s speed, it would have taken at least half a day to reach him from afar. However, in the blink of an eye, the chariot had already appeared.","Ground Shrinking Technique?","Ling Han clasped his hands respectfully, and said to the humanoid figure in Battle Armor, “Senior, can you give me a ride?”","The man in Battle Armor didn’t reply, and only slowly turned the chariot around.","‘Then I’ll take that as a yes.’","Ling Han hurriedly leaped toward the chariot. This was because if the chariot turned around, it would immediately flee from him.","He was betting that Buddha Doga wouldn’t harm him.","He landed steadily on the chariot, and the man in armor didn’t pay any attention to him at all. It was as if he didn’t know that he had boarded the chariot.","‘Fine, you’re at the level of a Great Emperor, so you can indeed view me as an ant.’","The chariot advanced slowly, heading into the depths of the plains."]},{"number":4394,"title":"Chapter 4394: Imperial Armor?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4394: Imperial Armor?","Editor: Henyee Translations","The chariot seemed to be moving very slowly, but in truth, it was astonishingly fast. It was clearly just a revolution of its wheels, but boundless distance had been left behind.","Ling Han remained silent. Since this elite didn’t like to talk, it was best that he didn’t disturb him.","Villains usually died from speaking too much. Though he was not a villain, he still had some self-awareness.","After walking for half a day, they had reached the end of the plain. A bare mountain appeared ahead of them, with only strangely shaped rocks. As for plants, they did not exist at all.","Ling Han leaped onto the ground, then turned around, and bowed respectfully towards the man in armour, “Thank you, Senior.”","The chariot slowly stopped, and the man in armour didn’t respond.","Ling Han bowed again before turning around to leave.","After taking a few steps, he suddenly heard a loud clang. He hurriedly turned around, only to see that the Battle Armor had actually fallen all over the ground. There was a helmet, wrist guard, knee guards, and so on. It had fallen all over the chariot.","However, not a single elite appeared.","Ling Han’s heart involuntarily clenched. Could it be that it was that Battle Armor that had been moving on its own previously?","Because the Battle Armor was seamlessly fitted, and not the slightest gap was revealed, it was really hard to tell if there was anyone inside.","Had it really been a Battle Armor that had brought him here?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel his heart palpitate. Then, this Battle Armor was definitely an Imperial Weapon.","When it came to the Imperial Weapon, most people would be thinking of weapons. Moreover, why was the Imperial Weapon called the Imperial Weapon instead of Imperial Tool? It could also be seen that most of them were in the form of weapons, not armor.","If he could obtain this armor, then with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower as offence, and the Imperial Armor as defence, just how awesome would that be?","However, this thought only flashed through Ling Han’s mind. He shook his head, and did not make a move.","Why?","Throughout history, he was definitely not the first person to come here, but why had this chariot and Battle Armor always been here?","How could it be that others would not be interested in the Imperial Armor?","It definitely wasn’t, so it probably couldn’t be taken.","This was indeed an alluring temptation, but this Battle Armor and chariot were still here. What did this mean?","It was not that no one had designs on it, but rather that no one could do it.","And those who had failed?","They had probably all died.","Ling Han guessed that the dangers mentioned by the Buddha Doga probably also contained a test of the human heart.","He took a deep breath, turned around and left without hesitation.","The Imperial Armor was indeed tempting, but Ling Han was filled with confidence in himself.","He was invincible, and didn’t need any external items!","Yi?","Ling Han had just stepped onto the withered mountain, when he felt a power taking effect inside his body, wanting to tear him to shreds.","He hurriedly channeled his mystical power to suppress this power, and his tough physique was also as steady as a boulder.","One step after another, he resolutely forged onwards.","This power was changing. At one moment, it was acting on his entire body, but at another moment, it was only acting on a certain part of his body. This was terrifying. With such a powerful force exploding at a single point, Ling Han’s reaction was only slightly slower. Pa, blood immediately spurted from that part of his body.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. A bloody hole had already appeared on his left forearm, and his blood was as crystalline as agate. It hadn’t dripped down at all.","And this was still because his physique was tough. Otherwise, this bloody hole would have enlarged several times over, and in fact, even his whole forearm would have been split apart.","Alarm bells rang in Ling Han’s mind. He definitely couldn’t be careless. He definitely had to react in time. Otherwise, what if this power exploded in his mind?","This was really a godforsaken place, and was incredibly dangerous.","Ling Han’s reaction speed was raised to the extreme. The moment that power moved, he moved as well.","Thankfully, though this power was strong, it was only about the same level as his. As long as he reacted in time, he would not be injured.","However, Ling Han didn’t just have to resist this power. He also had to walk and observe the situation of this withered mountain. If there was an even greater danger, he naturally had to avoid it.","The withered mountain wasn’t tall, and there was only a strange power that was acting everywhere, yearning to tear people apart. Thus, Ling Han’s speed naturally couldn’t be any faster. He had to focus his full attention on resisting this power.","Thus, after a very long time, he finally reached the summit.","Yi?","Ling Han was startled. He had actually seen a vine at the summit, coiled on a crimson red rock. This vine should be close to death, and more than half of its leaves had wilted, but there was actually a fruit borne on it.","This fruit was only the size of a longan. It was pink in colour, and there were mysterious veined patterns on its skin, making one focus immediately on it at first sight.","“Wu!” Ling Han groaned, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","How could he be distracted at this time?","Thankfully, that power was acting on his entire body this time. Thus, it only made him spit out a mouthful of blood. Otherwise, it was really possible that he would die on the spot.","Ling Han hurriedly averted his gaze, strode over, and plucked the fruit. Who cares what it was? To be born in such a strange place and not be damaged, it must be a Treasured Fruit!","Then, he descended the mountain.","This was another half day’s journey, and Ling Han finally arrived at the foot of the mountain. Ahead of him was another plain, yet it was covered with snow and ice. An endless chill assaulted him, causing him to involuntarily shiver.","This was truly a world of ice and fire.","This side of the mountain was covered in ice and snow, but the other side was gushing with lava, which could easily burn a Saint to death.","The strange power had already disappeared, but Ling Han didn’t dare to be careless. The lava could burn Saints to death, so this place definitely wouldn’t be any safer.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to advance. Instead, he first healed his injuries.","Though it had only been a short day, under the ravaging of that power, he was covered with injuries. Furthermore, he was constantly in a state of high alert, so the pressure on his spirit was also very great.","He indeed needed to rest.","After three days, his injuries had basically recovered completely, and his spiritual power was already full and flawless.","He finally took out the fruit that he had harvested at the top of the withered mountain, and examined it carefully.","That mountain was filled with tearing force, and even he was having a hard time dealing with it. How had that vine survived, and why had this fruit not exploded?","He examined it carefully. The surface of the fruit was covered with mysterious veined patterns, as if it contained some kind of true meaning of great dao. His eyes were instantly drawn to it, and he was immersed in it.","After a long while, Ling Han finally withdrew his gaze. With a slight hook of his finger, the Regulations took form, and appeared between his fingers like the strings of a qin. He fiddled with them, and weng, weng, weng, great dao sang.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised. This was a technique that used great dao, and could be used in secret techniques to increase the might of the celestial technique.","Hiss, the veined patterns on the skin of the fruit were already so amazing, then what level of Great Herb was the fruit?","Ling Han didn’t hesitate and immediately threw it into his mouth. He chewed lightly, and immediately, juices filled his mouth. It was incredibly sweet, causing every pore on his body to open up.","Beautiful, truly delicious.","He was still unsatisfied, but the whole fruit had already turned into juice that flowed into his mouth, leaving behind only a layer of skin."]},{"number":4395,"title":"Chapter 4395: Feng Miaoling","paragraphs":["Chapter 4395: Feng Miaoling","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han didn’t waste it. He put away the skin of the fruit. The veined patterns on it were mysterious and could be comprehended. Moreover, he also wanted to know the origins of this fruit.","“So hot!”","He suddenly gritted his teeth, and a wave of heat surged through his limbs and veins. Visibly, heat rose from his body. Boom, it even started to burn, and his clothes were instantly turned into ashes.","It should be known that the clothes he was wearing were knitted from Celestial Material. Even if his figure enlarged and shrank, the fabric could also enlarge and shrink accordingly, completely fitting him.","But now, it had actually been burnt into ashes. Hiss, these flames were really shocking.","However, Ling Han only felt an extraordinary heat, and there was not the slightest bit of burn marks on his skin, which was extremely strange.","This heat must have originated from the fruit he had just eaten. It seemed to be the case as well. He only felt the heat, but for the time being, there was no damage caused to him.","At the same time, waves of energy surged in his body, as if they wanted to fill him up.","Ling Han’s cultivation level began to increase, and his seventh spiritual body was rapidly growing.","As expected, this was a Great Herb. The medicinal effects were really too shocking, but the problem was this heat was too high. Though it temporarily did not cause him any injury, Ling Han could feel that the water in his body was rapidly evaporating.","He couldn’t take it, he couldn’t take it at all!","Ling Han dove into the world of ice and snow ahead of him, hoping that he could use this ice to cool himself down.","Zi, he was too hot. The moment he rushed into the snowy ground, the snow and ice began to melt, and steam soared into the sky.","It wasn’t enough; it was still too hot.","At this moment, Ling Han’s eyes were only filled with ice and snow. He was running around like a headless fly, but he still had a sliver of reason. All this while, he was only running around in the proximity, and did not venture deep into this snowy plain.","After who knew how long, this wave of heat finally passed. Ling Han forcibly pulled himself together, and retreated back to the foot of the withered mountain. Then, he collapsed, and fell into a deep slumber.","...","At the same time.","A black-robed figure also shockingly appeared at the foot of the withered mountain, but it was on the other side of the mountain.","This person’s face was covered with a black gauze, and her features could not be seen clearly, but judging from her shapely and beautiful figure, this should be a woman. Her slender waist could be grasped in a single hand, her buttocks were shapely, and her chest was round and full, appearing very proud.","She turned around to look at the chariot, and a tempted expression appeared on her face. However, in the end, she didn’t make a move.","If she couldn’t suppress this kind of greed, then what awaited her would only be death.","She turned around, and walked towards the withered mountain, her beautiful eyes flickering.","She knew that there was an Extreme Fire Earth Spiritual Vine on the mountain, and the fruit it bore was a rare Great Herb. Not only could it increase her cultivation level, it could also help her cultivate a technique that could draw on the Dao of heaven and earth.","With this as the foundation, she could even develop an Imperial Technique!","This was the fated opportunity that she could see and touch.","“Everyone thinks that there is only one entrance to the Imperial Path, but the Imperial Path is actually in between the two realms of Yin and Yang, and there is naturally an entrance to the Netherworld. Furthermore, this is the Reincarnation Path of the Netherworld. As long as one can successfully walk out of it, he would be able to live a second life.”","“Unfortunately, throughout history, how many people have managed to succeed?”","She murmured softly, as if she was giving a commentary, but also seemed to be remembering.","“Throughout history, there are only two Empresses!”","“However, there will soon be a third Empress!”","She declared proudly, exuding a strong confidence.","“That would be me, Feng Miaoling!”","This woman walked slowly, but there was a frightening tearing force on the withered mountain. Because of the change in cultivation level, though she was a Sect Master, she still appeared to be very strained, blood continuously spurting from her delicate body.","“What a terrifying place. With my strength, I am actually still in such a sorry state. Is there a second person in this world that can pass?”","Feng Miaoling cried out, but her tone was more of an affirmation of her own strength.","“Wu!” She coughed up blood, dyeing the black cloth covering her face bright red.","At this moment, a silvery light flickered on her body, forming a shield. The tearing power was instantly blocked outside.","“No, I can do it!” the woman said stubbornly. She did something, and the shield instantly disappeared.","She advanced with great difficulty, and after spending close to a day’s time, she finally reached the summit.","“I’m here!” A smile spread across her face, but the smile on her face instantly froze.","Where were the celestial fruit?","Where was the Extreme Fire Earth Spiritual Fruit?","She stared dumbly at that withered old vine, her face filled with disbelief. She really could spit out a mouthful of blood.","However, there was no time for her to be in a daze here. The terrifying tearing force was taking effect almost at all times, causing her to feel a sharp pain, and she suddenly came back to her senses.","She could clearly see that there were obvious signs of harvesting on the old vine, and it was very “fresh”.","In other words, it wasn’t that the information was wrong, but that someone had rushed ahead of her and plucked the Extreme Fire Earth Spiritual Fruit.","When this realization arose, she suddenly felt a burning sensation on her face.","—Just now, she had even boasted that there was no other person that could pass aside from her, and what was the result?","She couldn’t help but feel a strong fighting spirit rise up in her, as well as a deep animosity.","They had yet to meet, yet this person had already slapped her across the face.","This was intolerable!","She pulled herself together and headed down the mountain.","If she caught up to that guy, even if she couldn’t snatch back the celestial fruit, she would still give him a harsh beating. He actually dared to slap her face.","Another day passed, and she finally arrived at the foot of the mountain.","‘Hmm?’","Her beautiful eyes swept over, and she had already spotted Ling Han. Then, her pretty face flushed red like fire.","What had she seen?","A naked man!","This was too demeaning to her worldview.","What was this place?","This was the most dangerous place in the world, yet there was a naked man lying here. This was simply inconceivable, and absolutely unbelievable.","However, she immediately realized that this must be the person who had harvested the Extreme Fire Earth Spiritual Fruit before her.","That’s right. He must have ingested the celestial fruit. The medicinal effects took effect, and even his clothes were burnt to ashes.","She turned her head, but her hand waved out, condensing into a flash of Sword Qi, its might terrifying.","Just as the Sword Qi was about to strike him, Ling Han suddenly flew up, narrowly dodging this attack.","He had already refined the celestial fruit, but because the medicinal effects were too powerful, he was still in a coma. However, how sensitive was a cultivator like him to danger? His body instinctively reacted at the first instant.","At this moment, his consciousness finally returned.","Yi, what was going on?","He looked at Feng Miaoling, and there was a hint of confusion in his gaze. At the same time, there was also a sliver of killing intent.","To make a move on him for no reason, this was really too despicable.","“Who are you?” Ling Han asked coldly.","“Damn guy!” Feng Miaoling was about to spit fire. ‘You’re already awake, so why didn’t you put on some clothes?’","He was clearly naked, but there was not the slightest bit of shame on his face. He was still crossing his arms behind his back and pretending to be a poser!","Ling Han finally came to his senses after being scolded by her.","‘F*ck! Where’s my clothes?’","He hurriedly took out some clothes and put them on, shaking his head as he did so. This time, he had really been taken advantage of.","As he thought this, his face naturally revealed his thoughts.","When Feng Miaoling saw this, she almost went mad with anger.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4396,"title":"Chapter 4396: Enemy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4396: Enemy","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Madman, you are courting death!” Feng Miaoling charged out.","Since Ling Han was already dressed, she naturally had no more reservations.","What a shameless person. He was completely naked in front of her, and looked like it was him that had suffered a loss.","Too despicable, too shameless, too detestable!","Boom, a Sect Master’s strength completely burst forth. A great river actually appeared behind her, emitting a turbulent and majestic sound.","It was clearly a river, yet it seemed to be even more majestic than the sea. Endless Regulations surged.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. This was a Sect Master opponent.","As he retreated, he continued to unleash murderous aura attacks.","However, what surprised him was that the other was completely unaffected.","It should be known that even if her abilities were stronger than his, the barrage of murderous aura could still be effective. This was an attack aimed at the soul, and the difference lay in the extent of its effects.","Completely unaffected?","Imperial Daughter?","Unless she was wearing armor that had been personally forged by the Great Emperor, a Sect Master should not be able to be completely unaffected by the barrage of murderous aura.","Only now did Ling Han suddenly come to his senses. This woman had actually also walked the Imperial Path from the Netherworld?","‘Strange. Are you also being hunted, so you couldn’t go through the main doors?’","Hong, Feng Miaoling’s attack missed, and she couldn’t help but reveal a hint of surprise, because Ling Han was only a Spirit Transformation Tier.","However, her fury made her not have the interest to speak at all, and ask Ling Han about his background.","It was too piercing to the eyes. That unkempt appearance kept swaying in front of her eyes. Now, she only had one thought, and that was to kill Ling Han.","How difficult would it be for a Sect Master elite to kill a Spirit Transformation Tier True Lord?","Moreover, she was such an outstanding prodigy.","Boom, the great river behind her surged violently, pouring towards Ling Han.","Ling Han suddenly had a feeling that even if just a drop of the river water touched him, he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","This woman was actually so strong?","It was very normal for the Imperial Daughter to be in possession of treasures.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate and immediately used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","Run!","He didn’t linger in battle. A Spirit Transformation True Lord was already at a disadvantage when battling against a Sect Master, what more when this Sect Master was the Golden Generation, and was far more powerful than the conventional Minor Advanced Tier.","Boom, two fiery wings spread out, and he headed towards the snowy plains.","Feng Miaoling’s fury soared sky-high. When she saw Ling Han’s “naked body”, her heart was already filled with anger, and Ling Han still looked like it was him who had been taken advantage of. This naturally caused her fury to burn even hotter.","Kill, no matter what, she had to kill this brat.","Hu!","But at this moment, the whole sky was filled with snowy winds. The strong winds whistled fiercely, and the cold winds penetrated straight into her bones, causing even the circulation of mystical power to become sluggish.","Feng Miaoling couldn’t help but drop down from the skies. This cold wind was like blades, not only slicing her whole body painfully, even her clothes were about to disintegrate.","This naturally could not be allowed to happen.","She had seen Ling Han’s body, and she had suffered a disadvantage because of that. If she allowed Ling Han to see her body, it would definitely not be a tie between the two of them, but she would be at an even greater disadvantage.","However, she shockingly discovered that Ling Han was actually still running. Though his speed had decreased slightly, he was still faster than her.","How was this possible?","Ling Han didn’t know, but she knew very well that the environment here would exert a different kind of pressure on people of different cultivation levels. Thus, whether it was the Spirit Transformation Tier or the Minor Advanced Tier, the pressure they endured could be said to be equal, and were both around their own respective limits.","It could be said that the best display of one’s natural talent was in this place. The stronger one’s strength at the same cultivation level, the more relaxed one’s performance would be.","She was actually inferior to Ling Han?","How, could, this, be!","She could not believe it, and could not accept it. With her aptitude, she was completely capable of taking the throne by force, but she was actually inferior to this naked man in front of her?","But the truth was indeed so. The gap between her and Ling Han was presently widening, causing her to be shocked, angered, and speechless.","At this moment, Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks. He turned around, and called out loudly, “Crazy woman, you spied on me, and still want to kill me to keep the secret. This is not over!”","Feng Miaoling almost spat out a mouthful of blood. You still have the face to make false accusations?","However, Ling Han had already turned around and left. She couldn’t vent her anger.","...","In the distance, Ling Han gritted his teeth. He knew that it was understandable that Feng Miaoling would be so furious, but how could he tolerate being sneak attacked in his “sleep” and hunted down?","Just wait, he would definitely come back for revenge. No matter what, he had to spank this little girl’s behind.","Yi?","He suddenly discovered that his seventh spiritual body had already reached a state of perfection.","The effect of that celestial fruit.","Ling Han immediately came to his senses. While he had fallen into a deep slumber due to the medicinal effects, his cultivation level had also rapidly increased, advancing all the way to the peak stage of the Seventh Change.","“It’s too cold here, so it’s not suitable to break through.”","“I’ll walk out of the ice plain first, then consider breaking through to the Eighth Change.”","He walked through the blizzard, and in order to avoid the blizzard that was as cold as blades, he descended, and walked on the snowy plains. One foot deep, one foot shallow. The accumulated snow was as thick as two feet, and with each step, practically the whole lower half of his body was buried within.","However, even if he was on the ground, where he could avoid the icy winds and snow, when he came into direct contact with the accumulated snow, a powerful chill still seeped out, causing Ling Han to waver continuously. Any kind of defense would be useless at this moment.","Thankfully, Ling Han’s physique was tough enough. Otherwise, he would definitely have frozen to death.","He sighed ruefully. There should be very few people that could pass through this snowy plain.","If he could only set out from here to reach the Imperial Path, then if one surveyed the whole world, would the number of people that could pass be more than can be counted on two hands?","Three days later, Ling Han finally walked out of the snowy plains.","A canyon appeared ahead of him. It wasn’t too long, and he could see the end of it with a single glance.","Should he pass first, or break through first?","Ling Han thought for a moment, then decided to break through first. He really yearned for abilities too much.","He took out the Void Beast hide and put it on. Then, he sat down in a cross-legged position, and began to break through to Eighth Change.","The eighth spiritual body gradually took form, slowly forming.","At this moment, Feng Miaoling appeared. When she passed by Ling Han, she paused slightly, as if she had discovered something, but after a sweep of her beautiful eyes, she continued onwards.","She could vaguely sense something off, but did not discover anything. She only thought that she had been overly suspicious.","Danger lay ahead!","She stopped in her tracks and sat down in a cross-legged position. After recovering to her prime condition, she stood up.","She rushed into the canyon, and instantly, multiple sharp golden swords descended from the skies, slashing down on her.","Feng Miaoling used her movement technique, dodging and evading, not daring to be touched by the golden swords.","She knew that this golden sword possessed incomparably terrifying destructive power. She definitely could not allow it to touch her, or her life would be in danger.","Dodging all the way, it was very dangerous, but she still managed to pass successfully.","“That scoundrel actually passed as well!” she muttered. Though there was still killing intent in her tone, there was also a sliver of admiration.","She knew very well just how difficult it was to pass through this canyon. If she was the slightest bit careless, she would die and be destroyed.","However, what she didn’t know was that the guy she wanted nothing more than to kill actually hadn’t passed through the canyon at all."]},{"number":4397,"title":"Chapter 4397: The Other Side","paragraphs":["Chapter 4397: The Other Side","Editor: Henyee Translations","Three days later, Ling Han successfully broke through to Eighth Change.","“Eighth Change, and I’m closer to the Minor Advanced Tier.” Ling Han broke into a grin. “As expected, a horse cannot grow fat without night grass. To rapidly improve my cultivation level, I still have to enter into this kind of Mystery Realm.”","Ordinarily, it would take him at least four to five years to advance into Eighth Change, but now? It had only been a few days.","“However, the dangers of this canyon are beyond my imagination.”","Ling Han murmured. Previously, though he had been in a state of seclusion, there was still a sliver of divine sense circulating, and he had “seen” the scene of Feng Miaoling passing through the canyon.","“A rain of swords will fall from the sky, and the slightest carelessness would mean eternal damnation!”","He didn’t move at the first instant. Firstly, he had to be careful, and it was possible that Feng Miaoling would be guarding against him on the other side. Secondly, he also had to stabilize his cultivation level.","Another two days later, Ling Han finally stood up.","“Let’s give it a try.”","He walked into the canyon, and instantly, a golden sword suddenly flew out of the originally peaceful canyon, shooting madly towards him.","Ling Han activated his movement technique, dodging with all his might.","He couldn’t charge forward in a single breath. This was because the entire canyon was raining swords. If he rashly charged forward, he would only lose his life.","His spirit was maintained in a state of high-speed reaction, while his mind was clear. Any slightest change was within his grasp.","In a short while, he had already passed through one third of the canyon.","‘Soon.’","However, his expression remained unchanged as he continued to walk forward.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Sword Rays slashed down.","He was already halfway there.","Cold sweat appeared on Ling Han’s forehead. His brain was constantly in a state of high-speed, causing him to feel great pressure.","This tested his reaction speed too much. As long as he was the slightest bit careless, it was guaranteed that he would immediately die.","Two-thirds.","Ling Han’s eyes burned. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and his speed was not only fast, but also extraordinarily steady.","Xiu, Ling Han leaped again, and finally exited the canyon.","He turned around, and a strong feeling of relief rose up in his heart.","So close, he had finally passed.","Though it was not too long, only half an hour, he felt as if he had experienced a terrifying great battle, causing his whole body to be covered in sweat.","Ling Han sat down to recover.","Half a day later, he stood up and walked forwards.","Thankfully, Feng Miaoling was not guarding against him here. She probably thought that he had long since passed.","True, who would have thought that he would suddenly break through?","This journey took four days. From afar, Ling Han heard the turbulent sound of the great river.","Yi, was it that fierce woman that was fighting?","Ling Han instinctively thought that when Feng Miaoling battled, a large river would be reflected behind her, and the sound of the waves would roll out.","However, after walking for a while longer, he discovered that it was not Feng Miaoling, but was indeed a turbulent great river.","This river was extraordinarily long, and the end could not be seen from either direction, and its width was about 5km. With Ling Han’s vision, he could see the other side with a single glance.","But the problem was, he could not see what lay on the other side of the river at all. It was only a blur.","Strange.","Ling Han looked at the river water, and couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression.","That was because along with the roaring river waters, there were also multiple human faces. They were either malevolent, furious, or terrified, and there were all kinds of expressions.","They weren’t corpses, but rather faces.","F***, what kind of river was this?","Ling Han didn’t take the risk to cross the river. Instinctively, he thought that there was something very strange about this river.","Sigh, since Buddha Doga had sent him here, why couldn’t he be a good person to the end and tell him more information?","Er... could this person be considered a good person?","He had killed countless people, and he had even tortured countless Saints to death. From this aspect, he was definitely not a good person. However, he had forced the Masters of the Yin River and the Blood Sea to retreat, and single-handedly blocked the invasion of the Yin souls. It could only be described as an extraordinary merit.","Merely this point was enough to erase all his previous crimes.","“I have benefited from his help, so I am not qualified to give a commentary.”","“This... I’ll leave it for future generations to evaluate.”","Ling Han walked along the river, wanting to find out more.","After walking upstream for ten days, Ling Han came up empty-handed. Ling Han returned to the starting point, then headed downstream.","This time, it was only seven days, and he saw a stone tablet.","Stone tablet?","There were words on it, and Ling Han walked over to read them.","These were incredibly ancient characters, and had long since fallen out of use. Thankfully, Ling Han had deliberately learnt various ancient languages for the sake of ancient pill recipes. Thus, it was not too straining for him.","“The other shore.”","He read that this river was called “Other Side”, and was also the final stage that Yin souls who wanted to return to the Living Realm had to pass.","After reaching the Other Side, his blood and flesh would regrow, and he would live a second life.","However, there were countless vengeful spirits in the river, and they would not be easily passed over. They would drag everything into the river, to become a part of the vengeful spirits.","At the very least, if a Saint fell into the river just like that, it was guaranteed that he would not be spared.","What was to be done?","“With the Immortality Leaf as raft, one can avoid being entwined by vengeful spirits, and use faith as motivation to urge the raft to cross the river.”","Ling Han followed the stone tablet’s guidance, and soon found a towering tree. However, amidst the leaves that filled the skies, there were multiple hideous heads. Now, they were all staring at Ling Han, revealing baleful expressions.","It was like if if Ling Han were to leap up to pluck the leaves, these heads would gnaw at him.","That was indeed the case. There was a clear hint on the stone tablet. One definitely could not climb up the tree to pluck leaves, and could only wait for the leaves to fall on their own.","This tree leaf was very big, about three feet long, and about two feet wide. It was thick and fat, but to use it as a raft would always make people feel that it was unreliable.","All of a sudden, a beautiful song rang out, causing Ling Han to be overjoyed, his eyes intoxicated. This formed a powerful attraction, causing Ling Han to want to move in the direction of the sound.","And the source of this beautiful sound was this great tree.","Ling Han’s powerful willpower took effect. He forcefully stopped his raised foot, and when he raised his head, he saw that it was one of the hideous heads that was singing an incredibly beautiful and melodious song.","It was really dangerous.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He couldn’t leave and return when the leaves fell, because once the leaves fell onto the ground, they would immediately dissipate.","Thus, he needed a strong willpower.","How could it be so easy to live a second life? And this was still because Ling Han himself had a physical body, which lowered the difficulty level by at least tens of thousands of times. If his soul had walked this path, he would have long since died.","These heads had all kinds of enticing techniques. They would either attract by singing, or release murmurs that would cause one’s heart to throb wildly, stimulating the most primitive desires.","Ling Han sat down cross-legged, using his powerful willpower to suppress himself, ignoring all temptations or effects.","Weng, in the dimensions inside his body, the willpower of living beings all surged, turning into millions and millions of streaks of willpower. Though every single streak of will was extremely subtle, when they were combined, they gave Ling Han a strong support.","After about two days, a leaf quietly floated down.","Ling Han reached over and grabbed the leaf.","He could leave now, but he did not move.","— New chapter is coming soon —","WRITE A REVIEW"]},{"number":4398,"title":"Chapter 4398 A perfect soul","paragraphs":["Ling Han suddenly discovered that in the two days that he had been here, his willpower had clearly improved.","Spiritual power was very difficult to cultivate. Even if there were corresponding cultivation techniques, the power of heaven and earth could only transform into mystical power, and could not increase one's spiritual power. Thus, one could only grind it bit by bit, and slowly improve it.","However, in this place, those human heads continued to tempt him. In the process of resisting, his willpower had also been extremely tempered, and his improvement was extremely obvious.","\"If my previous willpower was made of clay, it has now been tempered and turned into brick. It has clearly become stronger.\"","Ling Han was very pleased. This kind of improvement was not an increase in quantity, but rather a qualitative change.","\"I'll stay here for a few more days.\"","\"I have never believed that a single path can decide one's fate.\"","\"Even if I am not the first to complete the Imperial Path, or even the thousandth or ten thousandth, as long as I have gained something, this trip will not be wasted.\"","\"Being strong yourself is the path of the strongest.\"","\"This can't decide my fate!\"","Ling Han continued to sit in a cross-legged position, not bothering about which place he would be to complete the Imperial Path.","What was the point of walking quickly? He had to become stronger on this path. That was the true way to go.","The head continued to release seductive sounds, and Ling Han resisted with all his might. In this kind of contest, he continuously toughened his willpower, and his Spiritual Power was becoming more and more tenacious.","From clay to brick, from brick to rock, from rock to iron, from iron... he had polished its sharpness, and was capable of striking the heaven and earth.","At this moment, those human heads no longer spoke, and no longer stared at him. All of them closed their eyes, as if they had suddenly lost interest in him.","Yi, continue!","Ling Han looked at the tree, and began to provoke them, \"Hey, hey, hey, you guys better not sleep. How can you have the nerve to sleep when you're so ugly?\"","If this was a normal person, they would probably roll their eyes at him even if they didn't scold him back, right?","However, these heads weren't real living beings, so they didn't have any emotions. It was as if they were all dead, and they ignored him completely.","Ling Han provoked them for a while longer. Even with his ability to insult others, he was actually unable to anger these heads in the slightest, which made him feel deeply frustrated.","\"My skill is still not up to scratch. If it was Old Black...\"","Unfortunately, the large black dog was not here.","Ling Han shook his head, and stretched out a hand to grab a falling leaf. He strode forwards, and arrived at the riverbank.","He threw the tree leaf into the river, then with a leap, landed on the tree leaf.","Ordinarily, with his cultivation level, he was completely capable of making his body as light as a feather, and completely weightless. However, when he stepped on the leaf, the leaf suddenly sank a bit, and the river water instantly reached Ling Han's ankle.","Thankfully, it did not go any higher.","The problem was that the river was surging, bringing Ling Han straight down, but there was no sign of crossing at all.","Ling Han suddenly recalled the message left on the stone tablet. He had to use his faith as motivation.","He immediately activated his willpower, pushing the tree leaf to cross the river.","His willpower was strong to begin with, and he had also been tempering his willpower these past few days, reaching an astonishing strength. Even in this strange river, it was effective, pushing the tree leaf to begin crossing.","All around him, when the faces were washed over by the river waters, they were filled with yearning. They were all staring at Ling Han with hatred in their eyes, as if they were saying, 'Why don't you have to be dragged into the river and suffer that eternal torture?'","They wanted to drag Ling Han down with them, but the Immortality Leaf was exuding a faint light. This light had a powerful intimidating effect on the faces, making them not dare to cross the line.","Ling Han was determined, and ignored these faces. He didn't consider at all whether he would be torn to pieces by these faces if his \"ship\" capsized.","He only had one thought, and that was to cross the river.","His journey was the universe, and he was a man who was going to become Emperor in the future. How could he die here?","The river waters surged, and the demonic faces howled. However, Ling Han completely ignored them. In the past few days of tempering his willpower, it was as if he had obtained a new life.","Close, close, the other shore was right in front of his eyes.","At this moment, a faint light suddenly flickered on Ling Han's body.","Ling Han felt as if his body was undergoing an earth-shattering change. His cultivation level clearly hadn't increased at all, yet it was as if he had been reborn. It was as if heaven and earth had changed color.","He saw the Regulations of heaven and earth, manifested in front of his eyes. It was as if he only had to stretch out a hand, and he would be able to channel a Regulation or even a few Regulations at will, turning them into an indestructible spear, or an incredibly sturdy shield.","\"Yi?\"","He felt an itch on his face. With a rub, he had actually scraped off a layer of his old skin!","At the same time, he also felt an extraordinary itch in his bones, and bone scraps were actually expelling from the pores on his skin.","Heavens, he was really undergoing a complete transformation!","Ling Han was stunned. He had cultivated every cultivation level to perfection, and had even broken through his limits time and time again. Added with the fact that he had cultivated the Heavenly Dragon Emperor Technique, no matter which cultivation level he was at, he should still have a perfect body.","However, he could actually undergo a complete transformation, and evolve to an even more perfect state.","This!","Ling Han finally understood. This was a qualitative change on the spiritual level. His spirit had become perfect, and it had affected his physical body, making him even more perfect.","Other Side, Return to Living Realm, his second life.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. After the Yin soul crossed this river, it would be able to obtain a body of flesh and blood, and begin its second life. Furthermore, he had not died in the first place, so he naturally could not begin his second life. Thus, it only allowed his soul to approach near perfection.","He couldn't help but grin. This path was indeed dangerous, but the opportunities were also astonishing. Otherwise, what kind of Great Herb would he need to cultivate his soul to such perfection?","He had arrived at the other shore.","Ling Han leaped down and landed on the bank of the river. When he turned around, those faces all revealed expressions of defiance, as if they were all about to rush out of the river and drag Ling Han back.","However, they were completely unable to break free from the restraints of the river waters. Amidst the sound of surging waves, they were mercilessly washed downstream.","Ling Han retracted his gaze. Ahead of him was a plain, and there was presently a large number of people running and flying around, but not a single person gave him a second look.","Yi, why don't you guys find it strange?","Hold on, where was the sound of the river?","Ling Han was astonished. He turned around again, and this time, he was stunned.","Where was the river?","There was also a plain behind him. Where was the river?","No wonder no one cared about him. Though he had appeared out of thin air, there were really too many people here, and everyone was scrambling to rush forwards, so who would care about him?","Alright, so be it if no one cared. In any case, he did not care either.","Ling Han followed them, and looking at everyone's cultivation level and aptitude, he was sure that those who entered now were inferior to even Dao Child-level.","It was clear that the Imperial Son, the Dao Child, and the others had all left before it was these people's turn.","Ling Han had already changed his appearance. In reality, his soul had undergone a perfect evolution. Even if it didn't change, it was very likely that few people would be able to recognize him.","Very soon, a canyon appeared ahead of them, and in the canyon, multiple massive axes were slashing horizontally, covering the whole canyon."]},{"number":4399,"title":"Chapter 4399 Saber and Axe Canyon","paragraphs":["Sabers and axes danced, covering the entire canyon.","If they barged in rashly, they would be instantly slashed into pieces.","Ling Han couldn't help but stop in his tracks and start to observe.","These axes and sabers were extraordinarily huge, as if they were multiple small mountains, and though they were brandishing together, they were definitely not uniform in pattern. They were separated from one another, yet seemed to have some kind of rhythm to them.","Ling Han had just grasped it, when he suddenly realized that there was something off about the pattern.","Yi?","It had changed, and became another pattern.","In a short while, he had figured it out. There was indeed a pattern to the movements of the axes and sabers, but it would change about every minute.","He advanced again, and after walking for quite a while, he finally arrived at the foot of the canyon.","Only after arriving here did he discover that this canyon was astonishingly huge. If one stood at the foot and looked up, they would only feel extremely tiny.","There were a great many people standing at the entrance to the canyon, and as they deduced the pattern, they all looked terrified.","That was because someone had entered into the canyon, yet had been sliced into mush by blades and axes!","Why couldn't he pass through from another direction?","Someone had indeed made an attempt, but they had only arrived at half the height of the canyon before they were suppressed.","The paths were blocked, so they could only walk through the canyon.","A great many people had summarized the pattern, and confidently entered into the canyon, but halfway, two thirds of the way, they were sliced in half by the giant axes. Both their body and soul were destroyed, and they did not even have the chance for their souls to enter into the Netherworld.","Why? Hadn't they already found a pattern?","Ling Han immediately came to a realization.","That was because the Regulations here would change every minute.","Thus, you spent half a minute to find a pattern, but if passing through the canyon required 40 seconds, then you would definitely not be able to pass through, because after one minute had passed, the pattern had already changed.","To pass through the canyon, not only did he have to find a pattern, he also had to calculate how long it would take to pass through the canyon according to this pattern, how much time he had used, and whether there was enough time left.","Ling Han could see very clearly that there were some patterns that were traps in the first place. Observing them once would take more than half a minute, and if he entered at this time, it would only mean death.","Of course, there were also a considerable number of smart people. Very soon, they moved according to the correct pattern, and just barely managed to pass.","Ling Han naturally wouldn't care about others. After watching for a while, xiu, his figure darted out and began to pass.","However, even if he had grasped the pattern, it was still not an easy thing to pass through.","Shua, as the saber and axe swept past, a sharp Qi swept out. Its destructive power was incredibly frightening, and even Venerate Tier elites could be easily killed.","Ling Han was not the only one who had grasped the pattern of this time. There were a great many others with him, but there was a difference in speed. The majority had fallen behind Ling Han, but there were also a few that were about his speed, and there were even some that were ahead of him.","That was a Sect Master-level elite, who was probably a few thousand years old. However, with Minor Advanced Tier's lifespan of 40,000 years, he was naturally very young. Thus, he looked to be only in his twenties, his flame of life blazing.","Boom!","As the saber and axe swept over, booming sounds rang out.","\"Scram!\" Behind him, a person rushed over.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. 'Scram to let you go ahead? Then where am I going?'","In this place, one's own speed actually could not be of much use, because there was a pattern to the movements of the axe and saber. You could not be fast, nor could you be slow. The changes that you could make were extremely limited.","If he stepped aside, he would have to face the blade head-on.","Was there something wrong with him?","Ling Han ignored him. This person only had to be slightly slower, and not rush forwards. It was not like he would die.","But the problem was, that person charged over without any regard for anything else. Brandishing the Divine Sword in his hand, he slashed it towards Ling Han.","He was a Spirit Transformation Tier, but it was clear that he didn't dare to use his spiritual body here. That would be a suicidal action.","A killing intent surged in Ling Han's heart. Since you don't care about the life or death of others, why should he care?","He raised his hand, and merely threw a light punch.","Peng!","As the force surged, it forcibly stopped that person.","He had only used a sliver of power, and had not caused any damage to that person. The problem was, the environment here was extremely dangerous.","Shua, the axe and saber slashed over, easily slicing that person into two.","Immediately, a fountain of blood exploded, and that person was sliced into two halves. His internal organs fell out noisily, and his mind had also been forcefully shattered. Both his body and spirit had been destroyed.","\"Disciple!\" Ahead of them, the Sect Master elite released an enraged roar, his eyes practically spitting fire.","However, he did not dare to stop at all, and could only continue onwards.","To linger here was completely courting death.","Ling Han raised a brow. No wonder that person was so arrogant. As it turned out, he had a Sect Master elite to back him up.","His expression did not change, and he continued onwards.","Shua, shua, shua! The saber and axe moved in an extremely rhythmic manner.","It wasn't long before the Sect Master elite had already rushed out of the canyon. He immediately turned around and glared at Ling Han, a hint of cruelty in his eyes.","There was no other way here. The moment Ling Han walked out, he would send Ling Han back, so that the latter would also be struck by blades and axes, and experience the same despair.","Ling Han was getting closer and closer. Xiu, he rushed out of the canyon.","The Sect Master sneered, and sent out a palm strike.","Instantly, the Regulations turned into a net, blocking the exit of the canyon.","'You can just die inside.'","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and the Saint Tool staff was already in his hand. He shot out an attack.","Peng, the web of Regulations was immediately shattered.","Ling Han scuttled out, a smile appearing on his face.","His Spiritual Power had not improved, but the quality had been completely transformed. Thus, the attack launched by the Saint Tool that he had activated was naturally a bit stronger. Though it was still Pseudo Sect Master level, if its might was concentrated at one point, it was enough to break through the web of Regulations.","\"What!\" The Sect Master was stunned for a moment. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so strong.","In his eyes, Ling Han's punch had only blocked his younger brother, and Ling Han's battle prowess was no more than his younger brother's. However, now that he had activated his Spirit Tool, it was actually able to penetrate his web of Regulations. This astonished him, and he was even unable to accept it.","What was going on?","However, he immediately tossed this question to one side. He pressed down with his hand, and struck out at Ling Han again.","He definitely had to avenge his brother's death.","Ling Han humphed as he activated Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. He immediately sped up, so fast that even the elite was dumbfounded.","\"Wu!\" That elite gave a muffled humph, and couldn't help but take a few steps back. The scorching flames made him feel slightly uncomfortable.","This stunned him even more. A mere Spirit Transformation Tier could actually pose a threat to him?","This was the biggest joke in the world!","His expression became stern. 'Who cares who you are? This is the Mystery Realm. If he wants to kill someone, who can stop him?'","He also used his movement technique, and set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","This battle was really a little unjust.","Ling Han was walking around peacefully, and when he had been rebuked, he definitely had to make a move for the sake of his own safety. And now, he had gotten himself into trouble.","He shook his head. Since he had already provoked them, he was not the type to be afraid of trouble.","Weng, the murderous aura activated, and he began his counterattack."]},{"number":4400,"title":"Chapter 4400 Slightly inferior","paragraphs":["Could a Spirit Transformation True Lord rival a Sect Master?","If he asked anyone, it was guaranteed that everyone would shake their heads, and reprimand him as dreaming.","Ling Han had advanced into the Eighth Change, and his battle prowess had increased greatly again. Furthermore, his spirit had undergone a complete transformation. It could be said that his whole person had reached the limit of his current cultivation level, and could no longer be improved in the slightest.","However, compared to the Sect Master-level battle prowess, he was still slightly inferior.","Though the gap was already not too far.","Ling Han activated the murderous aura, which affected his opponent. Meanwhile, he activated the Imperial Technique, which further boosted his battle prowess. Although he was still at a disadvantage, if they fought for ten moves, he could still counter with one or even two moves.","This caused the spectators to be dumbfounded.","What was going on?","Was this really a Spirit Transformation Tier","\"I know that Sect Master. He's the prodigy of the Wenren Clan, Wenren Liangping!\"","\"That's right, that's right. Wenren Liangping is only 4000 years old, yet he's already advanced to the Minor Advanced Tier. He's terrifyingly freakish.\"","\"But his opponent?\"","\"Spirit Transformation True Lord?\"","\"A Spirit Transformation True Lord can actually rival a Sect Master, and he's only at a disadvantage?\"","\"Though it hasn't been long since Wenren Liangping broke through to Sect Master-level, no matter what, that is still battle prowess of Sect Master-level!\"","Everyone was in disbelief. This was practically too unbelievable. Even if they had seen it with their own eyes, it was still very hard to believe.","Yet Ling Han felt that this was very normal.","He was a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator who had broken through to Ten Forms. Theoretically speaking, when he reached Ninth Change, he should be able to match a Minor Advanced Tier cultivator. Now, however, his soul had received a great baptism, which naturally further increased his battle prowess.","Eighth Change, just barely enough to match the weakest Sect Master.","Wenren Liangping was about to go crazy. What kind of luck did he and his brother have to actually encounter such an opponent?","Even so, his killing intent became even more intense.","He definitely could not let Ling Han off the hook. That was because if Ling Han advanced another step further, would he still be a match for Ling Han?","Hence, since he had already formed an enmity with this kind of prodigy, he definitely had to kill him. He could not leave behind any future troubles, and lay a trap for himself.","He unleashed his full power, instantly suppressing Ling Han.","After all, he was a Sect Master. His explosive might was definitely not just for show. It was too terrifying.","However, Ling Han was extremely slippery as he unleashed Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. His speed was no slower than Wenren Liangping. In fact, it was even faster than Wenren Liangping.","Thus, even though Wenren Liangping had the upper hand, he was completely unable to kill Ling Han.","Seeing this, everyone gritted their teeth again, feeling their scalps go numb.","Heavens, was this really a Spirit Transformation Tier?","Monster, freak!","\"I can't let you live!\" Wenren Liangping said in a baleful voice. He gritted his teeth, retrieved a green toad, and furiously swallowed it.","\"Ah!\" A twisted expression immediately appeared on his face, and the veins on his face throbbed violently, as if his blood was about to gush out.","'F*ck! Have you been possessed?'","Ling Han grumbled. However, he knew very well that this person wasn't bewitched. Instead, he had used some forbidden technique to forcefully increase his battle prowess. His body couldn't withstand it for the moment, and that was why he had such a twisted expression.","He was done playing. Retreat.","Though Ling Han had always been confident in himself, he was definitely not blind. This opponent was stronger than him in the first place, and it was not just by a little bit either. And now, he had used a forbidden technique to increase his battle prowess. If he continued to fight head-on, that would only be making things difficult for himself.","Xiu, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. He ran into the distance at an astonishing speed, and Wenren Liangping wasn't able to stop him at all.","\"Don't even think about running!\" Wenren Liangping roared. He had paid a huge price to obtain the toad that he had ingested. It could greatly increase his battle prowess for a short period of time. However, he still had to sacrifice a certain amount of his lifespan.","If he could kill Ling Han, then he would have no choice but to accept it. He would have gotten rid of a future threat, and he would have gotten his revenge for his younger brother.","However... Ling Han had fled.","He had ran, he had ran, he had ran... He was extremely depressed.","In the distance, Ling Han stopped, turned around and said, \"You're too disgusting. You even eat toads. Fighting with someone like you will make me throw up.\"","After saying this, he strode off.","Wenren Liangping was enraged upon hearing this. 'You actually dare to mock me?'","He gave chase with all his might, but in terms of speed, he had not surpassed Ling Han. Instead, he was slightly inferior, so how could he possibly catch up to Ling Han?","Thus, he could only watch helplessly as Ling Han became farther and farther away, and was about to disappear from his sight.","Ling Han turned around and added, \"Just you wait. The next time we meet, I'll chop off your head and kick it around like a ball.\"","Wenren Liangping stopped in his tracks. He knew that it was impossible for him to catch up to Ling Han.","Damn it, he had killed his younger brother, and caused him to waste a treasure for nothing!","\"I'll definitely find you and kill you with my own hands!\" he said balefully. He definitely couldn't allow Ling Han to take another step forward and break through to the Minor Advanced Tier.","—He only thought that Ling Han was already Ninth Change, and this was very normal. If this wasn't the end of Spiritual Transformation Tier, then what kind of monster are you?","Ling Han rapidly sped forwards. Very soon, he stopped channelling the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. This movement technique was indeed fast, but firstly, it was too eye-catching, and secondly, it expended a lot of mystical power. Unless absolutely necessary, it was best not to use it.","He stopped, and summarized the previous battle.","It could be said that this was the first real confrontation between him and a Sect Master. He didn't need the Spirit Tool, and he could deal with it with his own strength.","\"I'm just a sliver away,\" Ling Han murmured. When he advanced into the Ninth Change, he would definitely be able to match the Minor Advanced Tier. In fact, he might even be able to win.","Of course, this kind of Minor Advanced Tier was definitely the weakest level. He had just advanced into this cultivation level, and he couldn't be Imperial Son-level either. Otherwise, he probably wouldn't be able to defeat him.","After all, he was only in the Spirit Transformation Tier. It was already inconceivable that he could stand against a Sect Master.","He continued to advance. He really wanted to see what was so amazing about this Imperial Path.","After a few days, the crowds ahead of him became denser again.","Clearly, a barrier had appeared ahead of them, and those who had come here first were all stuck here — at least, a great many of them were stuck here.","Ling Han looked into the distance, but he couldn't see anything from here.","After walking forward for a while, he arrived at a massive plaza.","The tiles on the floor weren't laid out, but rather it was a single tile. It was as if they had been carved out of a massive rock.","The plaza was completely white in colour, and the stones were slightly exuding a gentle light. However, there was not a single person on the plaza, because there were presently two great elites exchanging blows, and the strong winds they created whistled. Regulations surged violently; this was too terrifying.","Upon a closer look, one of these two great elites was a clay figure, while the other was a fiery figure. From east to west, and from south to north, the whole plaza was their territory.","Some people wanted to sneak in, but they had only walked one third of the way, when they were swept by the shockwaves of the battle, and were instantly killed.","And this person who wanted to \"sneak in\" was shockingly a Spirit Transformation Tier elite.","A Spirit Transformation Tier was actually killed by the shockwaves caused by the aftermath of the battle!","Hence, everyone watched, frowning deeply."]}]);
